(442004, 40645, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - A little like Gordon''s photo of people taken some time ago but taken closer to Swanston St.  I''m from Melbourne myself - but didn''t get a chance to enter this weeks challenge.  Well done - I really like the glow of the signs combined with the sharpness of other details.</td>', 'Nice photo - A little like Gordon''s photo of people taken some time ago but taken closer to Swanston St.  I''m from Melbourne myself - but didn''t get a chance to enter this weeks challenge.  Well done - I really like the glow of the signs combined with the sharpness of other details.', '2003-10-08 01:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(442009, 41261, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great sky.</td>', 'Great sky.', '2003-10-08 01:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
