(442025, 40676, 3419, '<td valign="top">I like the saturated colors in this image. However, in my mind, it does not meet the challenge. Urban landscape is supposed to depict a city or town landscape. This is a country (or rural) landscape. 7 anyway.</td>', 'I like the saturated colors in this image. However, in my mind, it does not meet the challenge. Urban landscape is supposed to depict a city or town landscape. This is a country (or rural) landscape. 7 anyway.', '2003-10-08 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
