(442037, 40786, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - almost perfect symmetry (the only thing that doesn''t match are the round windows). Nice composition and capture of colors and detail.</td>', 'Very nicely done - almost perfect symmetry (the only thing that doesn''t match are the round windows). Nice composition and capture of colors and detail.', '2003-10-08 01:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(442038, 41184, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love the symetry in this shot.  However, the photo is slightly rotated and the framing doesn''t match the symetry.  It would have been better if you took the picture from a location cenetered about the middle of the long balcony.</td>', 'I love the symetry in this shot.  However, the photo is slightly rotated and the framing doesn''t match the symetry.  It would have been better if you took the picture from a location cenetered about the middle of the long balcony.', '2003-10-08 01:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
