(442054, 41049, 4338, '<td valign="top">not sure if you can see it on your monitor, but the image has a lot of lines, like a grid all over it, more noticible in the sky....Im not going to take away from the score for that, because there are many other things I like about the image, like lighting, color and composition....</td>', 'not sure if you can see it on your monitor, but the image has a lot of lines, like a grid all over it, more noticible in the sky....Im not going to take away from the score for that, because there are many other things I like about the image, like lighting, color and composition....', '2003-10-08 01:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
