(442065, 41336, 12661, '<td valign="top">Towers aren''t buildings!!! I give you a 1.  Uhm. I mean, great job capturing the rain. It''s not always easy to do. I also like the angle it magnifizes the greatness of the structure and sets the shot up oerfectly for the rule of thirds. If only you could have talked the mgmt into turning off the red lights at mid tower. That is the only distracting part. I think I''ll up the 1 to an 8.</td>', 'Towers aren''t buildings!!! I give you a 1.  Uhm. I mean, great job capturing the rain. It''s not always easy to do. I also like the angle it magnifizes the greatness of the structure and sets the shot up oerfectly for the rule of thirds. If only you could have talked the mgmt into turning off the red lights at mid tower. That is the only distracting part. I think I''ll up the 1 to an 8.', '2003-10-08 01:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(442067, 41218, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome !</td>', 'Thats awesome !', '2003-10-08 01:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
