(442534, 41152, 9109, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry laid out by the buildings, but I feel that the sky is too bland.</td>', 'Interesting geometry laid out by the buildings, but I feel that the sky is too bland.', '2003-10-08 07:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(442535, 40760, 9109, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot and the title fits perfectly. The border is a bit too thick for my liking though.</td>', 'The angle of the shot and the title fits perfectly. The border is a bit too thick for my liking though.', '2003-10-08 07:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(442537, 41366, 9109, '<td valign="top">LOL funny setup, but could do with more DOF though. The out-of-focus background doesn''t do well for a "cityscape" scene....</td>', 'LOL funny setup, but could do with more DOF though. The out-of-focus background doesn''t do well for a "cityscape" scene....', '2003-10-08 07:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(442538, 40429, 10125, '<td valign="top">vaccume?</td>', 'vaccume?', '2003-10-08 07:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(442539, 40474, 9109, '<td valign="top">Too much sky!!! If the were more interesting....</td>', 'Too much sky!!! If the were more interesting....', '2003-10-08 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(442543, 40764, 9109, '<td valign="top">Looks great except for the noise at the dark regions, and that darkened spot at the lower left of the frame - what is it?</td>', 'Looks great except for the noise at the dark regions, and that darkened spot at the lower left of the frame - what is it?', '2003-10-08 07:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(442544, 41392, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very colourful city, interesting angle that you''ve got there.</td>', 'Very colourful city, interesting angle that you''ve got there.', '2003-10-08 07:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(442545, 40474, 5728, '<td valign="top">This place is sure on my list of places to visit! I love those style buildings, I photographed a lot of them when I was in Russia two weeks ago. What a pity the sky was overcast, although the way you have used the sky as negative space is a good idea. So of the three people at DPC coming from Estonia I wonder who this pic belongs too :-) (8)</td>', 'This place is sure on my list of places to visit! I love those style buildings, I photographed a lot of them when I was in Russia two weeks ago. What a pity the sky was overcast, although the way you have used the sky as negative space is a good idea. So of the three people at DPC coming from Estonia I wonder who this pic belongs too :-) (8)', '2003-10-08 07:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(442546, 41239, 5728, '<td valign="top">When the skies are overcast I find going B &amp; W does a lot for a photo otherwise the sky just looks plain blown out. You made the right choice on that.</td>', 'When the skies are overcast I find going B & W does a lot for a photo otherwise the sky just looks plain blown out. You made the right choice on that.', '2003-10-08 07:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(442547, 40800, 5728, '<td valign="top">This isn''t an urban landscape, it is a landscape. Urban means in the city or town, so in an urban landscape you gotta see bridges, buildings that kind of stuff.</td>', 'This isn''t an urban landscape, it is a landscape. Urban means in the city or town, so in an urban landscape you gotta see bridges, buildings that kind of stuff.', '2003-10-08 07:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(442549, 41214, 9109, '<td valign="top">That''s a different way of looking at the city, nice frame!</td>', 'That''s a different way of looking at the city, nice frame!', '2003-10-08 07:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(442551, 41065, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, one you can be proud of. It''s got a very soft feel to it, neat image perhaps? The contrasts between the water, land and sky is awesome and the stormy looking sky tops it all off, well done (10)</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, one you can be proud of. It''s got a very soft feel to it, neat image perhaps? The contrasts between the water, land and sky is awesome and the stormy looking sky tops it all off, well done (10)', '2003-10-08 07:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(442557, 41049, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I love the light you''ve caught here, this was a good time of day for this shot. Great saturation. I like the grid pattern in the sky, although I''m not quite sure what it is. However, the composition doesn''t quite work for me. In my opinion, the new yorker building needs to take up more of the frame. 7</td>', 'Fantastic, I love the light you''ve caught here, this was a good time of day for this shot. Great saturation. I like the grid pattern in the sky, although I''m not quite sure what it is. However, the composition doesn''t quite work for me. In my opinion, the new yorker building needs to take up more of the frame. 7', '2003-10-08 08:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(442558, 41390, 9109, '<td valign="top">I like the way the trees frame the building.. Nice, clean colours too.</td>', 'I like the way the trees frame the building.. Nice, clean colours too.', '2003-10-08 08:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(442559, 41136, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in the building, but I think you should only have pushed the blues and cyans as the foreground is too oversaturated.  Perhaps some different cropping was required, there are just too many elements which take my eye away from the great building. 6</td>', 'Beautiful colours in the building, but I think you should only have pushed the blues and cyans as the foreground is too oversaturated.  Perhaps some different cropping was required, there are just too many elements which take my eye away from the great building. 6', '2003-10-08 08:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(442560, 41213, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 1/3 - 5/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 1/3 - 5/10', '2003-10-08 08:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(442561, 40959, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10', '2003-10-08 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(442562, 40564, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10', '2003-10-08 08:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(442563, 41174, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10', '2003-10-08 08:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(442564, 41136, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10', '2003-10-08 08:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(442566, 40416, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 8/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 8/10', '2003-10-08 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(442567, 41325, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 0/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 4/4,  technical 3/3, meeting the challenge 0/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(442568, 40645, 12243, '<td valign="top">Woohhoo, an Aussie entrant.</td>', 'Woohhoo, an Aussie entrant.', '2003-10-08 08:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(442569, 41351, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(442571, 41155, 8522, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of potential, but the orange colour cast as a result of the wrong white balance really spoils it here. This is an amazing building... did you consider shooting in portrait orientation? This would have emphasised the height as opposed to the width. There is just enough floor to let us know it''s there, but I find this a bit annoying... if the floor should be in the shot, then I think more needs to be made of it. There are so many great geometric shapes here, that I personally would have made more of them, going for a little more of an arty, abstract look than a snapshot, which is what this one looks like. 5</td>', 'This picture has a lot of potential, but the orange colour cast as a result of the wrong white balance really spoils it here. This is an amazing building... did you consider shooting in portrait orientation? This would have emphasised the height as opposed to the width. There is just enough floor to let us know it''s there, but I find this a bit annoying... if the floor should be in the shot, then I think more needs to be made of it. There are so many great geometric shapes here, that I personally would have made more of them, going for a little more of an arty, abstract look than a snapshot, which is what this one looks like. 5', '2003-10-08 08:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(442572, 41379, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 10/10', '2003-10-08 08:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(442573, 40867, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(442574, 40463, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(442575, 41232, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 6/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 6/10', '2003-10-08 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(442576, 40639, 8522, '<td valign="top">A very nice moody shot in duotone. Great choice of colour. 2 things bother me quite a lot here though.<br/>1: A horizon running halfway through the frame rarely works, and it doesn''t here... it looks unimaginative.<br/>2: I really can''t stand that border. I''ve never seen one of these borders that enhance a picture and just can''t understand why people keep using them.<br/>Score: 6<br/>Score with above issues addressed: Probably 8</td>', 'A very nice moody shot in duotone. Great choice of colour. 2 things bother me quite a lot here though.1: A horizon running halfway through the frame rarely works, and it doesn''t here... it looks unimaginative.2: I really can''t stand that border. I''ve never seen one of these borders that enhance a picture and just can''t understand why people keep using them.Score: 6Score with above issues addressed: Probably 8', '2003-10-08 08:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(442577, 41207, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 5/10<br/>I get your point however.</td>', 'Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 5/10I get your point however.', '2003-10-08 08:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(442578, 41281, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 8/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 8/10', '2003-10-08 08:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(442579, 41085, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(442580, 41374, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 -6/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 -6/10', '2003-10-08 08:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(442581, 41007, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(442582, 41094, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 6/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 6/10', '2003-10-08 08:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(442583, 41313, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 4/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 1/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 2/3 - 4/10', '2003-10-08 08:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(442586, 40469, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 8/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 3/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 8/10', '2003-10-08 08:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(442588, 40622, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 1/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(442589, 41403, 11114, '<td valign="top">Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10</td>', 'Visual appeal 2/4,  technical 2/3, meeting the challenge 3/3 - 7/10', '2003-10-08 08:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(442590, 40678, 8522, '<td valign="top">There are so  many rows of coloured houses like this in Brighton that I can''t help feeling there must have been a better picture somewhere. I''d have tried to find a shot without cars. The building in the top right really doesn''t look good. Great idea though. 5</td>', 'There are so  many rows of coloured houses like this in Brighton that I can''t help feeling there must have been a better picture somewhere. I''d have tried to find a shot without cars. The building in the top right really doesn''t look good. Great idea though. 5', '2003-10-08 08:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(442594, 41138, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic use of complementary colours. Great study in contrasts. Shame about the bird that''s been cut in half by the spire. An unusual take on the challenge. 8</td>', 'Wow, fantastic use of complementary colours. Great study in contrasts. Shame about the bird that''s been cut in half by the spire. An unusual take on the challenge. 8', '2003-10-08 08:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(442596, 40790, 12661, '<td valign="top">A tad of clockwise rotation could have helped. A nice choice in subjects though. There is more to Urban than sparkling reflective skyscrapers.</td>', 'A tad of clockwise rotation could have helped. A nice choice in subjects though. There is more to Urban than sparkling reflective skyscrapers.', '2003-10-08 08:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(442597, 41215, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the purple fringing which is beyond your control. The wonky tower is though... why didn''t you correct it? The picture is underexposed (look at the clock), and I think the composition needs to be a lot more imaginative. 4</td>', 'Shame about the purple fringing which is beyond your control. The wonky tower is though... why didn''t you correct it? The picture is underexposed (look at the clock), and I think the composition needs to be a lot more imaginative. 4', '2003-10-08 08:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(442599, 41233, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the idea.  Too bad this shot is so overexposed.  Could have worked in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the idea.  Too bad this shot is so overexposed.  Could have worked in B&W too.', '2003-10-08 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(442600, 41165, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative title! Great shot, tricky to expose for and you managed very well. Effective composition. Nice use of duotone. I like the textures. 8</td>', 'Very imaginative title! Great shot, tricky to expose for and you managed very well. Effective composition. Nice use of duotone. I like the textures. 8', '2003-10-08 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(442602, 41265, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very overexposed, you''ve lost loads of detail in the highlights. 4</td>', 'Very overexposed, you''ve lost loads of detail in the highlights. 4', '2003-10-08 08:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(442603, 40429, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the spelling makes me doubt whether I should take the photographer seriously. Shame about the burnt out highlights. Good composition. 6</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the spelling makes me doubt whether I should take the photographer seriously. Shame about the burnt out highlights. Good composition. 6', '2003-10-08 08:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(442606, 41389, 12061, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent picture. I just love the reflection.</td>', 'this is an excellent picture. I just love the reflection.', '2003-10-08 08:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(442609, 41345, 8522, '<td valign="top">Way too much sharpening, you can see artifacting all around the building. Nice architecture. Composition doesn''t strike me as very imaginative though. 5</td>', 'Way too much sharpening, you can see artifacting all around the building. Nice architecture. Composition doesn''t strike me as very imaginative though. 5', '2003-10-08 08:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(442610, 41378, 12061, '<td valign="top">good timing on the exposure .. I really like the softenss of the water</td>', 'good timing on the exposure .. I really like the softenss of the water', '2003-10-08 08:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(442612, 40565, 12061, '<td valign="top">This picture could be brightened up a little, looks a bit dull</td>', 'This picture could be brightened up a little, looks a bit dull', '2003-10-08 08:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(442613, 41379, 12061, '<td valign="top">Great night shot. I wish the glare on that light pole was a little less dramatic</td>', 'Great night shot. I wish the glare on that light pole was a little less dramatic', '2003-10-08 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(442614, 41370, 12061, '<td valign="top">Looks low res - or a bit too blurry</td>', 'Looks low res - or a bit too blurry', '2003-10-08 08:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(442615, 40813, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wish the metro were clearer, it took me a little while before I realised what it was. Great sunset and building. 6</td>', 'I wish the metro were clearer, it took me a little while before I realised what it was. Great sunset and building. 6', '2003-10-08 08:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(442616, 41389, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent foreground, too bad the sky scraper is kinda blown out.  maybe on a less sunny day you would have had better luck. 7.</td>', 'excellent foreground, too bad the sky scraper is kinda blown out.  maybe on a less sunny day you would have had better luck. 7.', '2003-10-08 08:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(442617, 41062, 12061, '<td valign="top">Great colors - I''d say it would look better if you cropped some of the grass off on the bottom, and added a little more sky</td>', 'Great colors - I''d say it would look better if you cropped some of the grass off on the bottom, and added a little more sky', '2003-10-08 08:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(442618, 41294, 472, '<td valign="top">kick ass abstract</td>', 'kick ass abstract', '2003-10-08 08:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(442619, 40953, 12061, '<td valign="top">yikes, too small - hard to really tell if its a good picture</td>', 'yikes, too small - hard to really tell if its a good picture', '2003-10-08 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(442620, 41138, 12061, '<td valign="top">nice! So sharp</td>', 'nice! So sharp', '2003-10-08 08:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(442621, 41323, 12061, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too much sky ... very nice though</td>', 'Maybe a little too much sky ... very nice though', '2003-10-08 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(442622, 41218, 472, '<td valign="top">absolutely top notch.  meets the challenge perfectly, with wow to spare.  postcard ready!</td>', 'absolutely top notch.  meets the challenge perfectly, with wow to spare.  postcard ready!', '2003-10-08 08:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(442623, 40471, 12061, '<td valign="top">interesting architecture - I kinda like this.</td>', 'interesting architecture - I kinda like this.', '2003-10-08 08:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(442624, 40676, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing picture but I wish it was more urban. I know this is controversial, but I just can''t give it the score it would deserve on it''s own merits. It''s just (to me) not urban in any way whatsoever. 5</td>', 'Wow, amazing picture but I wish it was more urban. I know this is controversial, but I just can''t give it the score it would deserve on it''s own merits. It''s just (to me) not urban in any way whatsoever. 5', '2003-10-08 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(442626, 41056, 472, '<td valign="top">nice shot. there''s a bit of a greenish color cast to it.</td>', 'nice shot. there''s a bit of a greenish color cast to it.', '2003-10-08 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(442627, 41281, 472, '<td valign="top">nice light and compo but shots is a little bit out of focus or camera shaken</td>', 'nice light and compo but shots is a little bit out of focus or camera shaken', '2003-10-08 08:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(442628, 40864, 8522, '<td valign="top">I can''t work out why on earth this photo needed inverting. 2</td>', 'I can''t work out why on earth this photo needed inverting. 2', '2003-10-08 08:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(442631, 41350, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s so blurry. It''s a cliched shot, but it''s cliched because it''s good. 7</td>', 'Shame it''s so blurry. It''s a cliched shot, but it''s cliched because it''s good. 7', '2003-10-08 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(442642, 41370, 8522, '<td valign="top">An impressionistic treatment. I get the impression that this would look a lot better if you were allowed to show it with larger dimensions. It just doesn''t work with the 640 constraint. There''s not much you can do about this though (other than enter another picture!), but I can''t imagine the missing detail. 7</td>', 'An impressionistic treatment. I get the impression that this would look a lot better if you were allowed to show it with larger dimensions. It just doesn''t work with the 640 constraint. There''s not much you can do about this though (other than enter another picture!), but I can''t imagine the missing detail. 7', '2003-10-08 09:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(442644, 40987, 8522, '<td valign="top">Is Times Square on a hill? This really needs straightening. 4</td>', 'Is Times Square on a hill? This really needs straightening. 4', '2003-10-08 09:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(442650, 41102, 8522, '<td valign="top">Way too much sharpening, you can see bad artifacting all along the horizon. Interesting view, but the colours look a bit Photoshopped. 6</td>', 'Way too much sharpening, you can see bad artifacting all along the horizon. Interesting view, but the colours look a bit Photoshopped. 6', '2003-10-08 09:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(442653, 41325, 12061, '<td valign="top">love the tones and saturation in this pic</td>', 'love the tones and saturation in this pic', '2003-10-08 09:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(442656, 41381, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun interplay of reflection light, and DOF. Very nice. 9</td>', 'Fun interplay of reflection light, and DOF. Very nice. 9', '2003-10-08 09:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(442657, 41211, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Interesting point of view; most would choose to be closer to the busy street. 9</td>', 'Lovely! Interesting point of view; most would choose to be closer to the busy street. 9', '2003-10-08 09:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(442658, 40959, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful exposure controls here in a tough situation. 9</td>', 'Wonderful exposure controls here in a tough situation. 9', '2003-10-08 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(442659, 40760, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice claustrophobic feeling to this shot. I like the thicker border,too. 10</td>', 'Nice claustrophobic feeling to this shot. I like the thicker border,too. 10', '2003-10-08 09:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(442660, 40460, 6870, '<td valign="top">what a nice mood here. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'what a nice mood here. Nice composition, too.', '2003-10-08 09:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(442665, 40860, 8522, '<td valign="top">Needs straightening. I''m not convinced by your choice of colour. I think the photo needs more tonal contrast. Score: 5 (6 in normal black and white, and straightened).</td>', 'Needs straightening. I''m not convinced by your choice of colour. I think the photo needs more tonal contrast. Score: 5 (6 in normal black and white, and straightened).', '2003-10-08 09:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(442669, 40928, 12061, '<td valign="top">The lens flare and strong rays don''t work for me</td>', 'The lens flare and strong rays don''t work for me', '2003-10-08 09:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(442671, 41392, 12061, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful, colorful, crisp image!</td>', 'what a beautiful, colorful, crisp image!', '2003-10-08 09:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(442673, 40432, 8522, '<td valign="top">A great shot, but I really wich you hadn''t chopped the people in half at the bottom. This looks careless, and confuses the viewer. Are they supposed to be there? Either crop them out altogether, or make them an integral part of the shot. 6</td>', 'A great shot, but I really wich you hadn''t chopped the people in half at the bottom. This looks careless, and confuses the viewer. Are they supposed to be there? Either crop them out altogether, or make them an integral part of the shot. 6', '2003-10-08 09:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
