(442860, 40453, 3569, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t consider Bishop''s Castle as urban...nearest town San Isabel is 6 mile south.  But nice shot of Jim''s dream.</td>', 'I wouldn''t consider Bishop''s Castle as urban...nearest town San Isabel is 6 mile south.  But nice shot of Jim''s dream.', '2003-10-08 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(442864, 41218, 656, '<td valign="top">Great scene, particularly with the dark lake off to the side.  <br/> <br/>Very good entry.  From the Hanncock Building ?   If I had to make suggestions - maybe slightly earlier in the evening so the sky wasn''t totally black, but I don''t know then if hte lights are on and maybe a touch less sky/ more pointed downwards if you could ?  A very strong entry for the theme.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great scene, particularly with the dark lake off to the side.   Very good entry.  From the Hanncock Building ?   If I had to make suggestions - maybe slightly earlier in the evening so the sky wasn''t totally black, but I don''t know then if hte lights are on and maybe a touch less sky/ more pointed downwards if you could ?  A very strong entry for the theme. ', '2003-10-08 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(442871, 40540, 5728, '<td valign="top">An absolutely beautiful photo, perfectly composed. The lights are amazing, not blown out anywhere meaning a spot on exposure - 10</td>', 'An absolutely beautiful photo, perfectly composed. The lights are amazing, not blown out anywhere meaning a spot on exposure - 10', '2003-10-08 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(442872, 41226, 5728, '<td valign="top">The reflections are so clear. Good thing you got that blue sky in the background, an overcast day wouldn''t have had the same effect - 10</td>', 'The reflections are so clear. Good thing you got that blue sky in the background, an overcast day wouldn''t have had the same effect - 10', '2003-10-08 11:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(442874, 41088, 5728, '<td valign="top">The gold toning is what makes this photo a pleasure to look at, choice!</td>', 'The gold toning is what makes this photo a pleasure to look at, choice!', '2003-10-08 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(442875, 41410, 5728, '<td valign="top">Photo = perfect, Exposure = perfect, Composition = perfect. You can''t get better than that! (10)</td>', 'Photo = perfect, Exposure = perfect, Composition = perfect. You can''t get better than that! (10)', '2003-10-08 11:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(442879, 41402, 12661, '<td valign="top">The tree looks kind of odd. It''s too small for it''s location. But I guess that''s more of a landscape issue than a photography issue.</td>', 'The tree looks kind of odd. It''s too small for it''s location. But I guess that''s more of a landscape issue than a photography issue.', '2003-10-08 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(442880, 41176, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very quaint and just screaming history. Maybe a slight bit on the soft side though.</td>', 'Very quaint and just screaming history. Maybe a slight bit on the soft side though.', '2003-10-08 11:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(442882, 41272, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool effect with the people moving past in a blur, almost like ghosts. A very good concept (10)</td>', 'Cool effect with the people moving past in a blur, almost like ghosts. A very good concept (10)', '2003-10-08 11:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(442884, 41214, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, certainly different to most the other shots, well done.</td>', 'This is a good idea, certainly different to most the other shots, well done.', '2003-10-08 11:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(442885, 41394, 10643, '<td valign="top">good, actually has that landscape feel. the reflections of the headlights and taillights in the cars are sort of distracting but at the same time a nice detail. I might have cropped it slightly higher to get more of that nice sky.</td>', 'good, actually has that landscape feel. the reflections of the headlights and taillights in the cars are sort of distracting but at the same time a nice detail. I might have cropped it slightly higher to get more of that nice sky.', '2003-10-08 11:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(442886, 40887, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and beautiful clouds. The fact that the bridge blends into the cityscape is a bit distracting. I think a higher vanage point that would have isolated the bridge with water above and below it could have added something to the photo.</td>', 'Very nice capture and beautiful clouds. The fact that the bridge blends into the cityscape is a bit distracting. I think a higher vanage point that would have isolated the bridge with water above and below it could have added something to the photo.', '2003-10-08 11:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(442887, 41183, 10643, '<td valign="top">nice juxtaposition, buildings like this next to each other are always so jarring!</td>', 'nice juxtaposition, buildings like this next to each other are always so jarring!', '2003-10-08 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(442888, 41361, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for B&amp;W and I like the contrast between factory and mountains.</td>', 'Nice choice for B&W and I like the contrast between factory and mountains.', '2003-10-08 11:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(442889, 40887, 10643, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. i''m not a fan of that wheel at all but it''s actually sort of attractive here.</td>', 'beautiful shot. i''m not a fan of that wheel at all but it''s actually sort of attractive here.', '2003-10-08 11:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(442890, 41342, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!!! The silohuette stands out so prominently against the sky. And that red toning just kicks this image into top mark territory :-) -----&gt; 10</td>', 'Awesome!!!!! The silohuette stands out so prominently against the sky. And that red toning just kicks this image into top mark territory :-) -----> 10', '2003-10-08 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
