(442962, 41325, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow this almost looks like a painting. Although it isn''t really an urban landscape, more rural in fact, I am guessing you don''t live in a town or city and this is the best you could find. I''m still going to give it a 10 tho....</td>', 'Wow this almost looks like a painting. Although it isn''t really an urban landscape, more rural in fact, I am guessing you don''t live in a town or city and this is the best you could find. I''m still going to give it a 10 tho....', '2003-10-08 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(442964, 40796, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic building. I  do think they look a bit tilted here and the light post on the left needed be cropped out.</td>', 'Fantastic building. I  do think they look a bit tilted here and the light post on the left needed be cropped out.', '2003-10-08 11:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(442966, 41389, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man this is going to be interesting to see who wins this challenge, there are so many good shots here. And this one is definitely a candidate for a ribbon. Only one number for it ----&gt;  "10"</td>', 'Man this is going to be interesting to see who wins this challenge, there are so many good shots here. And this one is definitely a candidate for a ribbon. Only one number for it ---->  "10"', '2003-10-08 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
