(443005, 41272, 8522, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a cheating entry at first, but it turns out it is an almost identical shot to one in this month''s Total Digital Photographer magazine (page 113, by Richard Wentk). I''d like to give it a 10, but the fact that there is an almost identical photo on the newstands this month knocks it down for me. It also needs more sharpening. 7</td>', 'I thought this was a cheating entry at first, but it turns out it is an almost identical shot to one in this month''s Total Digital Photographer magazine (page 113, by Richard Wentk). I''d like to give it a 10, but the fact that there is an almost identical photo on the newstands this month knocks it down for me. It also needs more sharpening. 7', '2003-10-08 12:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(443006, 41333, 11155, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like that this was shot at street level and what appears to be in the middle of the street.  Lighting is perfect.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like that this was shot at street level and what appears to be in the middle of the street.  Lighting is perfect.', '2003-10-08 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
