(443150, 40871, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice study in circular shapes with a great sky as a background. The bright buildings at the bottom of the picture tend to break the mood a little.</td>', 'A nice study in circular shapes with a great sky as a background. The bright buildings at the bottom of the picture tend to break the mood a little.', '2003-10-08 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(443152, 40873, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of veiw. I also like the pastel look of the colors. Speaking of colors, the yellow car does draw a little to much of my attention away from the rest of the image. But still nice image.</td>', 'I like the angle of veiw. I also like the pastel look of the colors. Speaking of colors, the yellow car does draw a little to much of my attention away from the rest of the image. But still nice image.', '2003-10-08 12:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(443154, 40792, 12661, '<td valign="top">The streetlights are detracting from the cityscape. Next time bring a BB gun. ;)</td>', 'The streetlights are detracting from the cityscape. Next time bring a BB gun. ;)', '2003-10-08 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(443155, 40698, 12733, '<td valign="top">Phoenixville has a beautiful library, and your photo captures the attractive masonry on the facade.</td>', 'Phoenixville has a beautiful library, and your photo captures the attractive masonry on the facade.', '2003-10-08 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(443156, 40796, 10785, '<td valign="top">With the way your country is growing, you ought to have some national pride and patriotism. Nice capture of a well known monument. Cheers!</td>', 'With the way your country is growing, you ought to have some national pride and patriotism. Nice capture of a well known monument. Cheers!', '2003-10-08 12:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(443157, 41181, 4813, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I bet the color version is just as good</td>', 'Great photo.  I bet the color version is just as good', '2003-10-08 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(443158, 41338, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. A red sunset behind the image would have made the shot spectacular. But alas, we can''t move the sun. :(</td>', 'Nicely composed. A red sunset behind the image would have made the shot spectacular. But alas, we can''t move the sun. :(', '2003-10-08 12:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(443159, 41317, 6845, '<td valign="top">That is alot of trees. They have great color to them.</td>', 'That is alot of trees. They have great color to them.', '2003-10-08 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(443161, 41011, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective lines.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective lines.', '2003-10-08 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(443162, 41366, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the set up. makes for a nice composition.</td>', 'I like the set up. makes for a nice composition.', '2003-10-08 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(443163, 41261, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s a spectacular sky and a good choice of buildings for the foreground.</td>', 'That''s a spectacular sky and a good choice of buildings for the foreground.', '2003-10-08 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(443164, 40540, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice night time image.</td>', 'Nice night time image.', '2003-10-08 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(443165, 40676, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot. I hope people don''t slam it for not fitting their definition of urban.</td>', 'Very beautiful shot. I hope people don''t slam it for not fitting their definition of urban.', '2003-10-08 12:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(443167, 40432, 6845, '<td valign="top">This image messes with my head, but I like it.</td>', 'This image messes with my head, but I like it.', '2003-10-08 12:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(443168, 41056, 12733, '<td valign="top">The town seems dwarfed by the majestic mountain and lovely sky.</td>', 'The town seems dwarfed by the majestic mountain and lovely sky.', '2003-10-08 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(443169, 41378, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Have you considered going back and taking a picture with a longer exposure time to get a blur effect from the waterfalls?</td>', 'Nice composition. Have you considered going back and taking a picture with a longer exposure time to get a blur effect from the waterfalls?', '2003-10-08 12:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(443170, 41260, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the angle used here. Nice image.</td>', 'I like the angle used here. Nice image.', '2003-10-08 12:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(443171, 40519, 6845, '<td valign="top">I personaly would have liked to have seen the light post more off to the right of the image. But I do like the mood it creates.</td>', 'I personaly would have liked to have seen the light post more off to the right of the image. But I do like the mood it creates.', '2003-10-08 12:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(443172, 41088, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflection. Including some sky above the building to contrast the reflected sky on the building may have added something to the picture.</td>', 'Nice use of reflection. Including some sky above the building to contrast the reflected sky on the building may have added something to the picture.', '2003-10-08 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(443173, 40463, 12733, '<td valign="top">You certainly found an interesting selection of rooms to shoot, and you''ve composed them will into an attractive photo.</td>', 'You certainly found an interesting selection of rooms to shoot, and you''ve composed them will into an attractive photo.', '2003-10-08 12:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(443174, 40772, 12661, '<td valign="top">The grid adds too much confusion.</td>', 'The grid adds too much confusion.', '2003-10-08 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(443177, 41133, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Great composition. The plane, for me, adds so mush more to the image. Great shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Great composition. The plane, for me, adds so mush more to the image. Great shot.', '2003-10-08 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(443179, 41062, 12733, '<td valign="top">The building contrasts nicesly with the amazingly green grass to create a very attractive picture.</td>', 'The building contrasts nicesly with the amazingly green grass to create a very attractive picture.', '2003-10-08 13:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(443180, 40786, 12661, '<td valign="top">Spectacular symetry. If only the guy in the right circle window office would have been nice enough to turn off his light. ;)</td>', 'Spectacular symetry. If only the guy in the right circle window office would have been nice enough to turn off his light. ;)', '2003-10-08 13:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(443181, 40564, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic shot.</td>', 'Nice graphic shot.', '2003-10-08 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(443182, 41294, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting veiw. I like it.</td>', 'This is a very interesting veiw. I like it.', '2003-10-08 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(443183, 41250, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice low-key silhouetting and framing to create a somber mood.</td>', 'Nice low-key silhouetting and framing to create a somber mood.', '2003-10-08 13:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443184, 41289, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. This is one of the few images in the challenge that really works well with a centered horizon.</td>', 'Nice composition. This is one of the few images in the challenge that really works well with a centered horizon.', '2003-10-08 13:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(443185, 41410, 12733, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of brightly lit night skylines in this challenge, but this one is a real grabber.</td>', 'There are a lot of brightly lit night skylines in this challenge, but this one is a real grabber.', '2003-10-08 13:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(443186, 41060, 12733, '<td valign="top">The stone texture makes the gate itself very attractive; the view through it arouses great curiosity.</td>', 'The stone texture makes the gate itself very attractive; the view through it arouses great curiosity.', '2003-10-08 13:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(443187, 41138, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The light color of the building really helps the one bird stand out. I like the colors.</td>', 'Nice image. The light color of the building really helps the one bird stand out. I like the colors.', '2003-10-08 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(443188, 41128, 9949, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture and title! My favourite in this challenge, a 10.</td>', 'Wonderful picture and title! My favourite in this challenge, a 10.', '2003-10-08 13:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(443189, 41389, 11241, '<td valign="top">very nice reflection in the water...very nice shot</td>', 'very nice reflection in the water...very nice shot', '2003-10-08 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(443191, 41128, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. nice composition.</td>', 'This is a great image. nice composition.', '2003-10-08 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(443193, 41177, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this image. Nice capture.</td>', 'I really like the feel of this image. Nice capture.', '2003-10-08 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(443194, 40758, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic image. I rreally like the composition.</td>', 'Nice graphic image. I rreally like the composition.', '2003-10-08 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(443198, 40937, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.</td>', 'Nice color and composition.', '2003-10-08 13:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
