(443586, 41059, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, especially the contrast between the silo and the sky. I have to wonder about the sky, though - it seems to get lighter closer to the silo rather than closer to the top of the frame as it naturally would. Is that unsharp mask?</td>', 'I like the colors here, especially the contrast between the silo and the sky. I have to wonder about the sky, though - it seems to get lighter closer to the silo rather than closer to the top of the frame as it naturally would. Is that unsharp mask?', '2003-10-08 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
