(443627, 41129, 208, '<td valign="top">Oh - a la 1950! Now I get why you''re using that effect - you certainly nailed it. I''m not sure about the composition, though. Maybe lower the shot and shift it right - more of the statue and move the statue more to the left.</td>', 'Oh - a la 1950! Now I get why you''re using that effect - you certainly nailed it. I''m not sure about the composition, though. Maybe lower the shot and shift it right - more of the statue and move the statue more to the left.', '2003-10-08 16:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
