(443629, 41288, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent landscape photo. (foreground, midground, and background clearly defined) The horizon is in the bottom third, which is a plus. Maybe the atmosphere is hazy, but this looks a little under-exposed. The trees in the foreground seem to be exposed the best, then it fades into the background. Possibly Intentional?</td>', 'Excellent landscape photo. (foreground, midground, and background clearly defined) The horizon is in the bottom third, which is a plus. Maybe the atmosphere is hazy, but this looks a little under-exposed. The trees in the foreground seem to be exposed the best, then it fades into the background. Possibly Intentional?', '2003-10-08 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(443631, 41189, 208, '<td valign="top">I wish the buildings could be as clear as the sky. I really like the composition - it''s not some typical symmetrical picture.</td>', 'I wish the buildings could be as clear as the sky. I really like the composition - it''s not some typical symmetrical picture.', '2003-10-08 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
