(443684, 40800, 7778, '<td valign="top">This interpretation, I suspect, will get some flak here for stretching the topic. It is, however, quite a beautiful capture, which I''m rating accordingly. Would a slight change of perspective have resulted in a more pleasing composition with respect to the centred rock or mount? The single grass stem appears just a little too sparse to achieve a fully balanced result.<br/> <br/>I also wish the image was a little larger than it is.</td>', 'This interpretation, I suspect, will get some flak here for stretching the topic. It is, however, quite a beautiful capture, which I''m rating accordingly. Would a slight change of perspective have resulted in a more pleasing composition with respect to the centred rock or mount? The single grass stem appears just a little too sparse to achieve a fully balanced result. I also wish the image was a little larger than it is.', '2003-10-08 17:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(443686, 41184, 11321, '<td valign="top">bonus for finding symmetry,<br/>minus for not closeing all the doors and windows... just jokeing!<br/>great find!</td>', 'bonus for finding symmetry,minus for not closeing all the doors and windows... just jokeing!great find!', '2003-10-08 17:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
