(443722, 41046, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is very striking! I love the balance of bright color and stark metal. Good composition here. Very otherworldly. The bridge detracts from the skyline, but I only noticed it on second glance.</td>', 'This is very striking! I love the balance of bright color and stark metal. Good composition here. Very otherworldly. The bridge detracts from the skyline, but I only noticed it on second glance.', '2003-10-08 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
