(443734, 41132, 11114, '<td valign="top">What a vivid reflection, compared to the gloomy sky behind the building.  Did you have to max out any of your settings to acheive this or is this the way it looked at the time?</td>', 'What a vivid reflection, compared to the gloomy sky behind the building.  Did you have to max out any of your settings to acheive this or is this the way it looked at the time?', '2003-10-08 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
