(443759, 40927, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like how you show how this big hunk of steel and glass is surrounded by much smaller buildings and greenery.  <br/> <br/>I always wonder what pushes city councils to accept the building of such large structures that look soooo out of place with their surroundings.  These people should read up on Post Modernism.  Adapt new buildings to the existing man-mande and natural landscape.  It doesn''t look as goofy.<br/> <br/>Keep up the nice work.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like how you show how this big hunk of steel and glass is surrounded by much smaller buildings and greenery.   I always wonder what pushes city councils to accept the building of such large structures that look soooo out of place with their surroundings.  These people should read up on Post Modernism.  Adapt new buildings to the existing man-mande and natural landscape.  It doesn''t look as goofy. Keep up the nice work.', '2003-10-08 17:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(443760, 41404, 11114, '<td valign="top">They DO look like they''re popping up out of the ground.  I''d like to see it with the top cropped off so that only the roofs are visible but perhaps it works best this way.</td>', 'They DO look like they''re popping up out of the ground.  I''d like to see it with the top cropped off so that only the roofs are visible but perhaps it works best this way.', '2003-10-08 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(443763, 40813, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice elements.</td>', 'Nice elements.', '2003-10-08 17:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(443765, 41010, 2223, '<td valign="top">Like, WOW. I absolutley LOVE this!! Good luck. 10+</td>', 'Like, WOW. I absolutley LOVE this!! Good luck. 10+', '2003-10-08 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(443766, 41069, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, I like it.</td>', 'Nicely framed, I like it.', '2003-10-08 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(443768, 40801, 11114, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Although there are buildings it would be a stretch to say this is urban, but it IS lovely.  Where is it?  NFLD?</td>', 'Lovely.  Although there are buildings it would be a stretch to say this is urban, but it IS lovely.  Where is it?  NFLD?', '2003-10-08 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(443771, 40837, 11114, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what it is</td>', 'I can''t figure out what it is', '2003-10-08 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(443774, 40496, 2223, '<td valign="top">Don''t you mean the Empire State Building?</td>', 'Don''t you mean the Empire State Building?', '2003-10-08 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(443775, 40811, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting and rendition of the details is just right, and the dark background really sets the tower off. This is a very mysterious building - what is it?</td>', 'The lighting and rendition of the details is just right, and the dark background really sets the tower off. This is a very mysterious building - what is it?', '2003-10-08 17:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(443776, 41138, 11114, '<td valign="top">Should we be looking at the birds or the buildings?</td>', 'Should we be looking at the birds or the buildings?', '2003-10-08 17:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(443777, 40665, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good photo, a little bit sharper would have been great,</td>', 'Good photo, a little bit sharper would have been great,', '2003-10-08 17:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(443779, 41264, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of background fog and foreground clarity. The boats add to the effect, but the tree, especially in dead-center position, detracts - at least for me.</td>', 'Nice contrast of background fog and foreground clarity. The boats add to the effect, but the tree, especially in dead-center position, detracts - at least for me.', '2003-10-08 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(443780, 40758, 11114, '<td valign="top">The radiating supports provide visual interest, but neither the sky nor the building beyond the glass are particulary interesting - I think it needs a little more.</td>', 'The radiating supports provide visual interest, but neither the sky nor the building beyond the glass are particulary interesting - I think it needs a little more.', '2003-10-08 17:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(443783, 40861, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice, has a peaceful feeling to it!</td>', 'Nice, has a peaceful feeling to it!', '2003-10-08 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(443785, 41024, 11114, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition but it looks a bit grainy to me</td>', 'Lovely composition but it looks a bit grainy to me', '2003-10-08 17:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(443786, 40519, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nifty - having the sun behind the lantern.</td>', 'Nifty - having the sun behind the lantern.', '2003-10-08 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(443788, 40887, 11114, '<td valign="top">Very nice compisition - the lovely sky colours on top and the visual interest of the ferris wheel to the left with older London on the right - I love it.  I might have cropped out some of the foreground - not sure it adds anything.</td>', 'Very nice compisition - the lovely sky colours on top and the visual interest of the ferris wheel to the left with older London on the right - I love it.  I might have cropped out some of the foreground - not sure it adds anything.', '2003-10-08 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(443789, 40510, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern of lights. You found the right vantage point to give the light background and foreground to border the darker center.</td>', 'Nice pattern of lights. You found the right vantage point to give the light background and foreground to border the darker center.', '2003-10-08 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(443790, 40697, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2003-10-08 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(443792, 41410, 11114, '<td valign="top">Maybe San Diego will buy it as a postcard!  Lovely to look at, and lots of space in the foreground to write San Diego.  Otherwise I think I''d crop the foreground some.</td>', 'Maybe San Diego will buy it as a postcard!  Lovely to look at, and lots of space in the foreground to write San Diego.  Otherwise I think I''d crop the foreground some.', '2003-10-08 17:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(443794, 41139, 12733, '<td valign="top">Briliant colors on the graffiti on the walls,garbage on the ground and that totally incogruous lettering. Somehow, it all works.</td>', 'Briliant colors on the graffiti on the walls,garbage on the ground and that totally incogruous lettering. Somehow, it all works.', '2003-10-08 18:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(443797, 41065, 12733, '<td valign="top">The golden light and the reflections create a lovely image.</td>', 'The golden light and the reflections create a lovely image.', '2003-10-08 18:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(443798, 40662, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good timing - enough light to show the shapes of the buildings, enough dark for the lights to stand out. And the sky color is astounding.</td>', 'Good timing - enough light to show the shapes of the buildings, enough dark for the lights to stand out. And the sky color is astounding.', '2003-10-08 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(443800, 41136, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the warm colors and rounded shapes in the foreground and the stark shapes and cool colors in the background.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the warm colors and rounded shapes in the foreground and the stark shapes and cool colors in the background.', '2003-10-08 18:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(443805, 41069, 12733, '<td valign="top">The hall is an interesting building, and the foreground flowers really set it off. Great depth of field - was this a wide angle lens?</td>', 'The hall is an interesting building, and the foreground flowers really set it off. Great depth of field - was this a wide angle lens?', '2003-10-08 18:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(443810, 41011, 509, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get too many complaints of "blurriness".  I really think it adds to this.  This has a surreal type look to it, and almost looks as though it could be an airbrushed graphic, rather than a photograph.  Was the image this color naturally?  It has a nice duotone quality to it.  Overall very nice work.  -9-</td>', 'I hope you don''t get too many complaints of "blurriness".  I really think it adds to this.  This has a surreal type look to it, and almost looks as though it could be an airbrushed graphic, rather than a photograph.  Was the image this color naturally?  It has a nice duotone quality to it.  Overall very nice work.  -9-', '2003-10-08 18:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443812, 40627, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting architecture, but a landscape?  That''s a bit of a stretch.  I like the lens flare highlites, but overall the lighting seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'Interesting architecture, but a landscape?  That''s a bit of a stretch.  I like the lens flare highlites, but overall the lighting seems a bit harsh.', '2003-10-08 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(443813, 41059, 11114, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!  Did you have to pump up the saturation or did it come this way?  I think it''s a winner.</td>', 'Magnificent!  Did you have to pump up the saturation or did it come this way?  I think it''s a winner.', '2003-10-08 18:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(443816, 40747, 509, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this shot is a bit skewed...  Was this intentional?  If so, I don''t see the need for it... The picture doesn''t hold very much interest imho.</td>', 'The perspective on this shot is a bit skewed...  Was this intentional?  If so, I don''t see the need for it... The picture doesn''t hold very much interest imho.', '2003-10-08 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(443818, 40867, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - it looks as though the image could be rotated clockwise a little, but that would throw off the vertical nature of the space needle, though a slight rotate might be a good compromise.  Nice work -7-</td>', 'Nice perspective - it looks as though the image could be rotated clockwise a little, but that would throw off the vertical nature of the space needle, though a slight rotate might be a good compromise.  Nice work -7-', '2003-10-08 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(443821, 41367, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting silhouettes, beautiful sky, nice rendition of the water.</td>', 'Interesting silhouettes, beautiful sky, nice rendition of the water.', '2003-10-08 18:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(443824, 40678, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a pretty street, and nicely presented.</td>', 'What a pretty street, and nicely presented.', '2003-10-08 18:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(443825, 41408, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the clarity. I really like the reflections off of the buildings on the left. Seems to have too much sky (wasted space).</td>', 'I like the colors and the clarity. I really like the reflections off of the buildings on the left. Seems to have too much sky (wasted space).', '2003-10-08 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(443827, 41218, 10339, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The buildings have just the right amount of light, and can see the outline of the lake clearly.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The buildings have just the right amount of light, and can see the outline of the lake clearly.', '2003-10-08 18:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(443828, 40760, 10339, '<td valign="top">I really get the sense of looking up in this! Nice.</td>', 'I really get the sense of looking up in this! Nice.', '2003-10-08 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(443830, 40927, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, nice contrast with foregorund water, trees and stone along the shore. A very pretty sky.</td>', 'Interesting building, nice contrast with foregorund water, trees and stone along the shore. A very pretty sky.', '2003-10-08 18:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(443834, 41261, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in the sky. The buildings seem to lean in to the center a bit.</td>', 'I like the colors in the sky. The buildings seem to lean in to the center a bit.', '2003-10-08 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(443836, 41371, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! I have flown through Hartsfield many times. It has never looked this nice! I love the colors and the reflections on the planes.</td>', 'Wow! I have flown through Hartsfield many times. It has never looked this nice! I love the colors and the reflections on the planes.', '2003-10-08 18:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(443838, 40606, 12325, '<td valign="top">Really great view, the coulds are fantastic.  It''s a bit underexposed towards the bottom left though..</td>', 'Really great view, the coulds are fantastic.  It''s a bit underexposed towards the bottom left though..', '2003-10-08 18:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(443841, 41157, 12733, '<td valign="top">The buildings are picturesque, the water is incredibly blue - this could be an advertisement for the country or a postcard.</td>', 'The buildings are picturesque, the water is incredibly blue - this could be an advertisement for the country or a postcard.', '2003-10-08 18:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(443844, 41395, 12325, '<td valign="top">It''s a well taken photo ... but I think the composition could be more striking.</td>', 'It''s a well taken photo ... but I think the composition could be more striking.', '2003-10-08 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443845, 40800, 12325, '<td valign="top">Lovely! But no buildings?</td>', 'Lovely! But no buildings?', '2003-10-08 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(443846, 40829, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sky, almost surrealistic shapes.</td>', 'Very pretty sky, almost surrealistic shapes.', '2003-10-08 18:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(443847, 40645, 9906, '<td valign="top">In a shot like this I''m (personally) not sure I like the overstaturated colors.  It''s also a little blown out on the right hand side down low (between tree and bridge).  With a shot like this I wish I could compare with original!</td>', 'In a shot like this I''m (personally) not sure I like the overstaturated colors.  It''s also a little blown out on the right hand side down low (between tree and bridge).  With a shot like this I wish I could compare with original!', '2003-10-08 18:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(443848, 40760, 12325, '<td valign="top">PERFECT!</td>', 'PERFECT!', '2003-10-08 18:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(443849, 41152, 12325, '<td valign="top">I think I would like it better if the buildings took up more of the frame</td>', 'I think I would like it better if the buildings took up more of the frame', '2003-10-08 18:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(443852, 41007, 9906, '<td valign="top">Oh my god.....Take one (or two) steps to the left to get rid of that horrible light and this would be an AWESOME (with a capital AWESOME) shot.  I would also like to see the tip of the lightning rod.  Shallower DOF works nicely here.  Where is this???  (I love old places)</td>', 'Oh my god.....Take one (or two) steps to the left to get rid of that horrible light and this would be an AWESOME (with a capital AWESOME) shot.  I would also like to see the tip of the lightning rod.  Shallower DOF works nicely here.  Where is this???  (I love old places)', '2003-10-08 18:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(443854, 41024, 12325, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but something about it doesn''t resonate with the theme correctly with me.  But I can''t quite put my finger on why so I''ll still rate it pretty high :)</td>', 'I really like this picture, but something about it doesn''t resonate with the theme correctly with me.  But I can''t quite put my finger on why so I''ll still rate it pretty high :)', '2003-10-08 18:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(443855, 41374, 12733, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to the architect on an attractive building, and to the photographer on the interesting lighd and good angle.</td>', 'Congratulations to the architect on an attractive building, and to the photographer on the interesting lighd and good angle.', '2003-10-08 18:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(443856, 40676, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban', '2003-10-08 18:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(443857, 41325, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban', '2003-10-08 18:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
