(443859, 41346, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the fog, sharp foreground and reflections.</td>', 'I really like the fog, sharp foreground and reflections.', '2003-10-08 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(443860, 41217, 12325, '<td valign="top">It''s quite nice, but it feels a bit crooked</td>', 'It''s quite nice, but it feels a bit crooked', '2003-10-08 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(443861, 40801, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban', '2003-10-08 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(443862, 41010, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  Love the focus and DOF.  The guy chillin'' on the right hand scaffolding toward the top makes the shot.  This time I have to agree with the B/W treatment.  This is obviously a construction (reconstruction) site and I think color would detract in this instance!!!</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  Love the focus and DOF.  The guy chillin'' on the right hand scaffolding toward the top makes the shot.  This time I have to agree with the B/W treatment.  This is obviously a construction (reconstruction) site and I think color would detract in this instance!!!', '2003-10-08 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(443863, 41089, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice Colors and strong, Go Iceland?</td>', 'Nice Colors and strong, Go Iceland?', '2003-10-08 18:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(443864, 41187, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, and the figures are captured well. The tilt is a bit unsettling - it''s not quite enough to add excitment.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, and the figures are captured well. The tilt is a bit unsettling - it''s not quite enough to add excitment.', '2003-10-08 18:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(443866, 41007, 12325, '<td valign="top">It''s really beautiful!  I think the light on the building is a bit distracting though</td>', 'It''s really beautiful!  I think the light on the building is a bit distracting though', '2003-10-08 18:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(443867, 40864, 9906, '<td valign="top">If I was gonna play with the color on this one (without seeing the original of course), I would left the yellow stripe and desaturated the rest!  Not sure I like this treatment though.</td>', 'If I was gonna play with the color on this one (without seeing the original of course), I would left the yellow stripe and desaturated the rest!  Not sure I like this treatment though.', '2003-10-08 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443868, 41261, 12327, '<td valign="top">This one jumps out at me for some reason.  I like the dramatic look of the sky and clouds.  Looks like there is quite a bit of lens distortion (parallax?) or whatever it''s called.  What lens were you using?  it almost looks like it was a fisheye lens.<br/>I can''t decide if this would benefit from running it through one of those lens distortion correction programs, or not.  The distortion itself may be adding to the dramatic effect.</td>', 'This one jumps out at me for some reason.  I like the dramatic look of the sky and clouds.  Looks like there is quite a bit of lens distortion (parallax?) or whatever it''s called.  What lens were you using?  it almost looks like it was a fisheye lens.I can''t decide if this would benefit from running it through one of those lens distortion correction programs, or not.  The distortion itself may be adding to the dramatic effect.', '2003-10-08 18:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(443869, 40671, 12733, '<td valign="top">The buildings are interesting in themselves, but the presentation brings them out well.</td>', 'The buildings are interesting in themselves, but the presentation brings them out well.', '2003-10-08 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(443871, 41332, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, however it appears to be more rural than urban', '2003-10-08 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(443872, 41287, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL....It does look like the keel of a boat!  Nice job!  Great DOF and colors!</td>', 'LOL....It does look like the keel of a boat!  Nice job!  Great DOF and colors!', '2003-10-08 18:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(443875, 41143, 12733, '<td valign="top">The Coke sign dominates, but the tight portrayal of the background buildings makes the shot. From the compression of space, I would guess this was taken with a telephoto lens, which is very effective for this scene.</td>', 'The Coke sign dominates, but the tight portrayal of the background buildings makes the shot. From the compression of space, I would guess this was taken with a telephoto lens, which is very effective for this scene.', '2003-10-08 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(443876, 40644, 6888, '<td valign="top">unfortunately, no buildings</td>', 'unfortunately, no buildings', '2003-10-08 18:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(443877, 41394, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lights in the foreground contrast well with the ambient light on the background buildings. And the sky is just great.</td>', 'The lights in the foreground contrast well with the ambient light on the background buildings. And the sky is just great.', '2003-10-08 18:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(443880, 40864, 12325, '<td valign="top">I think i would prefer it without the alterations</td>', 'I think i would prefer it without the alterations', '2003-10-08 18:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
