(443890, 40645, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The colors are wonderful. Great clarity except for the slight blur on the bridge. But in my opinion it does not take away from this shot at all. Wonderful job! 9</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The colors are wonderful. Great clarity except for the slight blur on the bridge. But in my opinion it does not take away from this shot at all. Wonderful job! 9', '2003-10-08 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
