(443937, 41216, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there are two blotches in the sky which are a little bothersome.</td>', 'Good idea, but there are two blotches in the sky which are a little bothersome.', '2003-10-08 19:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
