(444227, 41069, 9437, '<td valign="top">Skillful photograph with both the foreground and background in focus. I would like to see a lighter image with truer white.</td>', 'Skillful photograph with both the foreground and background in focus. I would like to see a lighter image with truer white.', '2003-10-08 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(444230, 41189, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the rich sky color and the tunnel effect.</td>', 'I like the rich sky color and the tunnel effect.', '2003-10-08 22:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(444231, 41399, 12733, '<td valign="top">The framing is more interesting than the subject. I especially like the dappled shadow effect. It does offer a different view of the ESB building, with enough to give an impression of that building''s character.</td>', 'The framing is more interesting than the subject. I especially like the dappled shadow effect. It does offer a different view of the ESB building, with enough to give an impression of that building''s character.', '2003-10-08 22:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444235, 41260, 9437, '<td valign="top">What an unusual building. You accentuated its uniqueness with an imaginative photo. 8</td>', 'What an unusual building. You accentuated its uniqueness with an imaginative photo. 8', '2003-10-08 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444236, 41302, 12825, '<td valign="top">nice colours, great composition, cool light flares!</td>', 'nice colours, great composition, cool light flares!', '2003-10-08 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(444239, 41102, 12825, '<td valign="top">where is this?</td>', 'where is this?', '2003-10-08 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(444240, 41392, 12825, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Aptly titled.  Nice shot.', '2003-10-08 22:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(444242, 41398, 12825, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I wonder... what does it look like in colour?</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I wonder... what does it look like in colour?', '2003-10-08 22:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444243, 41372, 12825, '<td valign="top">Gah... suburbs! =)</td>', 'Gah... suburbs! =)', '2003-10-08 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(444245, 40697, 12825, '<td valign="top">Very nice light flares and streaks.  What f-stop did you use?</td>', 'Very nice light flares and streaks.  What f-stop did you use?', '2003-10-08 22:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(444247, 41408, 12825, '<td valign="top">Horizon looks a little crooked.  Could improve by straightening photo then cropping, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Horizon looks a little crooked.  Could improve by straightening photo then cropping, but that''s just my opinion.', '2003-10-08 22:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(444248, 40937, 12733, '<td valign="top">The market is an attractive set of buildings, and the bright red highlights in front contrast nicely with the green buildings. The wet pavement adds a lot of interest with both reflections and color. I found it hard to stay in the picture, though, because the red line leads directly to the white arrow and out.</td>', 'The market is an attractive set of buildings, and the bright red highlights in front contrast nicely with the green buildings. The wet pavement adds a lot of interest with both reflections and color. I found it hard to stay in the picture, though, because the red line leads directly to the white arrow and out.', '2003-10-08 22:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(444251, 41319, 12825, '<td valign="top">Kinda hazy; composition might be more interesting with the large building off-center... remember the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Kinda hazy; composition might be more interesting with the large building off-center... remember the rule of thirds.', '2003-10-08 22:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(444254, 40953, 12825, '<td valign="top">This is OK but (maybe I''m missing something) I don''t see any reflections.</td>', 'This is OK but (maybe I''m missing something) I don''t see any reflections.', '2003-10-08 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(444255, 40404, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections, beautiful sky and an impressive skyline. Nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections, beautiful sky and an impressive skyline. Nice shot.', '2003-10-08 22:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444257, 41176, 12825, '<td valign="top">I wish I had urban landscapes like this to shoot. ;-)</td>', 'I wish I had urban landscapes like this to shoot. ;-)', '2003-10-08 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444259, 41155, 12943, '<td valign="top">It looks more like architecture than urban landscape. The picture is very good but</td>', 'It looks more like architecture than urban landscape. The picture is very good but', '2003-10-08 22:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(444262, 41150, 12825, '<td valign="top">I''m definitely not an expert but there seems to be a bit of blue cast in this photo.  Some post processing with hues/saturation might correct this.</td>', 'I''m definitely not an expert but there seems to be a bit of blue cast in this photo.  Some post processing with hues/saturation might correct this.', '2003-10-08 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444264, 40800, 12825, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Composition is great; I like the grass in the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Composition is great; I like the grass in the foreground.', '2003-10-08 22:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(444266, 40645, 12733, '<td valign="top">The blazing colors in the foreground contrast nicely with the large expanses of black between the buildings in the background. The reflections add to the effect.</td>', 'The blazing colors in the foreground contrast nicely with the large expanses of black between the buildings in the background. The reflections add to the effect.', '2003-10-08 22:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444268, 41291, 12825, '<td valign="top">Kinda plain subject but seems well shot to my untrained eye.</td>', 'Kinda plain subject but seems well shot to my untrained eye.', '2003-10-08 22:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444273, 41291, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality of this photo.</td>', 'I like the abstract quality of this photo.', '2003-10-08 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(444274, 40861, 12825, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bright; could try (I think) a faster shutter speed to let less light into the exposure... colours are a little washed out due to over-exposure.</td>', 'Seems a little bright; could try (I think) a faster shutter speed to let less light into the exposure... colours are a little washed out due to over-exposure.', '2003-10-08 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(444275, 41323, 9437, '<td valign="top">Now that''s blue! Very dramatic piece.</td>', 'Now that''s blue! Very dramatic piece.', '2003-10-08 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444277, 41007, 12825, '<td valign="top">This is just my personal opinion but I think a smaller aperture (higher f-stop) might have been nice to bring the entire photo into focus.</td>', 'This is just my personal opinion but I think a smaller aperture (higher f-stop) might have been nice to bring the entire photo into focus.', '2003-10-08 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444278, 40681, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice light flares.  I''ve never seen a hospital lit that way before!</td>', 'Nice light flares.  I''ve never seen a hospital lit that way before!', '2003-10-08 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(444279, 41216, 12825, '<td valign="top">Sad to see what seems like the expansion of suburbia... although the photo itself is kinda plain.  If only we could order up great sunsets on command. =)</td>', 'Sad to see what seems like the expansion of suburbia... although the photo itself is kinda plain.  If only we could order up great sunsets on command. =)', '2003-10-08 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444280, 41279, 12825, '<td valign="top">Did somebody else take a very similar shot of this same building?<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice shot.</td>', 'Did somebody else take a very similar shot of this same building? Anyway, nice shot.', '2003-10-08 22:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444281, 41185, 12825, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-10-08 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(444283, 40540, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lights come across almost as bright as daytime. The bridge and reflections really add a lot.</td>', 'The lights come across almost as bright as daytime. The bridge and reflections really add a lot.', '2003-10-08 22:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(444284, 40752, 12825, '<td valign="top">This photo might have been more interesting if the building was off to one side.  Remember the Rule of Thirds. =)</td>', 'This photo might have been more interesting if the building was off to one side.  Remember the Rule of Thirds. =)', '2003-10-08 22:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(444285, 41260, 12733, '<td valign="top">Flat? I''ll say. Nice rendition, every brick stands out. Nice sky background, unusual angle.</td>', 'Flat? I''ll say. Nice rendition, every brick stands out. Nice sky background, unusual angle.', '2003-10-08 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444287, 40682, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a bit of noise in the dark areas.  Otherwise very cool.</td>', 'Nice shot but a bit of noise in the dark areas.  Otherwise very cool.', '2003-10-08 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444289, 41412, 12733, '<td valign="top">The building makes a great canvas for the colored lights. Nice shot.</td>', 'The building makes a great canvas for the colored lights. Nice shot.', '2003-10-08 23:04:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(444290, 41325, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice colour contrast between sky and fields!  Overall shot seems a little out of focus though.  Maybe try a higher f-stop value?  Close the aperture?</td>', 'Nice colour contrast between sky and fields!  Overall shot seems a little out of focus though.  Maybe try a higher f-stop value?  Close the aperture?', '2003-10-08 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(444292, 40644, 12825, '<td valign="top">Seems like there is a lot of noise/speckles in this photo... did the original look this way as well?</td>', 'Seems like there is a lot of noise/speckles in this photo... did the original look this way as well?', '2003-10-08 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444294, 41272, 12825, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  High f-stop value, slow shutter speed?  Just wondering, I''m very new to photography, but in any case, I really like this shot!</td>', 'Very nice!  High f-stop value, slow shutter speed?  Just wondering, I''m very new to photography, but in any case, I really like this shot!', '2003-10-08 23:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(444295, 41089, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice colour contrast.</td>', 'Nice colour contrast.', '2003-10-08 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(444296, 40627, 12733, '<td valign="top">The complex pattern makes a nice shot, with just a hint of what lies outside.</td>', 'The complex pattern makes a nice shot, with just a hint of what lies outside.', '2003-10-08 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(444297, 41278, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice colour but shot seems a little out of focus.  Try higher f-stop value, slightly slower shutter speed?</td>', 'Nice colour but shot seems a little out of focus.  Try higher f-stop value, slightly slower shutter speed?', '2003-10-08 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(444300, 41049, 12825, '<td valign="top">Can anyone else see an odd pattern / noise in the sky part of this shot?  Distracts from an otherwise good photograph.</td>', 'Can anyone else see an odd pattern / noise in the sky part of this shot?  Distracts from an otherwise good photograph.', '2003-10-08 23:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444303, 41294, 12733, '<td valign="top">A mysterious horizontal structure, made more so by the angle it''s shot at. Very interesting photo.</td>', 'A mysterious horizontal structure, made more so by the angle it''s shot at. Very interesting photo.', '2003-10-08 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(444309, 41185, 12741, '<td valign="top">WOW<br/>Simply fabulous.</td>', 'WOWSimply fabulous.', '2003-10-08 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444310, 40801, 12825, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-10-08 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(444311, 41329, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice, clear panoramic view, you can see every building clearly and still get a wide sweep. Nice sky - you picked a good day to shoot it.</td>', 'A nice, clear panoramic view, you can see every building clearly and still get a wide sweep. Nice sky - you picked a good day to shoot it.', '2003-10-08 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(444313, 40786, 12741, '<td valign="top">Imaginative - well thought out - good definition</td>', 'Imaginative - well thought out - good definition', '2003-10-08 23:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(444315, 41239, 12741, '<td valign="top">nice effort but needs more of a focal point</td>', 'nice effort but needs more of a focal point', '2003-10-08 23:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444316, 40649, 12741, '<td valign="top">keep trying - doesn''t really tell a story</td>', 'keep trying - doesn''t really tell a story', '2003-10-08 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(444318, 41152, 12741, '<td valign="top">too simple</td>', 'too simple', '2003-10-08 23:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(444322, 41150, 12741, '<td valign="top">nice - just wish that one headlight at the bottom left wasn''t there - a little annoying</td>', 'nice - just wish that one headlight at the bottom left wasn''t there - a little annoying', '2003-10-08 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444323, 41207, 12741, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2003-10-08 23:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444326, 41355, 12733, '<td valign="top">Little boxes made of ticky-tacky, and they all look just the same.</td>', 'Little boxes made of ticky-tacky, and they all look just the same.', '2003-10-08 23:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444328, 41370, 12741, '<td valign="top">good but not for this contest - too restricted for a photo of this type</td>', 'good but not for this contest - too restricted for a photo of this type', '2003-10-08 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(444329, 40432, 12741, '<td valign="top">done before  but good definiton</td>', 'done before  but good definiton', '2003-10-08 23:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(444332, 41399, 12741, '<td valign="top">What''s the theme? sorry, i don''t quite get it</td>', 'What''s the theme? sorry, i don''t quite get it', '2003-10-08 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444336, 40678, 12741, '<td valign="top">Almost! - but it looks like the cars don''t really agree with the concept of the picture</td>', 'Almost! - but it looks like the cars don''t really agree with the concept of the picture', '2003-10-08 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(444337, 41010, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the metallic appearance of this photo.</td>', 'I like the metallic appearance of this photo.', '2003-10-08 23:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444338, 41059, 12741, '<td valign="top">Not really .... well you figure it out</td>', 'Not really .... well you figure it out', '2003-10-08 23:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(444339, 40474, 12741, '<td valign="top">Nope - too easy</td>', 'Nope - too easy', '2003-10-08 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(444342, 40869, 12741, '<td valign="top">good angle but wrong time of day</td>', 'good angle but wrong time of day', '2003-10-08 23:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444343, 41258, 12741, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m undecided</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m undecided', '2003-10-08 23:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444348, 40453, 12733, '<td valign="top">What an amazing building.</td>', 'What an amazing building.', '2003-10-08 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444350, 41298, 12741, '<td valign="top">You did it! Beautiful use of perspective, definition, as well shade and contrast<br/>Good Work!!!!</td>', 'You did it! Beautiful use of perspective, definition, as well shade and contrastGood Work!!!!', '2003-10-08 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(444351, 41011, 12741, '<td valign="top">no story here.</td>', 'no story here.', '2003-10-08 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(444352, 41138, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, nice shadows in a visually interesting setting.</td>', 'Nice catch, nice shadows in a visually interesting setting.', '2003-10-08 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(444353, 41351, 12741, '<td valign="top">Nice use of different ideas blended into one picture</td>', 'Nice use of different ideas blended into one picture', '2003-10-08 23:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444354, 41371, 12741, '<td valign="top">interesting but it''s missing something ... hmmm</td>', 'interesting but it''s missing something ... hmmm', '2003-10-08 23:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(444356, 41048, 12741, '<td valign="top">really ? not sure what to think here</td>', 'really ? not sure what to think here', '2003-10-08 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(444357, 41409, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the older foreground buildings and the distant skyscraper. I like the foreground building, with its variety of surfaces and close enough to bring out all the detail</td>', 'Great contrast between the older foreground buildings and the distant skyscraper. I like the foreground building, with its variety of surfaces and close enough to bring out all the detail', '2003-10-08 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(444358, 41292, 12741, '<td valign="top">the picture itself did all the work for you</td>', 'the picture itself did all the work for you', '2003-10-08 23:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444361, 40676, 12623, '<td valign="top">Not my definition of "urban"</td>', 'Not my definition of "urban"', '2003-10-08 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(444364, 41364, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, the ripples make the reflection more than just a copy of the building.</td>', 'Pretty shot, the ripples make the reflection more than just a copy of the building.', '2003-10-08 23:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(444365, 40429, 9437, '<td valign="top">Still a chilling reminder.</td>', 'Still a chilling reminder.', '2003-10-08 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(444367, 41132, 12753, '<td valign="top">Excelent Amazing view.</td>', 'Excelent Amazing view.', '2003-10-08 23:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444368, 40747, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast of styles, surfaces, building materials and shapes. You don''t often see buildings of such varying vintages so close together.</td>', 'Interesting contrast of styles, surfaces, building materials and shapes. You don''t often see buildings of such varying vintages so close together.', '2003-10-08 23:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444371, 40672, 12733, '<td valign="top">As you photograph them, there''s an element of grandeur in these props, but I can also see how people call them visual pollution and don''t want them in their back yard.</td>', 'As you photograph them, there''s an element of grandeur in these props, but I can also see how people call them visual pollution and don''t want them in their back yard.', '2003-10-08 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(444375, 41046, 11394, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I visited Japan last year and saw this building...Its  a tv or industrail sceince museum? I never did get a good photo of it. I like that you have the bridge in the backround also. It''s very pretty.</td>', 'I really like this photo. I visited Japan last year and saw this building...Its  a tv or industrail sceince museum? I never did get a good photo of it. I like that you have the bridge in the backround also. It''s very pretty.', '2003-10-08 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(444378, 41389, 12733, '<td valign="top">The arched form of the bridge turns a pretty but ordinary set of reflecions into a work of art. The lighting is also excellent - it adds brilliant color to the already interesting foreground buildings.</td>', 'The arched form of the bridge turns a pretty but ordinary set of reflecions into a work of art. The lighting is also excellent - it adds brilliant color to the already interesting foreground buildings.', '2003-10-08 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(444383, 40987, 12733, '<td valign="top">Amidst all the hurry and hustle - well caught with no blur - there''s this guy kind of strolling across the street. He''s dead center, and serves to emphasize the sense of activity that permeates Times Square.</td>', 'Amidst all the hurry and hustle - well caught with no blur - there''s this guy kind of strolling across the street. He''s dead center, and serves to emphasize the sense of activity that permeates Times Square.', '2003-10-08 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(444387, 41256, 12435, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but wish it was sharper. I guess it could be the website. Nice shot</td>', 'I like the photo but wish it was sharper. I guess it could be the website. Nice shot', '2003-10-08 23:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(444389, 41180, 12733, '<td valign="top">You caught the sense of the crowded downtown cityscape nicely.</td>', 'You caught the sense of the crowded downtown cityscape nicely.', '2003-10-08 23:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(444391, 41181, 12733, '<td valign="top">A pretty building nicely framed and shot.</td>', 'A pretty building nicely framed and shot.', '2003-10-08 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(444394, 41357, 12435, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2003-10-08 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(444396, 40467, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sharp angle of the building on the right draws me into the photo, the straightness of the other building brings a kind of repose by contrast. Quite a sky you got for a background.</td>', 'The sharp angle of the building on the right draws me into the photo, the straightness of the other building brings a kind of repose by contrast. Quite a sky you got for a background.', '2003-10-08 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(444401, 40786, 12733, '<td valign="top">Vertical perspective is usually considered a flaw, but you''ve turned it into a positive element in this photo. The dark reflection (I assume that''s what it is) emphasizes the symmetry and adds an air of mystery.</td>', 'Vertical perspective is usually considered a flaw, but you''ve turned it into a positive element in this photo. The dark reflection (I assume that''s what it is) emphasizes the symmetry and adds an air of mystery.', '2003-10-08 23:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(444405, 40500, 12733, '<td valign="top">This looks more like an underwater city than a reflection. Only one building stands above the waterline to be reflected - are the others on the opposite side of the river? And why do they not appear to be upside down, as is usual with reflections? A very interesting shot.</td>', 'This looks more like an underwater city than a reflection. Only one building stands above the waterline to be reflected - are the others on the opposite side of the river? And why do they not appear to be upside down, as is usual with reflections? A very interesting shot.', '2003-10-08 23:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444408, 41245, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s a great sky, but I wish you''d shown us more of Tehran.</td>', 'It''s a great sky, but I wish you''d shown us more of Tehran.', '2003-10-08 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444409, 41385, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how the reflections go so much deeper than the lights that are reflected. The colors also take on more brilliance in the reflections. Nicely done.</td>', 'It''s amazing how the reflections go so much deeper than the lights that are reflected. The colors also take on more brilliance in the reflections. Nicely done.', '2003-10-08 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(444412, 41214, 9437, '<td valign="top">What a unique perspective. The color works well in this photo also.</td>', 'What a unique perspective. The color works well in this photo also.', '2003-10-08 23:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444416, 41345, 12435, '<td valign="top">I like this photo nice color</td>', 'I like this photo nice color', '2003-10-08 23:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(444418, 41303, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way the curved shapes of the wall, roof, walkway and grass parallel each other and end in the straight lines of the building. There''s also an odd sense of disorientation as the building is so far below the grade of the walkway, which for the most part is not a bridge.</td>', 'I like the way the curved shapes of the wall, roof, walkway and grass parallel each other and end in the straight lines of the building. There''s also an odd sense of disorientation as the building is so far below the grade of the walkway, which for the most part is not a bridge.', '2003-10-08 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(444426, 41214, 12268, '<td valign="top">really excellent shot. very creative.</td>', 'really excellent shot. very creative.', '2003-10-09 00:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444427, 41014, 12733, '<td valign="top">The light colors of the building reinforce the feeling of morning in the sky.</td>', 'The light colors of the building reinforce the feeling of morning in the sky.', '2003-10-09 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(444429, 40928, 12268, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been a really nice shot if you didn''t shoot into the sun. I kinda like the effects of the sun rays but you can''t see the buildings which this challenge was about.</td>', 'i think this would have been a really nice shot if you didn''t shoot into the sun. I kinda like the effects of the sun rays but you can''t see the buildings which this challenge was about.', '2003-10-09 00:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(444430, 40860, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this image - It''s as if I''m on vacation in a quaint village.  With the position of the sun, it''s hard to get the sky right.  Nice job with this photo!</td>', 'I really like the feel of this image - It''s as if I''m on vacation in a quaint village.  With the position of the sun, it''s hard to get the sky right.  Nice job with this photo!', '2003-10-09 00:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(444431, 40747, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is really neat how the buildings are so different, yet ''attached''.  I like your idea with this photo.  I would rather see it straight rather than tilted, but otherwise a nice shot!</td>', 'This is really neat how the buildings are so different, yet ''attached''.  I like your idea with this photo.  I would rather see it straight rather than tilted, but otherwise a nice shot!', '2003-10-09 00:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(444432, 41185, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice! I love relfection shots!</td>', 'nice! I love relfection shots!', '2003-10-09 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(444433, 40800, 12268, '<td valign="top">is this ocean park in s.f? nice shot</td>', 'is this ocean park in s.f? nice shot', '2003-10-09 00:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(444436, 41404, 12733, '<td valign="top">"They''re growing houses in the fields between the farms" quote from a song by John Gorka. Your photo captures the sense of houses jammed together. I''d guess you used a fairly long focal length telephoto to get that tight-packed effect.</td>', '"They''re growing houses in the fields between the farms" quote from a song by John Gorka. Your photo captures the sense of houses jammed together. I''d guess you used a fairly long focal length telephoto to get that tight-packed effect.', '2003-10-09 00:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(444437, 41251, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is certainly inner city urban.  Nice capture with lighting and the blue sky.</td>', 'This is certainly inner city urban.  Nice capture with lighting and the blue sky.', '2003-10-09 00:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(444439, 41272, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black and white, and the long exposure.  You have captured the essence of a fast paced city.  There is a lot going on in this photo.  I like the capital being perfectly centered.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the use of black and white, and the long exposure.  You have captured the essence of a fast paced city.  There is a lot going on in this photo.  I like the capital being perfectly centered.  Well done.', '2003-10-09 00:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444441, 41350, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  Makes me want to book tickets and come back to this wonderful city.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  Makes me want to book tickets and come back to this wonderful city.  Nice job.', '2003-10-09 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(444442, 41330, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground for the city - it adds a lot of color to an otherwise near monochrome cityscape. The red light at the top of the building near the center picks up the bright red and draws me into the photo.</td>', 'Nice foreground for the city - it adds a lot of color to an otherwise near monochrome cityscape. The red light at the top of the building near the center picks up the bright red and draws me into the photo.', '2003-10-09 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(444443, 41279, 12733, '<td valign="top">Starburst filters and extended lights from moving vehicles can easily be overdone, but you''ve controlled them well. Nice shot.</td>', 'Starburst filters and extended lights from moving vehicles can easily be overdone, but you''ve controlled them well. Nice shot.', '2003-10-09 00:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
