(444545, 40800, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even though I don''t believe this meets the challenge, and your focus is too soft in the foreground, I am a sucker for mist images and this one has a great sci-fi feel to it. Almost appears to be a distant planet''s landscape.  6 Would have been higher had it met the challenge.</td>', 'Even though I don''t believe this meets the challenge, and your focus is too soft in the foreground, I am a sucker for mist images and this one has a great sci-fi feel to it. Almost appears to be a distant planet''s landscape.  6 Would have been higher had it met the challenge.', '2003-10-09 01:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
