(444766, 41392, 10635, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours in this.  I cant work out if it should also show some cars going across the junction in front of the waiting cars.  Maybe also crop more on the right?</td>', 'I really like the colours in this.  I cant work out if it should also show some cars going across the junction in front of the waiting cars.  Maybe also crop more on the right?', '2003-10-09 08:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(444769, 40924, 10635, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Things can look different on different PC monitors, but I cant see much in this.</td>', 'Too dark.  Things can look different on different PC monitors, but I cant see much in this.', '2003-10-09 08:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444770, 41260, 10635, '<td valign="top">simple idea.  Bold, nice contrast</td>', 'simple idea.  Bold, nice contrast', '2003-10-09 08:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(444771, 40959, 10635, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Shame about the light (top left) I find it pulls my eyes towards it.</td>', 'Nice photo!  Shame about the light (top left) I find it pulls my eyes towards it.', '2003-10-09 08:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(444776, 41128, 10370, '<td valign="top">Awesome...I absolutely love this one. I''m not usually a particularly high marker but I have to give this 9. My only criticism is the spot of greenery in the top left hand corner which is a bit of a distraction.  I hope you get a ribbon for this.</td>', 'Awesome...I absolutely love this one. I''m not usually a particularly high marker but I have to give this 9. My only criticism is the spot of greenery in the top left hand corner which is a bit of a distraction.  I hope you get a ribbon for this.', '2003-10-09 09:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(444777, 41256, 8125, '<td valign="top">The glare in the window is a bit overpowering.  The lighting is good, which makes the color of the bricks and blue sky really pop out.</td>', 'The glare in the window is a bit overpowering.  The lighting is good, which makes the color of the bricks and blue sky really pop out.', '2003-10-09 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(444778, 40888, 11241, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little out of focus, but man I love the color of the blue in the sky...very nice</td>', 'This shot is a little out of focus, but man I love the color of the blue in the sky...very nice', '2003-10-09 09:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(444779, 41155, 10370, '<td valign="top">Really great, I love the low aspect. Pity you couldn''t get more of the top into view.</td>', 'Really great, I love the low aspect. Pity you couldn''t get more of the top into view.', '2003-10-09 09:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(444780, 41059, 10370, '<td valign="top">Great colours - great shot</td>', 'Great colours - great shot', '2003-10-09 09:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(444783, 41404, 11738, '<td valign="top">This photo would have had more impact if you had cropped out the sky and only concentrated on the house tops.  The pale sky gives it a washed-out effect.  Great idea!  I hope you''re not afraid of heights.</td>', 'This photo would have had more impact if you had cropped out the sky and only concentrated on the house tops.  The pale sky gives it a washed-out effect.  Great idea!  I hope you''re not afraid of heights.', '2003-10-09 09:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(444785, 41128, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like this image - a different perspective on photographing urban.  What kind of building is this?  It''s very interesting from the top.  :-)</td>', 'I like this image - a different perspective on photographing urban.  What kind of building is this?  It''s very interesting from the top.  :-)', '2003-10-09 09:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(444787, 40662, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent composition on the skyline.  You have it well framed with just the right amount of water and sky.  I think it seems a bit grainy, or maybe the focus is slightly off.  Anyhow - nice shot.</td>', 'This is an excellent composition on the skyline.  You have it well framed with just the right amount of water and sky.  I think it seems a bit grainy, or maybe the focus is slightly off.  Anyhow - nice shot.', '2003-10-09 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(444788, 41157, 8125, '<td valign="top">Oh, I want to go!!  Very nice shot...</td>', 'Oh, I want to go!!  Very nice shot...', '2003-10-09 09:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444790, 40811, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of your subject.  I like use of color (or lack thereof).  It pops out against that dark sky.</td>', 'This is a great shot of your subject.  I like use of color (or lack thereof).  It pops out against that dark sky.', '2003-10-09 09:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(444791, 41311, 8125, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this photo, I got the image in my head of a tornado on the way - the dark sky looks ominous.</td>', 'When I first looked at this photo, I got the image in my head of a tornado on the way - the dark sky looks ominous.', '2003-10-09 09:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(444792, 40564, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice, well done.  A great photo of a really cool looking building.</td>', 'Very nice, well done.  A great photo of a really cool looking building.', '2003-10-09 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(444793, 40429, 8125, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title vs. the picture.  It''s a good picture of your subject and I like the urban setting beyond it.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title vs. the picture.  It''s a good picture of your subject and I like the urban setting beyond it.', '2003-10-09 09:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(444794, 41402, 8125, '<td valign="top">What a nice setting!  The building on the left with the streetlight looks like it''s straight out of the 1950''s.  Good job!</td>', 'What a nice setting!  The building on the left with the streetlight looks like it''s straight out of the 1950''s.  Good job!', '2003-10-09 09:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(444795, 41136, 8125, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful setting!  I love the ''farmers market'' type stand there with downtown looming right about it.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'What a beautiful setting!  I love the ''farmers market'' type stand there with downtown looming right about it.  Very nicely done!', '2003-10-09 09:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444796, 40796, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this building on Discovery or Learning Channel - is it in China?  The street light is a bit out of focus and the white clouds seem a bit too sharp.  I wonder if you could have moved over just a bit to the right so not to get that streetlight?  The towers are nicely captured.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this building on Discovery or Learning Channel - is it in China?  The street light is a bit out of focus and the white clouds seem a bit too sharp.  I wonder if you could have moved over just a bit to the right so not to get that streetlight?  The towers are nicely captured.', '2003-10-09 10:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444797, 40787, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice picture.  I like how you''ve captured the building.  This is very desolate looking.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow, nice picture.  I like how you''ve captured the building.  This is very desolate looking.  Well done.', '2003-10-09 10:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(444798, 41183, 8125, '<td valign="top">Well done - I like the reflection in the new mirrored building.</td>', 'Well done - I like the reflection in the new mirrored building.', '2003-10-09 10:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(444799, 40676, 10970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I love it but somehow it doesn''t say urban.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I love it but somehow it doesn''t say urban.', '2003-10-09 10:03:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(444802, 41060, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nicely photographed.  It''s got a line leading me right through the arches...good color in the stone.</td>', 'Very nicely photographed.  It''s got a line leading me right through the arches...good color in the stone.', '2003-10-09 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(444803, 40860, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is charming and certainly gives the feel of urban landscape - the lines are clean, crisp, and the textures are nice 8</td>', 'this is charming and certainly gives the feel of urban landscape - the lines are clean, crisp, and the textures are nice 8', '2003-10-09 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(444804, 41310, 11155, '<td valign="top">Is this in NYC?</td>', 'Is this in NYC?', '2003-10-09 10:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(444805, 41298, 6624, '<td valign="top">very interesting approach to the challenge to use the water jets as landscape 8</td>', 'very interesting approach to the challenge to use the water jets as landscape 8', '2003-10-09 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(444806, 40952, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture, certainly meets the challenge 8</td>', 'nice capture, certainly meets the challenge 8', '2003-10-09 10:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444807, 41346, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice image, meets the challenge, and well-titled 8</td>', 'very nice image, meets the challenge, and well-titled 8', '2003-10-09 10:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(444809, 41010, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice image, well-composed (you probably placed the painters just where they are, right?lol) interesting shadows and well-titled 7</td>', 'nice image, well-composed (you probably placed the painters just where they are, right?lol) interesting shadows and well-titled 7', '2003-10-09 10:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(444814, 41250, 12448, '<td valign="top">I could not score this one very high because I feel it was too dark, not enough contrast for my taste for the overall picture.  As for meeting the challenge, this does convey a great sense of urban to me<br/> <br/>Ammedment:  After readjusting the contrast and brightness on my monitor, I find this wasn''t as dark as I originally thought and can now see more of the details.  Still a bit dark overall but the score does go up.  I like the framing too and the overall sense of grittiness in the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I could not score this one very high because I feel it was too dark, not enough contrast for my taste for the overall picture.  As for meeting the challenge, this does convey a great sense of urban to me Ammedment:  After readjusting the contrast and brightness on my monitor, I find this wasn''t as dark as I originally thought and can now see more of the details.  Still a bit dark overall but the score does go up.  I like the framing too and the overall sense of grittiness in the shot.  Well done.', '2003-10-09 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(444815, 41316, 12448, '<td valign="top">I think I understand where you were trying to go with this, the grittiness, dirty side of urban living?  Nice concept but the picture itself really throws me off.  The lines draw your eyes out to the edges but I feel if the background, the landscape itself was just slightly more defined it might have score higher with me.</td>', 'I think I understand where you were trying to go with this, the grittiness, dirty side of urban living?  Nice concept but the picture itself really throws me off.  The lines draw your eyes out to the edges but I feel if the background, the landscape itself was just slightly more defined it might have score higher with me.', '2003-10-09 10:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(444816, 40938, 12448, '<td valign="top">I understand the coloring from your title but I think I would have liked this shot better in it''s original colors.  The shot itself if well cropped, the statue "looking" down is very appealing and the building behind conveys a very strong sense of urban to me.</td>', 'I understand the coloring from your title but I think I would have liked this shot better in it''s original colors.  The shot itself if well cropped, the statue "looking" down is very appealing and the building behind conveys a very strong sense of urban to me.', '2003-10-09 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444818, 41272, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Black and white makes this interesting and the people add a human element to it as well.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Black and white makes this interesting and the people add a human element to it as well.', '2003-10-09 10:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(444820, 41399, 11155, '<td valign="top">Yes - nice to see a different POV on this.  Good eye.I also like the angles.</td>', 'Yes - nice to see a different POV on this.  Good eye.I also like the angles.', '2003-10-09 10:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444823, 40837, 12448, '<td valign="top">????  Not sure where the title come from, and after closer examination I see the buildings in the reflection but they are unclear and does not really convey a sense of urban or interest.<br/> <br/>Ammendment:  If the object you took the reflection from was sharper I would have probably scored much higher on this.  It''s fuzziness cost you a point or two for me.</td>', '????  Not sure where the title come from, and after closer examination I see the buildings in the reflection but they are unclear and does not really convey a sense of urban or interest. Ammendment:  If the object you took the reflection from was sharper I would have probably scored much higher on this.  It''s fuzziness cost you a point or two for me.', '2003-10-09 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(444824, 40800, 11155, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like haystack in Astoria.  Well, can''t really rate this too high - it''s a great shot, but no buildings (at least that I see).  It aslo isn''t very ''urban''.  But it is a nice shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Almost looks like haystack in Astoria.  Well, can''t really rate this too high - it''s a great shot, but no buildings (at least that I see).  It aslo isn''t very ''urban''.  But it is a nice shot, nonetheless.', '2003-10-09 10:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(444828, 40627, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This would have been great for the repitition contest!  The sun reflecting off the glass is a great effect and I really like the way it draws you up but it also throws me off balance which can be a good thing!</td>', 'WOW!  This would have been great for the repitition contest!  The sun reflecting off the glass is a great effect and I really like the way it draws you up but it also throws me off balance which can be a good thing!', '2003-10-09 10:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(444829, 40671, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective of the towers.  Looks like they are about to tumble on top of you!  This does meet the challenge very well in my book but the overall shading, contrast of the picture seems just slightly off to me.</td>', 'Nice perspective of the towers.  Looks like they are about to tumble on top of you!  This does meet the challenge very well in my book but the overall shading, contrast of the picture seems just slightly off to me.', '2003-10-09 10:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(444832, 40474, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space but too much for my taste for this challenge.  If you had focused more on the buildings I think the sense of urban would have come through much better.  Otherwise it''s a lovely shot, good color, crisp, clear and appealing.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space but too much for my taste for this challenge.  If you had focused more on the buildings I think the sense of urban would have come through much better.  Otherwise it''s a lovely shot, good color, crisp, clear and appealing.', '2003-10-09 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(444834, 40864, 12448, '<td valign="top">I do get the sense of urban but don''t really like the effects you did to the picture.  And possibly if you had focused more on the buildings instead of the street I could have scored much higher.</td>', 'I do get the sense of urban but don''t really like the effects you did to the picture.  And possibly if you had focused more on the buildings instead of the street I could have scored much higher.', '2003-10-09 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(444835, 41343, 11440, '<td valign="top">landscape?</td>', 'landscape?', '2003-10-09 10:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(444836, 40496, 12448, '<td valign="top">Overall a good concept and does convey a sense of urban but all the darkness in the middle (and my monitor has been readjusted so the darkest pictures are much better) really throws me off.  It''s almost as if the picture got cut in half.    Maybe if you had focused more in ont he NAiLS/McDonalds building to the right I would have found this much more interesting.</td>', 'Overall a good concept and does convey a sense of urban but all the darkness in the middle (and my monitor has been readjusted so the darkest pictures are much better) really throws me off.  It''s almost as if the picture got cut in half.    Maybe if you had focused more in ont he NAiLS/McDonalds building to the right I would have found this much more interesting.', '2003-10-09 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(444837, 41066, 6624, '<td valign="top">quite a striking image, sharp and balanced well to give a sense of landscape as well as urban 8</td>', 'quite a striking image, sharp and balanced well to give a sense of landscape as well as urban 8', '2003-10-09 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(444838, 41279, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very interestingmoving car lights,8 from me!</td>', 'Very interestingmoving car lights,8 from me!', '2003-10-09 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444839, 41149, 6405, '<td valign="top">Looks like Houston Tx,8 from me!</td>', 'Looks like Houston Tx,8 from me!', '2003-10-09 10:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444841, 41060, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice image, while the interior to the right is a little too dark the textures and warmth of tone make this inviting  meets the challenge and lets the eye and mind wander</td>', 'very nice image, while the interior to the right is a little too dark the textures and warmth of tone make this inviting  meets the challenge and lets the eye and mind wander', '2003-10-09 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(444843, 41212, 11440, '<td valign="top">this place looks familiar...</td>', 'this place looks familiar...', '2003-10-09 10:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(444844, 41132, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky reflection,8 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful sky reflection,8 from me!', '2003-10-09 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(444846, 40983, 11155, '<td valign="top">Not what I originally would have called "urban landscape".  This is  a beautiful photo so I''m going to score it higher than I probably should.  (one building, more rural than urban)  Love the colors in it, but the red bush looks just a bit over saturated.  Could just be me.  9 from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Not what I originally would have called "urban landscape".  This is  a beautiful photo so I''m going to score it higher than I probably should.  (one building, more rural than urban)  Love the colors in it, but the red bush looks just a bit over saturated.  Could just be me.  9 from me.  Good luck!', '2003-10-09 10:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(444847, 41065, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Budim,9 from me!</td>', 'Nice shot of Budim,9 from me!', '2003-10-09 10:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
