(444856, 41180, 12448, '<td valign="top">This would be a great postcard shot!  I love the overall sense of urban conveyed and the angle the shot was taken from.  The only thing that would have made it better for me was if the cropping was just a bit tighter, less sky and background.</td>', 'This would be a great postcard shot!  I love the overall sense of urban conveyed and the angle the shot was taken from.  The only thing that would have made it better for me was if the cropping was just a bit tighter, less sky and background.', '2003-10-09 11:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
