(444861, 40985, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot fits the challenge very well, really conveys that sense urban to me very well.  The only thing that would have made this shot better for me would be the lighting, the left side is too dark for my taste but otherwise, good job!</td>', 'This shot fits the challenge very well, really conveys that sense urban to me very well.  The only thing that would have made this shot better for me would be the lighting, the left side is too dark for my taste but otherwise, good job!', '2003-10-09 11:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(444862, 41217, 6405, '<td valign="top">Photo is tilted right about 2 degrees,nice light effect and reflection,6 from me!</td>', 'Photo is tilted right about 2 degrees,nice light effect and reflection,6 from me!', '2003-10-09 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(444866, 40871, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, although the glare spots off of the window on a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, although the glare spots off of the window on a little distracting.', '2003-10-09 11:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(444869, 41291, 12448, '<td valign="top">The angle and colors in this picture really throw me off.  If you had focused more on the lower part of the picture, the fence and building and less sky and worked on the angle a bit more I would have probably felt much better about you meeting the challenge and the picture itself would have been more appealing to me personally.</td>', 'The angle and colors in this picture really throw me off.  If you had focused more on the lower part of the picture, the fence and building and less sky and worked on the angle a bit more I would have probably felt much better about you meeting the challenge and the picture itself would have been more appealing to me personally.', '2003-10-09 11:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(444871, 41310, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot except for the buildings on the side, I know it must be next to impossible to get a clean, clear shot of this building considering it''s location, maybe if you had gotten closer to the base and shot even further up?</td>', 'I love this shot except for the buildings on the side, I know it must be next to impossible to get a clean, clear shot of this building considering it''s location, maybe if you had gotten closer to the base and shot even further up?', '2003-10-09 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(444875, 41309, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy photo, so many things going on, so many things trying to draw your attention in, the hand rails going in all different directions offset by the straight lines of the building.  Excellent capture of the chaos that can come from the urban area.  The reflections really did throw me off at first but upon a second, longer look I see how they again, help convey the sense of chaos and busy aspect of the photo.  Raising the score on this one for sure!</td>', 'This is a very busy photo, so many things going on, so many things trying to draw your attention in, the hand rails going in all different directions offset by the straight lines of the building.  Excellent capture of the chaos that can come from the urban area.  The reflections really did throw me off at first but upon a second, longer look I see how they again, help convey the sense of chaos and busy aspect of the photo.  Raising the score on this one for sure!', '2003-10-09 11:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444876, 40860, 6405, '<td valign="top">beautiful 2 tones,very sharp,10 from me!</td>', 'beautiful 2 tones,very sharp,10 from me!', '2003-10-09 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(444877, 41320, 12448, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why! :)<br/> <br/>The lines on this photo help draw your attention accross the picture, which I do like but the lighting seems to be off.  I''m guessing the store itself was in the shadows?  And it seems just a bit grainy on my monitor.</td>', 'I don''t know why! :) The lines on this photo help draw your attention accross the picture, which I do like but the lighting seems to be off.  I''m guessing the store itself was in the shadows?  And it seems just a bit grainy on my monitor.', '2003-10-09 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444878, 40681, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors...love the lighting!</td>', 'Beautiful colors...love the lighting!', '2003-10-09 11:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(444880, 41407, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I almost did something similar to this.</td>', 'Nice shot...I almost did something similar to this.', '2003-10-09 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(444882, 41287, 12448, '<td valign="top">This originally scored very low for me, it just didn''t grab me at first glance but upon a second look I think it was the angle of the shot that originally threw me off.  I see exactly what you mean by Urban Boat, it does look the bow of a ship.  The antennea on the top adds the smokestack effect, very nice.  The lighting and colors are excellent, this score goes way up on a second look.</td>', 'This originally scored very low for me, it just didn''t grab me at first glance but upon a second look I think it was the angle of the shot that originally threw me off.  I see exactly what you mean by Urban Boat, it does look the bow of a ship.  The antennea on the top adds the smokestack effect, very nice.  The lighting and colors are excellent, this score goes way up on a second look.', '2003-10-09 11:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(444884, 41332, 12448, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought you had gone for the nature landscape despite the title!  But upon a second and closer look I now really see the building in the background and how it appears that it''s being taken over by the tree but the ratios are slightly off, which actually adds to the picture for me.   I am raising my original score but it could have been much higher if you had possibly cropped a little differently, brought the building in tighter, cutting out the right side would have worked for me, drawing more attention to the tree on the left</td>', 'At first glance I thought you had gone for the nature landscape despite the title!  But upon a second and closer look I now really see the building in the background and how it appears that it''s being taken over by the tree but the ratios are slightly off, which actually adds to the picture for me.   I am raising my original score but it could have been much higher if you had possibly cropped a little differently, brought the building in tighter, cutting out the right side would have worked for me, drawing more attention to the tree on the left', '2003-10-09 11:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(444886, 41007, 12448, '<td valign="top">Urban village, I love it.  The picture itself is cropped well, I like the sense of being drawn over the bridge into the village.  A bit more clarity would have raised your score a few more points for me.  The light is a wonderful focal point.</td>', 'Urban village, I love it.  The picture itself is cropped well, I like the sense of being drawn over the bridge into the village.  A bit more clarity would have raised your score a few more points for me.  The light is a wonderful focal point.', '2003-10-09 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444890, 40532, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot originally scored very low with me and upon second appraisal I will be raising my score but only by a few points.  The angle of the shot really throws me and it if was a bit more level I probably would have liked it much better.  The focus is too soft , more sharpness would have really worked on this for me.  The sense of the challenge was met without a doubt, really conveys that sense of urban.</td>', 'This shot originally scored very low with me and upon second appraisal I will be raising my score but only by a few points.  The angle of the shot really throws me and it if was a bit more level I probably would have liked it much better.  The focus is too soft , more sharpness would have really worked on this for me.  The sense of the challenge was met without a doubt, really conveys that sense of urban.', '2003-10-09 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444891, 41324, 6668, '<td valign="top">very small photo...would be easier to critique and see detail if photo were larger.</td>', 'very small photo...would be easier to critique and see detail if photo were larger.', '2003-10-09 11:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(444894, 41059, 12448, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge, it does convey that sense of urban but the colors seem off to me and the lines in the building actually make it look out of focus and distorted a bit, especially the ones on the silos themselves.  The shot itself is well done, I like the cropping, the balance between the building and the sky.</td>', 'This does meet the challenge, it does convey that sense of urban but the colors seem off to me and the lines in the building actually make it look out of focus and distorted a bit, especially the ones on the silos themselves.  The shot itself is well done, I like the cropping, the balance between the building and the sky.', '2003-10-09 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(444895, 41085, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is scoring low for me simply because the focus is way off, it''s just a blur of lights to me, not a lot of definition and the balance between the sky and town is off.  Too much negative space for this challenge.</td>', 'This is scoring low for me simply because the focus is way off, it''s just a blur of lights to me, not a lot of definition and the balance between the sky and town is off.  Too much negative space for this challenge.', '2003-10-09 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(444898, 40937, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rural urban is the sense I get from this picture.  I like that but the aspect of it, the angle is throwing me a bit but not in a bad way.  The big white arrow on the right draws too much attention away from the buildings but at the same time makes you look at the overall picture.</td>', 'Rural urban is the sense I get from this picture.  I like that but the aspect of it, the angle is throwing me a bit but not in a bad way.  The big white arrow on the right draws too much attention away from the buildings but at the same time makes you look at the overall picture.', '2003-10-09 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444900, 41008, 12448, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would work much better in it''s original form.  The effects you added really ruin the overall picture for me.  It meets the challenge without a doubt.</td>', 'I think this shot would work much better in it''s original form.  The effects you added really ruin the overall picture for me.  It meets the challenge without a doubt.', '2003-10-09 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(444902, 40644, 12448, '<td valign="top">Great shot overall, love the coloring, the shape of the clouds, the cropping but you don''t really get a sense of urban with this shot, no buildings, just a street lamp that is out of focus and a very minimal part of the picture.</td>', 'Great shot overall, love the coloring, the shape of the clouds, the cropping but you don''t really get a sense of urban with this shot, no buildings, just a street lamp that is out of focus and a very minimal part of the picture.', '2003-10-09 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(444904, 40510, 12422, '<td valign="top">Where were you in this photo? In a tree? Good photo.</td>', 'Where were you in this photo? In a tree? Good photo.', '2003-10-09 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(444905, 40416, 12448, '<td valign="top">A great meeting of the challenge, too bad those spotlights are aiming at you, it''s very distracting from the rest of the picture, draws too much away from the castle itself.  And the clarity is slightly lacking, if it was just a tad sharper I would have scored much higher.</td>', 'A great meeting of the challenge, too bad those spotlights are aiming at you, it''s very distracting from the rest of the picture, draws too much away from the castle itself.  And the clarity is slightly lacking, if it was just a tad sharper I would have scored much higher.', '2003-10-09 11:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(444907, 41132, 12448, '<td valign="top">This originally score very low with me after just glancing and going with gut instinct.  Upon a second look, a closer look I tried to figure out what it was that made me start so low.  Then I realized that it was the disjointed reflections that threw me for a loop.  But now that I''ve taken time to really look at it, I like the effect.  Was that storm coming or going?<br/> <br/>I think i fyou had panned more to the right and gotten more of the other building being reflected on the right into the shot I would have felt it really met the challange more, don''t know why, just get that feeling.<br/> <br/>Great shot upon a second look, score is going way up on this one for me.</td>', 'This originally score very low with me after just glancing and going with gut instinct.  Upon a second look, a closer look I tried to figure out what it was that made me start so low.  Then I realized that it was the disjointed reflections that threw me for a loop.  But now that I''ve taken time to really look at it, I like the effect.  Was that storm coming or going? I think i fyou had panned more to the right and gotten more of the other building being reflected on the right into the shot I would have felt it really met the challange more, don''t know why, just get that feeling. Great shot upon a second look, score is going way up on this one for me.', '2003-10-09 11:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
