(444919, 40665, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice sky - I might have cropped out the lights in the foreground completely, they''re a bit distracting from the mood of the background.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nice sky - I might have cropped out the lights in the foreground completely, they''re a bit distracting from the mood of the background.  Very nice.', '2003-10-09 12:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
