(444924, 41277, 12448, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this one twice to realize that this was a docking area, LOL!  At first glance I thought it was a flooded alley way bu then realized the doors were still above water.  I like the sense it conveys, very urban, busy in the background and calm in the front.  Originally I scored low on this one but am raising my score quite a bit, the picture didn''t really grab me at first but I do like the cropping and the tree on the left helps draw your attention to all the corners.</td>', 'I had to look at this one twice to realize that this was a docking area, LOL!  At first glance I thought it was a flooded alley way bu then realized the doors were still above water.  I like the sense it conveys, very urban, busy in the background and calm in the front.  Originally I scored low on this one but am raising my score quite a bit, the picture didn''t really grab me at first but I do like the cropping and the tree on the left helps draw your attention to all the corners.', '2003-10-09 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
