(445437, 40697, 11570, '<td valign="top">This looks like the same building as someone else here has taken.  Ah!! must be one of those sibling or husband and wife team outings.</td>', 'This looks like the same building as someone else here has taken.  Ah!! must be one of those sibling or husband and wife team outings.', '2003-10-09 20:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(445438, 40931, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the warm orange glow against the dark/black background.</td>', 'I like the warm orange glow against the dark/black background.', '2003-10-09 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(445439, 41177, 2158, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the lady on the right draws attention away from the main subject of the picture - she is too large to be merely one of the crowd.</td>', 'In my opinion the lady on the right draws attention away from the main subject of the picture - she is too large to be merely one of the crowd.', '2003-10-09 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(445441, 41316, 11793, '<td valign="top"><br/>i like the idea - differs from the rest<br/>speaks urban - simple and to the point<br/>still intriguing - and holds your eye<br/>9<br/> <br/>soup</td>', 'i like the idea - differs from the restspeaks urban - simple and to the pointstill intriguing - and holds your eye9 soup', '2003-10-09 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(445443, 41287, 11570, '<td valign="top">Amazing symmetry would almost a spot the difference competition - a realtive fo the flatiron buidling I see.<br/> <br/>Well seen and taken.</td>', 'Amazing symmetry would almost a spot the difference competition - a realtive fo the flatiron buidling I see. Well seen and taken.', '2003-10-09 20:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(445444, 41154, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d taken this at a time of day when there was sun on both sides of the building.</td>', 'I wish you''d taken this at a time of day when there was sun on both sides of the building.', '2003-10-09 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(445446, 40679, 11570, '<td valign="top">Camera shake methinks sadly does not replace long exposure blur.<br/> <br/>If artistic impact was intended - sorry it does not work for me!</td>', 'Camera shake methinks sadly does not replace long exposure blur. If artistic impact was intended - sorry it does not work for me!', '2003-10-09 20:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(445447, 41404, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen- IMO cropping the top skyline just leaving the roofs would hav given a wow factor.</td>', 'Nicely seen- IMO cropping the top skyline just leaving the roofs would hav given a wow factor.', '2003-10-09 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(445449, 41215, 205, '<td valign="top">seems tilted</td>', 'seems tilted', '2003-10-09 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(445450, 41272, 11570, '<td valign="top">Another cracking long exposure shot and interestingly the monochrome treatment does give it something. 10 I think</td>', 'Another cracking long exposure shot and interestingly the monochrome treatment does give it something. 10 I think', '2003-10-09 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(445454, 41310, 11570, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this structure.<br/> <br/>IMHO it would have an in your face quality if the composition and position of the taking point coild have removed the other buildings - as it can not be cropped to get that.</td>', 'Great lighting on this structure. IMHO it would have an in your face quality if the composition and position of the taking point coild have removed the other buildings - as it can not be cropped to get that.', '2003-10-09 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(445457, 41346, 8860, '<td valign="top">Exsquisite shot. I love the composition and the vibe created by the [early morning?] mist and low sunlight. The stillness and calm belies the activity within the sprawl over yonder. <br/> <br/>I actually believe that I''m looking at the ''perfect photograph'' - nothing to criticise at all! I''d be delighted if this shot wins the blue. It certainly wins mine. [10,10,10!]</td>', 'Exsquisite shot. I love the composition and the vibe created by the [early morning?] mist and low sunlight. The stillness and calm belies the activity within the sprawl over yonder.  I actually believe that I''m looking at the ''perfect photograph'' - nothing to criticise at all! I''d be delighted if this shot wins the blue. It certainly wins mine. [10,10,10!]', '2003-10-09 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(445459, 41309, 9437, '<td valign="top">There''s so much going on in this picture it comes across as an abstract. I like the composition and the warm against dark colors. Good job.</td>', 'There''s so much going on in this picture it comes across as an abstract. I like the composition and the warm against dark colors. Good job.', '2003-10-09 20:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(445461, 40873, 205, '<td valign="top">portland?</td>', 'portland?', '2003-10-09 20:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(445462, 41046, 11570, '<td valign="top">A bit more building with a bit less field perhaps because I acn see a hint of a bridge in the background left.<br/> <br/>Otherwise an interesting composition.<br/> <br/>Where is that building - shades of La Defense in Paris.</td>', 'A bit more building with a bit less field perhaps because I acn see a hint of a bridge in the background left. Otherwise an interesting composition. Where is that building - shades of La Defense in Paris.', '2003-10-09 20:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(445464, 40987, 9437, '<td valign="top">Lots of visual impact in this busy scene. Well done.</td>', 'Lots of visual impact in this busy scene. Well done.', '2003-10-09 20:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(445468, 40467, 11570, '<td valign="top">Looks more "uptown" to me.  Nice detail but lacking in interest.<br/> <br/>Exposure and light spot on.</td>', 'Looks more "uptown" to me.  Nice detail but lacking in interest. Exposure and light spot on.', '2003-10-09 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(445470, 41298, 8860, '<td valign="top">How do they get water that straight? Well captured, clean, good lighting, nice take, fresh viewpoint, - good composition. Not typical urban, but cool urban. [8]</td>', 'How do they get water that straight? Well captured, clean, good lighting, nice take, fresh viewpoint, - good composition. Not typical urban, but cool urban. [8]', '2003-10-09 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(445474, 41355, 8860, '<td valign="top">How sad. And this happening all over the world - sprawl, sprawl, sprawl...  Nice shot, well composed - good use of mono. Shade is a little indistinct. [7]</td>', 'How sad. And this happening all over the world - sprawl, sprawl, sprawl...  Nice shot, well composed - good use of mono. Shade is a little indistinct. [7]', '2003-10-09 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(445478, 41366, 11570, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.<br/> <br/>Toy Town I see.</td>', 'Made me smile. Toy Town I see.', '2003-10-09 21:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(445479, 40474, 11570, '<td valign="top">Roof scape good but way too much bland sky IMO would have at least been helped by a major crop of the sky.</td>', 'Roof scape good but way too much bland sky IMO would have at least been helped by a major crop of the sky.', '2003-10-09 21:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(445483, 41155, 11570, '<td valign="top">What a place!!!!!!<br/> <br/>Looks like the WB has not accounted for the fluorescent lighting but this is some viewpoint - on the florr by the look of it!</td>', 'What a place!!!!!! Looks like the WB has not accounted for the fluorescent lighting but this is some viewpoint - on the florr by the look of it!', '2003-10-09 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(445484, 41371, 11570, '<td valign="top">What incredible colours</td>', 'What incredible colours', '2003-10-09 21:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(445485, 40474, 3735, '<td valign="top">I thank you should have crop some of the sky , The town is so beautiful.  7</td>', 'I thank you should have crop some of the sky , The town is so beautiful.  7', '2003-10-09 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(445489, 40983, 3735, '<td valign="top">This is just beautifullllllllllllll        10 +</td>', 'This is just beautifullllllllllllll        10 +', '2003-10-09 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(445491, 40432, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it more if you had stood back futher. All the lines and angles become confusing and you cut off the people walking around which could have given the picture a little extra something.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it more if you had stood back futher. All the lines and angles become confusing and you cut off the people walking around which could have given the picture a little extra something.', '2003-10-09 21:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(445497, 41260, 11800, '<td valign="top">The color seems to be off, too blue. I think the composition does a good job at accenting the narrowness of the building even though ideally I would perfer it being a little futher over to the left touching just above the lower corner and maybe taking up a little more of the frame. The perspective works well also. 7</td>', 'The color seems to be off, too blue. I think the composition does a good job at accenting the narrowness of the building even though ideally I would perfer it being a little futher over to the left touching just above the lower corner and maybe taking up a little more of the frame. The perspective works well also. 7', '2003-10-09 21:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(445502, 41014, 11800, '<td valign="top">Amazing that no matter where in the world, buildings have a generic look. A little too hazy in my opinion, but still clear enough to see. I would have pumped up the saturation and contrast. But your treatment gives a peaceful feeling. Ironic isn''t it?</td>', 'Amazing that no matter where in the world, buildings have a generic look. A little too hazy in my opinion, but still clear enough to see. I would have pumped up the saturation and contrast. But your treatment gives a peaceful feeling. Ironic isn''t it?', '2003-10-09 21:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(445507, 40861, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this. Every city needs it''s intimate spaces. A little over exposed but I guess your camera was fooled by the dark door in the center. It looks like you were using spot metering and picked the darkest part to calculate with. Oops, I do that all the time.</td>', 'I like this. Every city needs it''s intimate spaces. A little over exposed but I guess your camera was fooled by the dark door in the center. It looks like you were using spot metering and picked the darkest part to calculate with. Oops, I do that all the time.', '2003-10-09 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(445512, 41330, 11800, '<td valign="top">I somewhat like the foreground. And I know that all the books say you have to have a foreground, but what the books don''t say is the foreground should compliment the picture either by framing in a pleasing way or thru repetition of the shape of the body of the picture. The foreground should not be more overpowering than the body of the picture. So using this, the red in the leaves compliment the red in the one building. That is good. The limbs on the side just get in the way and distract from the view.</td>', 'I somewhat like the foreground. And I know that all the books say you have to have a foreground, but what the books don''t say is the foreground should compliment the picture either by framing in a pleasing way or thru repetition of the shape of the body of the picture. The foreground should not be more overpowering than the body of the picture. So using this, the red in the leaves compliment the red in the one building. That is good. The limbs on the side just get in the way and distract from the view.', '2003-10-09 22:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(445513, 41065, 10207, '<td valign="top">a ribbon shot here...good job</td>', 'a ribbon shot here...good job', '2003-10-09 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(445517, 40864, 11800, '<td valign="top">I know this is your interpretation of what urban means, but I must say I don''t like the color treatment. Just wanted to let you know why I didn''t give you a higher score. It looks like a very decent image if not for the colors. Only thing composition wise, I''d crop the sky down to just above the highest lightpost.</td>', 'I know this is your interpretation of what urban means, but I must say I don''t like the color treatment. Just wanted to let you know why I didn''t give you a higher score. It looks like a very decent image if not for the colors. Only thing composition wise, I''d crop the sky down to just above the highest lightpost.', '2003-10-09 22:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(445518, 40800, 7570, '<td valign="top">that rock looks almost like the roof of a majestic building. Love the misty feeling. 7</td>', 'that rock looks almost like the roof of a majestic building. Love the misty feeling. 7', '2003-10-09 22:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(445520, 41261, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great Sky.9</td>', 'Great Sky.9', '2003-10-09 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(445522, 41024, 7570, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the main subject a lot. However, if only the entire roof is within the photo, and possibly, more of the buildings at the bottom can be included, it would get a higher vote from me. An 8 for this.</td>', 'I like the tones and the main subject a lot. However, if only the entire roof is within the photo, and possibly, more of the buildings at the bottom can be included, it would get a higher vote from me. An 8 for this.', '2003-10-09 22:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(445523, 40764, 7570, '<td valign="top">splendid tones on the sky, and the faraway city adds a nice touch to the atmsphere. An 8</td>', 'splendid tones on the sky, and the faraway city adds a nice touch to the atmsphere. An 8', '2003-10-09 22:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(445525, 41344, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s not so much that it doesn''t fit the challenge. It''s the lack of focus, the composition, and lack of details. I feel I would be insulting you if I offered any suggestions about how you could improve this. Good luck.</td>', 'It''s not so much that it doesn''t fit the challenge. It''s the lack of focus, the composition, and lack of details. I feel I would be insulting you if I offered any suggestions about how you could improve this. Good luck.', '2003-10-09 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(445526, 41344, 7570, '<td valign="top">the colours are unsaturated and details from this photo seem poor. Fits the challenge in my opinion (the walk planks are signs of urbanization to me). The bright sky is uninspiring (no details at all). I rate this a 6</td>', 'the colours are unsaturated and details from this photo seem poor. Fits the challenge in my opinion (the walk planks are signs of urbanization to me). The bright sky is uninspiring (no details at all). I rate this a 6', '2003-10-09 22:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(445527, 41138, 7570, '<td valign="top">Love the details in this! 7</td>', 'Love the details in this! 7', '2003-10-09 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445528, 41176, 9109, '<td valign="top">This is a tough shot, considering the dynamic range of the lighting here. Good work on the exposure.</td>', 'This is a tough shot, considering the dynamic range of the lighting here. Good work on the exposure.', '2003-10-09 22:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445529, 41372, 9109, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean picture, good show of perspective, nice framing but fairly uninteresting sky. Still like the shot though.</td>', 'Nice and clean picture, good show of perspective, nice framing but fairly uninteresting sky. Still like the shot though.', '2003-10-09 22:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(445530, 40640, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good tones and dof composition. Fits the challenge for me even if it''s not a building per say. 7</td>', 'Good tones and dof composition. Fits the challenge for me even if it''s not a building per say. 7', '2003-10-09 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(445532, 41261, 9109, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky, amazing that you can still get a good exposure on the cityscape. Polariser or graduated ND in use perhaps?</td>', 'Awesome sky, amazing that you can still get a good exposure on the cityscape. Polariser or graduated ND in use perhaps?', '2003-10-09 22:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(445535, 41345, 9109, '<td valign="top">Interesting building but I would have preferred to see this somewhere in the morning or evening where the lighting would made the shot more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting building but I would have preferred to see this somewhere in the morning or evening where the lighting would made the shot more interesting.', '2003-10-09 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(445539, 41277, 9109, '<td valign="top">Not sure if B&amp;W was the best way to depict this scene...</td>', 'Not sure if B&W was the best way to depict this scene...', '2003-10-09 22:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(445542, 41329, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very nice cityscape... shooting at a different time of day would have made this good shot great IMO.</td>', 'Very nice cityscape... shooting at a different time of day would have made this good shot great IMO.', '2003-10-09 22:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(445549, 41133, 811, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this shot without the haze as well, but there is something about it that really appeals to me.  10</td>', 'I would like to see this shot without the haze as well, but there is something about it that really appeals to me.  10', '2003-10-09 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(445551, 41215, 9109, '<td valign="top">Picture looks quite soft overall - perhaps more DOF would help?</td>', 'Picture looks quite soft overall - perhaps more DOF would help?', '2003-10-09 22:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(445552, 41319, 9109, '<td valign="top">The picture looks very soft, with perhaps too much pixelation (from up-sizing?). The tree in the lower left corner is also distracting... and composition-wise I would have the tall building framed somewhere to the left of the frame rather than dead center.</td>', 'The picture looks very soft, with perhaps too much pixelation (from up-sizing?). The tree in the lower left corner is also distracting... and composition-wise I would have the tall building framed somewhere to the left of the frame rather than dead center.', '2003-10-09 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(445553, 41367, 9109, '<td valign="top">Exquisite colour and detail!</td>', 'Exquisite colour and detail!', '2003-10-09 22:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(445554, 41272, 7570, '<td valign="top">nice movement effect and main subject. 8</td>', 'nice movement effect and main subject. 8', '2003-10-09 22:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(445556, 40416, 9109, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone works great for this shot... just too bad for the two spotlights though :-(<br/>If not shooting for the challenge I would assume you''d bracket the shot and then combine them in PS?</td>', 'The sepia tone works great for this shot... just too bad for the two spotlights though :-(If not shooting for the challenge I would assume you''d bracket the shot and then combine them in PS?', '2003-10-09 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445558, 41008, 9109, '<td valign="top">This shot is way too overexposed ... if this was intentional then it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'This shot is way too overexposed ... if this was intentional then it doesn''t work for me.', '2003-10-09 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(445559, 40877, 9109, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the bird really adds more interest into the picture!</td>', 'Great shot, the bird really adds more interest into the picture!', '2003-10-09 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(445560, 41132, 9109, '<td valign="top">Wow great sky but somewhat overexposed, I think.</td>', 'Wow great sky but somewhat overexposed, I think.', '2003-10-09 23:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(445561, 41214, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition with the window as framing,<br/>and you picked the perfect day with a dramatic cloudy sky :)<br/>great job !</td>', 'beautiful composition with the window as framing,and you picked the perfect day with a dramatic cloudy sky :)great job !', '2003-10-09 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(445562, 40453, 6668, '<td valign="top">nice shot but cropped a little to closely.</td>', 'nice shot but cropped a little to closely.', '2003-10-09 23:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445563, 40952, 9411, '<td valign="top">I''d think the Wicita Chamber of Commerce would pay for this shot!  Amazing clarity. Good capture on the cloud reflection.</td>', 'I''d think the Wicita Chamber of Commerce would pay for this shot!  Amazing clarity. Good capture on the cloud reflection.', '2003-10-09 23:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(445567, 41294, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract. Particurly  good use of colour.  9</td>', 'Very nice abstract. Particurly  good use of colour.  9', '2003-10-09 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(445569, 41315, 9411, '<td valign="top">Chicago?  The best "mood" shot of the challenge, imo. 9</td>', 'Chicago?  The best "mood" shot of the challenge, imo. 9', '2003-10-09 23:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(445571, 40665, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...personally I feel it would be better without the round lights near the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot...personally I feel it would be better without the round lights near the bottom.', '2003-10-09 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(445575, 41278, 8125, '<td valign="top">A cool urban image - and I like the spotlight on the top of the tallest building.  I think a tighter crop would have gotten rid of the bright light at the bottom left without sacrificing the image.</td>', 'A cool urban image - and I like the spotlight on the top of the tallest building.  I think a tighter crop would have gotten rid of the bright light at the bottom left without sacrificing the image.', '2003-10-09 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(445577, 41287, 8125, '<td valign="top">A cool building and the title is very fitting.  Compositionally strong, good lighting, colors are very nice and I love how the sky looks.  Well done!</td>', 'A cool building and the title is very fitting.  Compositionally strong, good lighting, colors are very nice and I love how the sky looks.  Well done!', '2003-10-09 23:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(445578, 41150, 8125, '<td valign="top">The image seems a little dark, probably due to time of day.  I wonder if you tried a tighter crop the buildings might become a stronger part of the photo... ?</td>', 'The image seems a little dark, probably due to time of day.  I wonder if you tried a tighter crop the buildings might become a stronger part of the photo... ?', '2003-10-09 23:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(445579, 41085, 9411, '<td valign="top">Really like the clouds. 7</td>', 'Really like the clouds. 7', '2003-10-09 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(445580, 40786, 11769, '<td valign="top">My favorite. 10+</td>', 'My favorite. 10+', '2003-10-09 23:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(445581, 41218, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s cool.  It''s obvious where the lake is  :-)  There appears to be some spots at the top of the picture, but now I''m just picking...  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow - that''s cool.  It''s obvious where the lake is  :-)  There appears to be some spots at the top of the picture, but now I''m just picking...  Nicely done.', '2003-10-09 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(445584, 40500, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow... very interesting idea for this challenge.  The only thing I can see is some of the imperfections from the glass, but that''s tough to avoid.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow... very interesting idea for this challenge.  The only thing I can see is some of the imperfections from the glass, but that''s tough to avoid.  Nice job!', '2003-10-09 23:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(445585, 41389, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection shot!!</td>', 'Excellent reflection shot!!', '2003-10-09 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(445586, 40627, 11800, '<td valign="top">The more of this type of picture, the more I get the feeling that they are really hard to get the right balance between busy and boring. Admire the attempt. I would have maybe cropped it square, using the top portion.</td>', 'The more of this type of picture, the more I get the feeling that they are really hard to get the right balance between busy and boring. Admire the attempt. I would have maybe cropped it square, using the top portion.', '2003-10-09 23:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(445587, 40953, 8125, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit too small - hard to see detail.</td>', 'This image is a bit too small - hard to see detail.', '2003-10-09 23:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(445588, 41303, 8125, '<td valign="top">Where does the singing come into play, is how the walls are shaped and how wind moves through them?</td>', 'Where does the singing come into play, is how the walls are shaped and how wind moves through them?', '2003-10-09 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(445591, 41257, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it except the vertical is off.</td>', 'I like it except the vertical is off.', '2003-10-09 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445593, 41343, 8125, '<td valign="top">I love the architecture of this building.  I would prefer to see it clear with a beautiful blue sky above - but this is still nicely photographed.</td>', 'I love the architecture of this building.  I would prefer to see it clear with a beautiful blue sky above - but this is still nicely photographed.', '2003-10-09 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(445596, 41069, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow, a cool looking building.  You captured detail and color.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow, a cool looking building.  You captured detail and color.  Nice job.', '2003-10-09 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445597, 40676, 11923, '<td valign="top">The colors are gorgeous, they work well together.  I very much like the scene, sits well.  The lighting is great.  Very nice composition.  This would make a wonderful print.  Excellent job.</td>', 'The colors are gorgeous, they work well together.  I very much like the scene, sits well.  The lighting is great.  Very nice composition.  This would make a wonderful print.  Excellent job.', '2003-10-09 23:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(445598, 40639, 8125, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset shot and I think the frame you used fits this image very well.</td>', 'A beautiful sunset shot and I think the frame you used fits this image very well.', '2003-10-09 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(445600, 40639, 6668, '<td valign="top">Gorgous colors...love the frame it really accents the picture nicely...nice work..10</td>', 'Gorgous colors...love the frame it really accents the picture nicely...nice work..10', '2003-10-09 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(445601, 41062, 11800, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition for this building and grounds. The lack of contrast makes the picture look more boring than it needs to be. Too bad you couldn''t clone out the tree on the right.</td>', 'Perfect composition for this building and grounds. The lack of contrast makes the picture look more boring than it needs to be. Too bad you couldn''t clone out the tree on the right.', '2003-10-09 23:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
