(445611, 40460, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - well done.  I like the effect of the fog with the lights on the buildings.</td>', 'Wow - well done.  I like the effect of the fog with the lights on the buildings.', '2003-10-09 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
