(445646, 41392, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and the clarity is amazing.  One of the best night shots I''ve seen yet.  At first I was a bit put off by the darkness in the upper right corner but upon closer examination the different colors and contrasts really help make the picture.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and the clarity is amazing.  One of the best night shots I''ve seen yet.  At first I was a bit put off by the darkness in the upper right corner but upon closer examination the different colors and contrasts really help make the picture.', '2003-10-09 23:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
