(445651, 41211, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot is a good grasp of the challenge but the overall shot could use some more contrast and detail, the clarity is wanting.</td>', 'This shot is a good grasp of the challenge but the overall shot could use some more contrast and detail, the clarity is wanting.', '2003-10-09 23:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
