(445654, 41371, 12448, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are wonderful, the pinks in the sky are fasinating!  The tail wind on the left really is a plus but reminds me of a whale tail more than an airplane.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are wonderful, the pinks in the sky are fasinating!  The tail wind on the left really is a plus but reminds me of a whale tail more than an airplane.', '2003-10-09 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
