(445663, 41315, 11800, '<td valign="top">The composition is effective and I can see the man sitting there all alone. The only thing that is bothersome is the fringing on the white lights. I don''t know how you could improve that short of getting a better lens. 7</td>', 'The composition is effective and I can see the man sitting there all alone. The only thing that is bothersome is the fringing on the white lights. I don''t know how you could improve that short of getting a better lens. 7', '2003-10-10 00:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(445665, 41398, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love black and white church photos. They convey a timeless sort of mystery. I love a black and white shot on a sunny day too. Nice textures in the trees that frame the subject beautifully. There is a simplicity to this that really works.</td>', 'I love black and white church photos. They convey a timeless sort of mystery. I love a black and white shot on a sunny day too. Nice textures in the trees that frame the subject beautifully. There is a simplicity to this that really works.', '2003-10-10 00:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(445667, 41239, 11800, '<td valign="top">B and w works well for this.  Looks like an old photo of an old city.</td>', 'B and w works well for this.  Looks like an old photo of an old city.', '2003-10-10 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
