(445670, 40787, 12611, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me want to give fifty bucks to UNICEF and then rent mad max. Nice foreground subject placement and you really convey the feeling of abject poverty. Two things... no city, and that sky is the color of any partly sunny New Jersey sky- you just would expect more from an "Africa shot."</td>', 'This picture makes me want to give fifty bucks to UNICEF and then rent mad max. Nice foreground subject placement and you really convey the feeling of abject poverty. Two things... no city, and that sky is the color of any partly sunny New Jersey sky- you just would expect more from an "Africa shot."', '2003-10-10 00:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(445671, 41323, 7570, '<td valign="top">the sky looks nice, but the buildings at the bottom are uninspiring, seem too linear. 7</td>', 'the sky looks nice, but the buildings at the bottom are uninspiring, seem too linear. 7', '2003-10-10 00:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
