(445677, 41059, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very Nice color juxtaposition of the blue and yellow elements. THhe viewer''s eyes slide onto the "B &amp; O Mills"  part and won''t unlock. Your eyes just get pulled down and that is distracting. Go a little more abstract adn focus on the super-saturated color- its your strength.</td>', 'Very Nice color juxtaposition of the blue and yellow elements. THhe viewer''s eyes slide onto the "B & O Mills"  part and won''t unlock. Your eyes just get pulled down and that is distracting. Go a little more abstract adn focus on the super-saturated color- its your strength.', '2003-10-10 00:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(445678, 40654, 7570, '<td valign="top">nice clean lines and level where this is taken. 7</td>', 'nice clean lines and level where this is taken. 7', '2003-10-10 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
