(445681, 40435, 11800, '<td valign="top">Dreamy. Looks really old and beat up. Maybe stepping back just a little would give some more clues about the city it''s in. Is it as old and beat up or maybe it''s clean and well kept.</td>', 'Dreamy. Looks really old and beat up. Maybe stepping back just a little would give some more clues about the city it''s in. Is it as old and beat up or maybe it''s clean and well kept.', '2003-10-10 00:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(445683, 41318, 12611, '<td valign="top">This photo has something charming about it, the movement, the water, but... the water and sky are way to much in this picture. The foreground is far too busy, and there could be a bit more color/contrast in this shot. I like the red building, though...</td>', 'This photo has something charming about it, the movement, the water, but... the water and sky are way to much in this picture. The foreground is far too busy, and there could be a bit more color/contrast in this shot. I like the red building, though...', '2003-10-10 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(445684, 40665, 12681, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. I like the darkened images of buildings and the hint of sunset in the horizon. The street lights in foreground reinforce the night mood.</td>', 'Nice exposure. I like the darkened images of buildings and the hint of sunset in the horizon. The street lights in foreground reinforce the night mood.', '2003-10-10 00:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
