(445689, 40869, 7570, '<td valign="top">the cropping makes it hard to figure out what the subject is/looks like. and dusk is giving off an orange tone, which doesn''t really suit the main subject (metal). just my personal opinion. 5</td>', 'the cropping makes it hard to figure out what the subject is/looks like. and dusk is giving off an orange tone, which doesn''t really suit the main subject (metal). just my personal opinion. 5', '2003-10-10 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(445692, 41257, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this shot of ?paris?Truly beautiful with the trees! so leaf-luscious and detailed. THe only flaw is the big fortressy type building. Not enough- or too much is shown. Maybe  if the shot was from a little lower perspective it might be nicer. all in all a great subject and good photo.</td>', 'I love this shot of ?paris?Truly beautiful with the trees! so leaf-luscious and detailed. THe only flaw is the big fortressy type building. Not enough- or too much is shown. Maybe  if the shot was from a little lower perspective it might be nicer. all in all a great subject and good photo.', '2003-10-10 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(445693, 41239, 7570, '<td valign="top">hmm, greyscale is giving a nice mood, but i''d prefer sepia in this case. 7</td>', 'hmm, greyscale is giving a nice mood, but i''d prefer sepia in this case. 7', '2003-10-10 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
