(445697, 41289, 12681, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The reflections of the buildings are so deep and dramatic. The still water makes an effective photo.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The reflections of the buildings are so deep and dramatic. The still water makes an effective photo.', '2003-10-10 00:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(445699, 40937, 12611, '<td valign="top">This has nice color, composition, and  sharpness. It is, however, not very "artistic" in the artsy fartsy photo sense. This photo needs a kick in the pants or else it looks like you are just blowing film on your way to getting it developed.</td>', 'This has nice color, composition, and  sharpness. It is, however, not very "artistic" in the artsy fartsy photo sense. This photo needs a kick in the pants or else it looks like you are just blowing film on your way to getting it developed.', '2003-10-10 00:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
