(445704, 41292, 12611, '<td valign="top">I really have a thing for rooftops, and these are famous rooftops. The sunlight is distracting- try taking this same shot on a foggy, day, make it black and white, and you have a 9 or 10.</td>', 'I really have a thing for rooftops, and these are famous rooftops. The sunlight is distracting- try taking this same shot on a foggy, day, make it black and white, and you have a 9 or 10.', '2003-10-10 00:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
