(445823, 41177, 6172, '<td valign="top">My problem with this is the leaning of the architecture.   I don''t know if you have Photoshop, but there is a way to fix this.  Otherwise I really like this photo.  I like the clouds and the effect you created with them.</td>', 'My problem with this is the leaning of the architecture.   I don''t know if you have Photoshop, but there is a way to fix this.  Otherwise I really like this photo.  I like the clouds and the effect you created with them.', '2003-10-10 01:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
