(446097, 41211, 12216, '<td valign="top">Little bit grainy on left corner but anywhere nice lightning and good angle.<br/>subject : 1/1 shoot : 2/3 layout : 2/3 title : 1/1  presentation : 2/2</td>', 'Little bit grainy on left corner but anywhere nice lightning and good angle.subject : 1/1 shoot : 2/3 layout : 2/3 title : 1/1  presentation : 2/2', '2003-10-10 08:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446114, 40432, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting response to the challenge...a crop at tje bottom to remove the distracting red would have helped this viewer</td>', 'this is a very interesting response to the challenge...a crop at tje bottom to remove the distracting red would have helped this viewer', '2003-10-10 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446115, 40959, 6624, '<td valign="top">certainly an urban landscape, nice compositional balance with the curves - lot of city clutter 6</td>', 'certainly an urban landscape, nice compositional balance with the curves - lot of city clutter 6', '2003-10-10 09:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446116, 41089, 11155, '<td valign="top">Not really what I would consider "urban" (urban=city in my opinion), but this is an excellent photo.  I love the blues and the whites.  Shapes are interesting too.  Even though I don''t consider this urban, I''m still going to give it a decent score  just because it is a building and it is such a wonderful capture.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not really what I would consider "urban" (urban=city in my opinion), but this is an excellent photo.  I love the blues and the whites.  Shapes are interesting too.  Even though I don''t consider this urban, I''m still going to give it a decent score  just because it is a building and it is such a wonderful capture.  Good luck.', '2003-10-10 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(446117, 40754, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - lights are great.  Buildings look a little tilted to the right.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice capture - lights are great.  Buildings look a little tilted to the right.  Good luck.', '2003-10-10 09:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446121, 41097, 5728, '<td valign="top">The sepia toning is very fitting. I also like how you have included some of the railway track into the image. However, I would have prefered to have seen this in landscape instead of portrait.</td>', 'The sepia toning is very fitting. I also like how you have included some of the railway track into the image. However, I would have prefered to have seen this in landscape instead of portrait.', '2003-10-10 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446123, 41329, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the stepping effect of the buildings and the chimneys from left to right. For some reason when I look at this pic I get the feeling that the right side is going to tip over, like when someone is sitting on the end of a bench and tips the whole bench? It isn''t negative at all, just the first thing I thought when I saw this. Technically this is very good.</td>', 'I like the stepping effect of the buildings and the chimneys from left to right. For some reason when I look at this pic I get the feeling that the right side is going to tip over, like when someone is sitting on the end of a bench and tips the whole bench? It isn''t negative at all, just the first thing I thought when I saw this. Technically this is very good.', '2003-10-10 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446126, 41102, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks like a kind of futuristic building. The stormy skies and color tones really do it for this image (9)</td>', 'Looks like a kind of futuristic building. The stormy skies and color tones really do it for this image (9)', '2003-10-10 09:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446127, 41085, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good city night shot, full of life. A little on the soft side however. The cloudy dark sky brings in a good effect. It wouldn''t be as impressive had it been totally black.</td>', 'Good city night shot, full of life. A little on the soft side however. The cloudy dark sky brings in a good effect. It wouldn''t be as impressive had it been totally black.', '2003-10-10 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(446129, 40540, 11022, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the diagonal lines in this shot.  Very aptly titled and nicely done</td>', 'I love the colors and the diagonal lines in this shot.  Very aptly titled and nicely done', '2003-10-10 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446130, 41088, 11022, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Here is a perfect blend of the awesome facade of the city reflecting the majesty of the sky.  I like the tight crop to exclude any real sky, catching only the reflection. Excellent urban landscape.</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Here is a perfect blend of the awesome facade of the city reflecting the majesty of the sky.  I like the tight crop to exclude any real sky, catching only the reflection. Excellent urban landscape.', '2003-10-10 10:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446132, 41155, 11022, '<td valign="top">Wonderful repetetive elements, great color and composition, everything is quite pleasing.  The only drawback I can see is that "landscape" implies "outdoors" to me.  However, I didn''t let that stand in the way of voting this high.</td>', 'Wonderful repetetive elements, great color and composition, everything is quite pleasing.  The only drawback I can see is that "landscape" implies "outdoors" to me.  However, I didn''t let that stand in the way of voting this high.', '2003-10-10 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446133, 41218, 6624, '<td valign="top">the density of this is very interesting, certainly gives the appropriate feel for the challenge 8</td>', 'the density of this is very interesting, certainly gives the appropriate feel for the challenge 8', '2003-10-10 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446135, 41346, 11022, '<td valign="top">I love this image and voted it quite high.  I do find it awkward that the eye is drawn from right to left instead of the more natural left to right.  If it were mine (and I sure do wish it was!) I would also crop the sky closer and include more water in the forerground to get the horizon off center a bit more.  These are only suggestions of course...this shot is already wonderful.</td>', 'I love this image and voted it quite high.  I do find it awkward that the eye is drawn from right to left instead of the more natural left to right.  If it were mine (and I sure do wish it was!) I would also crop the sky closer and include more water in the forerground to get the horizon off center a bit more.  These are only suggestions of course...this shot is already wonderful.', '2003-10-10 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(446137, 41010, 11022, '<td valign="top">Your choice of color has added so much to this image, I think.  There is drama and interest and a true sense of "urban" here.  I keep coming back to look at it again.  It appeals to me on many levels without me understanding exactly why. It reminds me a bit of West Side Story or a set of a Broadway play.  In any case, this is stunning.  Great job.</td>', 'Your choice of color has added so much to this image, I think.  There is drama and interest and a true sense of "urban" here.  I keep coming back to look at it again.  It appeals to me on many levels without me understanding exactly why. It reminds me a bit of West Side Story or a set of a Broadway play.  In any case, this is stunning.  Great job.', '2003-10-10 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(446138, 41366, 6624, '<td valign="top">model RR?</td>', 'model RR?', '2003-10-10 10:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446139, 41313, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like General Palmer street view better.. LOL....</td>', 'I like General Palmer street view better.. LOL....', '2003-10-10 10:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446152, 40460, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very surreal feeling to this shot, the soft focus with the fog around the top of the building at first turned me off and I started with a lower score for you.  As I come back and look at it more closely I see the back light on the buildings really adds to the shot.  The way the top of the tallest building is almost swallowed by the fog is rather interesting and helps draw your attention to that corner of the shot. <br/> <br/>The only thing that could have made this score higher for me was a bit more focus on the bottom of the shot, from very sharp on the bottom to very muted at the top.  Otherwise an excellent shot overall.</td>', 'A very surreal feeling to this shot, the soft focus with the fog around the top of the building at first turned me off and I started with a lower score for you.  As I come back and look at it more closely I see the back light on the buildings really adds to the shot.  The way the top of the tallest building is almost swallowed by the fog is rather interesting and helps draw your attention to that corner of the shot.  The only thing that could have made this score higher for me was a bit more focus on the bottom of the shot, from very sharp on the bottom to very muted at the top.  Otherwise an excellent shot overall.', '2003-10-10 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446153, 41129, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept here, the feeling of urban and landscape come through very well but I''m not sure I like the coloration you did to the shot.  It''s interesting and certainly grabs your attention at first but then it''s almost distrubing, to me anyway.</td>', 'I really like the concept here, the feeling of urban and landscape come through very well but I''m not sure I like the coloration you did to the shot.  It''s interesting and certainly grabs your attention at first but then it''s almost distrubing, to me anyway.', '2003-10-10 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446155, 40453, 12448, '<td valign="top">A bit small, hard to see the details and the top of the tower got cut off either in the shot itself or the cropping.  The light is good, nice and bright but the focus also seems just a bit off.</td>', 'A bit small, hard to see the details and the top of the tower got cut off either in the shot itself or the cropping.  The light is good, nice and bright but the focus also seems just a bit off.', '2003-10-10 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446157, 41389, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice composition, the intensity of the color in the reflection is very good, certainly an urban landscape 8</td>', 'nice composition, the intensity of the color in the reflection is very good, certainly an urban landscape 8', '2003-10-10 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446158, 40878, 9493, '<td valign="top">nice photograph were you on a boat?  i like it</td>', 'nice photograph were you on a boat?  i like it', '2003-10-10 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(446159, 40653, 2241, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast.  Very good photo</td>', 'I like the contrast.  Very good photo', '2003-10-10 11:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446160, 41217, 2241, '<td valign="top">Looks like the same rainbow we had down in Charlotte.  Ain''t that amazing.</td>', 'Looks like the same rainbow we had down in Charlotte.  Ain''t that amazing.', '2003-10-10 11:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446162, 40829, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective, very clear and sharp. The cloud is an added bonus which  balances out the darkness/brightness perfectly.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective, very clear and sharp. The cloud is an added bonus which  balances out the darkness/brightness perfectly.', '2003-10-10 11:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446163, 41264, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition although a little too hazy. The boats bring in more interest so that it isn''t just a plain urban landscape pic. I think in this challenge an extra element of interest is necessary.</td>', 'Good composition although a little too hazy. The boats bring in more interest so that it isn''t just a plain urban landscape pic. I think in this challenge an extra element of interest is necessary.', '2003-10-10 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446165, 41319, 5728, '<td valign="top">A little on the hazy side this pic. I would gone more with landscape format instead of portrait. Either that or used more of a wider angle. Also I would have moved your shooting position a little to the left and gotten in more of the cityscape. By moving more to the left you wouldn''t have gotten in the lines of the bridge which are a little distracting. Just the thoughts that jumped to mind when I clicked on your pic.</td>', 'A little on the hazy side this pic. I would gone more with landscape format instead of portrait. Either that or used more of a wider angle. Also I would have moved your shooting position a little to the left and gotten in more of the cityscape. By moving more to the left you wouldn''t have gotten in the lines of the bridge which are a little distracting. Just the thoughts that jumped to mind when I clicked on your pic.', '2003-10-10 11:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446166, 41287, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well captured. Spot on perspective and focus. Maybe just a little less exposure the bring out the richness of the colors. 8</td>', 'Well captured. Spot on perspective and focus. Maybe just a little less exposure the bring out the richness of the colors. 8', '2003-10-10 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(446167, 41372, 10785, '<td valign="top">Cookie cutter housing! Gotta love it! It''s like Levittown circa 1948! The photo is technically accurate, but to me it lacks interest. It could probably use something in the foreground besides street.</td>', 'Cookie cutter housing! Gotta love it! It''s like Levittown circa 1948! The photo is technically accurate, but to me it lacks interest. It could probably use something in the foreground besides street.', '2003-10-10 11:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(446169, 41260, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s the thinnest building I''ve ever seen! What is it, 6 ft. wide max.?</td>', 'Wow! That''s the thinnest building I''ve ever seen! What is it, 6 ft. wide max.?', '2003-10-10 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446171, 40787, 10785, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge. The land is so barren though, it lacks interest. It''s a technically accurate depiction of what you saw.</td>', 'This meets the challenge. The land is so barren though, it lacks interest. It''s a technically accurate depiction of what you saw.', '2003-10-10 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446173, 41026, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture, a little small though. You could have probably put the sign in the top-left third and captured more of the building. That''s just a personal opinion though. Maybe you would have lost the clouds though.</td>', 'It''s a good picture, a little small though. You could have probably put the sign in the top-left third and captured more of the building. That''s just a personal opinion though. Maybe you would have lost the clouds though.', '2003-10-10 11:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446174, 41174, 11800, '<td valign="top">The location you shot from really adds more to this image than just getting a picture of buildings. The steps indicate there are people in the city and the different directions and groups of steps implies that it is a very diverse busy city. The lack of a city name in the title suggests the city could be anywhere in the world. Really good job.</td>', 'The location you shot from really adds more to this image than just getting a picture of buildings. The steps indicate there are people in the city and the different directions and groups of steps implies that it is a very diverse busy city. The lack of a city name in the title suggests the city could be anywhere in the world. Really good job.', '2003-10-10 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446179, 41330, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, the natural framing with the trees comes over well, especially bringing in the reds to break the grey cityscape colors.</td>', 'I like the concept here, the natural framing with the trees comes over well, especially bringing in the reds to break the grey cityscape colors.', '2003-10-10 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446180, 41404, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny title, very fitting.</td>', 'Funny title, very fitting.', '2003-10-10 11:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446181, 41007, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty spooky looking town there. It''s hard to comment on this one. I want to see more detail, and for the tower to be more in focus. The composition is ok.</td>', 'Pretty spooky looking town there. It''s hard to comment on this one. I want to see more detail, and for the tower to be more in focus. The composition is ok.', '2003-10-10 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446183, 40800, 10785, '<td valign="top">That might be a building there in the background, I don''t know...but it''s definitely a landscape shot! Good dof in the forground!</td>', 'That might be a building there in the background, I don''t know...but it''s definitely a landscape shot! Good dof in the forground!', '2003-10-10 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446185, 40952, 12363, '<td valign="top">I never knew Wichita to be so nice :)<br/>The reflection is nice, but the main piece of the photo is the hotel which is pretty simple.  You''ve got warm light and calm waters.  <br/>You''ve split the image in half horizontally - try to avoid this.  Some photos it''ll work ok in, but only a few.</td>', 'I never knew Wichita to be so nice :)The reflection is nice, but the main piece of the photo is the hotel which is pretty simple.  You''ve got warm light and calm waters.  You''ve split the image in half horizontally - try to avoid this.  Some photos it''ll work ok in, but only a few.', '2003-10-10 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446189, 41366, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s a toy train set, right? Good try. Would have liked more clarity and details.</td>', 'It''s a toy train set, right? Good try. Would have liked more clarity and details.', '2003-10-10 11:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446190, 41283, 12363, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of shadow here...not much detail for use to see in the buildings.<br/>The bridge seems to be the interesting piece of the subject, but it''s feels out of focus.<br/>The concrete/brick in the lower left leads us into the image well.  Good usage.<br/>The sunlight leads us in as well.<br/>The clouds may be a bit bright.  <br/>Basically the exposure of this scene is very wide (bright brights to dark darks.  This is hard to pull off.  You''d need to step down .5 to 1 stops and use the Levels in PS to pull out the detail.<br/></td>', 'There''s a lot of shadow here...not much detail for use to see in the buildings.The bridge seems to be the interesting piece of the subject, but it''s feels out of focus.The concrete/brick in the lower left leads us into the image well.  Good usage.The sunlight leads us in as well.The clouds may be a bit bright.  Basically the exposure of this scene is very wide (bright brights to dark darks.  This is hard to pull off.  You''d need to step down .5 to 1 stops and use the Levels in PS to pull out the detail.', '2003-10-10 11:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(446193, 41154, 11800, '<td valign="top">Too much neat image. Lost all your details. A little overboard on the usm also. The composition is ok, maybe not so much blank space on the left. Neat image and usm are great tools, but the best way to get a good picture is to shoot it better.</td>', 'Too much neat image. Lost all your details. A little overboard on the usm also. The composition is ok, maybe not so much blank space on the left. Neat image and usm are great tools, but the best way to get a good picture is to shoot it better.', '2003-10-10 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446202, 41262, 11800, '<td valign="top">The shadows relly work well in this picture. Good composition also. Maybe getting the full bottom landing would have added a visual completion to the photo.</td>', 'The shadows relly work well in this picture. Good composition also. Maybe getting the full bottom landing would have added a visual completion to the photo.', '2003-10-10 12:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(446204, 40800, 3898, '<td valign="top">Where is the urban?<br/>Its a good shot though.</td>', 'Where is the urban?Its a good shot though.', '2003-10-10 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(446205, 41404, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good job visualizing the claustraphobia(sp) associated with new developments. Makes one wonder how people can live there.</td>', 'Good job visualizing the claustraphobia(sp) associated with new developments. Makes one wonder how people can live there.', '2003-10-10 12:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(446206, 41007, 3898, '<td valign="top">It makes me feel cold and wet.</td>', 'It makes me feel cold and wet.', '2003-10-10 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446208, 40926, 6845, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like water. Nice image.</td>', 'Almost looks like water. Nice image.', '2003-10-10 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446210, 40474, 11800, '<td valign="top">Why so much boring sky?</td>', 'Why so much boring sky?', '2003-10-10 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446223, 41024, 208, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice feel to it, a bit forbidding like an Edgar Allen Poe story. I''d like to see the top of the spire, though.</td>', 'This has a really nice feel to it, a bit forbidding like an Edgar Allen Poe story. I''d like to see the top of the spire, though.', '2003-10-10 12:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446224, 40801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful. I think I''d like to see the horizon moved up or down (further from centre). Great colours and light.</td>', 'Very peaceful. I think I''d like to see the horizon moved up or down (further from centre). Great colours and light.', '2003-10-10 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446225, 41303, 208, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit dull, but this is well framed. Nice shot.</td>', 'The colors are a bit dull, but this is well framed. Nice shot.', '2003-10-10 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446226, 41342, 208, '<td valign="top">NIce silhouette. I like how the tree is in the brightest part of the sunset.</td>', 'NIce silhouette. I like how the tree is in the brightest part of the sunset.', '2003-10-10 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(446227, 41346, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I like the aerial perspective. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent shot. I like the aerial perspective. Very well done.', '2003-10-10 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446229, 40952, 208, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but the main focus of it - the Hyatt building - isn''t very interesting. The picture''s composition and color is nice, though.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but the main focus of it - the Hyatt building - isn''t very interesting. The picture''s composition and color is nice, though.', '2003-10-10 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446230, 40671, 208, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if the building were either more centered in the frame or if they were at a more interesting angle. They''re slightly off-center here. I do like the black and white, though - I usually see these in color.</td>', 'I think it would be better if the building were either more centered in the frame or if they were at a more interesting angle. They''re slightly off-center here. I do like the black and white, though - I usually see these in color.', '2003-10-10 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446231, 40758, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  Good entry to the challenge.  It''s hard to take these pictures agains such a bright sky.</td>', 'Very beautiful.  Good entry to the challenge.  It''s hard to take these pictures agains such a bright sky.', '2003-10-10 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446233, 41088, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Makes you dizzy to look at this picture.  This is Toronto, right?  Good work, good entry.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful.  Makes you dizzy to look at this picture.  This is Toronto, right?  Good work, good entry.  ~8', '2003-10-10 12:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446234, 41257, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, good b/w.</td>', 'Beautiful, good b/w.', '2003-10-10 12:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446235, 40829, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like all the angles and shapes in this picture, contrasted to the fluffy white cloud on the blue sky.  Good entry!</td>', 'I like all the angles and shapes in this picture, contrasted to the fluffy white cloud on the blue sky.  Good entry!', '2003-10-10 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446236, 41272, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a really wonderful shot!  I love the way you''ve included people, which are as much a part of urban landscapes as are buildings.  It really expresses the hustle and bustle of city life. The tones are great as well.</td>', 'This is a really wonderful shot!  I love the way you''ve included people, which are as much a part of urban landscapes as are buildings.  It really expresses the hustle and bustle of city life. The tones are great as well.', '2003-10-10 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446237, 40653, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette!  I like it.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette!  I like it.  ~8', '2003-10-10 12:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(446238, 41289, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, good reflection.  Very nice.</td>', 'Wow, good reflection.  Very nice.', '2003-10-10 12:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446239, 40887, 5112, '<td valign="top">That ferris wheel looks like it''s going to fall into the water at any time!!!  I LOVE the sky, and the silhouettes are beautiful.  Very good entry.  ~9</td>', 'That ferris wheel looks like it''s going to fall into the water at any time!!!  I LOVE the sky, and the silhouettes are beautiful.  Very good entry.  ~9', '2003-10-10 12:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446240, 40463, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good colours!</td>', 'Good colours!', '2003-10-10 12:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446241, 41150, 12719, '<td valign="top">a bit of a blue cast, but good composition...a mite ditracted by the lamp on the right.  still, v. good composition - well done.</td>', 'a bit of a blue cast, but good composition...a mite ditracted by the lamp on the right.  still, v. good composition - well done.', '2003-10-10 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446242, 40639, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful at left, especially where sun streams down onto buildings from broken cloud. Right hand side is a little too dark.</td>', 'Beautiful at left, especially where sun streams down onto buildings from broken cloud. Right hand side is a little too dark.', '2003-10-10 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446243, 40864, 5112, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I must say that after reading the title, my first thought was to wonder if the Federal Buildings were a street :)  Gutsy entry, but I''m not sure what to think of it.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I must say that after reading the title, my first thought was to wonder if the Federal Buildings were a street :)  Gutsy entry, but I''m not sure what to think of it.', '2003-10-10 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446244, 41389, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful reflection, so clear. ~9</td>', 'Very beautiful reflection, so clear. ~9', '2003-10-10 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446245, 41346, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful low-key image. <br/>I''d prefer horizon to be either centred more accurately or more obviously off centre, either up or down within the frame.</td>', 'A beautiful low-key image. I''d prefer horizon to be either centred more accurately or more obviously off centre, either up or down within the frame.', '2003-10-10 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(446246, 41218, 5822, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOOOOUTSTANDING !!!</td>', 'OOOOOOOOOUTSTANDING !!!', '2003-10-10 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(446247, 40731, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b/w!   Good entry to urban landscape.   ~9</td>', 'Beautiful b/w!   Good entry to urban landscape.   ~9', '2003-10-10 12:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446248, 40985, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the play between light and dark. There are enough details to make this interesting, and the flatness makes it look like a cartoon world. Good job. Too much blankness on the left, but that''s minor.</td>', 'I like the play between light and dark. There are enough details to make this interesting, and the flatness makes it look like a cartoon world. Good job. Too much blankness on the left, but that''s minor.', '2003-10-10 12:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(446249, 41281, 11907, '<td valign="top">Perfect time of day, and one of my favorite places to visit. Nice job</td>', 'Perfect time of day, and one of my favorite places to visit. Nice job', '2003-10-10 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446250, 41346, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  One of my favourites this challenge.  Foggy silhouettes, and an excellent reflection - wow, what a concept.  I like it.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  One of my favourites this challenge.  Foggy silhouettes, and an excellent reflection - wow, what a concept.  I like it.  ~10', '2003-10-10 12:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446251, 41404, 5112, '<td valign="top">Funny (and very sad at the same time).</td>', 'Funny (and very sad at the same time).', '2003-10-10 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446252, 41012, 208, '<td valign="top">Niether the tree nor the building seems to be in focus. It''s probably a camera thing (happened to me all the time with my last one). Best thing to do is take a bunch of photos with different focus points. I like the effect you''re going for, though.</td>', 'Niether the tree nor the building seems to be in focus. It''s probably a camera thing (happened to me all the time with my last one). Best thing to do is take a bunch of photos with different focus points. I like the effect you''re going for, though.', '2003-10-10 12:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(446254, 40458, 3087, '<td valign="top">... and put up a parking lot!<br/>Nicely taken, nice curved foreground and perspective and nice use of b/w and colour.</td>', '... and put up a parking lot!Nicely taken, nice curved foreground and perspective and nice use of b/w and colour.', '2003-10-10 12:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(446255, 41094, 5112, '<td valign="top">Definitely an urban landscape (IMO).  ~7</td>', 'Definitely an urban landscape (IMO).  ~7', '2003-10-10 12:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446256, 40579, 11907, '<td valign="top">Graffitti advertising, an American original. I like it, very urban!</td>', 'Graffitti advertising, an American original. I like it, very urban!', '2003-10-10 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446258, 41294, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quriky, cool abstract.</td>', 'Quriky, cool abstract.', '2003-10-10 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446260, 41010, 3087, '<td valign="top">Reminds of that print with the workmen on the crane...<br/>Great choice to go B/W.</td>', 'Reminds of that print with the workmen on the crane...Great choice to go B/W.', '2003-10-10 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446261, 40796, 2241, '<td valign="top">I have the same leaning in on the edges.  I know that''s a characteristic of the lens.  I don''t know of a way to correct it.  Do you.  good picture</td>', 'I have the same leaning in on the edges.  I know that''s a characteristic of the lens.  I don''t know of a way to correct it.  Do you.  good picture', '2003-10-10 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446262, 40679, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but (in my opinion) this kind of shot needs to have a focal point that''s actually in focus and still, so all the motion is pointing to something.</td>', 'Cool idea, but (in my opinion) this kind of shot needs to have a focal point that''s actually in focus and still, so all the motion is pointing to something.', '2003-10-10 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446263, 41323, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, the sky is very beautiful.  The picture might be a bit more effective if the buildings presented a stronger, more defined silhouette (not a sort of flat line with just a couple small breaks).  I don''t know, something to try.</td>', 'Good idea, the sky is very beautiful.  The picture might be a bit more effective if the buildings presented a stronger, more defined silhouette (not a sort of flat line with just a couple small breaks).  I don''t know, something to try.', '2003-10-10 12:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(446265, 41324, 11800, '<td valign="top">A little too blue.  In a small city like this, if you could maybe pick out one thing that is interesting and shoot a few frames with that as the focus, from different perspectives, you might find a more interesting picture.</td>', 'A little too blue.  In a small city like this, if you could maybe pick out one thing that is interesting and shoot a few frames with that as the focus, from different perspectives, you might find a more interesting picture.', '2003-10-10 12:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446267, 40473, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, this high rise looks like it''s going up in smoke (or steam).  That lamp is really strange looking.  Interesting.</td>', 'Wow, this high rise looks like it''s going up in smoke (or steam).  That lamp is really strange looking.  Interesting.', '2003-10-10 12:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446268, 41155, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-10-10 12:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446269, 40822, 3087, '<td valign="top">Evokes a strong feeling of melancholy...</td>', 'Evokes a strong feeling of melancholy...', '2003-10-10 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446270, 40662, 11907, '<td valign="top">Very nice, most definetly urban</td>', 'Very nice, most definetly urban', '2003-10-10 12:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446271, 41262, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  Love the shadows made by the steps.  I think the title and the picture don''t quite match, at least to me, the catching element in the picture are the play of angles between windows, bricks, steps and shadows, in particular the steps and shadows.  I like this one.  ~9</td>', 'Very beautiful.  Love the shadows made by the steps.  I think the title and the picture don''t quite match, at least to me, the catching element in the picture are the play of angles between windows, bricks, steps and shadows, in particular the steps and shadows.  I like this one.  ~9', '2003-10-10 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446272, 40460, 3087, '<td valign="top">Dreamy! Very Bladerunner! Like it!</td>', 'Dreamy! Very Bladerunner! Like it!', '2003-10-10 12:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(446275, 40676, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good choice of lighting - is it late afternoon? Great colours.</td>', 'Good choice of lighting - is it late afternoon? Great colours.', '2003-10-10 12:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446276, 40460, 11907, '<td valign="top">Nature rules the skies tonight! Very good capture. I really like it!</td>', 'Nature rules the skies tonight! Very good capture. I really like it!', '2003-10-10 12:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
