(446292, 41102, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing sky and the curved building looks great against it, but the buildings below are simply too dark. I wonder whether a different angle which cropped out the buildings below but retained that sky would be stronger? Just wondering, so very possibly not!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing sky and the curved building looks great against it, but the buildings below are simply too dark. I wonder whether a different angle which cropped out the buildings below but retained that sky would be stronger? Just wondering, so very possibly not!', '2003-10-10 13:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
