(446312, 41133, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh action shot. Haze doesn''t work for me, sky a little bland but composition and content are good.</td>', 'Oooh action shot. Haze doesn''t work for me, sky a little bland but composition and content are good.', '2003-10-10 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446314, 40640, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful study of detail. I really like this very much.</td>', 'Wonderful study of detail. I really like this very much.', '2003-10-10 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446315, 41287, 2241, '<td valign="top">It''s weird, but I like it.  Don''t know if I''d have seen it.</td>', 'It''s weird, but I like it.  Don''t know if I''d have seen it.', '2003-10-10 13:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446316, 41292, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah quaint old London. Good idea to get as many landmarks in in the photo as possible. I recognise a number of buildings plus the wheel on the Thames way out the back. This is like one of those puzzle pics: "How many buildings can you name" :-)</td>', 'Ah quaint old London. Good idea to get as many landmarks in in the photo as possible. I recognise a number of buildings plus the wheel on the Thames way out the back. This is like one of those puzzle pics: "How many buildings can you name" :-)', '2003-10-10 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446317, 41289, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the reflections, the way they disappear into darkness. Great composition. Lighting excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the reflections, the way they disappear into darkness. Great composition. Lighting excellent.', '2003-10-10 13:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446318, 40864, 208, '<td valign="top">The effects seem sort of haphazard. They work really well on the buildings and cars on the right, but not really anywhere else.</td>', 'The effects seem sort of haphazard. They work really well on the buildings and cars on the right, but not really anywhere else.', '2003-10-10 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(446319, 40731, 3087, '<td valign="top">This could almost be one of those atmospheric Parisian images - the steam helps with that too - but the composition doesn''t work for me and the right hand side of the frame doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'This could almost be one of those atmospheric Parisian images - the steam helps with that too - but the composition doesn''t work for me and the right hand side of the frame doesn''t add anything.', '2003-10-10 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446320, 40931, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, the lighting is good. Not blown out anywhere. The sky and river front appear a little grainy but that might just be because I am looking at this on my laptop.</td>', 'Nice night shot, the lighting is good. Not blown out anywhere. The sky and river front appear a little grainy but that might just be because I am looking at this on my laptop.', '2003-10-10 13:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(446321, 41298, 3087, '<td valign="top">Makes a boring building much more interesting - and I do like the motion capture of the water.</td>', 'Makes a boring building much more interesting - and I do like the motion capture of the water.', '2003-10-10 13:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446322, 40858, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for colourful, gritty graffiti shots. This one is great but I''d prefer the door not to be centred within the frame...</td>', 'I''m a sucker for colourful, gritty graffiti shots. This one is great but I''d prefer the door not to be centred within the frame...', '2003-10-10 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446323, 41327, 11895, '<td valign="top">I find the tower to faint, it should dominate, why not color?</td>', 'I find the tower to faint, it should dominate, why not color?', '2003-10-10 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446328, 41139, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are exceptional. Great framing. I don''t understand the meaning of the title. This conveys, to me, both the permanence and the changing nature of a city. It has it''s own personality. Good job presenting a different view of a urban landscape. 10</td>', 'The colors are exceptional. Great framing. I don''t understand the meaning of the title. This conveys, to me, both the permanence and the changing nature of a city. It has it''s own personality. Good job presenting a different view of a urban landscape. 10', '2003-10-10 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446329, 41407, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, what did it look like in color?</td>', 'I like the composition, what did it look like in color?', '2003-10-10 13:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446334, 41294, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the exposure under control and yet getting enough details to add interest to the shot.</td>', 'Good job keeping the exposure under control and yet getting enough details to add interest to the shot.', '2003-10-10 13:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446339, 40738, 2764, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop out the light and the cars?  The building is interesting as an abstract.</td>', 'Maybe crop out the light and the cars?  The building is interesting as an abstract.', '2003-10-10 13:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446340, 41316, 208, '<td valign="top">Man, you are gonna get a really low score on a really cool picture. The details on the window and pane are great, and there''s just enough of the city visible to give this an "urban" feel. Well done.</td>', 'Man, you are gonna get a really low score on a really cool picture. The details on the window and pane are great, and there''s just enough of the city visible to give this an "urban" feel. Well done.', '2003-10-10 13:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446343, 40787, 208, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like all the empty space around the lone building.</td>', 'Well done. I like all the empty space around the lone building.', '2003-10-10 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446345, 40938, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is a different take on the challenge. I love seeing different interpretations, ones that don''t always "go with the flow" and this one is both original and well composed. The poor guy has lost his hand :-(</td>', 'Now this is a different take on the challenge. I love seeing different interpretations, ones that don''t always "go with the flow" and this one is both original and well composed. The poor guy has lost his hand :-(', '2003-10-10 13:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446346, 40519, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice work using the lamp and the sun together like this.</td>', 'Nice work using the lamp and the sun together like this.', '2003-10-10 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(446347, 40579, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a better picture without so much of the foreground, good subject for the challenge</td>', 'I think it would have been a better picture without so much of the foreground, good subject for the challenge', '2003-10-10 13:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446350, 41133, 208, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, I just wish there was some more color in it. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom, but otherwise a well composed shot.</td>', 'It''s a great shot, I just wish there was some more color in it. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom, but otherwise a well composed shot.', '2003-10-10 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446351, 41140, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please - more contrast would be nice too</td>', 'more pixels please - more contrast would be nice too', '2003-10-10 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446353, 41102, 208, '<td valign="top">The cityscape is too dark to make out much of what''s going on down there. NIce composition of the shot, though, especially the building on the left and the huge sky.</td>', 'The cityscape is too dark to make out much of what''s going on down there. NIce composition of the shot, though, especially the building on the left and the huge sky.', '2003-10-10 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(446354, 40829, 11895, '<td valign="top">cool shot, might be neat to shoot under the light from those reflectors after dark, where is this?</td>', 'cool shot, might be neat to shoot under the light from those reflectors after dark, where is this?', '2003-10-10 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446356, 41319, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a low score because everything is out of focus.</td>', 'I gave you a low score because everything is out of focus.', '2003-10-10 13:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446357, 40869, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more color, but this is a cool idea. I like all the sky on the right.</td>', 'I''d like to see more color, but this is a cool idea. I like all the sky on the right.', '2003-10-10 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(446361, 40564, 11800, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t comment about the border, but this one is way too big. Not too bad because it blends in on the top, but it really takes away from the beauty of the photo on the bottom. I was really enjoying the symetry as the image came up, only to have the mood broken by the border. 8 and I''ll not knock you down for the mistake. Please don''t make the same mistake again.</td>', 'I usually don''t comment about the border, but this one is way too big. Not too bad because it blends in on the top, but it really takes away from the beauty of the photo on the bottom. I was really enjoying the symetry as the image came up, only to have the mood broken by the border. 8 and I''ll not knock you down for the mistake. Please don''t make the same mistake again.', '2003-10-10 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446367, 40760, 11800, '<td valign="top">It does create the feeling of being closed in. I don''t know if the border enhances the mood or distracts. I don''t like it. You might have gotten more of a feeling of unease if you had used a mismatched border. One that is somewhat wider on the sides, the thickest part being 1/5 to 1/3 the thickness of the current border. But that''s a personal observation.</td>', 'It does create the feeling of being closed in. I don''t know if the border enhances the mood or distracts. I don''t like it. You might have gotten more of a feeling of unease if you had used a mismatched border. One that is somewhat wider on the sides, the thickest part being 1/5 to 1/3 the thickness of the current border. But that''s a personal observation.', '2003-10-10 13:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446378, 41281, 5792, '<td valign="top">I agree with the others... NeatImage makes a big difference with this image. It is perfect for noise reduction. You would be able to do better before your post, but this is what it does to reduce noise of your finished image from DPC using the free version...   //www.pbase.com/image/22156884</td>', 'I agree with the others... NeatImage makes a big difference with this image. It is perfect for noise reduction. You would be able to do better before your post, but this is what it does to reduce noise of your finished image from DPC using the free version...   //www.pbase.com/image/22156884', '2003-10-10 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446380, 41133, 11843, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much. It looks as though the buildings in the background are actually a ship afloat on the water, like a big aircraft carrier. Nice composition between the taller buildings and the seaplane. I sense a slightly hazy evening atmosphere that you see a lot at the waters edge.</td>', 'I like this shot very much. It looks as though the buildings in the background are actually a ship afloat on the water, like a big aircraft carrier. Nice composition between the taller buildings and the seaplane. I sense a slightly hazy evening atmosphere that you see a lot at the waters edge.', '2003-10-10 14:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446382, 40500, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a low score 2 because the quality is really low. It is difficult to get reflection pictures right. It''s difficult to figure out which is the reflection and which is the reality. If you had left it in color, maybe there would not be that confusion. The contrast is too low.</td>', 'I gave you a low score 2 because the quality is really low. It is difficult to get reflection pictures right. It''s difficult to figure out which is the reflection and which is the reality. If you had left it in color, maybe there would not be that confusion. The contrast is too low.', '2003-10-10 14:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446383, 41218, 11843, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking shot! Now this is an Urban Landscape in the real sense of the word.</td>', 'Breathtaking shot! Now this is an Urban Landscape in the real sense of the word.', '2003-10-10 14:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(446386, 41314, 11800, '<td valign="top">I rated you image low because it doesn''t fit the challenge, and the quality is not so good. I like pictures that show movement when it is obvious that that is what was intended. This picture shows movement, but it looks like it''s from a lack of light and a lack of planning on the photographer''s part.</td>', 'I rated you image low because it doesn''t fit the challenge, and the quality is not so good. I like pictures that show movement when it is obvious that that is what was intended. This picture shows movement, but it looks like it''s from a lack of light and a lack of planning on the photographer''s part.', '2003-10-10 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(446399, 40811, 4090, '<td valign="top">this tower is very sharp in focus but the sky IMHO seem unreal.. 6/10</td>', 'this tower is very sharp in focus but the sky IMHO seem unreal.. 6/10', '2003-10-10 14:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446403, 40672, 11895, '<td valign="top">seeing a little motion in the props may have helped this picture, like the slant and the colors</td>', 'seeing a little motion in the props may have helped this picture, like the slant and the colors', '2003-10-10 14:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446407, 41154, 11506, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue emcompasses the building.</td>', 'I like how the blue emcompasses the building.', '2003-10-10 14:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446410, 41088, 11855, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. Well done!</td>', 'Nice angle. Well done!', '2003-10-10 14:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446411, 41329, 11506, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  It''s a little decieveing at first because you''re looking at the city in the distance, but then you focus on the closer building which at first looks to be gigantic.   I also find it weird that nothing is coming out of the taller smoke stacks.  good luck.</td>', 'This is a great picture.  It''s a little decieveing at first because you''re looking at the city in the distance, but then you focus on the closer building which at first looks to be gigantic.   I also find it weird that nothing is coming out of the taller smoke stacks.  good luck.', '2003-10-10 14:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(446412, 40510, 11506, '<td valign="top">This is a well captured cityscape.  Shots like this give you a sense of the magnatude of a city- especially at night.  Good luck</td>', 'This is a well captured cityscape.  Shots like this give you a sense of the magnatude of a city- especially at night.  Good luck', '2003-10-10 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(446414, 40959, 11895, '<td valign="top">provocative title</td>', 'provocative title', '2003-10-10 14:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(446415, 41309, 11506, '<td valign="top">I think you had a really good idea here.  However I find a couple things distracting.  The sign for instance.  I''d like to see it gone, but I think you could get away with including it.  -anything other than cutting it off.  My eyes follow the sign pole up to the beam in the corner.  It needs to go as well.  I do give you credit for not getting yourself in the shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think you had a really good idea here.  However I find a couple things distracting.  The sign for instance.  I''d like to see it gone, but I think you could get away with including it.  -anything other than cutting it off.  My eyes follow the sign pole up to the beam in the corner.  It needs to go as well.  I do give you credit for not getting yourself in the shot.  Good luck.', '2003-10-10 14:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446417, 41350, 11506, '<td valign="top">Clean and contrasting image.  This is one of my favorites thus far.  There''s something to be said for B&amp;W night shots.  The only thing more I could wish for in this shot would be a little more clarity in the skyline on the right.  Good luck.</td>', 'Clean and contrasting image.  This is one of my favorites thus far.  There''s something to be said for B&W night shots.  The only thing more I could wish for in this shot would be a little more clarity in the skyline on the right.  Good luck.', '2003-10-10 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446420, 41131, 11506, '<td valign="top">This is a truely excellent shot.   I think this image excels in several areas.  For example, I love that within the reflector you can see office lights giving depth to the building and not just a flat surface.  I also love how well the reflectee shows up.  Many times one loses detail in reflections and you managed to maintain the visual integrity here.  Good luck and well done.</td>', 'This is a truely excellent shot.   I think this image excels in several areas.  For example, I love that within the reflector you can see office lights giving depth to the building and not just a flat surface.  I also love how well the reflectee shows up.  Many times one loses detail in reflections and you managed to maintain the visual integrity here.  Good luck and well done.', '2003-10-10 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446423, 41026, 11506, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I like the contrasts of the red in the sky.  I''m not sure if it was done on purpose or not, but I like how you''ve left the area behind the free of clouds to stand out more.  I was going to suggest that a shot more to the left would have captured the "A" a little better but then I realized that would have brought in the clouds.  Well done.</td>', 'Oooh, I like the contrasts of the red in the sky.  I''m not sure if it was done on purpose or not, but I like how you''ve left the area behind the free of clouds to stand out more.  I was going to suggest that a shot more to the left would have captured the "A" a little better but then I realized that would have brought in the clouds.  Well done.', '2003-10-10 15:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446425, 41133, 11895, '<td valign="top">would love to see this shot on a clear day</td>', 'would love to see this shot on a clear day', '2003-10-10 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446427, 41085, 11506, '<td valign="top">This would be a great image if something was in focus.  I have a notion that you''re going to get clobbered for that, but good luck.</td>', 'This would be a great image if something was in focus.  I have a notion that you''re going to get clobbered for that, but good luck.', '2003-10-10 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
