(446490, 41372, 12733, '<td valign="top">Can you stand by your title after looking at the variety of urban landscapes in this challenge? This might better be described as suburban, and yes, they come much closer to "all the same." The houses make a great statement, but too much street for an effective photo.</td>', 'Can you stand by your title after looking at the variety of urban landscapes in this challenge? This might better be described as suburban, and yes, they come much closer to "all the same." The houses make a great statement, but too much street for an effective photo.', '2003-10-10 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
