(446584, 40952, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great reflection!  It''s great taht you were able to find the water so calm!  Nice colors -- I assume this was either sunrise or sunset.</td>', 'Great reflection!  It''s great taht you were able to find the water so calm!  Nice colors -- I assume this was either sunrise or sunset.', '2003-10-10 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446585, 41088, 13016, '<td valign="top">excellant! textural, vibrant, rich</td>', 'excellant! textural, vibrant, rich', '2003-10-10 18:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446586, 41262, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great lines on this one!  I like the use of B&amp;W here as it adds to the old feeling of the building.  Great work! - 8</td>', 'Great lines on this one!  I like the use of B&W here as it adds to the old feeling of the building.  Great work! - 8', '2003-10-10 18:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446587, 41389, 3102, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflection, assuming of course that your city doesn''t feature an upside-down building surrounded by a sea of blue!  :)  Very cool effect here.</td>', 'Awesome reflection, assuming of course that your city doesn''t feature an upside-down building surrounded by a sea of blue!  :)  Very cool effect here.', '2003-10-10 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446589, 41010, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice job of toning without overdoing it!  Having the workers on the scaffolding is a great plus and item of interest here.</td>', 'Nice job of toning without overdoing it!  Having the workers on the scaffolding is a great plus and item of interest here.', '2003-10-10 18:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446591, 41302, 11895, '<td valign="top">nicely timed to get the not yet dark sky at sunset and the night time lights in the bldgs and street</td>', 'nicely timed to get the not yet dark sky at sunset and the night time lights in the bldgs and street', '2003-10-10 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446592, 41155, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting structure!  I like the colors and sharpness.  Very nice.</td>', 'Quite an interesting structure!  I like the colors and sharpness.  Very nice.', '2003-10-10 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446594, 40983, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard!  I love the rich colors -- the deep blue of the sky (thanks to a polarizing filter, I''m guessing) are a great contrast for the white of the church.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard!  I love the rich colors -- the deep blue of the sky (thanks to a polarizing filter, I''m guessing) are a great contrast for the white of the church.', '2003-10-10 18:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(446595, 41352, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I find the reflection and soft focus a little distracting...</td>', 'I''m afraid I find the reflection and soft focus a little distracting...', '2003-10-10 18:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(446596, 41395, 11895, '<td valign="top">a little red roof left at the bottom right after your crop detracts a bit, where is this?</td>', 'a little red roof left at the bottom right after your crop detracts a bit, where is this?', '2003-10-10 18:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446600, 41324, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid there''s not a whole lot of "wow" here -- it just seems like there wasn''t a lot of thought put into it in all honesty.  The banner and wires are distracting, and the exposure is a bit too "contrasty," particuarly in the white of the clouds.  I''d also try to submit shots a bit closer to the maximum size allowed -- this is just a bit too small to judge well.  Just being honest...</td>', 'I''m afraid there''s not a whole lot of "wow" here -- it just seems like there wasn''t a lot of thought put into it in all honesty.  The banner and wires are distracting, and the exposure is a bit too "contrasty," particuarly in the white of the clouds.  I''d also try to submit shots a bit closer to the maximum size allowed -- this is just a bit too small to judge well.  Just being honest...', '2003-10-10 18:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446601, 40671, 7778, '<td valign="top">Bold and balanced symmetry. <br/> <br/>The bland, nearly imperceptible presence of sky appears itself to be dwarved by the mono(duo-)lithic subject. This simple and precise composition suits the slightly wide format of the image. The perspective makes excellent use of lens perception.<br/> <br/>Not a lurid or glorious image, but an astoundingly appropiate teatment (the choice of b and w, avoidance of excessive lighting) of such horrific architecture.</td>', 'Bold and balanced symmetry.  The bland, nearly imperceptible presence of sky appears itself to be dwarved by the mono(duo-)lithic subject. This simple and precise composition suits the slightly wide format of the image. The perspective makes excellent use of lens perception. Not a lurid or glorious image, but an astoundingly appropiate teatment (the choice of b and w, avoidance of excessive lighting) of such horrific architecture.', '2003-10-10 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446602, 40469, 11895, '<td valign="top">should have cropped just a little more off the right</td>', 'should have cropped just a little more off the right', '2003-10-10 18:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(446604, 41178, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, if this were my pic I think I would have tried to get just a little more definition, or detail, into the sky and the water by lightening it up</td>', 'very nice shot, if this were my pic I think I would have tried to get just a little more definition, or detail, into the sky and the water by lightening it up', '2003-10-10 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446605, 41345, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!  Nice compostion, clarity, lighting.   The colors are great.<br/>The outtline of the roof against the sky is especially good.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!  Nice compostion, clarity, lighting.   The colors are great.The outtline of the roof against the sky is especially good.', '2003-10-10 18:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(446606, 40701, 7778, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing landscape, well and consciously composed. The traditional format (dimensions of photo), IMO, fits this contemporary urbanity very well. The wonderful and subtle givens of light and haze in this shot are respectfully treated by having avoided any undue sharpening.<br/> <br/>The title, too, is more than apt, since obviously this (the in-between) is where the action is. PS: Being a stickler for words, I ''d like to (alternatively) suggest -Gap- as a synonymous title...</td>', 'Very pleasing landscape, well and consciously composed. The traditional format (dimensions of photo), IMO, fits this contemporary urbanity very well. The wonderful and subtle givens of light and haze in this shot are respectfully treated by having avoided any undue sharpening. The title, too, is more than apt, since obviously this (the in-between) is where the action is. PS: Being a stickler for words, I ''d like to (alternatively) suggest -Gap- as a synonymous title...', '2003-10-10 18:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446607, 41355, 6504, '<td valign="top">Some of this photo is too dark, maybe a little contrast help in photo editing would improve it.    I don''t understand about the tomatoes, but maybe I''m not looking hard enough.  On second look, I think I have it, did this used to be a tomato field??</td>', 'Some of this photo is too dark, maybe a little contrast help in photo editing would improve it.    I don''t understand about the tomatoes, but maybe I''m not looking hard enough.  On second look, I think I have it, did this used to be a tomato field??', '2003-10-10 18:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446608, 41256, 6504, '<td valign="top">The window glare could have been softened somewhat with a uv filter.</td>', 'The window glare could have been softened somewhat with a uv filter.', '2003-10-10 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446609, 40474, 8816, '<td valign="top">I like what your trying to do here, but I think you got too much sky, and not enough of the town (assuming there is something more to photograph).  I like this photo nonetheless.  Might have been better on a clearer day, those bright houeses would have looked great, but you only got what ya got. 8</td>', 'I like what your trying to do here, but I think you got too much sky, and not enough of the town (assuming there is something more to photograph).  I like this photo nonetheless.  Might have been better on a clearer day, those bright houeses would have looked great, but you only got what ya got. 8', '2003-10-10 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446610, 40790, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would have eliminated the wooden crate holders and you would have a better photo I think.</td>', 'I would have eliminated the wooden crate holders and you would have a better photo I think.', '2003-10-10 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(446611, 40985, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge, but the photo is a little too dark.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge, but the photo is a little too dark.', '2003-10-10 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446612, 41366, 6504, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a little too much going on in this photo.  Maybe early in the morning before cars and people are out would have  made a better photo.</td>', 'I think there''s a little too much going on in this photo.  Maybe early in the morning before cars and people are out would have  made a better photo.', '2003-10-10 18:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(446613, 41251, 6504, '<td valign="top">I don''t think garbage ever makes a good photo.   Maybe just a shot of the grafitti would be better.</td>', 'I don''t think garbage ever makes a good photo.   Maybe just a shot of the grafitti would be better.', '2003-10-10 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(446616, 40787, 6504, '<td valign="top">Without the title this might not be an interesting photo, but with the title it''s very good.   It says quite a bit.</td>', 'Without the title this might not be an interesting photo, but with the title it''s very good.   It says quite a bit.', '2003-10-10 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446617, 41319, 6504, '<td valign="top">A lttle too much out of focus.   Nice composition, though.</td>', 'A lttle too much out of focus.   Nice composition, though.', '2003-10-10 18:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446618, 40759, 11895, '<td valign="top">wish there was more detail on the lower level</td>', 'wish there was more detail on the lower level', '2003-10-10 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446619, 41139, 6504, '<td valign="top">More of the wall and less of the ground would improve this.</td>', 'More of the wall and less of the ground would improve this.', '2003-10-10 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446620, 40822, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this in color, but it''s still a very good shot.  A tiny more sharp and it would be great.</td>', 'I would like to see this in color, but it''s still a very good shot.  A tiny more sharp and it would be great.', '2003-10-10 19:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(446621, 41287, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very good. Nice and clear and good colors, clarity.</td>', 'Very good. Nice and clear and good colors, clarity.', '2003-10-10 19:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446623, 41097, 6504, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too out of focus, and I would have got more of the building and less of the ground.</td>', 'It''s a little too out of focus, and I would have got more of the building and less of the ground.', '2003-10-10 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446624, 40662, 6504, '<td valign="top">A beauty.  I love the blueness of the lights.   Very good.</td>', 'A beauty.  I love the blueness of the lights.   Very good.', '2003-10-10 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446625, 41329, 11843, '<td valign="top">You are from Syracuse!!!!! I know this skyline!!!<br/>My second choice....<br/>{thumb]41646[/thumb]</td>', 'You are from Syracuse!!!!! I know this skyline!!!My second choice....{thumb]41646[/thumb]', '2003-10-10 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446626, 41374, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautfiul colors against drab building.  Clever title.  One of the better pictures in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautfiul colors against drab building.  Clever title.  One of the better pictures in the challenge.', '2003-10-10 19:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446628, 40665, 11895, '<td valign="top">I love the top two thirds of this picture</td>', 'I love the top two thirds of this picture', '2003-10-10 19:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446629, 41301, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I like the colors, and the one person in the picture.  It really looks like "Saturday Morning".  Good compostion.  I think it could be just a litttle more sharp.</td>', 'Very good.  I like the colors, and the one person in the picture.  It really looks like "Saturday Morning".  Good compostion.  I think it could be just a litttle more sharp.', '2003-10-10 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446631, 41178, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Wonderful clarity, colors, and teriffic composition.   Should be in the top three for sure.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Wonderful clarity, colors, and teriffic composition.   Should be in the top three for sure.', '2003-10-10 19:10:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(446633, 40759, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion.  My only critique is that the foreground is a little too dark, otherwise it''s a very appealing photo.</td>', 'Very nice compostion.  My only critique is that the foreground is a little too dark, otherwise it''s a very appealing photo.', '2003-10-10 19:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446634, 40682, 11895, '<td valign="top">a very nice picture, perhaps aimimg a little more to the left would have eliminated those two street lights and maybe gotten you a better exposure</td>', 'a very nice picture, perhaps aimimg a little more to the left would have eliminated those two street lights and maybe gotten you a better exposure', '2003-10-10 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446637, 40937, 6504, '<td valign="top">The outline of the buildings against the sky is very good, the colors and compostion''s good,  I would have waited ill there were no people in the picture, (early morning? )   I would like to see more of the building and less of the parking lot.  A tighter shot with the pumpkins in front would be good.</td>', 'The outline of the buildings against the sky is very good, the colors and compostion''s good,  I would have waited ill there were no people in the picture, (early morning? )   I would like to see more of the building and less of the parking lot.  A tighter shot with the pumpkins in front would be good.', '2003-10-10 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446638, 41349, 6504, '<td valign="top">The one improvement I would suggest is to have waited till there were no cars in the picture.  The compostion and clarity, colors are all very good.</td>', 'The one improvement I would suggest is to have waited till there were no cars in the picture.  The compostion and clarity, colors are all very good.', '2003-10-10 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(446639, 41340, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good and clear and colors are very good.  My one suggestion would be to try to have shot this without the people in the picture (They distract from the quality)<br/>Early morning before they arrive is a good time maybe.</td>', 'Good and clear and colors are very good.  My one suggestion would be to try to have shot this without the people in the picture (They distract from the quality)Early morning before they arrive is a good time maybe.', '2003-10-10 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446641, 41207, 10720, '<td valign="top">I find the pole very distracting in this picture I realise from the title it is ment to be teh focal point of the picture but dark and not a very interesting shape.</td>', 'I find the pole very distracting in this picture I realise from the title it is ment to be teh focal point of the picture but dark and not a very interesting shape.', '2003-10-10 19:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446644, 40888, 10720, '<td valign="top">image looks a bit soft, likely due to long exposure time?</td>', 'image looks a bit soft, likely due to long exposure time?', '2003-10-10 19:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446646, 41392, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 9 when I was going thru the entries. Now I''m back to comment. What I like best is that your title didn''t dissapoint me. It really is colorful. Good job.</td>', 'I gave you a 9 when I was going thru the entries. Now I''m back to comment. What I like best is that your title didn''t dissapoint me. It really is colorful. Good job.', '2003-10-10 19:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446647, 41066, 10720, '<td valign="top">really like this, the colors pop! Sky is blown out possibly a circular filter or gradulated filter could have helped. Still one of my favorites.</td>', 'really like this, the colors pop! Sky is blown out possibly a circular filter or gradulated filter could have helped. Still one of my favorites.', '2003-10-10 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446650, 40738, 10720, '<td valign="top">The red is bright and the sky is visible but look very titled because of the lightpost. Also I would have shown all the red car matching the red building behind it.</td>', 'The red is bright and the sky is visible but look very titled because of the lightpost. Also I would have shown all the red car matching the red building behind it.', '2003-10-10 19:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446651, 40469, 10720, '<td valign="top">I find this picture a bit grainy. Did you have to do a crop? It might be over processed.</td>', 'I find this picture a bit grainy. Did you have to do a crop? It might be over processed.', '2003-10-10 19:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446652, 41402, 10720, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space shape (the shape of the sky showing). not so fond of the windows.</td>', 'I like the negative space shape (the shape of the sky showing). not so fond of the windows.', '2003-10-10 19:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446653, 40760, 10720, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and effective title</td>', 'Nice angle and effective title', '2003-10-10 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(446655, 41136, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful\''!!    I love the colors in the foreground with the shiny buildings behind.   The clarity, composition, all of it is good!  Top three for sure. Looks like a pro shot this one.</td>', 'Very beautiful\''!!    I love the colors in the foreground with the shiny buildings behind.   The clarity, composition, all of it is good!  Top three for sure. Looks like a pro shot this one.', '2003-10-10 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446656, 40759, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 9 during my first pass. I like all the textures, the sharpness, colors and the fact you have so much included without the image feeling too busy. You did a really good job.</td>', 'I gave you a 9 during my first pass. I like all the textures, the sharpness, colors and the fact you have so much included without the image feeling too busy. You did a really good job.', '2003-10-10 19:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(446658, 41008, 10720, '<td valign="top">i am afraid the color choice and having it so blown out does not appeal to me.  My eye does not seem to have anything in particular to focus on, and the color choice does not invoke any particular feeling in me. (like a Red or Green might have) Find the color calming and makes me feel the shot is very static. Nor is it so changed that my mind does not immediately identify all the objects (which does fit the challenge I certainly can say).</td>', 'i am afraid the color choice and having it so blown out does not appeal to me.  My eye does not seem to have anything in particular to focus on, and the color choice does not invoke any particular feeling in me. (like a Red or Green might have) Find the color calming and makes me feel the shot is very static. Nor is it so changed that my mind does not immediately identify all the objects (which does fit the challenge I certainly can say).', '2003-10-10 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446661, 41155, 10720, '<td valign="top">I like the high arches, I find the light reflections in the glass at bit distracting but a minor complaint (and doubt that a circular polarizer would have gotten them all so left with unallowed spot edditing)</td>', 'I like the high arches, I find the light reflections in the glass at bit distracting but a minor complaint (and doubt that a circular polarizer would have gotten them all so left with unallowed spot edditing)', '2003-10-10 19:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446662, 40747, 10720, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more creative shots in this challenge. I am not sure if the angle you choose is the best but it does make an interesting negative space at the top where the sky shows (blown out but minor)</td>', 'This is one of the more creative shots in this challenge. I am not sure if the angle you choose is the best but it does make an interesting negative space at the top where the sky shows (blown out but minor)', '2003-10-10 19:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446664, 41374, 10720, '<td valign="top">hmmm, the fact that the sign is readable and says pine takes away from your title. I do like the colors of your shot however.</td>', 'hmmm, the fact that the sign is readable and says pine takes away from your title. I do like the colors of your shot however.', '2003-10-10 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446665, 40987, 10720, '<td valign="top">Well done, very Urban, very colorful, got everythign in crisp and a great dof. What lens did you use? Excellent job! Only thing I can see wrong? is that either a cloudy day or a washed out sky. Still one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Well done, very Urban, very colorful, got everythign in crisp and a great dof. What lens did you use? Excellent job! Only thing I can see wrong? is that either a cloudy day or a washed out sky. Still one of the best in this challenge.', '2003-10-10 19:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446667, 41245, 10720, '<td valign="top">Focus of this picture is more on the sky then the buildings. If I had a magazine called "Urban" this picture would not be one of the first I used. In another contest without the buildings (they look fuzzy to me blurred) the clouds make a wonderful picture on their own.</td>', 'Focus of this picture is more on the sky then the buildings. If I had a magazine called "Urban" this picture would not be one of the first I used. In another contest without the buildings (they look fuzzy to me blurred) the clouds make a wonderful picture on their own.', '2003-10-10 19:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446668, 41036, 10720, '<td valign="top">Eyes are drawn to the lightest part of this picture which is the center top. Unfortunitly that is also the part of the picture that is the least interesting. Cropping might have helped, so might a different camera angle, or a filter to control the light more.</td>', 'Eyes are drawn to the lightest part of this picture which is the center top. Unfortunitly that is also the part of the picture that is the least interesting. Cropping might have helped, so might a different camera angle, or a filter to control the light more.', '2003-10-10 19:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446670, 40877, 10720, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the seagul, the colors, the bikes all in a row.</td>', 'I like the expression on the seagul, the colors, the bikes all in a row.', '2003-10-10 19:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446671, 40463, 10720, '<td valign="top">These almost look like dolls houses. I like the colors but could of used a wider angle lens? see more of them</td>', 'These almost look like dolls houses. I like the colors but could of used a wider angle lens? see more of them', '2003-10-10 19:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446672, 41249, 11321, '<td valign="top">this picture is half-sky and half-city<br/>it doesn''t work this time for me..<br/>try to get some information about the " rule of thirds" to make this kind of photos more interesting.<br/>for example one-third of sky and two-thirds of city makes it more interesting..</td>', 'this picture is half-sky and half-cityit doesn''t work this time for me..try to get some information about the " rule of thirds" to make this kind of photos more interesting.for example one-third of sky and two-thirds of city makes it more interesting..', '2003-10-10 19:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446674, 40679, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think your idea would have been better expressed if the traffic was moving and the trees and buildings were in sharp focus. I gave you a 4</td>', 'I think your idea would have been better expressed if the traffic was moving and the trees and buildings were in sharp focus. I gave you a 4', '2003-10-10 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(446680, 41160, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title.  I''m sure it has something to do with why you chose to take this image of a obscured building. I''m sorry, but I gave you a 4</td>', 'I don''t understand the title.  I''m sure it has something to do with why you chose to take this image of a obscured building. I''m sorry, but I gave you a 4', '2003-10-10 19:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446684, 41356, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the rainbow. But the purpose for the picture was to get a building. You did, but I feel you liked the rainbow better and sacrificed the building. I gave this photo a 4 because I don''t like the composition, and the building is really distorted.</td>', 'I like the rainbow. But the purpose for the picture was to get a building. You did, but I feel you liked the rainbow better and sacrificed the building. I gave this photo a 4 because I don''t like the composition, and the building is really distorted.', '2003-10-10 19:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(446695, 40928, 6668, '<td valign="top">to much sun glare!</td>', 'to much sun glare!', '2003-10-10 20:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(446696, 41214, 6668, '<td valign="top">Like this shot ...although I think it would have been better if the top and bottom of the circle had not been cropped so tighltly...JMO 7</td>', 'Like this shot ...although I think it would have been better if the top and bottom of the circle had not been cropped so tighltly...JMO 7', '2003-10-10 20:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446697, 41256, 6668, '<td valign="top">sorry I don''t care for the glare at all.</td>', 'sorry I don''t care for the glare at all.', '2003-10-10 20:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(446699, 41008, 6668, '<td valign="top">these colors work well with this shot, not all photos would work with this effect.....I like it...8 from me.</td>', 'these colors work well with this shot, not all photos would work with this effect.....I like it...8 from me.', '2003-10-10 20:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446715, 41132, 12537, '<td valign="top">Wow! awesome photo! this is a great take on urban landscape idea, great job!</td>', 'Wow! awesome photo! this is a great take on urban landscape idea, great job!', '2003-10-10 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446726, 40460, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I enjoy the way the light filters through the fog.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I enjoy the way the light filters through the fog.', '2003-10-10 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446729, 41279, 11923, '<td valign="top">Solid photo!  I like the energy of the car lights against the sturdy solid looking buildings.  The coloring is nice as well, makes the head &amp; tail lights stand out even more.  Well done.</td>', 'Solid photo!  I like the energy of the car lights against the sturdy solid looking buildings.  The coloring is nice as well, makes the head & tail lights stand out even more.  Well done.', '2003-10-10 22:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(446730, 41262, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent black and white.. = 10</td>', 'excellent black and white.. = 10', '2003-10-10 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(446732, 41177, 11923, '<td valign="top">I found this photo intriguing.  The sepia tone gives it an extra oomph I think.  The building really stands out.  I also like how the sky looks with the sepia tone.  I realize its a busy area, but I''d suggest trying to get one with no one waking by- the people sitting are fine for me because they are lower, but the lady standing really distracts for me, the grass in the foreground does as well but to a lesser extent.  Very nice over all though!  Gave it a 7</td>', 'I found this photo intriguing.  The sepia tone gives it an extra oomph I think.  The building really stands out.  I also like how the sky looks with the sepia tone.  I realize its a busy area, but I''d suggest trying to get one with no one waking by- the people sitting are fine for me because they are lower, but the lady standing really distracts for me, the grass in the foreground does as well but to a lesser extent.  Very nice over all though!  Gave it a 7', '2003-10-10 22:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446736, 41214, 11923, '<td valign="top">I really like the unique view of the town in this photo.  It really centers the eye on the subject.. that being the urban landscape.  I also like the various colors represented with also help focus the eye on the inside away from the brown of whatever is being looked through.   The only thing I found relatively distracting was the white border.  I think it pulls away from the photo because it is already bordered.. by the circular construction.  Nice job!  7</td>', 'I really like the unique view of the town in this photo.  It really centers the eye on the subject.. that being the urban landscape.  I also like the various colors represented with also help focus the eye on the inside away from the brown of whatever is being looked through.   The only thing I found relatively distracting was the white border.  I think it pulls away from the photo because it is already bordered.. by the circular construction.  Nice job!  7', '2003-10-10 22:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446737, 40682, 12417, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I think B/W was a great choice. I do how ever think that the 2 lights on the left side are a bit to distracting due to their brightness.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I think B/W was a great choice. I do how ever think that the 2 lights on the left side are a bit to distracting due to their brightness.', '2003-10-10 22:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446738, 41389, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color combinations as well as shape differences.  I love the contrast of the organic curvature vs the solid angular look of the buildings.  I also like how the water though a reflection has deeper tones.  Very nice!  7</td>', 'Wonderful color combinations as well as shape differences.  I love the contrast of the organic curvature vs the solid angular look of the buildings.  I also like how the water though a reflection has deeper tones.  Very nice!  7', '2003-10-10 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446739, 41011, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I also like the contrast between the natural, ocean scene against the industrial building look.  Only thing I found distracting was the buildings look a bit out of focus in the foreground.  Not sure if this is from downsizing the picture or not.  Still a nice photo!  7</td>', 'Great colors!  I also like the contrast between the natural, ocean scene against the industrial building look.  Only thing I found distracting was the buildings look a bit out of focus in the foreground.  Not sure if this is from downsizing the picture or not.  Still a nice photo!  7', '2003-10-10 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(446740, 40672, 12417, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and great scky, but I think that the image should have been rotated just a bit to make the building in the background level... Everything is "tilted" a  little too much!</td>', 'Nice shot, and great scky, but I think that the image should have been rotated just a bit to make the building in the background level... Everything is "tilted" a  little too much!', '2003-10-10 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446741, 40959, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color, very vibrant.  Everything looks to be in good focus.  As a personal preference I''d have cropped out more of the bottom so people''s heads and tops of cars weren''t in the shot.  Very enjoyable. 7</td>', 'Great color, very vibrant.  Everything looks to be in good focus.  As a personal preference I''d have cropped out more of the bottom so people''s heads and tops of cars weren''t in the shot.  Very enjoyable. 7', '2003-10-10 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446743, 41155, 12417, '<td valign="top">Great architecture and lines, very nice shot. was it tough getting a shot with no people?</td>', 'Great architecture and lines, very nice shot. was it tough getting a shot with no people?', '2003-10-10 22:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(446746, 41356, 11923, '<td valign="top">I do like the rainbow, but I found the photo to be a bit dark and that lessened the impact for me.  Also has a slight glare in the top left corner - taken through a window?, making it all a bit unfocused.  Still a nice shot.</td>', 'I do like the rainbow, but I found the photo to be a bit dark and that lessened the impact for me.  Also has a slight glare in the top left corner - taken through a window?, making it all a bit unfocused.  Still a nice shot.', '2003-10-10 22:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(446748, 41102, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good colors, I like the detail of the building on the left. Great sky.</td>', 'Good colors, I like the detail of the building on the left. Great sky.', '2003-10-10 22:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(446750, 41155, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good colors, I like the detail in the arches.</td>', 'Good colors, I like the detail in the arches.', '2003-10-10 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446751, 41129, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this had a filter on it, but it definitely has a different tone to it, it works with this photo.  Gives it a painting look.  I did find the statue distracting however, since its an urban landscape I think the building should be the focus, but I find my eyes drawn to the statue since its so forward in the picture, this lowered my vote a bit.  Also looks like it could be a bit sharper.  6</td>', 'I''m not sure if this had a filter on it, but it definitely has a different tone to it, it works with this photo.  Gives it a painting look.  I did find the statue distracting however, since its an urban landscape I think the building should be the focus, but I find my eyes drawn to the statue since its so forward in the picture, this lowered my vote a bit.  Also looks like it could be a bit sharper.  6', '2003-10-10 22:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446752, 41097, 11432, '<td valign="top">Framing is nice, good color.</td>', 'Framing is nice, good color.', '2003-10-10 22:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(446753, 41214, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good colors, I like the detail.</td>', 'Good colors, I like the detail.', '2003-10-10 22:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446754, 41379, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good night shot, I like the lights.</td>', 'Good night shot, I like the lights.', '2003-10-10 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(446755, 41106, 11432, '<td valign="top">Great B/W I like the detail.</td>', 'Great B/W I like the detail.', '2003-10-10 22:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(446756, 41187, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good colors, I like the people, A little crooked but good.</td>', 'Good colors, I like the people, A little crooked but good.', '2003-10-10 22:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446757, 40871, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good detail, I like the spiral, too bad about the reflection.</td>', 'Good detail, I like the spiral, too bad about the reflection.', '2003-10-10 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446758, 41139, 11923, '<td valign="top">I have to admit I''m not sure what the title is referring to - I''m guessing humans dropping bits of trash as they go like glaciers did/do with rocks ''n the like.  Could be wrong.   Regardless, I love the colors from the painting on the wall and the different perspective on buildings.  I think it fits the challenge well with a unique view.  7</td>', 'I have to admit I''m not sure what the title is referring to - I''m guessing humans dropping bits of trash as they go like glaciers did/do with rocks ''n the like.  Could be wrong.   Regardless, I love the colors from the painting on the wall and the different perspective on buildings.  I think it fits the challenge well with a unique view.  7', '2003-10-10 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446762, 41062, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Greens are brilliant.  I wish the whole of the building could be in the picture, but that may not have been possible.  I do find the tree branch on the right to be distracting.  My suggestion would''ve been to go for the area around that tower as the focus, that way the road and trees would''ve probably been out of the photo all together.  I''d love to see a view from the end of that pond looking up the stairs.  :)    6</td>', 'Nice photo!  Greens are brilliant.  I wish the whole of the building could be in the picture, but that may not have been possible.  I do find the tree branch on the right to be distracting.  My suggestion would''ve been to go for the area around that tower as the focus, that way the road and trees would''ve probably been out of the photo all together.  I''d love to see a view from the end of that pond looking up the stairs.  :)    6', '2003-10-10 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446763, 40822, 11487, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Reminds me of living back east.  Nice character.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Reminds me of living back east.  Nice character.', '2003-10-10 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446764, 41181, 11487, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W.  Background on the left a liitle over exposed but still very nice.</td>', 'Very nice B&W.  Background on the left a liitle over exposed but still very nice.', '2003-10-10 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446765, 41012, 11923, '<td valign="top">I do like the color of the leaves against the building in general but I didn''t find the photo as a whole to really draw and keep my attention.  I do like the fact that the building is in more focus than the leaves, since the challenge is based on buildings.  Gave a 5</td>', 'I do like the color of the leaves against the building in general but I didn''t find the photo as a whole to really draw and keep my attention.  I do like the fact that the building is in more focus than the leaves, since the challenge is based on buildings.  Gave a 5', '2003-10-10 23:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(446766, 41176, 11487, '<td valign="top">I love the way you captured the character of the brick.  Very nice image.</td>', 'I love the way you captured the character of the brick.  Very nice image.', '2003-10-10 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
