(446774, 41357, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4<br/>Where are the buildings? Where is the sense of "Urban?" Photo is too small. Sky blown out -- or is that just fog? Good detail in what I can see. Road/path along bottom is a bit distracting.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4Where are the buildings? Where is the sense of "Urban?" Photo is too small. Sky blown out -- or is that just fog? Good detail in what I can see. Road/path along bottom is a bit distracting.', '2003-10-10 23:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446776, 40801, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great color and reflections.  Great job.</td>', 'Great color and reflections.  Great job.', '2003-10-10 23:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446778, 41333, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur.</td>', 'Nice motion blur.', '2003-10-10 23:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446781, 40540, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and use of light.</td>', 'Nice angle and use of light.', '2003-10-10 23:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446783, 41323, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice color range and good cloudscape.</td>', 'Very nice color range and good cloudscape.', '2003-10-10 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446785, 41211, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8<br/>A little soft focus for me, but that''s a judgement call. I realize it''s a night shot, but there are lots of areas of total darkness/blackness. Love the lighting on the bridge tower(?).</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8A little soft focus for me, but that''s a judgement call. I realize it''s a night shot, but there are lots of areas of total darkness/blackness. Love the lighting on the bridge tower(?).', '2003-10-10 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446788, 41226, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice detail shot.</td>', 'Nice detail shot.', '2003-10-10 23:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446790, 40644, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4<br/>Nothing about this says "Urban Landscape" -- no urban, no landscape, no buildings - you have one lamp post, which in this sky picture is more of a deterrent. Sky looks overly grainy. Perhaps a pass through neat image... Wispy clouds with yellow sunlight are nice and nice diagonal from lower left to upper right.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4Nothing about this says "Urban Landscape" -- no urban, no landscape, no buildings - you have one lamp post, which in this sky picture is more of a deterrent. Sky looks overly grainy. Perhaps a pass through neat image... Wispy clouds with yellow sunlight are nice and nice diagonal from lower left to upper right.', '2003-10-10 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(446792, 40736, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8<br/>I rarely say this one: It looks over sharpened. Strange angles in the drain pipe and window just in front of it on the second story is where it is most noticable. It could use a pass through neat image to clean up the noise in the sky, but otherwise, great photo.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8I rarely say this one: It looks over sharpened. Strange angles in the drain pipe and window just in front of it on the second story is where it is most noticable. It could use a pass through neat image to clean up the noise in the sky, but otherwise, great photo.', '2003-10-10 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446795, 41407, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7<br/>Depending on your town, this could be right in the center of it -- it was in my hometown. Sepia does nothing for this photo -- I would have loved to see it with the blue sky and wispy clouds. It could use a perspective adjustment too. (Is that legal in DPC?)</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7Depending on your town, this could be right in the center of it -- it was in my hometown. Sepia does nothing for this photo -- I would have loved to see it with the blue sky and wispy clouds. It could use a perspective adjustment too. (Is that legal in DPC?)', '2003-10-10 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(446798, 40829, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 8<br/>Meets all criteria and I can''t see anything technically wrong. I like the deep blue sky and white/gray clouds contrasting with the near black buildings. Overall though, I don''t find the image visually appealing -- totally a personal opinion, but what part of this comment wasn''t?</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 8Meets all criteria and I can''t see anything technically wrong. I like the deep blue sky and white/gray clouds contrasting with the near black buildings. Overall though, I don''t find the image visually appealing -- totally a personal opinion, but what part of this comment wasn''t?', '2003-10-10 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(446801, 41216, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 3<br/>Image is fairly flat -- could use some level adjustment and maybe push the saturation. Image is mainly homogeneous gray boring sky. Too bad you didn''t have a better day to shoot.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 3Image is fairly flat -- could use some level adjustment and maybe push the saturation. Image is mainly homogeneous gray boring sky. Too bad you didn''t have a better day to shoot.', '2003-10-10 23:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446803, 40801, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 8<br/>GREAT PHOTO, but it seems to have totally missed the challenge. OK, you can say it has multiple buildings, which is what the challenge called for, but I get no sense of Urban here. Surely there was at least a nearby village with a few people wandering the streets.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 8GREAT PHOTO, but it seems to have totally missed the challenge. OK, you can say it has multiple buildings, which is what the challenge called for, but I get no sense of Urban here. Surely there was at least a nearby village with a few people wandering the streets.', '2003-10-10 23:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446812, 40435, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 6<br/>There are no "buildings" in this photo, but I do get a sense of "Urban" from a deserted phone booth. Photo could be cropped more on the right to make it symmetric.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 6There are no "buildings" in this photo, but I do get a sense of "Urban" from a deserted phone booth. Photo could be cropped more on the right to make it symmetric.', '2003-10-10 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446818, 40671, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6<br/>I think I''ve seen these buildings in other photos and in at least one movie. Photo attempts to be symmetric, but fails -- needs to be cropped a little more on the right to make the edge the same as on the left -- also in looking closer, the whole thing tilts to the right.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6I think I''ve seen these buildings in other photos and in at least one movie. Photo attempts to be symmetric, but fails -- needs to be cropped a little more on the right to make the edge the same as on the left -- also in looking closer, the whole thing tilts to the right.', '2003-10-10 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446825, 40754, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 10<br/>Crap... how am I supposed to win any challenges when I keep giving out 10s -- oh sure... they''re deserved, but that''s not my point... I want to WIN! OK, enough whining... This is the 3rd or 4th 10 I''ve passed out, and this is so far, the best of them. Your image is great -- I love the colors cast by the varous lights and a nice use of the star filter. Overall lighting is spot on. Well done -- but next time, take it easy. I want to win sometime, OK?</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 10Crap... how am I supposed to win any challenges when I keep giving out 10s -- oh sure... they''re deserved, but that''s not my point... I want to WIN! OK, enough whining... This is the 3rd or 4th 10 I''ve passed out, and this is so far, the best of them. Your image is great -- I love the colors cast by the varous lights and a nice use of the star filter. Overall lighting is spot on. Well done -- but next time, take it easy. I want to win sometime, OK?', '2003-10-10 23:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446827, 40871, 12417, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but was distracted by the reflections from behind. This would be an amazing shot if you could get rid of them.... The lighting and lines are great though!</td>', 'I love this shot but was distracted by the reflections from behind. This would be an amazing shot if you could get rid of them.... The lighting and lines are great though!', '2003-10-10 23:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
