(447027, 40796, 12428, '<td valign="top">the angle is a little odd there... my personal opinion... maybe its good to separate the alien being from the petronas as it kills the composition... i ve been there personally and i think there ar much much more beautiful angles to take them, given the height of these creature. carry on shooting!</td>', 'the angle is a little odd there... my personal opinion... maybe its good to separate the alien being from the petronas as it kills the composition... i ve been there personally and i think there ar much much more beautiful angles to take them, given the height of these creature. carry on shooting!', '2003-10-11 06:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
