(447065, 40801, 10858, '<td valign="top">More landscape than urban, but very-very beautiful!</td>', 'More landscape than urban, but very-very beautiful!', '2003-10-11 06:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447097, 41085, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like how the skyline is sharp. I would have liked to see more details, maybe a closer view of the city. If you try a skyline picture again, try taking it just at sundown. You will get more light and not have to leave the shutter open as long.</td>', 'I like how the skyline is sharp. I would have liked to see more details, maybe a closer view of the city. If you try a skyline picture again, try taking it just at sundown. You will get more light and not have to leave the shutter open as long.', '2003-10-11 08:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447099, 41291, 11800, '<td valign="top">You have a good combination of elements here. I don''t know why, but they don''t add up to an interesting picture. Maybe a different point of view would have worked better.</td>', 'You have a good combination of elements here. I don''t know why, but they don''t add up to an interesting picture. Maybe a different point of view would have worked better.', '2003-10-11 08:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447100, 40931, 11800, '<td valign="top">I found the river! You know, I was feeling a bit cheated before. I couldn''t see a river. <br/>I used to live in San Antonio. Beautiful city. Well, it was a long time ago, that I lived there.</td>', 'I found the river! You know, I was feeling a bit cheated before. I couldn''t see a river. I used to live in San Antonio. Beautiful city. Well, it was a long time ago, that I lived there.', '2003-10-11 08:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(447102, 41278, 11800, '<td valign="top">The blue is really pretty. The searchlight is nice too.  I''ve noticed that a lot of the night shots aren''t in focus, or at least they appear to be not in focus. I like your composition, but the shot is too dark in the foreground area. Maybe crop the large red light out.</td>', 'The blue is really pretty. The searchlight is nice too.  I''ve noticed that a lot of the night shots aren''t in focus, or at least they appear to be not in focus. I like your composition, but the shot is too dark in the foreground area. Maybe crop the large red light out.', '2003-10-11 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(447105, 41265, 11800, '<td valign="top">These shots are so hard to get the right exposure on. If you meter on the bright area you will underexpose everything else and if you meter on a darker area, you blow the light area.</td>', 'These shots are so hard to get the right exposure on. If you meter on the bright area you will underexpose everything else and if you meter on a darker area, you blow the light area.', '2003-10-11 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447120, 41056, 10510, '<td valign="top">This is a breath taking view - absolutely beautiful.  10</td>', 'This is a breath taking view - absolutely beautiful.  10', '2003-10-11 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447123, 41183, 10510, '<td valign="top">The reflection is a great touch.  Is this Indianapolis?   10</td>', 'The reflection is a great touch.  Is this Indianapolis?   10', '2003-10-11 10:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447130, 40731, 11769, '<td valign="top">I worked in Boston for years and this one gives me a feeling of being there. very nice. 10</td>', 'I worked in Boston for years and this one gives me a feeling of being there. very nice. 10', '2003-10-11 10:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(447131, 41056, 6624, '<td valign="top">that is amazing urban sprawl, nice composition and good response to challenge 6</td>', 'that is amazing urban sprawl, nice composition and good response to challenge 6', '2003-10-11 11:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447138, 41046, 10799, '<td valign="top">The one big flower out of focus on the left might be cropped to make this better.  I like the contrast of flowers and technology.</td>', 'The one big flower out of focus on the left might be cropped to make this better.  I like the contrast of flowers and technology.', '2003-10-11 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447145, 41258, 10799, '<td valign="top">This does not seem very clear.</td>', 'This does not seem very clear.', '2003-10-11 11:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447151, 41002, 11800, '<td valign="top">The buildings look interesting. I didn''t give this a higher score because The colors seem to be washed out and it seems to be out of focus or maybe there are a lot of artifacts that make it seem to be unfocused. The composition could use some work. A good question to ask before taking a picture is, what do I feel is the best feature of this scene? And then work to highlight that part.</td>', 'The buildings look interesting. I didn''t give this a higher score because The colors seem to be washed out and it seems to be out of focus or maybe there are a lot of artifacts that make it seem to be unfocused. The composition could use some work. A good question to ask before taking a picture is, what do I feel is the best feature of this scene? And then work to highlight that part.', '2003-10-11 12:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(447156, 41354, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the wave shadow on the building, but I don''t like the lampost shadow. The composition could use some work. A good question to ask before taking a picture is, what do I feel is the best feature of this scene? And then work to highlight that part. I don''t understand the title.</td>', 'I like the wave shadow on the building, but I don''t like the lampost shadow. The composition could use some work. A good question to ask before taking a picture is, what do I feel is the best feature of this scene? And then work to highlight that part. I don''t understand the title.', '2003-10-11 12:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447163, 40800, 11800, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It is well composed and has a wonderful mood. You missed an opportunity to have fun. If there had even been a washed away sand castle in the frame, I would have voted higher. Sorry, there is no way to stretch this to the meet the challenge.</td>', 'I love this photo. It is well composed and has a wonderful mood. You missed an opportunity to have fun. If there had even been a washed away sand castle in the frame, I would have voted higher. Sorry, there is no way to stretch this to the meet the challenge.', '2003-10-11 12:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(447183, 41392, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture of the beautiful colors and detail.  Nicely done.</td>', 'wonderful capture of the beautiful colors and detail.  Nicely done.', '2003-10-11 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(447185, 40787, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo of a desert landscape, although it''s softness belies the harshness of the desert; some contrast and sharpness would really improve it. And I wish the sky was a bit darker so the clouds would be more visible. The perspective lines of the building draw the eye to the barren landscape, which is the real center of interest in this image. Yet without the building, the photo would be as boring as the vast desert it portrays. And the building itself is quite interesting visually, with its various textures and colors. This makes the overall composition work very well.</td>', 'This is a good photo of a desert landscape, although it''s softness belies the harshness of the desert; some contrast and sharpness would really improve it. And I wish the sky was a bit darker so the clouds would be more visible. The perspective lines of the building draw the eye to the barren landscape, which is the real center of interest in this image. Yet without the building, the photo would be as boring as the vast desert it portrays. And the building itself is quite interesting visually, with its various textures and colors. This makes the overall composition work very well.', '2003-10-11 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447186, 41174, 9441, '<td valign="top">very nice photo of the various geometrically diverse buildings.  Makes for a very interesting photo.  I like the various heights and angles of all the buildings.  The compostion is terrific.</td>', 'very nice photo of the various geometrically diverse buildings.  Makes for a very interesting photo.  I like the various heights and angles of all the buildings.  The compostion is terrific.', '2003-10-11 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447188, 40813, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  wonderful color.</td>', 'nice shot.  wonderful color.', '2003-10-11 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(447190, 41089, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very stunning photo.  Fabulous color and lighting!</td>', 'Very stunning photo.  Fabulous color and lighting!', '2003-10-11 13:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447192, 41389, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice job...great colors and detail!</td>', 'nice job...great colors and detail!', '2003-10-11 13:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447194, 41177, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo!  I love the tones and mood of this shot.  Good capture of the detail, and the people in the photo add alot of interest and feeling to this photo.  A 10.</td>', 'wonderful photo!  I love the tones and mood of this shot.  Good capture of the detail, and the people in the photo add alot of interest and feeling to this photo.  A 10.', '2003-10-11 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447195, 40698, 10402, '<td valign="top">A visually interesting building, and you chose a good angle to shoot it from. Good contrast and brightness, though a bit soft; some sharpening might help bring out the wonderful texture of the bricks.</td>', 'A visually interesting building, and you chose a good angle to shoot it from. Good contrast and brightness, though a bit soft; some sharpening might help bring out the wonderful texture of the bricks.', '2003-10-11 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(447208, 40474, 6130, '<td valign="top">wonderful 10</td>', 'wonderful 10', '2003-10-11 14:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447209, 41217, 10402, '<td valign="top">The different elements of this photo work well together. I especially like how you''ve incorporated the rainbow. It seems tilted slightly to the right. The Levels are fine as they are, but darkening the midtones a little might make it more dramatic.</td>', 'The different elements of this photo work well together. I especially like how you''ve incorporated the rainbow. It seems tilted slightly to the right. The Levels are fine as they are, but darkening the midtones a little might make it more dramatic.', '2003-10-11 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(447214, 41340, 6130, '<td valign="top">so beautiful</td>', 'so beautiful', '2003-10-11 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(447216, 41409, 10402, '<td valign="top">This image effectively conveys the Urban Landscapes theme with its definite foreground, midground, and background buildings. Great composition and exposure.</td>', 'This image effectively conveys the Urban Landscapes theme with its definite foreground, midground, and background buildings. Great composition and exposure.', '2003-10-11 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(447219, 41392, 10402, '<td valign="top">True to the title, the colors are the first thing that attracts attention in this image. But the arrangement of lights in the different buildings gives each a unique texture, which is interesting as well.</td>', 'True to the title, the colors are the first thing that attracts attention in this image. But the arrangement of lights in the different buildings gives each a unique texture, which is interesting as well.', '2003-10-11 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447224, 40871, 12537, '<td valign="top">very creative, beautiful picture. too bad theres that reflection on it but other than that i think its awesome.</td>', 'very creative, beautiful picture. too bad theres that reflection on it but other than that i think its awesome.', '2003-10-11 14:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(447226, 41281, 10402, '<td valign="top">You picked the perfect time of day for this; the lighting is great. The photo needs some noise reduction and sharpening.</td>', 'You picked the perfect time of day for this; the lighting is great. The photo needs some noise reduction and sharpening.', '2003-10-11 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447231, 41014, 10402, '<td valign="top">The building has an interesting shape and texture, and the low sun lights it well in this perspective. The composition would work better if the right side of the building didn''t cut the photo in half; cropping off the large tree on the far right would help. The photo definitely needs some postprocessing to reduce the color cast, darken the dark parts, and sharpen the image.</td>', 'The building has an interesting shape and texture, and the low sun lights it well in this perspective. The composition would work better if the right side of the building didn''t cut the photo in half; cropping off the large tree on the far right would help. The photo definitely needs some postprocessing to reduce the color cast, darken the dark parts, and sharpen the image.', '2003-10-11 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(447234, 41036, 674, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but feel it could be a little sharper and have a tad more contrast</td>', 'I love this shot but feel it could be a little sharper and have a tad more contrast', '2003-10-11 14:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(447238, 41256, 10402, '<td valign="top">The bright reflection of the sun really sucks the contrast out of this image. Curves could probably fix it.</td>', 'The bright reflection of the sun really sucks the contrast out of this image. Curves could probably fix it.', '2003-10-11 14:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(447239, 40747, 12537, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but it might of had more of an effect if you had cropped off the bottem where theres the little yellow store is or maybe had more of the sky in the photo. very nice.</td>', 'I like this picture but it might of had more of an effect if you had cropped off the bottem where theres the little yellow store is or maybe had more of the sky in the photo. very nice.', '2003-10-11 14:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447240, 40736, 674, '<td valign="top">There are some lovely contrasting textures in this shot  although it is a bit busy did you try it in black and white?</td>', 'There are some lovely contrasting textures in this shot  although it is a bit busy did you try it in black and white?', '2003-10-11 15:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447245, 41165, 674, '<td valign="top">A good shot but I would have cropped the top quarter of the sky off it is too bland and detracts from the drama of the rest of the shot.</td>', 'A good shot but I would have cropped the top quarter of the sky off it is too bland and detracts from the drama of the rest of the shot.', '2003-10-11 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(447247, 41161, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The larger building almost fills the frame and doesn''t really contrast with the sky, putting it in the background and giving the reflected building the spotlight. The imperfect reflection gives it an interesting texture.</td>', 'I like the composition. The larger building almost fills the frame and doesn''t really contrast with the sky, putting it in the background and giving the reflected building the spotlight. The imperfect reflection gives it an interesting texture.', '2003-10-11 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447250, 40959, 10402, '<td valign="top">The image effectively conveys the intended message implied by the title.</td>', 'The image effectively conveys the intended message implied by the title.', '2003-10-11 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(447251, 41132, 10402, '<td valign="top">The dramatic contrast between the reflected and background sky would be enhanced if a little more background was showing. But this is a very striking image.</td>', 'The dramatic contrast between the reflected and background sky would be enhanced if a little more background was showing. But this is a very striking image.', '2003-10-11 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447254, 41143, 10402, '<td valign="top">The bright red circle contrasts well with the subdued rectangular background buildings to make an interesting image.</td>', 'The bright red circle contrasts well with the subdued rectangular background buildings to make an interesting image.', '2003-10-11 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447255, 41394, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice urban landscape. The cars work well in the foreground, and the moon is a nice touch. Looks a bit blurry from camera shake.</td>', 'Nice urban landscape. The cars work well in the foreground, and the moon is a nice touch. Looks a bit blurry from camera shake.', '2003-10-11 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(447256, 41069, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetrical composition. The foreground flowers are a nice touch. But the image is very soft; it really needs some sharpening.</td>', 'Nice symmetrical composition. The foreground flowers are a nice touch. But the image is very soft; it really needs some sharpening.', '2003-10-11 15:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447281, 41342, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot, the colors are wonderful and your focus if right on, I love it!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot, the colors are wonderful and your focus if right on, I love it!', '2003-10-11 16:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(447283, 40927, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love the title it suits this shot perfectly. Good job...</td>', 'Great shot! I love the title it suits this shot perfectly. Good job...', '2003-10-11 16:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(447285, 40987, 10848, '<td valign="top">This defintely says Urban living to me. Great shot, captures the essence of the hectic life of urban living, I like it</td>', 'This defintely says Urban living to me. Great shot, captures the essence of the hectic life of urban living, I like it', '2003-10-11 16:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447286, 40460, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the fog adds a sense of drama to me. I love these night shots, great job.</td>', 'Great shot, the fog adds a sense of drama to me. I love these night shots, great job.', '2003-10-11 16:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447294, 40861, 10848, '<td valign="top">this is a fabulous shot, the way you captured the intimate atmosphere in this shot is great, title suits this shot very well.</td>', 'this is a fabulous shot, the way you captured the intimate atmosphere in this shot is great, title suits this shot very well.', '2003-10-11 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
