(447298, 40654, 10848, '<td valign="top">great shot, I like the way you got this in an upward angle, not your traditional straight on shot, a good choice, I like it</td>', 'great shot, I like the way you got this in an upward angle, not your traditional straight on shot, a good choice, I like it', '2003-10-11 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(447299, 40519, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I like the way you got the lamp post centered with the sun, adds interest to the shot, I like it alot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I like the way you got the lamp post centered with the sun, adds interest to the shot, I like it alot!', '2003-10-11 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(447306, 41160, 9004, '<td valign="top">Good shot but the tree is taking away too much of it.</td>', 'Good shot but the tree is taking away too much of it.', '2003-10-11 16:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447307, 41187, 9004, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot however either ISO or jpeg quality is making it too grainy.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot however either ISO or jpeg quality is making it too grainy.', '2003-10-11 16:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447310, 41272, 12773, '<td valign="top">Excellent symmetry, good use of low shutter speed to create the "busy crowd" effect. Excellent black and white exposure.</td>', 'Excellent symmetry, good use of low shutter speed to create the "busy crowd" effect. Excellent black and white exposure.', '2003-10-11 16:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447324, 40474, 10402, '<td valign="top">Too much space at the top for me. The vast negative space doesn''t add anything to the photo; just the opposite. Crop most of it out. What''s left is very interesting: a nice assortment of shapes and colors that conveys some of the character of Tallinn.</td>', 'Too much space at the top for me. The vast negative space doesn''t add anything to the photo; just the opposite. Crop most of it out. What''s left is very interesting: a nice assortment of shapes and colors that conveys some of the character of Tallinn.', '2003-10-11 17:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(447325, 41361, 10402, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works well for this, but it is a bit soft for such a stark subject; some sharpening would bring out some of the details and better suit the subject.</td>', 'B&W works well for this, but it is a bit soft for such a stark subject; some sharpening would bring out some of the details and better suit the subject.', '2003-10-11 17:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(447326, 40829, 12537, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo it bring a feeling of timeless serenity to the down town landscape.</td>', 'Very interesting photo it bring a feeling of timeless serenity to the down town landscape.', '2003-10-11 17:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447327, 41362, 10402, '<td valign="top">The composition seems to work and I like the starbursts on the lights. I''d have made it a bit sharper, but the softness gives this image a slightly dreamy feel appropriate for the night hour.</td>', 'The composition seems to work and I like the starbursts on the lights. I''d have made it a bit sharper, but the softness gives this image a slightly dreamy feel appropriate for the night hour.', '2003-10-11 17:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447330, 41140, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The foreground rose bush nicely frames the stadium. But the subject is obscured by haze. A UV or polarizing filter would have prevented it; some postprocessing Levels and/or Curves might be able to save it. Sharpening would help too.</td>', 'Great composition. The foreground rose bush nicely frames the stadium. But the subject is obscured by haze. A UV or polarizing filter would have prevented it; some postprocessing Levels and/or Curves might be able to save it. Sharpening would help too.', '2003-10-11 17:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(447331, 40800, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, soft and peaceful. A lot of different textures make it fun to explore. It would be great in the right context.</td>', 'Nice photo, soft and peaceful. A lot of different textures make it fun to explore. It would be great in the right context.', '2003-10-11 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(447334, 41346, 10402, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric perspective is put to good use here, and works with the reflection to make a peaceful image. The docked sailboats are a nice contrast and contribute to the overall effect. I don''t really understand the title.</td>', 'Atmospheric perspective is put to good use here, and works with the reflection to make a peaceful image. The docked sailboats are a nice contrast and contribute to the overall effect. I don''t really understand the title.', '2003-10-11 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447335, 41218, 8816, '<td valign="top">Holy shiza!  This one made me pee my pants.  Absolutely amazing!  You even managed to get some stars in their.  I can''t believe just how breathtaking this is.  I''m giving you a 12.  This better win, cause it''s much better then the rest of the shots I''ve seen so far.  CONGRATS!</td>', 'Holy shiza!  This one made me pee my pants.  Absolutely amazing!  You even managed to get some stars in their.  I can''t believe just how breathtaking this is.  I''m giving you a 12.  This better win, cause it''s much better then the rest of the shots I''ve seen so far.  CONGRATS!', '2003-10-11 18:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(447337, 40800, 12448, '<td valign="top">With only the rocks to represent buildings this is pushing the envelope to meet the challenge for me.  On the shot itself, if any of it has a sharper focus, either the front or the background I would go much higher on the overall shot.  It looks like a lovely area, the mist rolling in is very inviting to me.</td>', 'With only the rocks to represent buildings this is pushing the envelope to meet the challenge for me.  On the shot itself, if any of it has a sharper focus, either the front or the background I would go much higher on the overall shot.  It looks like a lovely area, the mist rolling in is very inviting to me.', '2003-10-11 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447340, 41349, 8816, '<td valign="top">This shot would''ve looked awesome in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This shot would''ve looked awesome in B&W.', '2003-10-11 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(447342, 41024, 11187, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice ethereal look and the black sky works well too. 10</td>', 'Great shot. Nice ethereal look and the black sky works well too. 10', '2003-10-11 18:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447344, 40792, 12537, '<td valign="top">yay! go calgary!</td>', 'yay! go calgary!', '2003-10-11 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447346, 40654, 10084, '<td valign="top">The angle that you chose to take the shot gives it a very dramatic feeling. Good contrast helps bring out the shadows in the photo to bring out the details in the trims. The sky frames the church very well. "9"</td>', 'The angle that you chose to take the shot gives it a very dramatic feeling. Good contrast helps bring out the shadows in the photo to bring out the details in the trims. The sky frames the church very well. "9"', '2003-10-11 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447349, 41248, 10084, '<td valign="top">The outline of the cityscape is beautifully framed by the blue hue of the sky and the fluffy clouds. The foreground is extremely interesting. Some really beautiful shadows in the foreground. Would make for a great postcard.</td>', 'The outline of the cityscape is beautifully framed by the blue hue of the sky and the fluffy clouds. The foreground is extremely interesting. Some really beautiful shadows in the foreground. Would make for a great postcard.', '2003-10-11 19:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447350, 41325, 12537, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture but its not an urban landscape</td>', 'beautiful picture but its not an urban landscape', '2003-10-11 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447351, 40927, 10084, '<td valign="top">The building is framed beautifully by the great hues in the blue sky and what fluffy clouds. The reflections on the building is incredible. The foreground with the water and trees make the composition interesting. "10"</td>', 'The building is framed beautifully by the great hues in the blue sky and what fluffy clouds. The reflections on the building is incredible. The foreground with the water and trees make the composition interesting. "10"', '2003-10-11 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(447353, 41152, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how the silhouettes of the buildings kind of converge toward the center. Gives it more interest. Love the beautiful colors in the sunset/sunrise it frames the buildings perfectly and give the composition even more interest. "9"</td>', 'I like how the silhouettes of the buildings kind of converge toward the center. Gives it more interest. Love the beautiful colors in the sunset/sunrise it frames the buildings perfectly and give the composition even more interest. "9"', '2003-10-11 19:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(447357, 41303, 13053, '<td valign="top">curves in pictures are always cool! great composition!</td>', 'curves in pictures are always cool! great composition!', '2003-10-11 20:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447358, 40469, 13053, '<td valign="top">great reflection</td>', 'great reflection', '2003-10-11 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447360, 41407, 8860, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. It''s a good choice if you have no city or typical urban stuff to shoot. The tone is a bit overpowering and it could do with a touch more contrast as the sepia has filled in much of the ''white'' areas.</td>', 'Interesting subject. It''s a good choice if you have no city or typical urban stuff to shoot. The tone is a bit overpowering and it could do with a touch more contrast as the sepia has filled in much of the ''white'' areas.', '2003-10-11 20:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(447362, 41184, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like this subject. I just think that shooting it square on would have made the composition more balanced and ''designed''. The diagonal at the top is unaesthetic.</td>', 'I like this subject. I just think that shooting it square on would have made the composition more balanced and ''designed''. The diagonal at the top is unaesthetic.', '2003-10-11 20:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(447364, 41278, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good snap, but it lacks clarity and definition. The bright light in the foreground is overpowering.</td>', 'Good snap, but it lacks clarity and definition. The bright light in the foreground is overpowering.', '2003-10-11 20:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(447365, 41258, 4321, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Too much white sky which makes the  buildings a little faded</td>', 'Lovely composition. Too much white sky which makes the  buildings a little faded', '2003-10-11 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447368, 41184, 4321, '<td valign="top">Very nice...any chance this is in San Remo?</td>', 'Very nice...any chance this is in San Remo?', '2003-10-11 20:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(447369, 40697, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and attractive light streaks. I like the colour of the building on the left which nicely offsets the usual yellow caste. Nice and crisp too. [8]</td>', 'Good exposure and attractive light streaks. I like the colour of the building on the left which nicely offsets the usual yellow caste. Nice and crisp too. [8]', '2003-10-11 20:35:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(447370, 40963, 12719, '<td valign="top">good clarity, good landscape, however I don''t find the composition particularly appealing, had good potential</td>', 'good clarity, good landscape, however I don''t find the composition particularly appealing, had good potential', '2003-10-11 20:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(447372, 41251, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like tagging if it''s done well - shame about the litter though, I hate it with a vengeance. Good viewpoint and muted tones work well, although your focus good be slightly deeper. This is quintessentially urban! [7]</td>', 'I like tagging if it''s done well - shame about the litter though, I hate it with a vengeance. Good viewpoint and muted tones work well, although your focus good be slightly deeper. This is quintessentially urban! [7]', '2003-10-11 20:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447373, 40645, 12719, '<td valign="top">wonderful colour. a good image that pops all round, I like it :)</td>', 'wonderful colour. a good image that pops all round, I like it :)', '2003-10-11 20:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447374, 40952, 12719, '<td valign="top">a lovely landscape with lovely colours.</td>', 'a lovely landscape with lovely colours.', '2003-10-11 20:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(447375, 40579, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual structure. Nice viewpoint although horizon is not straight.</td>', 'Unusual structure. Nice viewpoint although horizon is not straight.', '2003-10-11 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(447376, 40813, 12719, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s a cool sky. I love the reflections on the building too, very interesting. well done.</td>', 'wow, that''s a cool sky. I love the reflections on the building too, very interesting. well done.', '2003-10-11 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447377, 40639, 12719, '<td valign="top">beautiful intense colour and a really nice landscape, I find your border a little distracting - but that''s just personal taste isn''t it :)</td>', 'beautiful intense colour and a really nice landscape, I find your border a little distracting - but that''s just personal taste isn''t it :)', '2003-10-11 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447378, 41366, 8860, '<td valign="top">No, no, no - this is a set up. Those people are too posed - maybe they''re models?  ; )<br/> <br/>Excellent stuff although DOF is abit narrow. [7]</td>', 'No, no, no - this is a set up. Those people are too posed - maybe they''re models?  ; ) Excellent stuff although DOF is abit narrow. [7]', '2003-10-11 20:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447379, 41362, 12719, '<td valign="top">quite a nice nightscape - shame it seems a little fuzzy. possible camera shake?</td>', 'quite a nice nightscape - shame it seems a little fuzzy. possible camera shake?', '2003-10-11 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447381, 41046, 12719, '<td valign="top">I feel like there is rather too much foreground - especially with the orange flower to the left which is rather distracting. may have been better from a higher angle?</td>', 'I feel like there is rather too much foreground - especially with the orange flower to the left which is rather distracting. may have been better from a higher angle?', '2003-10-11 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447382, 41102, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint and composition. Sky looks great but your levels look a bit too dense in the dark areas where detail has been lost. However, given the subject I think you get away with it (Sean?). Very crisp focus all the way from foreground to horizon. Nice elevation too. [8]</td>', 'Nice viewpoint and composition. Sky looks great but your levels look a bit too dense in the dark areas where detail has been lost. However, given the subject I think you get away with it (Sean?). Very crisp focus all the way from foreground to horizon. Nice elevation too. [8]', '2003-10-11 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(447383, 40432, 12719, '<td valign="top">oooh, I love new york too. an interesting view of the landscape. nice symetry with the wires.</td>', 'oooh, I love new york too. an interesting view of the landscape. nice symetry with the wires.', '2003-10-11 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(447384, 41272, 12719, '<td valign="top">I like the way you managed to get the line down the middle of st. pauls, the railings and the homeless chap.</td>', 'I like the way you managed to get the line down the middle of st. pauls, the railings and the homeless chap.', '2003-10-11 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447385, 41245, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d like to have seen Tehran more clearly. The sky''s nice but it should not be the feature here and your subject is too blurred. A really dark, silhouetted skyline would have worked well.</td>', 'I''d like to have seen Tehran more clearly. The sky''s nice but it should not be the feature here and your subject is too blurred. A really dark, silhouetted skyline would have worked well.', '2003-10-11 20:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(447386, 40927, 12719, '<td valign="top">this said 2001 to me. the composition of this (which is nice) is making my brain feel like it''s a miniture. "those trees are just models" my brain says...nice job :) I especially like the little fluffly clouds, they look painted</td>', 'this said 2001 to me. the composition of this (which is nice) is making my brain feel like it''s a miniture. "those trees are just models" my brain says...nice job :) I especially like the little fluffly clouds, they look painted', '2003-10-11 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(447388, 40672, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is one shot where straightness is essential - how could you leave it like this? It''s spoilt an otherwise interesting subject to a large extent.</td>', 'This is one shot where straightness is essential - how could you leave it like this? It''s spoilt an otherwise interesting subject to a large extent.', '2003-10-11 20:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447389, 40665, 12719, '<td valign="top">very pretty, interesting yellow and green lights in the foreground...possibly slightly distracting though. my eyes can''t make up their mind if they are too distracting or not - but my eyes do keep popping to the building right fg. <br/> <br/>they sky is lovely though, and the bulidings with their little lights. you got the sky at a nice moment.</td>', 'very pretty, interesting yellow and green lights in the foreground...possibly slightly distracting though. my eyes can''t make up their mind if they are too distracting or not - but my eyes do keep popping to the building right fg.  they sky is lovely though, and the bulidings with their little lights. you got the sky at a nice moment.', '2003-10-11 20:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447390, 40564, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is very reminiscent of the film to me - when she''s in the chair being constructed...<br/> <br/>Nice lighting and composition, but not quite urban enough maybe.</td>', 'This is very reminiscent of the film to me - when she''s in the chair being constructed... Nice lighting and composition, but not quite urban enough maybe.', '2003-10-11 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447392, 41291, 8860, '<td valign="top">This needed rotating so that the verticals were straight.Colours are good but could be enhanced with an increase in contrast.</td>', 'This needed rotating so that the verticals were straight.Colours are good but could be enhanced with an increase in contrast.', '2003-10-11 21:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447393, 40959, 8860, '<td valign="top">They''re commercial buildings!  ; )<br/> <br/>Good composition, but I would have cropped out the bright light at the top and included more of the street.</td>', 'They''re commercial buildings!  ; ) Good composition, but I would have cropped out the bright light at the top and included more of the street.', '2003-10-11 21:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(447394, 41343, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too soft and bland for me. Contrast is shallow and the lighting too flat. Shooting early or late in the day would improve this. Could do with rotation so that verticals are straight.</td>', 'This is a bit too soft and bland for me. Contrast is shallow and the lighting too flat. Shooting early or late in the day would improve this. Could do with rotation so that verticals are straight.', '2003-10-11 21:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447395, 40474, 12325, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped differently, there''s just WAY too much sky</td>', 'I''d have cropped differently, there''s just WAY too much sky', '2003-10-11 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(447397, 40796, 12325, '<td valign="top">Out of place lamppost and strange dark shadow in top right.  Might have been better with a good crop</td>', 'Out of place lamppost and strange dark shadow in top right.  Might have been better with a good crop', '2003-10-11 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447398, 41215, 8860, '<td valign="top">I thought this was the leaning tower of Piza at first! The rotation is distracting, but shot lacks an urban focus particularly and lighting is a little flat with the sky causing a distracting brightness.</td>', 'I thought this was the leaning tower of Piza at first! The rotation is distracting, but shot lacks an urban focus particularly and lighting is a little flat with the sky causing a distracting brightness.', '2003-10-11 21:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(447399, 40873, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good, deep composition. Well focussed from near to far. Lighting is quite flat though so shooting early or late in the day would have been better.</td>', 'Good, deep composition. Well focussed from near to far. Lighting is quite flat though so shooting early or late in the day would have been better.', '2003-10-11 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447402, 41346, 11321, '<td valign="top">just perfect!</td>', 'just perfect!', '2003-10-11 21:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447404, 41154, 11321, '<td valign="top">half the building is in dark shadow..<br/>nice siluette though, try picture this on evening (if you live north side of the planet :), when the sun is lightining the other side of the building too.<br/></td>', 'half the building is in dark shadow..nice siluette though, try picture this on evening (if you live north side of the planet :), when the sun is lightining the other side of the building too.', '2003-10-11 21:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447407, 41330, 12719, '<td valign="top">I find the leaves in the foreground too distracting - I guess the idea was the frame the landscape, but I find them too much. it looked like a nice sky though that could have been empahsised more. an interesting skyline nonetheless :)</td>', 'I find the leaves in the foreground too distracting - I guess the idea was the frame the landscape, but I find them too much. it looked like a nice sky though that could have been empahsised more. an interesting skyline nonetheless :)', '2003-10-11 22:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447408, 41336, 12719, '<td valign="top">strange cool effect with the light there - was it raining?</td>', 'strange cool effect with the light there - was it raining?', '2003-10-11 22:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(447409, 41007, 12719, '<td valign="top">good composition, but 2 points - 1. the light is annoying me, maybe you could have moved so the bridge blocked it? and 2,. the quality of the image seems a little fuzzy to me - maybe just compression though.</td>', 'good composition, but 2 points - 1. the light is annoying me, maybe you could have moved so the bridge blocked it? and 2,. the quality of the image seems a little fuzzy to me - maybe just compression though.', '2003-10-11 22:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447411, 40679, 12719, '<td valign="top">wow, real nice sense of motion there, it sucks me in.</td>', 'wow, real nice sense of motion there, it sucks me in.', '2003-10-11 22:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447415, 40644, 11947, '<td valign="top">Nice colours captured in the clouds, though it''s not really urban is it? It looks pretty rural to me.</td>', 'Nice colours captured in the clouds, though it''s not really urban is it? It looks pretty rural to me.', '2003-10-11 22:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447417, 41302, 11947, '<td valign="top">nice light trails captured in the moving traffic, and the water looks nice and still. great timing! though the photograph seems to lack a strong central point, the vehicle in the bottom right taking away most of the attention. still, great sense of tranquility captured.</td>', 'nice light trails captured in the moving traffic, and the water looks nice and still. great timing! though the photograph seems to lack a strong central point, the vehicle in the bottom right taking away most of the attention. still, great sense of tranquility captured.', '2003-10-11 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447420, 40760, 12623, '<td valign="top">Thatt''s what I call urban :-)</td>', 'Thatt''s what I call urban :-)', '2003-10-11 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447422, 41178, 11947, '<td valign="top">the city is too small perhaps?</td>', 'the city is too small perhaps?', '2003-10-11 22:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(447423, 41214, 12623, '<td valign="top">Great colors a nd the composition. The horizon is a little  slanted</td>', 'Great colors a nd the composition. The horizon is a little  slanted', '2003-10-11 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(447425, 41260, 12623, '<td valign="top">great titlte</td>', 'great titlte', '2003-10-11 22:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(447426, 40429, 12623, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what it is even though I was there, Blurring makes it sad and subtle, as it should be. Excellent photo.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what it is even though I was there, Blurring makes it sad and subtle, as it should be. Excellent photo.', '2003-10-11 22:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447427, 40645, 11947, '<td valign="top">was the overexposure deliberate? nice halo-ish feeling though the trees and shrubs in the lower right are distracting..</td>', 'was the overexposure deliberate? nice halo-ish feeling though the trees and shrubs in the lower right are distracting..', '2003-10-11 22:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(447429, 40496, 11947, '<td valign="top">a little too dark i feel.</td>', 'a little too dark i feel.', '2003-10-11 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(447430, 40884, 11947, '<td valign="top">nice, strong lines.</td>', 'nice, strong lines.', '2003-10-11 22:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447431, 41342, 11947, '<td valign="top">great colours!</td>', 'great colours!', '2003-10-11 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(447432, 40432, 12623, '<td valign="top">Nice, People at  the bottom  could be cropped. The buildings on the right disturb the composition - a slight change of the angle would make it better</td>', 'Nice, People at  the bottom  could be cropped. The buildings on the right disturb the composition - a slight change of the angle would make it better', '2003-10-11 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447434, 41218, 12623, '<td valign="top">wow. My only 10.</td>', 'wow. My only 10.', '2003-10-11 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447435, 41333, 11947, '<td valign="top">great timing to capture the vehicle passing in front! nice mix of lights and the evening colours of dusk.</td>', 'great timing to capture the vehicle passing in front! nice mix of lights and the evening colours of dusk.', '2003-10-11 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447437, 40671, 11947, '<td valign="top">the towers look disturbingly unsymmetrical.</td>', 'the towers look disturbingly unsymmetrical.', '2003-10-11 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(447438, 41272, 12623, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but you probably exposed it for a bit too long - the bottom right spoils the picture</td>', 'I like the idea, but you probably exposed it for a bit too long - the bottom right spoils the picture', '2003-10-11 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447439, 41065, 12623, '<td valign="top">This is only Buda :-), good photo</td>', 'This is only Buda :-), good photo', '2003-10-11 22:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447441, 40796, 12719, '<td valign="top">strange light effects going on there in the sky...pp did that? eyes cant quite work out if they like it or not...tis a bit odd...also find the lampost on left v. distracting and also got an odd blur round it.</td>', 'strange light effects going on there in the sky...pp did that? eyes cant quite work out if they like it or not...tis a bit odd...also find the lampost on left v. distracting and also got an odd blur round it.', '2003-10-11 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447442, 41323, 12719, '<td valign="top">stunning sky, but for this challenge seems to be a bit too much sky and not enough landscape.</td>', 'stunning sky, but for this challenge seems to be a bit too much sky and not enough landscape.', '2003-10-11 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447443, 41409, 12719, '<td valign="top">nice foreground, mid and background. they all work nice together.</td>', 'nice foreground, mid and background. they all work nice together.', '2003-10-11 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447444, 41292, 12719, '<td valign="top">very nice, simplistic, crisp, clear and popping colours. good job.</td>', 'very nice, simplistic, crisp, clear and popping colours. good job.', '2003-10-11 23:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447445, 41008, 12719, '<td valign="top">it''s an intersting effect, but I find it very harsh. as a stand alone photo I quite like it, it''s interesting. for the challenge, it doesn''t click for me. sorry.</td>', 'it''s an intersting effect, but I find it very harsh. as a stand alone photo I quite like it, it''s interesting. for the challenge, it doesn''t click for me. sorry.', '2003-10-11 23:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447447, 40640, 12719, '<td valign="top">mmm, it''s a good photo but I find this very hard to fit to the challenge. it''s certinally not landscape and I don''t even know if it''s urban either. not clicking for me...as a photo - like it. for this challenge - mmm, not really.</td>', 'mmm, it''s a good photo but I find this very hard to fit to the challenge. it''s certinally not landscape and I don''t even know if it''s urban either. not clicking for me...as a photo - like it. for this challenge - mmm, not really.', '2003-10-11 23:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(447452, 41010, 2195, '<td valign="top">Wow, simply stunning! The lack of a singular focal point captivates the viewer and makes him roam throughout the photograph, ahh I just can''t adequatly describue it, I love the diaginal lines, the negative space, and the tones. Simply Superb!</td>', 'Wow, simply stunning! The lack of a singular focal point captivates the viewer and makes him roam throughout the photograph, ahh I just can''t adequatly describue it, I love the diaginal lines, the negative space, and the tones. Simply Superb!', '2003-10-11 23:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(447454, 41294, 12719, '<td valign="top">what a curious reflection, and angle. made my head fall sideways.</td>', 'what a curious reflection, and angle. made my head fall sideways.', '2003-10-11 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447457, 41218, 12719, '<td valign="top">wow. this is superb. what a mass of light! very pretty, but what a hell of light pollution. a very very nice shot. I like how it has such clarity that you can even see the stars too. sweet.</td>', 'wow. this is superb. what a mass of light! very pretty, but what a hell of light pollution. a very very nice shot. I like how it has such clarity that you can even see the stars too. sweet.', '2003-10-11 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447458, 41049, 12719, '<td valign="top">was this taken through a window? it has a very distracting grid pattern all over it, which is a shame.</td>', 'was this taken through a window? it has a very distracting grid pattern all over it, which is a shame.', '2003-10-11 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447459, 41066, 12719, '<td valign="top">extremly contrasty. overly so I think. it seems to have washed out the sky. other than that I really like it, it has nice composition, colour and a nice collection of elements.</td>', 'extremly contrasty. overly so I think. it seems to have washed out the sky. other than that I really like it, it has nice composition, colour and a nice collection of elements.', '2003-10-11 23:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
