(447667, 41302, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, I like the colors, good time lapse.</td>', 'Good contrast, I like the colors, good time lapse.', '2003-10-12 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447669, 41157, 11432, '<td valign="top">Is this off a cruse ship? Good lighting, I like the detail in the water.</td>', 'Is this off a cruse ship? Good lighting, I like the detail in the water.', '2003-10-12 12:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(447670, 41277, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good in B/W I like the Urbaness.</td>', 'Good in B/W I like the Urbaness.', '2003-10-12 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447671, 41037, 9504, '<td valign="top">My personal preference would have been to crop off the right side of this image and a portion of the top to get rid of the street light.  The two main buildings of the photo are very interesting and intersect nicely.  Where they intersect is very interesting.  The rest adds clutter. Still, nice capture:  6</td>', 'My personal preference would have been to crop off the right side of this image and a portion of the top to get rid of the street light.  The two main buildings of the photo are very interesting and intersect nicely.  Where they intersect is very interesting.  The rest adds clutter. Still, nice capture:  6', '2003-10-12 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447672, 40931, 11432, '<td valign="top">Wow, not any sign of movement. I love the warmness to this picture.</td>', 'Wow, not any sign of movement. I love the warmness to this picture.', '2003-10-12 12:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447674, 40698, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good building shot. I like the details.</td>', 'Good building shot. I like the details.', '2003-10-12 12:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(447675, 40682, 9504, '<td valign="top">A tripod here would have helped prevent the blur in the lighting.  I find it rather distracting.  I am also not sure why you chose black and white here.  I don''t think it helps your photo...</td>', 'A tripod here would have helped prevent the blur in the lighting.  I find it rather distracting.  I am also not sure why you chose black and white here.  I don''t think it helps your photo...', '2003-10-12 12:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
