(447705, 41381, 9504, '<td valign="top">Somehow this photo really appeals to me in the challenge.  I think the simplicity of it says it all.  You don''t need much more outside of the nice reflection you have.  Very well done! 9</td>', 'Somehow this photo really appeals to me in the challenge.  I think the simplicity of it says it all.  You don''t need much more outside of the nice reflection you have.  Very well done! 9', '2003-10-12 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
