(447818, 40564, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, I''ve been trying to pick my "shot of the challenge" and it''s been very hard.  I love the deco feel of this, the colours and compostition. It''s a shame you couldn''t ask them to out the light in the window on the left!<br/> <br/>IMO,, this is the winnder...  a very deserved 10</td>', 'Wonderful, I''ve been trying to pick my "shot of the challenge" and it''s been very hard.  I love the deco feel of this, the colours and compostition. It''s a shame you couldn''t ask them to out the light in the window on the left! IMO,, this is the winnder...  a very deserved 10', '2003-10-12 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(447823, 40764, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice, another cool cloud shot. i like how the city is in silohuette and the sky takes up the majority of the frame.</td>', 'nice, another cool cloud shot. i like how the city is in silohuette and the sky takes up the majority of the frame.', '2003-10-12 16:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
