(447826, 41346, 9027, '<td valign="top">love this! evokes a very dreamy feeling. great misty quality, and well composed.</td>', 'love this! evokes a very dreamy feeling. great misty quality, and well composed.', '2003-10-12 16:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447854, 40822, 10414, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love it!!!!   10  :)</td>', 'I absolutely love it!!!!   10  :)', '2003-10-12 18:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447857, 40653, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I''m a sucker for silhouettes. :-)<br/> <br/>I would like to see how this looks after cropping off the right side (and tank) so the taller thing was more in the top right corner of the photo.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I''m a sucker for silhouettes. :-) I would like to see how this looks after cropping off the right side (and tank) so the taller thing was more in the top right corner of the photo. Nice work.', '2003-10-12 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(447858, 41008, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve done this.  The crisp white and the purple work well together and give it a whole new look.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'I really like how you''ve done this.  The crisp white and the purple work well together and give it a whole new look. Nice job.', '2003-10-12 18:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447859, 40649, 12809, '<td valign="top">The weeds and some of the shadows are a little distracting to me.  You''ve titled this ghost ''town'' and I''m wondering what this may look like taken at a wider angle to fit more of the town in the picture.  Maybe there was too much clutter or weeds to do that, though?  The buildings do seem interesting to photograph and the colors in your picture are nice.  Nice job.</td>', 'The weeds and some of the shadows are a little distracting to me.  You''ve titled this ghost ''town'' and I''m wondering what this may look like taken at a wider angle to fit more of the town in the picture.  Maybe there was too much clutter or weeds to do that, though?  The buildings do seem interesting to photograph and the colors in your picture are nice.  Nice job.', '2003-10-12 18:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(447860, 41085, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty city at night.  I''m not sure what it is, but it feels like (to me) that my eyes are being pulled in two directions.  In one direction to look at the city and in the other to look at the illuminated clouds.  There seems to be a black, dead space (for lack of better terminology) in the middle of the two that is cutting this image in half.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty city at night.  I''m not sure what it is, but it feels like (to me) that my eyes are being pulled in two directions.  In one direction to look at the city and in the other to look at the illuminated clouds.  There seems to be a black, dead space (for lack of better terminology) in the middle of the two that is cutting this image in half. Nice job.', '2003-10-12 18:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(447861, 40959, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  The colors are very good.  The bright light in the top left corner is kind of distracting but I''m not sure there''s anything you can do about it.  If you tried to crop it out (along with the glow around it) you would lose the Phantom sign and part of the building.  I think you did the right thing by leaving it.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'This is really nice.  The colors are very good.  The bright light in the top left corner is kind of distracting but I''m not sure there''s anything you can do about it.  If you tried to crop it out (along with the glow around it) you would lose the Phantom sign and part of the building.  I think you did the right thing by leaving it. Nice work.', '2003-10-12 18:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(447862, 40473, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective on this one.  Like the sepia tone, too.  As a suggestion, I might have cropped off the right side so that the street light was more in the bottom right corner.  Otherwise, very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice perspective on this one.  Like the sepia tone, too.  As a suggestion, I might have cropped off the right side so that the street light was more in the bottom right corner.  Otherwise, very nice shot.', '2003-10-12 18:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447864, 41264, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful town.  Unfortunately the haze isn''t allowing the nice colors to come through.  There''s some color on the right of the image but as you move left towards the haze it gets washed out.  Also, the tree at the bottom of the image is distracting.  There''s a reddish colored string, scratch...something...through the entrie image.  It starts at the top at the 2/3 mark and goes down.  I''m not really sure what caused that.<br/> <br/>I think the location and angle of this shot are great.  It''s a beautiful area and the greens on land and blues of the water would make for a gorgeous image.  Brighten it up a little and lose the tree and you''ve have an excellent image!<br/> <br/>Nice job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Looks like a beautiful town.  Unfortunately the haze isn''t allowing the nice colors to come through.  There''s some color on the right of the image but as you move left towards the haze it gets washed out.  Also, the tree at the bottom of the image is distracting.  There''s a reddish colored string, scratch...something...through the entrie image.  It starts at the top at the 2/3 mark and goes down.  I''m not really sure what caused that. I think the location and angle of this shot are great.  It''s a beautiful area and the greens on land and blues of the water would make for a gorgeous image.  Brighten it up a little and lose the tree and you''ve have an excellent image! Nice job. ', '2003-10-12 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447866, 40860, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Like the angle and color you''ve chosen.  The bike leaning up against the building is a nice addition, too.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Like the angle and color you''ve chosen.  The bike leaning up against the building is a nice addition, too. Nice job.', '2003-10-12 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447867, 40678, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a colorful street to live on!  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Wow, what a colorful street to live on!  Nice perspective.', '2003-10-12 18:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447868, 40519, 13047, '<td valign="top">Really dig the comp. Excellent photo</td>', 'Really dig the comp. Excellent photo', '2003-10-12 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(447871, 40884, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the angles throw me off just a bit.  They lead you into the picture, which is good but then leave you kind of wanting, no real conclusion.  The lighting is also just a tad dark for my taste, maybe just a touch more contrast too?</td>', 'I like the idea, but the angles throw me off just a bit.  They lead you into the picture, which is good but then leave you kind of wanting, no real conclusion.  The lighting is also just a tad dark for my taste, maybe just a touch more contrast too?', '2003-10-12 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(447872, 40888, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like how the road starts/ends in the bottom corner and winds around to meet up with the bridge.  Did you work with the colors in this shot?  The sky seems a little too blue to be the actual color.  The boats and building seems soft; I think this could use a little unsharp mask.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'I like how the road starts/ends in the bottom corner and winds around to meet up with the bridge.  Did you work with the colors in this shot?  The sky seems a little too blue to be the actual color.  The boats and building seems soft; I think this could use a little unsharp mask. Nice job.', '2003-10-12 18:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447874, 40463, 10768, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Nice colors.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Nice colors.', '2003-10-12 18:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447875, 40752, 12448, '<td valign="top">The cropping on this really left me wandering all over the picture.  While the building in the center draws you in intially, the light pole to the right distracts you, even though the perspective is awesome, looks like it''s the same size, but then the awning across the bottom again draws you away and distracts you.</td>', 'The cropping on this really left me wandering all over the picture.  While the building in the center draws you in intially, the light pole to the right distracts you, even though the perspective is awesome, looks like it''s the same size, but then the awning across the bottom again draws you away and distracts you.', '2003-10-12 18:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(447876, 41361, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It isn''t too busy but there''s plenty to look at in this image.  I like how the mountain is in the background.  Love the b&amp;w, too.<br/> <br/>Nice job!</td>', 'I like this.  It isn''t too busy but there''s plenty to look at in this image.  I like how the mountain is in the background.  Love the b&w, too. Nice job!', '2003-10-12 18:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447877, 41024, 12448, '<td valign="top">The coloring on this photo, I think would have worked better in black and white instead of sepia.  The title makes you look for the rooftops but they are not a prominant part of the picture overall, the tower to the left is excellent balance but seems just a bit grainy, which actually works in this shot.</td>', 'The coloring on this photo, I think would have worked better in black and white instead of sepia.  The title makes you look for the rooftops but they are not a prominant part of the picture overall, the tower to the left is excellent balance but seems just a bit grainy, which actually works in this shot.', '2003-10-12 18:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(447878, 41149, 13047, '<td valign="top">Excelent comp. Impressive photo. Perhaps the furthest street light could have been angled inbetween the silhoette of the buildings.</td>', 'Excelent comp. Impressive photo. Perhaps the furthest street light could have been angled inbetween the silhoette of the buildings.', '2003-10-12 18:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(447879, 41399, 13047, '<td valign="top">Good photo.Black overhang somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Good photo.Black overhang somewhat distracting.', '2003-10-12 18:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(447880, 40519, 12448, '<td valign="top">The coloring on this shot is a bit dark for me, maybe if the brightness and hues were played with just a touch?  I love the sun behind the lamp post, very dramatic, would score much higher if the coloring was more defined.</td>', 'The coloring on this shot is a bit dark for me, maybe if the brightness and hues were played with just a touch?  I love the sun behind the lamp post, very dramatic, would score much higher if the coloring was more defined.', '2003-10-12 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447881, 41213, 13047, '<td valign="top">cityscape too far off into the distance</td>', 'cityscape too far off into the distance', '2003-10-12 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447882, 41323, 13047, '<td valign="top">Amazing color! Should have cropped the top half of the sky</td>', 'Amazing color! Should have cropped the top half of the sky', '2003-10-12 18:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447883, 41154, 12448, '<td valign="top">Country urban, I like it.  The balance is good, not quite centered, helps draw me in.  The lighting does throw me off a bit on the dark side of the building, maybe it''s the direction you took the shot from that is throwing me.  The shadow across the front on the lower side of the building draws you attention down and out of the photo for me.</td>', 'Country urban, I like it.  The balance is good, not quite centered, helps draw me in.  The lighting does throw me off a bit on the dark side of the building, maybe it''s the direction you took the shot from that is throwing me.  The shadow across the front on the lower side of the building draws you attention down and out of the photo for me.', '2003-10-12 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447884, 41327, 13047, '<td valign="top">Contrast seems a little off</td>', 'Contrast seems a little off', '2003-10-12 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(447886, 41398, 12448, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on this is a bit distracting and I think it would have worked much better in color, I would love to see the color version, are the trees turning yet?  The composition is good, though the large tree on the right is slightly distracting.</td>', 'The soft focus on this is a bit distracting and I think it would have worked much better in color, I would love to see the color version, are the trees turning yet?  The composition is good, though the large tree on the right is slightly distracting.', '2003-10-12 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447887, 41003, 12448, '<td valign="top">The light and contrasts on this one are not quite there for me.   The coloring you choose makes it blend just a tad too much to me.  I like the concept and the framing, focus could be just a tad sharper.</td>', 'The light and contrasts on this one are not quite there for me.   The coloring you choose makes it blend just a tad too much to me.  I like the concept and the framing, focus could be just a tad sharper.', '2003-10-12 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(447889, 41292, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is that BIG BEN waaaaaaaaaaaay in the background?  ;)  Having never been to London and not having a clue which is which besided Big Ben the shot itself is very compelling.  The jagged horizon from the different buildings has you looking all over the picture trying to capture the small details.  The shadow on the lower left is a bit distracting to m but I''m guessing you wanted the church {?} on the left included in the shot.  And if you didn''t have the buildings on the right to balance the shot it would have really left me wanting.</td>', 'Is that BIG BEN waaaaaaaaaaaay in the background?  ;)  Having never been to London and not having a clue which is which besided Big Ben the shot itself is very compelling.  The jagged horizon from the different buildings has you looking all over the picture trying to capture the small details.  The shadow on the lower left is a bit distracting to m but I''m guessing you wanted the church {?} on the left included in the shot.  And if you didn''t have the buildings on the right to balance the shot it would have really left me wanting.', '2003-10-12 19:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447890, 41294, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this shot about 8 times trying to figure it out.  I''m guessing it''s a reflection in a mirrored building, the angles and such are very disorienting.  I love the colors and the golden lines (office lights on?) are a nice way to break the shot.</td>', 'I have looked at this shot about 8 times trying to figure it out.  I''m guessing it''s a reflection in a mirrored building, the angles and such are very disorienting.  I love the colors and the golden lines (office lights on?) are a nice way to break the shot.', '2003-10-12 19:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447892, 41355, 12809, '<td valign="top">The angle of the row of houses is very good.  It''s so flat there - I think I can spot three water towers.  Re: Your title - It''s amazing how fast construction goes.</td>', 'The angle of the row of houses is very good.  It''s so flat there - I think I can spot three water towers.  Re: Your title - It''s amazing how fast construction goes.', '2003-10-12 19:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447893, 41065, 12448, '<td valign="top">The lack of clarity in the shot leave me wanting more.  I love the colors, the dark yellows and gold and the reflections in the river and the dark forbidding sky really adds to the shot.</td>', 'The lack of clarity in the shot leave me wanting more.  I love the colors, the dark yellows and gold and the reflections in the river and the dark forbidding sky really adds to the shot.', '2003-10-12 19:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447894, 40453, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very interesting structure.  Nice shot.  Only critique: Woudl''ve tried to keep to keep the entire tower in the pic.</td>', 'Very interesting structure.  Nice shot.  Only critique: Woudl''ve tried to keep to keep the entire tower in the pic.', '2003-10-12 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(447896, 40606, 12448, '<td valign="top">The darkness of the shot leaves me a bit cold, heck it looks cold there! ;)  But the dark patch on the lower left is very distracting and keeps taking me out of the shot, if the cropping was slightly different and you had played with the hues just a tad?</td>', 'The darkness of the shot leaves me a bit cold, heck it looks cold there! ;)  But the dark patch on the lower left is very distracting and keeps taking me out of the shot, if the cropping was slightly different and you had played with the hues just a tad?', '2003-10-12 19:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447897, 41398, 12809, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2003-10-12 19:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447898, 41330, 10768, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrant colors of the leaves against the cool colors of the city.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the vibrant colors of the leaves against the cool colors of the city.  Nicely done.', '2003-10-12 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447899, 40644, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool clouds.  I think this could use a little unsharp mask.  Also, I feel this is a stretch on the theme as it is.  It would be great if you could''ve gotten some houses, streets, buildings, or something in this shot along with the sky to be more on-theme.</td>', 'Cool clouds.  I think this could use a little unsharp mask.  Also, I feel this is a stretch on the theme as it is.  It would be great if you could''ve gotten some houses, streets, buildings, or something in this shot along with the sky to be more on-theme.', '2003-10-12 19:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(447900, 41185, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this shot so many times to try to figure out what about it that throws me so.  I love the reflection of the sun peaking through the clouds and the tower on the left is a great way to draw you in some more but I think it''s the lines of the shades inside that I find a bit too distracting and the coloring also throws me just a bit.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this shot so many times to try to figure out what about it that throws me so.  I love the reflection of the sun peaking through the clouds and the tower on the left is a great way to draw you in some more but I think it''s the lines of the shades inside that I find a bit too distracting and the coloring also throws me just a bit.', '2003-10-12 19:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447901, 41412, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Like the prespective and the look of the sign.  The roundness is nice.  Not a typical square sign.  Nice colors, too.</td>', 'Cool shot!  Like the prespective and the look of the sign.  The roundness is nice.  Not a typical square sign.  Nice colors, too.', '2003-10-12 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(447902, 40963, 12448, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt meets the challenge to me and the contrast of nature to man made is very nice, colors are bright and clear but the center of the shot is a bit much, maybe if it was more to the side and the bottom was cropped just a bit higher</td>', 'Without a doubt meets the challenge to me and the contrast of nature to man made is very nice, colors are bright and clear but the center of the shot is a bit much, maybe if it was more to the side and the bottom was cropped just a bit higher', '2003-10-12 19:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447903, 41318, 12448, '<td valign="top">Lovely area but the shot looks washed out, the horizon is not very defined and seems like a bit too much negative space for my personal taste.  I like the barge in the harbor and the lines, helps draw you in and look around.</td>', 'Lovely area but the shot looks washed out, the horizon is not very defined and seems like a bit too much negative space for my personal taste.  I like the barge in the harbor and the lines, helps draw you in and look around.', '2003-10-12 19:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(447907, 41233, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - the rough looking building with the plants.  Kind of symbolic of life and death, good and bad.  <br/> <br/>I wish the windows weren''t cut off at the top.  This could also use some color adjustments, a few degrees of CW rotation, and USM.<br/> <br/>Nice attempt.</td>', 'Interesting shot - the rough looking building with the plants.  Kind of symbolic of life and death, good and bad.   I wish the windows weren''t cut off at the top.  This could also use some color adjustments, a few degrees of CW rotation, and USM. Nice attempt.', '2003-10-12 19:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(447909, 41149, 12448, '<td valign="top">Look at that smog!  Or is that evening mist?  I''m guessing smog since it''s refineries.   :)  I love the concept that you were going for but the shot itself leaves me wanting, the lights are a bit too fuzzy and the total darkness at the bottom of the shot is a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'Look at that smog!  Or is that evening mist?  I''m guessing smog since it''s refineries.   :)  I love the concept that you were going for but the shot itself leaves me wanting, the lights are a bit too fuzzy and the total darkness at the bottom of the shot is a bit distracting to me.', '2003-10-12 19:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(447913, 41346, 12448, '<td valign="top">Talk about a busy harbor area!  You captured the challenge very well to me but the balance of light from the left to the right is just a bit to much, to bright on the left.  I like the way the line of boats draw your eye all around the shot but the masts are so empty, adds a sense of sadness, too bad you couldn''t get them all to raise their sails for your shot! :)</td>', 'Talk about a busy harbor area!  You captured the challenge very well to me but the balance of light from the left to the right is just a bit to much, to bright on the left.  I like the way the line of boats draw your eye all around the shot but the masts are so empty, adds a sense of sadness, too bad you couldn''t get them all to raise their sails for your shot! :)', '2003-10-12 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447915, 41065, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice ''glow'' and reflections.  Good angle, too.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice ''glow'' and reflections.  Good angle, too.', '2003-10-12 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(447918, 41216, 12809, '<td valign="top">Was this taken through a window?  Maybe there was just something on your lens.  I seem to see a few spots near the center of the image.  Also, placing the "Selver" sign a little more to the left (near the 2/3 mark) might work better.<br/> <br/>Nice try.</td>', 'Was this taken through a window?  Maybe there was just something on your lens.  I seem to see a few spots near the center of the image.  Also, placing the "Selver" sign a little more to the left (near the 2/3 mark) might work better. Nice try.', '2003-10-12 19:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447920, 40873, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks so familier to me but seeing the Saks Fifth Aveneu on the left I know I''ve never been there.  I origininally score this shot low because the roof top on the left was distracting and the shot itself was extremely busy, too much to absorb in a short time span.  But coming back and taking more time with it, the roof top actually adds to the shot, reminds me of a giraffe, don''t ask me why!  The busy feel of the shot helps add to the challenge meeting aspect of the area.  The only thing that could have made this better for me was a bit more brightness.  Score going up at least 5 points.</td>', 'This looks so familier to me but seeing the Saks Fifth Aveneu on the left I know I''ve never been there.  I origininally score this shot low because the roof top on the left was distracting and the shot itself was extremely busy, too much to absorb in a short time span.  But coming back and taking more time with it, the roof top actually adds to the shot, reminds me of a giraffe, don''t ask me why!  The busy feel of the shot helps add to the challenge meeting aspect of the area.  The only thing that could have made this better for me was a bit more brightness.  Score going up at least 5 points.', '2003-10-12 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447925, 41346, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  I like how the boats wrap around from one side of the photo to the other.  The reflections are great, too.  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  I like how the boats wrap around from one side of the photo to the other.  The reflections are great, too.  Nice job.', '2003-10-12 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(447926, 40931, 12448, '<td valign="top">Upon first glance and score run I score this one very low and upon coming back and looking again I think I know why.  The dark center of the shot where the row of buildings run up was too much darkness for me along with the upper right corner.  But now that I''ve come back and looked again I see it really adds to the shot and helps with the overall balance and concept.  A bit more sharpness would have scored you much higher with me but for now the score will go up at least 3 points.</td>', 'Upon first glance and score run I score this one very low and upon coming back and looking again I think I know why.  The dark center of the shot where the row of buildings run up was too much darkness for me along with the upper right corner.  But now that I''ve come back and looked again I see it really adds to the shot and helps with the overall balance and concept.  A bit more sharpness would have scored you much higher with me but for now the score will go up at least 3 points.', '2003-10-12 19:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(447928, 41331, 12448, '<td valign="top">The colors and shadows on this shot work fairly well for you though the left side looks rather washed out and a bit too bright to the right.  The building in the center back is very distracting and keeps drawing you away from the subject set forth in your title.  Focus is slightly off and the whole image could have been sharpened just a tad.</td>', 'The colors and shadows on this shot work fairly well for you though the left side looks rather washed out and a bit too bright to the right.  The building in the center back is very distracting and keeps drawing you away from the subject set forth in your title.  Focus is slightly off and the whole image could have been sharpened just a tad.', '2003-10-12 19:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447929, 40952, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great symmetry here.  Beautiful reflections and good angle.  nice work.</td>', 'Wow.  Great symmetry here.  Beautiful reflections and good angle.  nice work.', '2003-10-12 19:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(447931, 41218, 12809, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Just found my favorite so far.  Nice job!</td>', 'WOW!  Just found my favorite so far.  Nice job!', '2003-10-12 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(447932, 40622, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a lovely building.  The off center of the fountain and the building (the tree on the left makes the building look off center) are a bit distracting, maybe a slightly different angle or different cropping.  Also the coloring, I can see a bit of blue sky peeking through the clouds in the sky but the building looks a bit too yellow,.</td>', 'What a lovely building.  The off center of the fountain and the building (the tree on the left makes the building look off center) are a bit distracting, maybe a slightly different angle or different cropping.  Also the coloring, I can see a bit of blue sky peeking through the clouds in the sky but the building looks a bit too yellow,.', '2003-10-12 19:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447933, 41262, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  The angles of the stairs are great.  Love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Very nice work.  The angles of the stairs are great.  Love the b&w.', '2003-10-12 19:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447935, 40432, 12809, '<td valign="top">Love all the different lines and angles.  Really nice shot taken at a unique perspective.  Nice job.</td>', 'Love all the different lines and angles.  Really nice shot taken at a unique perspective.  Nice job.', '2003-10-12 19:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(447936, 41129, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the setup of this picture; the angle, the building itself, the statue.  I don''t really care for the colors chosen, though.  I think this would look beautiful in it''s natural colors.</td>', 'I like the setup of this picture; the angle, the building itself, the statue.  I don''t really care for the colors chosen, though.  I think this would look beautiful in it''s natural colors.', '2003-10-12 19:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
