(447939, 40758, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  Love all of  the arches.  Cool photo.</td>', 'This is really nice.  Love all of  the arches.  Cool photo.', '2003-10-12 19:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(447940, 41089, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image.  I love everything about it - the color of the sky, the arches of the builiding.  Super job.</td>', 'This is a powerful image.  I love everything about it - the color of the sky, the arches of the builiding.  Super job.', '2003-10-12 19:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447941, 41177, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Beautiful building and like the sepia.  One minor thing - The grass standing up at the bottom middle is a little distracting; could''ve just bent it over before snapping.  But sometimes it''s easy to miss the little things. <br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Beautiful building and like the sepia.  One minor thing - The grass standing up at the bottom middle is a little distracting; could''ve just bent it over before snapping.  But sometimes it''s easy to miss the little things.  Nice job.', '2003-10-12 19:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
