(447979, 40671, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Like the angle the building go in at and the b&amp;w.  Is this in Malaysia?  I think I remember seeing how this was built on tv. :-)<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Like the angle the building go in at and the b&w.  Is this in Malaysia?  I think I remember seeing how this was built on tv. :-) Nice job.', '2003-10-12 20:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447981, 41410, 7467, '<td valign="top">Nice, very clear shot. Maybe a little less water (though the reflection of the tall buildings does have a nice effect).</td>', 'Nice, very clear shot. Maybe a little less water (though the reflection of the tall buildings does have a nice effect).', '2003-10-12 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447984, 41165, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture!  Totally different take on the theme.  Love all the crosses sticking up, the negative space above, and the b&amp;w. <br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'This is an awesome picture!  Totally different take on the theme.  Love all the crosses sticking up, the negative space above, and the b&w.  Great job!', '2003-10-12 20:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(447985, 40796, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool subject.  Seems a little blurry and could use some USM.  The gray mass in the top right corner is distracting.  Parts of the sky are purple - may be from compression?  Also, a little CCW rotation might help straighten the buildings.<br/> <br/>Nice attempt.</td>', 'Cool subject.  Seems a little blurry and could use some USM.  The gray mass in the top right corner is distracting.  Parts of the sky are purple - may be from compression?  Also, a little CCW rotation might help straighten the buildings. Nice attempt.', '2003-10-12 20:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447987, 41340, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - The Citadel.  I was just there in August.  Like how you included the bus, it shows activity.  Nice colors.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot - The Citadel.  I was just there in August.  Like how you included the bus, it shows activity.  Nice colors.  Good job.', '2003-10-12 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447988, 41370, 12809, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.  Seems like it could use a bit more contrast.  Nice job.</td>', 'Pretty shot.  Seems like it could use a bit more contrast.  Nice job.', '2003-10-12 20:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(447990, 40474, 7467, '<td valign="top">I would zoom in on the village and reduce the sky significantly.</td>', 'I would zoom in on the village and reduce the sky significantly.', '2003-10-12 20:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447997, 40653, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette framed by a great shot of the sunset/sunrise. The silhouette is very bold and the contrast is really good. Very interesting shapes. "9"</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette framed by a great shot of the sunset/sunrise. The silhouette is very bold and the contrast is really good. Very interesting shapes. "9"', '2003-10-12 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447998, 41162, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night time shot. The lights are great. The trailing of the car lights are perfectly shot. The exposure was done perfectly. The landscape and outline of the city is framed well with the great blue hues in the sky. Absolutely beautiful. Should make it a postcard. "10"</td>', 'Beautiful night time shot. The lights are great. The trailing of the car lights are perfectly shot. The exposure was done perfectly. The landscape and outline of the city is framed well with the great blue hues in the sky. Absolutely beautiful. Should make it a postcard. "10"', '2003-10-12 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(448000, 40644, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful patterns and colors. Good composition. Some noise, but it doesn''t detract from the image. Nice photo. Doesn''t meet the challenge, despite the clever title.</td>', 'Beautiful patterns and colors. Good composition. Some noise, but it doesn''t detract from the image. Nice photo. Doesn''t meet the challenge, despite the clever title.', '2003-10-12 20:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448003, 41302, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The slow shutterspeed helps bump up the intensity of the lights and gives the shot great interest. I like how your eyes will look back at the buildings and the beautiful hues in the sky . You eyes are also led around the corner of the roadway. A lot to look at. "10"</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The slow shutterspeed helps bump up the intensity of the lights and gives the shot great interest. I like how your eyes will look back at the buildings and the beautiful hues in the sky . You eyes are also led around the corner of the roadway. A lot to look at. "10"', '2003-10-12 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(448005, 41389, 11570, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry - the exposure look spot on well done.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry - the exposure look spot on well done.', '2003-10-12 20:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(448006, 41102, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast on the buildings. Makes it look like a futuristic urban landscape from a movie. The hues of colors you have in the sky incredible. Love the fluffy clouds. The rounded structure has a great curvy shape and helps to lead your eyes to the background. Excellent shot. "10"</td>', 'I like the contrast on the buildings. Makes it look like a futuristic urban landscape from a movie. The hues of colors you have in the sky incredible. Love the fluffy clouds. The rounded structure has a great curvy shape and helps to lead your eyes to the background. Excellent shot. "10"', '2003-10-12 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(448007, 41054, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is familiar territory to me.  I nearly submitted a very different view of the same area.</td>', 'This is familiar territory to me.  I nearly submitted a very different view of the same area.', '2003-10-12 20:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(448012, 41185, 11570, '<td valign="top">A picture within a picture - overall exposure looks good.<br/> <br/>The use of a patio door for the reflection leaves me wanting to see the whole door, in other words I would like to see the setting for whole image.</td>', 'A picture within a picture - overall exposure looks good. The use of a patio door for the reflection leaves me wanting to see the whole door, in other words I would like to see the setting for whole image.', '2003-10-12 20:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(448013, 40800, 10370, '<td valign="top">Great shot but doesn''t fit the challenge at all ! Was this a mistake?</td>', 'Great shot but doesn''t fit the challenge at all ! Was this a mistake?', '2003-10-12 20:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(448014, 40540, 7467, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, very nice.</td>', 'Love this shot, very nice.', '2003-10-12 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(448016, 41218, 7467, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the glow on the horizon.</td>', 'Very nice! Love the glow on the horizon.', '2003-10-12 21:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(448018, 41262, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen - great angular patterns.<br/> <br/>The use of B&amp;W add to the sense of grit and grime.</td>', 'Nicely seen - great angular patterns. The use of B&W add to the sense of grit and grime.', '2003-10-12 21:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(448026, 41008, 10402, '<td valign="top">A unique high key, high contrast approach. You''ve executed it well; the elements are easily recognizable, yet the image has a nice abstract quality to it.</td>', 'A unique high key, high contrast approach. You''ve executed it well; the elements are easily recognizable, yet the image has a nice abstract quality to it.', '2003-10-12 21:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448030, 40861, 11570, '<td valign="top">An invitation picture - one that you want to "go in to" but I think it would benefit from having much less foreground.  At the very least cropped to the line where the shadow steps in on the right and the wall buttress on the left are.</td>', 'An invitation picture - one that you want to "go in to" but I think it would benefit from having much less foreground.  At the very least cropped to the line where the shadow steps in on the right and the wall buttress on the left are.', '2003-10-12 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448031, 41085, 10402, '<td valign="top">Although the clouds are nice, the city lights (the real subject of this image) are burned out and blend into each other.</td>', 'Although the clouds are nice, the city lights (the real subject of this image) are burned out and blend into each other.', '2003-10-12 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(448033, 41381, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a reflection shot but IMO it does not quite come off.  Perhaps a change of angle that would have revealed more of the reflected building.</td>', 'Nice idea for a reflection shot but IMO it does not quite come off.  Perhaps a change of angle that would have revealed more of the reflected building.', '2003-10-12 21:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(448035, 40644, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, too bad that wasn''t the point of the challenge. There seems to be a lot of noise.  I do see the light pole in the bottom center. I''d feel bad if that''s all the urbaness you have around you to photograph and I gave you a low score.</td>', 'Beautiful sky, too bad that wasn''t the point of the challenge. There seems to be a lot of noise.  I do see the light pole in the bottom center. I''d feel bad if that''s all the urbaness you have around you to photograph and I gave you a low score.', '2003-10-12 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(448036, 40653, 10402, '<td valign="top">The interesting shape of this oil rig makes an interesting silhouette. I don''t really call it a "building", though.</td>', 'The interesting shape of this oil rig makes an interesting silhouette. I don''t really call it a "building", though.', '2003-10-12 21:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(448037, 40985, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen but the large block of shadow on the left draws the eye too much.<br/> <br/>Perhaps could benefit from cropping that side to the vertical support.</td>', 'Nicely seen but the large block of shadow on the left draws the eye too much. Perhaps could benefit from cropping that side to the vertical support.', '2003-10-12 21:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(448039, 41129, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition. I like the focus on the woman. You could have even gotten closer to get more detail in her face. I don''t know if you adjusted the colors and contrast in a program, but I think they are a bit harsh although that color in your sky was popular during that era. I think I would have stood closer, more to the left (so she''s looking at me) with the building taking up most of the frame and focused only on her. Sorry. I got carried away.</td>', 'Pretty good composition. I like the focus on the woman. You could have even gotten closer to get more detail in her face. I don''t know if you adjusted the colors and contrast in a program, but I think they are a bit harsh although that color in your sky was popular during that era. I think I would have stood closer, more to the left (so she''s looking at me) with the building taking up most of the frame and focused only on her. Sorry. I got carried away.', '2003-10-12 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(448040, 40510, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I like the variety of textures captured in this photo. It''s a bit soft, which combines with the warm colors to convey a peaceful feeling. But I''d prefer a little sharpening to enhance the textures.</td>', 'Great composition. I like the variety of textures captured in this photo. It''s a bit soft, which combines with the warm colors to convey a peaceful feeling. But I''d prefer a little sharpening to enhance the textures.', '2003-10-12 21:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(448041, 40792, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a lower score. Sorry.<br/>But, I do have some suggestions.  You have a haze over the entire image. This would suggest to me that it is overexposed. Also, if you could find a less busy location that has a curve or something, the car lights would create a more interesting pattern. Try to avoid places that have multiple light sources close to where you will be shooting from.</td>', 'I gave you a lower score. Sorry.But, I do have some suggestions.  You have a haze over the entire image. This would suggest to me that it is overexposed. Also, if you could find a less busy location that has a curve or something, the car lights would create a more interesting pattern. Try to avoid places that have multiple light sources close to where you will be shooting from.', '2003-10-12 21:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(448042, 41174, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice array of shapes, colors, and textures. Hard to tell what the center of interest is; maybe it doesn''t need one, but I''m having a hard time deciding what this image is about. The blue and red of the title are at the top and bottom of the image, separated by several layers of structure, so that doesn''t seem to be it.</td>', 'Nice array of shapes, colors, and textures. Hard to tell what the center of interest is; maybe it doesn''t need one, but I''m having a hard time deciding what this image is about. The blue and red of the title are at the top and bottom of the image, separated by several layers of structure, so that doesn''t seem to be it.', '2003-10-12 21:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(448044, 41218, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wow! 10</td>', 'Wow! 10', '2003-10-12 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(448045, 41256, 11800, '<td valign="top">I really want to say something mean, but I realize you took time to take this and to post it, so it means something to you. Maybe a better angle of view would have given you a more interesting composition and helped you avoid the extreme flare.</td>', 'I really want to say something mean, but I realize you took time to take this and to post it, so it means something to you. Maybe a better angle of view would have given you a more interesting composition and helped you avoid the extreme flare.', '2003-10-12 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(448046, 40463, 11800, '<td valign="top">I just bumped you from a 4 to a 5. It meets the challenge, it''s exposed correctly but I don''t connect with it at all.</td>', 'I just bumped you from a 4 to a 5. It meets the challenge, it''s exposed correctly but I don''t connect with it at all.', '2003-10-12 21:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(448056, 41303, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks a tad underexposed to me. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Looks a tad underexposed to me. Nice composition though.', '2003-10-12 22:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(448057, 41311, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like the grain of this shot but it looks like you have a few water spots on your lens.</td>', 'I like the grain of this shot but it looks like you have a few water spots on your lens.', '2003-10-12 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(448059, 41046, 2279, '<td valign="top">The really close orange flower is really distracting from your subject.</td>', 'The really close orange flower is really distracting from your subject.', '2003-10-12 22:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(448060, 41258, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow that sky is REALLY bright.</td>', 'Wow that sky is REALLY bright.', '2003-10-12 23:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(448062, 40887, 2279, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a little underexposed to me.</td>', 'This shot looks a little underexposed to me.', '2003-10-12 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(448063, 41353, 2279, '<td valign="top">Yet another underexposed shot this challenge. When the sky is this bright your cameras meter makes everything darker so you need to manually overexpose your shot one or maybe two stops. PM me if you have questions.</td>', 'Yet another underexposed shot this challenge. When the sky is this bright your cameras meter makes everything darker so you need to manually overexpose your shot one or maybe two stops. PM me if you have questions.', '2003-10-12 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(448067, 41362, 2279, '<td valign="top">This must be Heather. Nice shot I love the effect of the lights. Is this a star cross filter or just from the long exposure?</td>', 'This must be Heather. Nice shot I love the effect of the lights. Is this a star cross filter or just from the long exposure?', '2003-10-12 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(448069, 41256, 2279, '<td valign="top">The light reflecting from the window is so bright that it threw your meter off and underexposed your shot. The lens flare is a little distracting also.</td>', 'The light reflecting from the window is so bright that it threw your meter off and underexposed your shot. The lens flare is a little distracting also.', '2003-10-12 23:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(448071, 41367, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset but your shot is overall underexposed. You lost a lot of detail in the building. Maybe manually overexposing a stop or two would have brought out more detail in the building.</td>', 'Nice sunset but your shot is overall underexposed. You lost a lot of detail in the building. Maybe manually overexposing a stop or two would have brought out more detail in the building.', '2003-10-12 23:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(448073, 41262, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very sharp image. Exposure is right on, shadows add a nice touch. Composition is excellent. Congradulations. 10.</td>', 'Very sharp image. Exposure is right on, shadows add a nice touch. Composition is excellent. Congradulations. 10.', '2003-10-12 23:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(448076, 40938, 6624, '<td valign="top">I am missing your intent with this image - I would appreciate your letting me know what this is about</td>', 'I am missing your intent with this image - I would appreciate your letting me know what this is about', '2003-10-12 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(448077, 41410, 2279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections. Composition and exposure are perfect. Very nice. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections. Composition and exposure are perfect. Very nice. 9.', '2003-10-12 23:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(448080, 40764, 2279, '<td valign="top">A little too much post processing for my taste.</td>', 'A little too much post processing for my taste.', '2003-10-12 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(448081, 40888, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks too me like you should have used a tripod. Too much blur to consider this an acceptable shot.</td>', 'Looks too me like you should have used a tripod. Too much blur to consider this an acceptable shot.', '2003-10-12 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(448085, 41251, 2279, '<td valign="top">This shot look a little bit underexposed. Maybe by manually overexposing one stop would have helped a bit.</td>', 'This shot look a little bit underexposed. Maybe by manually overexposing one stop would have helped a bit.', '2003-10-13 00:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(448086, 40983, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very nice color saturation in this image. Plenty of highlights in the church and lots of shadows in the trees. Very nice image. Congradulations. 10.</td>', 'Very nice color saturation in this image. Plenty of highlights in the church and lots of shadows in the trees. Very nice image. Congradulations. 10.', '2003-10-13 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(448087, 41046, 205, '<td valign="top">what the hell is that thing?</td>', 'what the hell is that thing?', '2003-10-13 00:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
