(448090, 41395, 205, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out more of the non-interesting sky.</td>', 'I would have cropped out more of the non-interesting sky.', '2003-10-13 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(448091, 41324, 205, '<td valign="top">it would seem that your white balance is off.</td>', 'it would seem that your white balance is off.', '2003-10-13 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(448092, 41128, 205, '<td valign="top">thats interesting</td>', 'thats interesting', '2003-10-13 00:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(448094, 41264, 205, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the bottom tree and boat, its distracting to your overall composition.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the bottom tree and boat, its distracting to your overall composition.', '2003-10-13 00:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(448095, 41152, 205, '<td valign="top">this would have made a great panoramic</td>', 'this would have made a great panoramic', '2003-10-13 00:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(448101, 40640, 12448, '<td valign="top">Despite the lack of buildings and actual landscape as stated in the challenge you have conveyed a sense of urban with this shot!  Amazing, I''ve come back to it several times trying to figure out just how and I think it''s the iron itself, the weed in the sidewalk and the general mood of the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Despite the lack of buildings and actual landscape as stated in the challenge you have conveyed a sense of urban with this shot!  Amazing, I''ve come back to it several times trying to figure out just how and I think it''s the iron itself, the weed in the sidewalk and the general mood of the shot.  Well done.', '2003-10-13 00:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448103, 41343, 12448, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot and an interesting house but it really doesn''t convey a sense of urban to me, more upper class but that''s just me.  I realize the shot is in the fog, hence the softer focus but the shot is almost washed out at the top, a bit distracting.</td>', 'A lovely shot and an interesting house but it really doesn''t convey a sense of urban to me, more upper class but that''s just me.  I realize the shot is in the fog, hence the softer focus but the shot is almost washed out at the top, a bit distracting.', '2003-10-13 00:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(448105, 40760, 205, '<td valign="top">great angle</td>', 'great angle', '2003-10-13 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(448106, 41394, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this shot was at dusk, hence the darker lighting and the lights coming on in the cars.  The sky colors are interesting but I think I would have liked it better if there parking lot was more cropped out, more buildings in focus of the shot.</td>', 'I''m guessing this shot was at dusk, hence the darker lighting and the lights coming on in the cars.  The sky colors are interesting but I think I would have liked it better if there parking lot was more cropped out, more buildings in focus of the shot.', '2003-10-13 00:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448107, 41152, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the background, a sharper focus on the buildings would have made me rate this much higher</td>', 'Nice colors in the background, a sharper focus on the buildings would have made me rate this much higher', '2003-10-13 00:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(448110, 41390, 205, '<td valign="top">nice use of natural framing</td>', 'nice use of natural framing', '2003-10-13 00:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(448111, 41187, 12448, '<td valign="top">The colors in the sky are stunning, really grabbed my attention but the foreground is cluttered, busy and too much out of focus.  Maybe a little tighter crop on the building itself?</td>', 'The colors in the sky are stunning, really grabbed my attention but the foreground is cluttered, busy and too much out of focus.  Maybe a little tighter crop on the building itself?', '2003-10-13 00:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(448113, 40759, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sharp, crisp, clear and the sun coming up to provide almost perfect lighting.  The only distraction for me was the darkness on the bottom but again it helps add to the shot at the same time.  The tree on the right is more distracting.</td>', 'Sharp, crisp, clear and the sun coming up to provide almost perfect lighting.  The only distraction for me was the darkness on the bottom but again it helps add to the shot at the same time.  The tree on the right is more distracting.', '2003-10-13 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(448114, 41372, 205, '<td valign="top">little boxes, mine has trees</td>', 'little boxes, mine has trees', '2003-10-13 00:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(448116, 41324, 12448, '<td valign="top">A bit small and the car on the left is very distracting, a tighter crop, a larger picture would have gotten a much higher score.  The light is good though the sky looks a bit washed out.</td>', 'A bit small and the car on the left is very distracting, a tighter crop, a larger picture would have gotten a much higher score.  The light is good though the sky looks a bit washed out.', '2003-10-13 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(448118, 40463, 205, '<td valign="top">is that the winchester mansion?</td>', 'is that the winchester mansion?', '2003-10-13 00:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(448120, 40796, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the title but this does fit the challenge.  The only things I would have changed is the lamp post on the left, very distracting and takes away from the buildings themselves.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the title but this does fit the challenge.  The only things I would have changed is the lamp post on the left, very distracting and takes away from the buildings themselves.', '2003-10-13 00:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(448124, 41281, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the reflections of the light. The quality seems off... not enough pixels? I have a nice winter shot of this building taken from Boston Common in winter... people iceskating in the foreground. I once worked at Charleys on Newberry so I saw a lot of this building. Boston is an awesome place for urban shots.</td>', 'I like the colors and the reflections of the light. The quality seems off... not enough pixels? I have a nice winter shot of this building taken from Boston Common in winter... people iceskating in the foreground. I once worked at Charleys on Newberry so I saw a lot of this building. Boston is an awesome place for urban shots.', '2003-10-13 00:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(448125, 41379, 12448, '<td valign="top">It looks like a lovely town, nice and quiet at night.  The overall picture is a bit dark but the slant of the shot is wonderful as it draws me in on the left and takes me all the way accross</td>', 'It looks like a lovely town, nice and quiet at night.  The overall picture is a bit dark but the slant of the shot is wonderful as it draws me in on the left and takes me all the way accross', '2003-10-13 00:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(448129, 41364, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a more effective shot had you cropped more off the bottom. I realize you liked the reflection of the chapel, but there is too much uninteresting foreground in the image.</td>', 'I think this would have been a more effective shot had you cropped more off the bottom. I realize you liked the reflection of the chapel, but there is too much uninteresting foreground in the image.', '2003-10-13 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448130, 41214, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I originally scored it low because I found the circle very distracting but as I''ve come back to it several times I realize that it''s a perfect lead in to the shot itself.  Very nice colors, if the circle was perfect, not cut off on the top and bottom this would have been a 9 or 10</td>', 'I love this shot.  I originally scored it low because I found the circle very distracting but as I''ve come back to it several times I realize that it''s a perfect lead in to the shot itself.  Very nice colors, if the circle was perfect, not cut off on the top and bottom this would have been a 9 or 10', '2003-10-13 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448131, 41242, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, I guess!  I find those shadows extremely distracting and really taking away from the picture myself.  I think I would have liked this shot much better with full light.  Otherwise, crisp, clear and the black and white works very well</td>', 'Wow, I guess!  I find those shadows extremely distracting and really taking away from the picture myself.  I think I would have liked this shot much better with full light.  Otherwise, crisp, clear and the black and white works very well', '2003-10-13 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(448132, 40747, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition you are showing, but I would have cropped out the logos and streetlight at the bottom. Then you could have also removed some of the featureless sky and had the striking contrast you are conceptualizing.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition you are showing, but I would have cropped out the logos and streetlight at the bottom. Then you could have also removed some of the featureless sky and had the striking contrast you are conceptualizing.', '2003-10-13 00:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(448133, 41239, 12448, '<td valign="top">The black and white hurts this shot I feel, the buildings all end up blending in with each other and there is no real distinction between them.  The shot is wonderful otherwise.</td>', 'The black and white hurts this shot I feel, the buildings all end up blending in with each other and there is no real distinction between them.  The shot is wonderful otherwise.', '2003-10-13 00:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(448135, 40860, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot but the duotones do nothing for me.  I would have liked to seen this in it''s original color or even black and white for comparision.  I love the perspective and the sense of urban is very strong.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot but the duotones do nothing for me.  I would have liked to seen this in it''s original color or even black and white for comparision.  I love the perspective and the sense of urban is very strong.', '2003-10-13 00:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(448137, 40764, 8624, '<td valign="top">a nice sillouette with a dramatic sky, but the city profile looks artifically dark.</td>', 'a nice sillouette with a dramatic sky, but the city profile looks artifically dark.', '2003-10-13 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(448138, 41404, 12448, '<td valign="top">A sad state of affairs, no doubt.  This really meets the challenge without a doubt but the shot itself leaves me wanting.  The coloring is so muted and the light in the shot is so dull overall.</td>', 'A sad state of affairs, no doubt.  This really meets the challenge without a doubt but the shot itself leaves me wanting.  The coloring is so muted and the light in the shot is so dull overall.', '2003-10-13 00:49:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(448140, 41211, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love how in the river of light that is the road....All the cars facing this way are waiting for the red light.  What luck in an obvious slow shutter shot...Very nice image but IMHO a touch to sharp...looks almost surreal.  Love the stopped cars though!  That''s where my eye stops every time!</td>', 'I love how in the river of light that is the road....All the cars facing this way are waiting for the red light.  What luck in an obvious slow shutter shot...Very nice image but IMHO a touch to sharp...looks almost surreal.  Love the stopped cars though!  That''s where my eye stops every time!', '2003-10-13 00:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(448141, 41088, 8624, '<td valign="top">good textures create a nice abstract image</td>', 'good textures create a nice abstract image', '2003-10-13 00:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(448142, 41353, 12448, '<td valign="top">CINDERELLA!  :)  The tower at the top was cut off, first thing I noticed and then was drawn to the people crossing the draw bridge.  I think different cropping would have worked a little better with this and taken me back to another era of urban.</td>', 'CINDERELLA!  :)  The tower at the top was cut off, first thing I noticed and then was drawn to the people crossing the draw bridge.  I think different cropping would have worked a little better with this and taken me back to another era of urban.', '2003-10-13 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(448143, 41233, 205, '<td valign="top">oh yay! they have those all around salem where I live. I like the juxtoposition here</td>', 'oh yay! they have those all around salem where I live. I like the juxtoposition here', '2003-10-13 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(448144, 40822, 12448, '<td valign="top">Definte meeting of the challenge.  The sense of urban is very strong in this shot, the only thing I find wanting is the contrast of the shot and just a tad to dark for me.</td>', 'Definte meeting of the challenge.  The sense of urban is very strong in this shot, the only thing I find wanting is the contrast of the shot and just a tad to dark for me.', '2003-10-13 00:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(448145, 41218, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!!!!  This is so impressive overall!  The colors, the sharpness, the clarity is amazing!  The only thing to me is that there are so many lights it almost makes the picture look noisy! ;)</td>', 'WOW!!!!!!!  This is so impressive overall!  The colors, the sharpness, the clarity is amazing!  The only thing to me is that there are so many lights it almost makes the picture look noisy! ;)', '2003-10-13 00:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(448146, 41225, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting color, but the siloutted object is too unrecognizable</td>', 'I like the lighting color, but the siloutted object is too unrecognizable', '2003-10-13 00:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(448148, 41149, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the strong lighting on the foreground buildings and the subtler lights on the ones in the distance. I would have cropped out the pipes at the bottom and the streetlight on the right. The horizon looks crooked as well.</td>', 'I like the strong lighting on the foreground buildings and the subtler lights on the ones in the distance. I would have cropped out the pipes at the bottom and the streetlight on the right. The horizon looks crooked as well.', '2003-10-13 00:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(448150, 40564, 6477, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. The concept is real good and the light superb. BTW one of my fav movie... Good luck 9</td>', 'Excellent image. The concept is real good and the light superb. BTW one of my fav movie... Good luck 9', '2003-10-13 00:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(448151, 40606, 8624, '<td valign="top">great sky. this would have been a terrific image had the skyline been sharper.</td>', 'great sky. this would have been a terrific image had the skyline been sharper.', '2003-10-13 00:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(448152, 40697, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, at first I didn''t really like it much and scored it low but upon second consideration I find it was the left side that really distracted me and threw me.  I love the time exposure shots, the "racing" lights effect and you managed to keep the rest of the shot clear and sharp, must have been a calm night :)  Score is going way up, at least 5 points.<br/> <br/>P.S.  Did you see this one?  //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=41279  Just a little freaky, wouldn''t you say?</td>', 'Nice shot, at first I didn''t really like it much and scored it low but upon second consideration I find it was the left side that really distracted me and threw me.  I love the time exposure shots, the "racing" lights effect and you managed to keep the rest of the shot clear and sharp, must have been a calm night :)  Score is going way up, at least 5 points. P.S.  Did you see this one?  //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=41279  Just a little freaky, wouldn''t you say?', '2003-10-13 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(448153, 41014, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping on this shot, it draws you in without overpowering you but the colors are washed out, probably the morning mist, maybe if the shot had been taken when it was a bit clearer?</td>', 'I like the cropping on this shot, it draws you in without overpowering you but the colors are washed out, probably the morning mist, maybe if the shot had been taken when it was a bit clearer?', '2003-10-13 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(448154, 41279, 12448, '<td valign="top">Didn\''t I just vote on this one?  This looks very familier to another of the shots entered!  YES I DID!  Look at this:  //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=40697  Freaky!  Well, you did crop tighter than the other shot and that was my biggest complaint on that one, the cropping.</td>', 'Didn\''t I just vote on this one?  This looks very familier to another of the shots entered!  YES I DID!  Look at this:  //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=40697  Freaky!  Well, you did crop tighter than the other shot and that was my biggest complaint on that one, the cropping.', '2003-10-13 00:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(448155, 41065, 6477, '<td valign="top">Very good work and lovely colors. The composition of the image is good. I would love to visit this City sometime!</td>', 'Very good work and lovely colors. The composition of the image is good. I would love to visit this City sometime!', '2003-10-13 01:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(448179, 40404, 205, '<td valign="top">how is it that the water is multi colored?</td>', 'how is it that the water is multi colored?', '2003-10-13 01:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(448187, 41355, 12448, '<td valign="top">This all happened in a year?  YIKES!  The shot is well done, the darkness on the right side is a bit distracting but otherwise I love the overall shot</td>', 'This all happened in a year?  YIKES!  The shot is well done, the darkness on the right side is a bit distracting but otherwise I love the overall shot', '2003-10-13 01:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(448190, 40736, 205, '<td valign="top">put more perspective in your shot if your gonna call it main street</td>', 'put more perspective in your shot if your gonna call it main street', '2003-10-13 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(448195, 40887, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the cropping on this, the ferris wheel draws you in and the bridge draws you across.  But the lighting and the hues really leave a lot to be desired</td>', 'I love the cropping on this, the ferris wheel draws you in and the bridge draws you across.  But the lighting and the hues really leave a lot to be desired', '2003-10-13 01:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(448196, 40983, 205, '<td valign="top">i''d give you a 10 if I didn''t feel that the colors were manipulated.</td>', 'i''d give you a 10 if I didn''t feel that the colors were manipulated.', '2003-10-13 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448197, 41342, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the concept you went for but it fell just short for me personally.  The orange is a bit too much, if it was toned down just a hair I would have loved this shot much more.  The brightness on the right is very distracting to me.</td>', 'I like the concept you went for but it fell just short for me personally.  The orange is a bit too much, if it was toned down just a hair I would have loved this shot much more.  The brightness on the right is very distracting to me.', '2003-10-13 01:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(448198, 41344, 12448, '<td valign="top">Rural urban, very well done.  Just a bit too fuzzy and the colors could be punched up just a bit.</td>', 'Rural urban, very well done.  Just a bit too fuzzy and the colors could be punched up just a bit.', '2003-10-13 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(448200, 41218, 205, '<td valign="top">wow, you actually got the stars in the shot, how long was the expsosure?</td>', 'wow, you actually got the stars in the shot, how long was the expsosure?', '2003-10-13 01:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(448202, 40800, 205, '<td valign="top">oregon? hmm don''t see anything urban about it. but still pretty.</td>', 'oregon? hmm don''t see anything urban about it. but still pretty.', '2003-10-13 01:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(448205, 41180, 205, '<td valign="top">something about this photo seems computer generated.</td>', 'something about this photo seems computer generated.', '2003-10-13 01:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(448238, 41358, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, I used to work at a Lyric Theatre (in Hammersmith, London UK), where the back door was even less appealing than this! Like the interplay of colours here, though it looks a lot like an unconsidered snap-shot, and I don''t think will do well on dpc. A pity, as it has a lot going for it - a nice study of the ignored spaces of our nasty urban world, huh? And right behind one of the places you''d expect to have a little more awareness ...</td>', 'Strangely enough, I used to work at a Lyric Theatre (in Hammersmith, London UK), where the back door was even less appealing than this! Like the interplay of colours here, though it looks a lot like an unconsidered snap-shot, and I don''t think will do well on dpc. A pity, as it has a lot going for it - a nice study of the ignored spaces of our nasty urban world, huh? And right behind one of the places you''d expect to have a little more awareness ...', '2003-10-13 01:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(448257, 41214, 8624, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2003-10-13 01:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(448264, 40676, 12848, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot!', '2003-10-13 02:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(448268, 41218, 12848, '<td valign="top">Impressive view!</td>', 'Impressive view!', '2003-10-13 02:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(448321, 41180, 9027, '<td valign="top">great capture. almost has this fish eye feel. nice simple framing.</td>', 'great capture. almost has this fish eye feel. nice simple framing.', '2003-10-13 02:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(448325, 40858, 9027, '<td valign="top">good subject matter. could use adjustments in saturation/constrast to bring out the colors. another option is to take a less direct shot. not so straight on.</td>', 'good subject matter. could use adjustments in saturation/constrast to bring out the colors. another option is to take a less direct shot. not so straight on.', '2003-10-13 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(448330, 41165, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice. good use of b/w treatment. gray tones help convey the gloomy, solemn feel.</td>', 'nice. good use of b/w treatment. gray tones help convey the gloomy, solemn feel.', '2003-10-13 02:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(448337, 41374, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the colors in this image. has potential, but would be stronger with adjustments in brightness and saturation to make the colors stand out more and add more light to image.</td>', 'i like the colors in this image. has potential, but would be stronger with adjustments in brightness and saturation to make the colors stand out more and add more light to image.', '2003-10-13 02:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(448340, 40473, 9027, '<td valign="top">well done! love the angle used and the simplicity of the composition. very striking. sepia works well.</td>', 'well done! love the angle used and the simplicity of the composition. very striking. sepia works well.', '2003-10-13 02:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448343, 41008, 9027, '<td valign="top">cool effects (is it legal?). has a feel of an architectural draft.</td>', 'cool effects (is it legal?). has a feel of an architectural draft.', '2003-10-13 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(448345, 40701, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice capture. love the dominating gray tones and cropping.</td>', 'nice capture. love the dominating gray tones and cropping.', '2003-10-13 02:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(448346, 40787, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice subject matter. i think small tweeks in levels/contrast would make the building ''pop'' more.</td>', 'nice subject matter. i think small tweeks in levels/contrast would make the building ''pop'' more.', '2003-10-13 02:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(448348, 41281, 9027, '<td valign="top">still can''t believe something as bad as pollution could create something so pretty. :o)</td>', 'still can''t believe something as bad as pollution could create something so pretty. :o)', '2003-10-13 02:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(448352, 41184, 9027, '<td valign="top">image could use some sharpness and contrast, but love the idea (repetitve shapes geometric shapes vs delicate balconies, the colors,etc) . :o)</td>', 'image could use some sharpness and contrast, but love the idea (repetitve shapes geometric shapes vs delicate balconies, the colors,etc) . :o)', '2003-10-13 02:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(448354, 40884, 9027, '<td valign="top">great textures/shapes created by the buildings, but feels a bit out of focus</td>', 'great textures/shapes created by the buildings, but feels a bit out of focus', '2003-10-13 02:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(448358, 41288, 9027, '<td valign="top">cool building! hehe.</td>', 'cool building! hehe.', '2003-10-13 02:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(448389, 41007, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7<br/>Photo seems a little flat and lifeless, but I do like the single point of light -- I guess I''m contradicting myself.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7Photo seems a little flat and lifeless, but I do like the single point of light -- I guess I''m contradicting myself.', '2003-10-13 03:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448391, 41327, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7<br/>Too white -- near blown out in spots. Overall effect makes it look like a ''clean city'' though.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 7Too white -- near blown out in spots. Overall effect makes it look like a ''clean city'' though.', '2003-10-13 03:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(448396, 40858, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8<br/>The challenge called for ''pictures of buildings (plural), but from a strictly "Urban" perspective, I think you nailed it. Again though, you missed the "landscape" part of the challenge. Still, love the colors.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8The challenge called for ''pictures of buildings (plural), but from a strictly "Urban" perspective, I think you nailed it. Again though, you missed the "landscape" part of the challenge. Still, love the colors.', '2003-10-13 03:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(448401, 41187, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6<br/>First, I''m amazed it seems you''ve got people frozen like it was a quick shutter, but yet this looks like a night shot which would require a long exposure -- how did you do that? Well, perhaps because it wasn''t yet dark yet? I see the clouds in the dark blue sky which wouldn''t be visible if it were purely night. Anyway, challenge points off for not having a ''photo of buildings'' (one building does not buildings make), technical points off for choice of cropping -- maybe this really should be aesthetic and not technical, but I''m going to slow as it is.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6First, I''m amazed it seems you''ve got people frozen like it was a quick shutter, but yet this looks like a night shot which would require a long exposure -- how did you do that? Well, perhaps because it wasn''t yet dark yet? I see the clouds in the dark blue sky which wouldn''t be visible if it were purely night. Anyway, challenge points off for not having a ''photo of buildings'' (one building does not buildings make), technical points off for choice of cropping -- maybe this really should be aesthetic and not technical, but I''m going to slow as it is.', '2003-10-13 03:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(448402, 41333, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8<br/>The streaks from the bus/truck are drawing my eye more than the rest of the picture, which is a shame because there are interesting things in the photo.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8The streaks from the bus/truck are drawing my eye more than the rest of the picture, which is a shame because there are interesting things in the photo.', '2003-10-13 03:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(448404, 41389, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 9<br/>Good balance of light, excellent composition.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 9Good balance of light, excellent composition.', '2003-10-13 03:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(448407, 41026, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6<br/>The ''ARTS'' is way too center. I would have cropped closer to the building. Only one building, missing the ''photo of buildings'' part of the challenge.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 2/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6The ''ARTS'' is way too center. I would have cropped closer to the building. Only one building, missing the ''photo of buildings'' part of the challenge.', '2003-10-13 03:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(448410, 40959, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 9<br/>No fair ... nothing like this in my town. Great use of color.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 9No fair ... nothing like this in my town. Great use of color.', '2003-10-13 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(448412, 40469, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 5<br/>This might have been a better ''fill the frame'' shot. I''m missing the ''urban landscape -- picture of buildings'' feel here.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 5This might have been a better ''fill the frame'' shot. I''m missing the ''urban landscape -- picture of buildings'' feel here.', '2003-10-13 03:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(448414, 40627, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 4</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 4', '2003-10-13 03:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
