(449002, 41136, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 10<br/>Nice use of the market to bring in color. It''s contrast with the cold steel and glass of the buildings is wonderful.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 3/3; total: 10Nice use of the market to bring in color. It''s contrast with the cold steel and glass of the buildings is wonderful.', '2003-10-13 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
