(449008, 41351, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8<br/>Buildings lean in a bit, but otherwise, great. I''m not sure if this can be fixed -- is perspective adjustment legal?</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 2/3; total: 8Buildings lean in a bit, but otherwise, great. I''m not sure if this can be fixed -- is perspective adjustment legal?', '2003-10-13 15:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(449009, 41338, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - could almost be a Hopper painting. I''d like to see a bit more sharpness in the architecture though. This is a good composition - I lke how you''ve placed the taller buildings toward the center - but not dead on center.</td>', 'Nice colors - could almost be a Hopper painting. I''d like to see a bit more sharpness in the architecture though. This is a good composition - I lke how you''ve placed the taller buildings toward the center - but not dead on center.', '2003-10-13 15:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(449017, 41024, 12049, '<td valign="top">I find your decision to crop off the top of the spire intriguing. It doesn''t actually hurt the photo too much, because I know there''s a spire there anyway. What it does do, however, is lead the eye out of the shot, which may not have been your original intention.<br/> <br/>From a technical perspective, consider NeatImage to reduce the noise in the sky, and maybe a crop to remove the foliage on the right.</td>', 'I find your decision to crop off the top of the spire intriguing. It doesn''t actually hurt the photo too much, because I know there''s a spire there anyway. What it does do, however, is lead the eye out of the shot, which may not have been your original intention. From a technical perspective, consider NeatImage to reduce the noise in the sky, and maybe a crop to remove the foliage on the right.', '2003-10-13 15:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(449024, 40460, 12049, '<td valign="top">This is a step above the ordinary night cityscape shot. The fog really adds a lot here, and you did well to see and capture it.</td>', 'This is a step above the ordinary night cityscape shot. The fog really adds a lot here, and you did well to see and capture it.', '2003-10-13 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(449027, 41327, 12049, '<td valign="top">Try playing with levels on this one. The tones are quite washed out - so much so that the TransAmerica lacks a bit of punch against that white sky.</td>', 'Try playing with levels on this one. The tones are quite washed out - so much so that the TransAmerica lacks a bit of punch against that white sky.', '2003-10-13 15:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449030, 41323, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and great colors. I''m not sure that the buildings have an interesting enough outline to warrant a photo however. Maybe the same shot from a different location would have worked even better.</td>', 'Nice idea, and great colors. I''m not sure that the buildings have an interesting enough outline to warrant a photo however. Maybe the same shot from a different location would have worked even better.', '2003-10-13 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(449033, 41350, 12049, '<td valign="top">This is a familiar composition, but the range of tones is quite narrow here. Color may in fact have been a better choice, adn would help llift the skyline out of its background.</td>', 'This is a familiar composition, but the range of tones is quite narrow here. Color may in fact have been a better choice, adn would help llift the skyline out of its background.', '2003-10-13 15:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449038, 40869, 12049, '<td valign="top">The sky looks pretty clear, so if you had waited a little longer you may heave got better color and better reflection.</td>', 'The sky looks pretty clear, so if you had waited a little longer you may heave got better color and better reflection.', '2003-10-13 15:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(449049, 41272, 12049, '<td valign="top">I like ithis - it just says ''busy'' to me. The construction work, the moving figures... Very nice.</td>', 'I like ithis - it just says ''busy'' to me. The construction work, the moving figures... Very nice.', '2003-10-13 15:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(449146, 41131, 9780, '<td valign="top">Good joob! 9</td>', 'Good joob! 9', '2003-10-13 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(449148, 40682, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice exposior of the buildings and pavement. 9</td>', 'Nice exposior of the buildings and pavement. 9', '2003-10-13 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(449150, 41339, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. Very simple, very clean image.</td>', 'I like the composition here. Very simple, very clean image.', '2003-10-13 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(449155, 41270, 208, '<td valign="top">The sky isn''t really interesting enough to take up so much of the frame. When you can, wait until the sky immediately above the steeple is interesting and crop the shot down farther. Just my opinion.</td>', 'The sky isn''t really interesting enough to take up so much of the frame. When you can, wait until the sky immediately above the steeple is interesting and crop the shot down farther. Just my opinion.', '2003-10-13 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(449159, 41239, 208, '<td valign="top">Black and white is a good choice here. Could use some more contrast in the sky, but that might just be a preference thing.</td>', 'Black and white is a good choice here. Could use some more contrast in the sky, but that might just be a preference thing.', '2003-10-13 17:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(449165, 41272, 208, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Oddly enough, I think the picture is even more compelling with the cranes and the one still person.</td>', 'This is excellent. Oddly enough, I think the picture is even more compelling with the cranes and the one still person.', '2003-10-13 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(449166, 41399, 208, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I want detail in the black space. I really like the play of light on the bottom building. Great shot.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I want detail in the black space. I really like the play of light on the bottom building. Great shot.', '2003-10-13 17:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(449170, 41143, 208, '<td valign="top">I took almost this exact picture this summer, but couldn''t get it to work. Yours is better. Plus a bonus point for my hometown.</td>', 'I took almost this exact picture this summer, but couldn''t get it to work. Yours is better. Plus a bonus point for my hometown.', '2003-10-13 17:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(449175, 41177, 208, '<td valign="top">The woman on the right really adds to this shot.</td>', 'The woman on the right really adds to this shot.', '2003-10-13 17:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(449179, 40474, 208, '<td valign="top">I ususally like negative space like this, but I think it''s too much this time. The buildings'' colors get lost. Still a pretty picture, though.</td>', 'I ususally like negative space like this, but I think it''s too much this time. The buildings'' colors get lost. Still a pretty picture, though.', '2003-10-13 17:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
