(449533, 41139, 12151, '<td valign="top">So close to being my top photo for this week.  Nice color, not a superficial image - it actually has that quality that makes me pause to think.  Nice job with the theme.  What barely stopped it from being my top photo was the slight blur in the background. I''d rather it be either all clear and crisp, or have a more obvious gradual blur into the background.</td>', 'So close to being my top photo for this week.  Nice color, not a superficial image - it actually has that quality that makes me pause to think.  Nice job with the theme.  What barely stopped it from being my top photo was the slight blur in the background. I''d rather it be either all clear and crisp, or have a more obvious gradual blur into the background.', '2003-10-13 22:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(449534, 41260, 12151, '<td valign="top">Makes me pause, as it''s kind of like an optical illusion... haha.</td>', 'Makes me pause, as it''s kind of like an optical illusion... haha.', '2003-10-13 22:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(449538, 41132, 12151, '<td valign="top">Clear, surreal image.  The dark background sky against the bright reflection in a man-made structure is slightly haunting.  Not sure what, if anything, you are trying to convey, though, if not just displaying a cool-looking image.  (Reminds me of Microsoft for some reason.)</td>', 'Clear, surreal image.  The dark background sky against the bright reflection in a man-made structure is slightly haunting.  Not sure what, if anything, you are trying to convey, though, if not just displaying a cool-looking image.  (Reminds me of Microsoft for some reason.)', '2003-10-13 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(449543, 41381, 12151, '<td valign="top">I\''m surprised at myself; this photo holds a lot of appeal for me, even though I\''d expect myself not to like it (because of its... oddness).  I can\''t pinpoint it, but that up-close number against the blur background is just pretty nice.</td>', 'I\''m surprised at myself; this photo holds a lot of appeal for me, even though I\''d expect myself not to like it (because of its... oddness).  I can\''t pinpoint it, but that up-close number against the blur background is just pretty nice.', '2003-10-13 22:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
