(449670, 40959, 10170, '<td valign="top">*laugh*  I am from Australia and visited NY about a month ago (GREAT place!)  One of my favorite photos I took was this exact part of Times Square.  Since I have been back this is the second time I''ve seen the same area appear in a challenge.  Happy memories :)  Nice shot as well by the way :)</td>', '*laugh*  I am from Australia and visited NY about a month ago (GREAT place!)  One of my favorite photos I took was this exact part of Times Square.  Since I have been back this is the second time I''ve seen the same area appear in a challenge.  Happy memories :)  Nice shot as well by the way :)', '2003-10-14 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(449672, 41325, 9643, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The sky comes through noisy and I have the same problems with my photos so can''t offer any help.  I do very much appreciate the artistic value of this picture in spite of the grain.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The sky comes through noisy and I have the same problems with my photos so can''t offer any help.  I do very much appreciate the artistic value of this picture in spite of the grain.', '2003-10-14 00:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(449674, 40968, 9643, '<td valign="top">The post in the foreground is distracting but I like the car pulling out - it makes the evening feel real and gives a nice balance against the quiet of the rest of the picture.  I like the light on the street and the depth is gives to the shadow on the right.</td>', 'The post in the foreground is distracting but I like the car pulling out - it makes the evening feel real and gives a nice balance against the quiet of the rest of the picture.  I like the light on the street and the depth is gives to the shadow on the right.', '2003-10-14 00:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
