(449706, 41245, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry, but a very dramatic sky over well contrasted buildings.</td>', 'A bit blurry, but a very dramatic sky over well contrasted buildings.', '2003-10-14 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(449712, 41356, 4648, '<td valign="top">most beautiful use of a rainbow.  Personally I like the darkiness of the over all photo.  It gives a mood and energy to it. The sky hints of color then takes it away like it''s playing tricks on you.  Great shot.. PLT</td>', 'most beautiful use of a rainbow.  Personally I like the darkiness of the over all photo.  It gives a mood and energy to it. The sky hints of color then takes it away like it''s playing tricks on you.  Great shot.. PLT', '2003-10-14 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449717, 41154, 4648, '<td valign="top">I haven''t seen a working grain elevator in quite a few years.  Understand your reasoning for the view of the photo, but I just wish the whole thing could have been in the light.  Great shot and use of the materials at hand.</td>', 'I haven''t seen a working grain elevator in quite a few years.  Understand your reasoning for the view of the photo, but I just wish the whole thing could have been in the light.  Great shot and use of the materials at hand.', '2003-10-14 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449725, 41260, 4648, '<td valign="top">I must see the rest of this building.  I know in England a friend calls her home "a flat" but this was not I what I imagined.  Very clear and neat shot.  Love the A/C sticking out the window.  Would like to have seen a little more of the "flat", but good shot of what you gave.</td>', 'I must see the rest of this building.  I know in England a friend calls her home "a flat" but this was not I what I imagined.  Very clear and neat shot.  Love the A/C sticking out the window.  Would like to have seen a little more of the "flat", but good shot of what you gave.', '2003-10-14 01:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(449734, 41317, 4648, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful colors.  Would make a beautiful puzzle, a very hard one to do.  Personally like your use of more of the river than the sky.  Good eye for what you see.  Best so far I''ve seen.  PTL</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful colors.  Would make a beautiful puzzle, a very hard one to do.  Personally like your use of more of the river than the sky.  Good eye for what you see.  Best so far I''ve seen.  PTL', '2003-10-14 01:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(449753, 41249, 4648, '<td valign="top">The subtle colors in the sky add so much to this.  You could have cut of almost 1/2 of the sky and not have hurt it any, but it did balance the bottom part beautifully.  The colors are clear and shart.  This looks like a post card of a city one has visited.  A very good over all photo.  PTL<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'The subtle colors in the sky add so much to this.  You could have cut of almost 1/2 of the sky and not have hurt it any, but it did balance the bottom part beautifully.  The colors are clear and shart.  This looks like a post card of a city one has visited.  A very good over all photo.  PTL              ', '2003-10-14 02:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(449756, 40649, 4648, '<td valign="top">The photo has such clear colors and shadows it looks like it was a set up photo take.  And that''s not bad either.  Just makes the photo so clear and clean it could have been used in a western movie.  Great work.</td>', 'The photo has such clear colors and shadows it looks like it was a set up photo take.  And that''s not bad either.  Just makes the photo so clear and clean it could have been used in a western movie.  Great work.', '2003-10-14 02:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(449757, 41214, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea of shooting through the round window.  Only improvment I can see would to have backed out a tad more and gotten the entire round frame.  But won''t count off for that.  Still a great shot any day.</td>', 'Wonderful idea of shooting through the round window.  Only improvment I can see would to have backed out a tad more and gotten the entire round frame.  But won''t count off for that.  Still a great shot any day.', '2003-10-14 02:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(449758, 41177, 4648, '<td valign="top">Feel you would have done better in natural color.  Like the overall photo but the tones pull down the grade by 2 points.</td>', 'Feel you would have done better in natural color.  Like the overall photo but the tones pull down the grade by 2 points.', '2003-10-14 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(449759, 41251, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love it!  This speaks of the times today.  Worthy of heading an artical.  Good focus, framing, great subject and colors.  Great shot.</td>', 'Love it!  This speaks of the times today.  Worthy of heading an artical.  Good focus, framing, great subject and colors.  Great shot.', '2003-10-14 02:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(449760, 41366, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too much out of focus for me personally.  Actually looks like a lego set than real people and setting.  This must be set up on some one''s train set.  For that it is a great photo, but for a real setting I can go with it.</td>', 'Too much out of focus for me personally.  Actually looks like a lego set than real people and setting.  This must be set up on some one''s train set.  For that it is a great photo, but for a real setting I can go with it.', '2003-10-14 02:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(449788, 41344, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not a realy bad shot, buy not very urban to me...</td>', 'Not a realy bad shot, buy not very urban to me...', '2003-10-14 04:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(449789, 40676, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not what i call urban, but a very nice sceen. Gave 8</td>', 'Not what i call urban, but a very nice sceen. Gave 8', '2003-10-14 04:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(449790, 41136, 10275, '<td valign="top">Ok, this should get a ribbon. The colour is just superb, great sharpness, great composition. I would have like a tiny bit more sky on the top of it, but this still is one of the best shots in this challenge IMO.</td>', 'Ok, this should get a ribbon. The colour is just superb, great sharpness, great composition. I would have like a tiny bit more sky on the top of it, but this still is one of the best shots in this challenge IMO.', '2003-10-14 04:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(449791, 41132, 11486, '<td valign="top">Realy dramatic effect of the mirroring!</td>', 'Realy dramatic effect of the mirroring!', '2003-10-14 04:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(449805, 40644, 11486, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but not exactly urban, as I interpret the challange...</td>', 'Nice sky, but not exactly urban, as I interpret the challange...', '2003-10-14 05:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(449807, 41233, 11486, '<td valign="top">I realy like the message in this one. As long as there is life, there are hope!<br/>I hope we NEVER need this kind of shelters!</td>', 'I realy like the message in this one. As long as there is life, there are hope!I hope we NEVER need this kind of shelters!', '2003-10-14 05:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(449811, 40800, 13074, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but I can''t see anything urban about it.</td>', 'I like the shot but I can''t see anything urban about it.', '2003-10-14 05:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(449814, 41049, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6<br/>I take it these are the grid lines being talked about in the forums. The buildings themselves seem very dark. Nice angle to the shot though.</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6I take it these are the grid lines being talked about in the forums. The buildings themselves seem very dark. Nice angle to the shot though.', '2003-10-14 05:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449816, 41218, 13074, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. I think that every light in Chicago has been turned on for this shot. Superb.</td>', 'Stunning photo. I think that every light in Chicago has been turned on for this shot. Superb.', '2003-10-14 06:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(449828, 41174, 9643, '<td valign="top">There are so many nice elements and contrasts in this picture.  I like the various colors of stone against the glass and the older structure on the left included with the modern architecture in the center.  My favorite is the earthtones in the foreground.  Very nice capture of the artistry in this cityscape.  Even the sky cooperated for you.</td>', 'There are so many nice elements and contrasts in this picture.  I like the various colors of stone against the glass and the older structure on the left included with the modern architecture in the center.  My favorite is the earthtones in the foreground.  Very nice capture of the artistry in this cityscape.  Even the sky cooperated for you.', '2003-10-14 08:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(449829, 41037, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a fresh approach to capturing buildings in an older city with narrow streets and crowding of structures. ( ie. opposed to rooftop photo)   I like the cropping very much because the piece left on the right side (which I''m pretty certain you included to capture the statue on the roof) is significantly contributing to the texture of this composition.  Nice perspective.  I''m not sure about including the lamplight on the top.  It is a little distracting , although I understand that it gives horizontal perspective too.</td>', 'What a fresh approach to capturing buildings in an older city with narrow streets and crowding of structures. ( ie. opposed to rooftop photo)   I like the cropping very much because the piece left on the right side (which I''m pretty certain you included to capture the statue on the roof) is significantly contributing to the texture of this composition.  Nice perspective.  I''m not sure about including the lamplight on the top.  It is a little distracting , although I understand that it gives horizontal perspective too.', '2003-10-14 08:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(449832, 40697, 6886, '<td valign="top">Nice Title.</td>', 'Nice Title.', '2003-10-14 08:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(449836, 40671, 11440, '<td valign="top">I think I see Frodo on the 44th floor!</td>', 'I think I see Frodo on the 44th floor!', '2003-10-14 08:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(449837, 41350, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very nice b&amp;w</td>', 'Very nice b&w', '2003-10-14 08:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449838, 41181, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2003-10-14 08:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(449839, 41294, 11440, '<td valign="top">I''m confused... <br/>Wait...<br/> <br/>Nope, still can''t figure it out...</td>', 'I''m confused... Wait... Nope, still can''t figure it out...', '2003-10-14 08:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(449840, 41088, 12258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous ... interesting composition, nice color!</td>', 'Gorgeous ... interesting composition, nice color!', '2003-10-14 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(449841, 41184, 11440, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-10-14 08:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
