(449846, 41155, 12258, '<td valign="top">WOW ... very nice!</td>', 'WOW ... very nice!', '2003-10-14 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449847, 40801, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful, indeed.</td>', 'Very peaceful, indeed.', '2003-10-14 08:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(449848, 41392, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, clarity, composition</td>', 'Very nice colors, clarity, composition', '2003-10-14 08:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(449855, 40758, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition!</td>', 'Very creative composition!', '2003-10-14 09:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(449856, 41056, 12258, '<td valign="top">Little too much sky, but beautiful shot!</td>', 'Little too much sky, but beautiful shot!', '2003-10-14 09:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(449858, 41249, 12258, '<td valign="top">Little too much sky, but very nice photo!</td>', 'Little too much sky, but very nice photo!', '2003-10-14 09:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(449860, 41131, 12258, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-10-14 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(449882, 40801, 8860, '<td valign="top">And why not? This is obviously not typically urban so your irony in this shot is its strength. Lighting is good, focus is perfect and the scene looks very tranquil - an inviting alternative to a concrete jungle! [8]</td>', 'And why not? This is obviously not typically urban so your irony in this shot is its strength. Lighting is good, focus is perfect and the scene looks very tranquil - an inviting alternative to a concrete jungle! [8]', '2003-10-14 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(449883, 40926, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good colour and contrasts. Strong shapes save what could otherwise be a dull scene. I think I would have cropped the left side of the building though.</td>', 'Good colour and contrasts. Strong shapes save what could otherwise be a dull scene. I think I would have cropped the left side of the building though.', '2003-10-14 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(449884, 40653, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette and a lovely time of day. Strong shapes too.</td>', 'Good silhouette and a lovely time of day. Strong shapes too.', '2003-10-14 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(449885, 41338, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition but it lacks some definition and contrast in the darker areas. A little play with the levels may have lifted this shot significantly.</td>', 'This is a great composition but it lacks some definition and contrast in the darker areas. A little play with the levels may have lifted this shot significantly.', '2003-10-14 10:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449901, 41133, 12971, '<td valign="top">Kinda makes me think of the old Pan Am Clippers...</td>', 'Kinda makes me think of the old Pan Am Clippers...', '2003-10-14 10:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(449902, 41233, 12971, '<td valign="top">nice composition...very powerful</td>', 'nice composition...very powerful', '2003-10-14 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(449903, 40731, 12971, '<td valign="top">this is really an incredible shot..great job...</td>', 'this is really an incredible shot..great job...', '2003-10-14 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449905, 40606, 12971, '<td valign="top">tough shot to grab...maybe a little longer explosure to capture the buildings, but, that may have overexposed the bright part of the sky...I still like it...</td>', 'tough shot to grab...maybe a little longer explosure to capture the buildings, but, that may have overexposed the bright part of the sky...I still like it...', '2003-10-14 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(449917, 41139, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot has brought me back to look at least 6 times before leaving a comment.  When I first saw it the T.O. in the back was extremely distracting, completely took me away from the wall colors.  But as I came back each time it became less and less because I was expecting it I guess.  It almost looks like it was added in after the shot but again, looking closer you can tell it''s not.   As for the shot itself, I like the cropping, the way the shot rises from bottom to top, drawing you in and taking you along the wall.  The colors are wonderful though the overall shot is just a tad dark for my taste.  Score is going up at least 5 points on this one, well done.</td>', 'This shot has brought me back to look at least 6 times before leaving a comment.  When I first saw it the T.O. in the back was extremely distracting, completely took me away from the wall colors.  But as I came back each time it became less and less because I was expecting it I guess.  It almost looks like it was added in after the shot but again, looking closer you can tell it''s not.   As for the shot itself, I like the cropping, the way the shot rises from bottom to top, drawing you in and taking you along the wall.  The colors are wonderful though the overall shot is just a tad dark for my taste.  Score is going up at least 5 points on this one, well done.', '2003-10-14 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(449920, 41412, 12448, '<td valign="top">This really does convey a sense of urban to me but something about the shot kept putting me off, couldn''t quite place my finger on it until I took a little more time to really examine it.  I think it the balance of light to the bottom marque.  Maybe if the cropping was just slightly different, less of the bottom marque it would be so distracting.  I like the shot, a tad more sharpness would score you another point, but it''s going up 4 points now.</td>', 'This really does convey a sense of urban to me but something about the shot kept putting me off, couldn''t quite place my finger on it until I took a little more time to really examine it.  I think it the balance of light to the bottom marque.  Maybe if the cropping was just slightly different, less of the bottom marque it would be so distracting.  I like the shot, a tad more sharpness would score you another point, but it''s going up 4 points now.', '2003-10-14 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(449922, 41362, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''ve been through here!  Been many a year but this looks very familer to me, from a different angle of course! :)  I like the overall shot, really fills the challenge nicely but the exposure was a bit long, the moon in the sky is a bit too bright and looks almost like a muted sun.  The star effect on the street lights works very well, but not on the moon for me personally.  I''m raising the score on this by at least 5 points.</td>', 'I''ve been through here!  Been many a year but this looks very familer to me, from a different angle of course! :)  I like the overall shot, really fills the challenge nicely but the exposure was a bit long, the moon in the sky is a bit too bright and looks almost like a muted sun.  The star effect on the street lights works very well, but not on the moon for me personally.  I''m raising the score on this by at least 5 points.', '2003-10-14 11:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(449923, 41395, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot overall but for me personally it conveys more landscape than urban, not a balance of both.  If the cropping was a little tighter maybe and a bit less sky?  Also ithe horizon looks very washed out on my monitor but the right lower half side is very clear and crisp compared to the rest of the shot.</td>', 'A nice shot overall but for me personally it conveys more landscape than urban, not a balance of both.  If the cropping was a little tighter maybe and a bit less sky?  Also ithe horizon looks very washed out on my monitor but the right lower half side is very clear and crisp compared to the rest of the shot.', '2003-10-14 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(449925, 41066, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, could be used for a postcard for the city.  The only thing that jumps out at me though is the sharpness of the shot and the coloring almost looks too rich but for a tourism shot that is great.  If the sky was a deep blue the shot would be close to perfect, darn mother nature!</td>', 'This is a great shot, could be used for a postcard for the city.  The only thing that jumps out at me though is the sharpness of the shot and the coloring almost looks too rich but for a tourism shot that is great.  If the sky was a deep blue the shot would be close to perfect, darn mother nature!', '2003-10-14 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(449926, 41350, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love San Francisco, only been there once and loved it.  This is a nice shot but for me it''s too dark and the cropping could be tighter so there isn''t as much darkness on the left.   The focus is a bit too soft for my taste but otherwise this has the potential to be a great shot.</td>', 'I love San Francisco, only been there once and loved it.  This is a nice shot but for me it''s too dark and the cropping could be tighter so there isn''t as much darkness on the left.   The focus is a bit too soft for my taste but otherwise this has the potential to be a great shot.', '2003-10-14 11:50:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(449928, 40458, 12448, '<td valign="top">This has met the challenge on both levels, a very good balance of urban and landscape but the colorization doesn''t really work for me personally, maybe if you had played with the contrast a tad more?  I like the cropping and the way the fence leads you across the shot.  Raising the score by 4 points from original.</td>', 'This has met the challenge on both levels, a very good balance of urban and landscape but the colorization doesn''t really work for me personally, maybe if you had played with the contrast a tad more?  I like the cropping and the way the fence leads you across the shot.  Raising the score by 4 points from original.', '2003-10-14 11:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(449929, 41367, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is such a peaceful shot, it would have worked great for the At Rest Challenge as well, LOL!   I like the way the sun is just disappearing behind the building and the colors in the sky are so balanced.  Nice job, the only thing I found personally distracting was the building in the front, I don''t know if it''s the shape or the darkness and I''m not sure what you could to to make it better for me but that''s not what this is about. :)  Raising my original score much higher!</td>', 'This is such a peaceful shot, it would have worked great for the At Rest Challenge as well, LOL!   I like the way the sun is just disappearing behind the building and the colors in the sky are so balanced.  Nice job, the only thing I found personally distracting was the building in the front, I don''t know if it''s the shape or the darkness and I''m not sure what you could to to make it better for me but that''s not what this is about. :)  Raising my original score much higher!', '2003-10-14 11:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(449930, 41402, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the clouds just above the roof of the far building are posing just for you, right?   ;-)  The only thing that jumped at me was the awning of the front building at first and then the lamp post but looking closer I see now they make a wonderful framing for the clouds and balance each other out very nicely.</td>', 'I really like this shot, the clouds just above the roof of the far building are posing just for you, right?   ;-)  The only thing that jumped at me was the awning of the front building at first and then the lamp post but looking closer I see now they make a wonderful framing for the clouds and balance each other out very nicely.', '2003-10-14 11:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(449934, 40707, 10785, '<td valign="top">Positive comments: This photo definitely meets the challenge topic. The eye is taken left to right across the photo and continues on down the road.<br/> <br/>Critiques: It has some compression issues that probably came from resizing. The wires and the sky are pixelated. The uneven lighting caused by the shadow line across the building detracts from the foreground. I didn''t get the feeling the stairs were the subject since they are partially hidden by the stop sign.<br/></td>', 'Positive comments: This photo definitely meets the challenge topic. The eye is taken left to right across the photo and continues on down the road. Critiques: It has some compression issues that probably came from resizing. The wires and the sky are pixelated. The uneven lighting caused by the shadow line across the building detracts from the foreground. I didn''t get the feeling the stairs were the subject since they are partially hidden by the stop sign.', '2003-10-14 11:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(449936, 40811, 208, '<td valign="top">Great sky. NIcely framed.</td>', 'Great sky. NIcely framed.', '2003-10-14 12:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(449938, 41012, 10785, '<td valign="top">This one kind of looks like an old slide. It looks like a capture from the intro of a  1970''s TV show or something! Very interesting.</td>', 'This one kind of looks like an old slide. It looks like a capture from the intro of a  1970''s TV show or something! Very interesting.', '2003-10-14 12:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(449943, 40871, 10785, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a way you could have avoided the interior light reflected on the glass. Otherwise a very strong photo: Well composed and good backlighting.</td>', 'I wish there was a way you could have avoided the interior light reflected on the glass. Otherwise a very strong photo: Well composed and good backlighting.', '2003-10-14 12:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(449944, 41370, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice dream-like quality to this.</td>', 'Nice dream-like quality to this.', '2003-10-14 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(449948, 41214, 208, '<td valign="top">This is well done. I especially like all the geometry (for lack of a better word) - the circle, the line and cut of the street, the horizon, the rooftops, etc.</td>', 'This is well done. I especially like all the geometry (for lack of a better word) - the circle, the line and cut of the street, the horizon, the rooftops, etc.', '2003-10-14 12:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(449953, 40500, 1368, '<td valign="top">Its hard to understand this photo Is this reflection in a window or what? Its to grey and flat it kinda fades all in one I think The picture would have been nice if it wasnt a reflection.</td>', 'Its hard to understand this photo Is this reflection in a window or what? Its to grey and flat it kinda fades all in one I think The picture would have been nice if it wasnt a reflection.', '2003-10-14 12:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(449958, 40837, 1368, '<td valign="top">I see, This is kinda cool But then again its a bit to unclear and The colors could have been better But the idea is great :) Good luck</td>', 'I see, This is kinda cool But then again its a bit to unclear and The colors could have been better But the idea is great :) Good luck', '2003-10-14 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(449962, 40924, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wish you would have used longer exposure here This could have been beautiful just my opinion I guess you wanted it like this. Its a bit to  black for me but the lights looks good . Good luck :)</td>', 'Wish you would have used longer exposure here This could have been beautiful just my opinion I guess you wanted it like this. Its a bit to  black for me but the lights looks good . Good luck :)', '2003-10-14 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(449963, 41233, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is cool But its a bit overexposured, then again mabey you wanted it like that. I dont know if I like the cropping or not Would like to see a picture with both windows uncropped, good luck</td>', 'This picture is cool But its a bit overexposured, then again mabey you wanted it like that. I dont know if I like the cropping or not Would like to see a picture with both windows uncropped, good luck', '2003-10-14 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449965, 41270, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little to flat and greyish for me And its like two lines, nothing that stands out in the landscape But its a beautiful landscape anyway mabey a bit more of the city and less sky? Good luck</td>', 'This picture is a little to flat and greyish for me And its like two lines, nothing that stands out in the landscape But its a beautiful landscape anyway mabey a bit more of the city and less sky? Good luck', '2003-10-14 12:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
