(450200, 41257, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good detail, nice in B/W.</td>', 'Good detail, nice in B/W.', '2003-10-14 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(450206, 40987, 13073, '<td valign="top">You captured a moment of getting  across that makes it good, not the background itself, but the combinatie I like very much, greetings doginroom</td>', 'You captured a moment of getting  across that makes it good, not the background itself, but the combinatie I like very much, greetings doginroom', '2003-10-14 15:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450207, 41404, 13073, '<td valign="top">what a dull city-town, where is it. gr doginroom</td>', 'what a dull city-town, where is it. gr doginroom', '2003-10-14 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(450209, 41212, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been more effective if the stairs took up more of the frame and it looked like you were really peeping up from down there. if it weren''t for your title, i would have thought it was jsut a street shot and wouldn''t have got what you were attempting to do.</td>', 'i think this would have been more effective if the stairs took up more of the frame and it looked like you were really peeping up from down there. if it weren''t for your title, i would have thought it was jsut a street shot and wouldn''t have got what you were attempting to do.', '2003-10-14 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(450212, 41094, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the idea you have here, but feel the composition is a bit noisy. perhaps if you shifted more to the left, the side buildings would not fight with the subject matter, causing the subject to get lost.</td>', 'i like the idea you have here, but feel the composition is a bit noisy. perhaps if you shifted more to the left, the side buildings would not fight with the subject matter, causing the subject to get lost.', '2003-10-14 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(450222, 40928, 6202, '<td valign="top">Those sunspots on the right side ruined the effect created by the sunrays.  Cropping them out would have helped.</td>', 'Those sunspots on the right side ruined the effect created by the sunrays.  Cropping them out would have helped.', '2003-10-14 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(450223, 40983, 6202, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Wonderful composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Wonderful composition.  Nicely done.', '2003-10-14 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450225, 40953, 6202, '<td valign="top">Image is just too small to be able to really vote on it and give it the proper score.  Try resizing to where the image is larger.</td>', 'Image is just too small to be able to really vote on it and give it the proper score.  Try resizing to where the image is larger.', '2003-10-14 16:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(450227, 41140, 6202, '<td valign="top">A bit to much haze from the California smog.  Could use a little contrast work to help with the haze. Aside from that it is a really good composition with a lot to work with.</td>', 'A bit to much haze from the California smog.  Could use a little contrast work to help with the haze. Aside from that it is a really good composition with a lot to work with.', '2003-10-14 16:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(450229, 41011, 6202, '<td valign="top">NIce coastline shot.</td>', 'NIce coastline shot.', '2003-10-14 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450234, 41346, 5792, '<td valign="top">What a terrific shot! Lighting is spectacular. Content and framing is superb. Beautiful.</td>', 'What a terrific shot! Lighting is spectacular. Content and framing is superb. Beautiful.', '2003-10-14 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450237, 41157, 6202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful travel photo.  Would make a great wish you were here postcard.  Nice color and good focus.  Well done,</td>', 'Beautiful travel photo.  Would make a great wish you were here postcard.  Nice color and good focus.  Well done,', '2003-10-14 16:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450240, 41396, 6202, '<td valign="top">Nice angles.  Very interesting.</td>', 'Nice angles.  Very interesting.', '2003-10-14 16:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(450247, 40645, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great content and framing. The variety of colors and soft focus make this an exceptional image. This will be a top finisher. Taken very close to your other winning shot.</td>', 'Great content and framing. The variety of colors and soft focus make this an exceptional image. This will be a top finisher. Taken very close to your other winning shot.', '2003-10-14 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450249, 41333, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Technically superior work. Clean, clear image. Nice ghost-like motion capture.</td>', 'Excellent image. Technically superior work. Clean, clear image. Nice ghost-like motion capture.', '2003-10-14 16:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(450250, 41218, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I would like to know how this was done. I see the moon rising, but are the white specks in the sky stars? If so, I don''t recognize any constellations. Never saw a night shot in a big city that shows so many sky objects. An excellent night shot.</td>', 'Interesting image. I would like to know how this was done. I see the moon rising, but are the white specks in the sky stars? If so, I don''t recognize any constellations. Never saw a night shot in a big city that shows so many sky objects. An excellent night shot.', '2003-10-14 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(450251, 40676, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice picture postcard perfect image. Looks like the Grand Tetons to me. Well composed, good color and content, but I am certain some will say this is rural and not urban at all and you will get low ratings from them for it, but not me.</td>', 'Nice picture postcard perfect image. Looks like the Grand Tetons to me. Well composed, good color and content, but I am certain some will say this is rural and not urban at all and you will get low ratings from them for it, but not me.', '2003-10-14 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450253, 41262, 5792, '<td valign="top">Not really a cityscape, but overall a terrific shot. I don''t usually pay much attention to borders, but the choice of white here works very well. High technical quality and a classic B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Not really a cityscape, but overall a terrific shot. I don''t usually pay much attention to borders, but the choice of white here works very well. High technical quality and a classic B&W image.', '2003-10-14 16:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(450254, 40653, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette. It is a shame you can''t get rid of the wires on the left side. Very good capture.</td>', 'Excellent silhouette. It is a shame you can''t get rid of the wires on the left side. Very good capture.', '2003-10-14 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(450255, 40665, 5792, '<td valign="top">Minneapolis never looked better. Super image all the way around. The only thing I would have done differently would have been to crop out the burn''t out light on the right. It detracts from this great shot and you''d only be cutting out uninteresting detail on that side of the frame anyway.</td>', 'Minneapolis never looked better. Super image all the way around. The only thing I would have done differently would have been to crop out the burn''t out light on the right. It detracts from this great shot and you''d only be cutting out uninteresting detail on that side of the frame anyway.', '2003-10-14 16:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(450256, 41155, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well framed. It is impossible to do a better job of framing than you have done with this image. Content is wonderful. It shows a touch of over post-processing, but this is one fantastic image. Hope you don''t get lower scores because they think this looks more like an indoor image than a landscape. Great job.</td>', 'Exceptionally well framed. It is impossible to do a better job of framing than you have done with this image. Content is wonderful. It shows a touch of over post-processing, but this is one fantastic image. Hope you don''t get lower scores because they think this looks more like an indoor image than a landscape. Great job.', '2003-10-14 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(450259, 41289, 5792, '<td valign="top">One very fine urban image. Good technical quality and very well framed. Simply beautiful</td>', 'One very fine urban image. Good technical quality and very well framed. Simply beautiful', '2003-10-14 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(450261, 41389, 5792, '<td valign="top">One super capture. Excellent in every way.</td>', 'One super capture. Excellent in every way.', '2003-10-14 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450264, 41010, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Good concept. Sepia works well with this. A bit oversharpened, but a very nice image.</td>', 'Nice capture. Good concept. Sepia works well with this. A bit oversharpened, but a very nice image.', '2003-10-14 16:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(450265, 41226, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good colors and unique subject for this challenge. Wish the metal railing in front of the church were not there.<br/></td>', 'Good colors and unique subject for this challenge. Wish the metal railing in front of the church were not there.', '2003-10-14 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450266, 41088, 5792, '<td valign="top">Some may not consider this a "landscape" but I realy like what you have done. This has a nice golden yellow color scheme and I like that the glass reflecting building fills the entire frame. I would like a tad more clarity, but otherwise it is terrific.</td>', 'Some may not consider this a "landscape" but I realy like what you have done. This has a nice golden yellow color scheme and I like that the glass reflecting building fills the entire frame. I would like a tad more clarity, but otherwise it is terrific.', '2003-10-14 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(450268, 41336, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well captured night shot showing the rain.</td>', 'Well captured night shot showing the rain.', '2003-10-14 16:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(450270, 41292, 5792, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful view.</td>', 'Simply wonderful view.', '2003-10-14 16:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(450271, 41315, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good capture... nice colors.</td>', 'Good capture... nice colors.', '2003-10-14 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(450273, 41272, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and capture. Well framed and B&amp;W works in this situation.</td>', 'Interesting concept and capture. Well framed and B&W works in this situation.', '2003-10-14 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(450280, 41346, 10145, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot!!  Beautiful!!   9</td>', 'I LOVE this shot!!  Beautiful!!   9', '2003-10-14 17:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
