(450303, 41332, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition... :)</td>', 'Nice composition... :)', '2003-10-14 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(450305, 41213, 7703, '<td valign="top">Ó elskulega Borgarne. Hefðir mátt snúa myndinni aðeins.</td>', 'Ó elskulega Borgarne. Hefðir mátt snúa myndinni aðeins.', '2003-10-14 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(450310, 41303, 12363, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s better to not see the end of the trail...leaves more drama/imagination up to the viewer.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s better to not see the end of the trail...leaves more drama/imagination up to the viewer.', '2003-10-14 17:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(450311, 41289, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture The Blue color os great just wish it was a little bigger</td>', 'Beautiful picture The Blue color os great just wish it was a little bigger', '2003-10-14 17:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(450312, 41351, 12363, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more detail come out of the shadows.  Looks like something with windows - a boat perhaps - near the watersedge on the left.<br/>Nice sky and reflections - the distant boomy clouds steel the show!<br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more detail come out of the shadows.  Looks like something with windows - a boat perhaps - near the watersedge on the left.Nice sky and reflections - the distant boomy clouds steel the show!Nice shot.', '2003-10-14 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(450318, 40645, 12363, '<td valign="top">I wish i was there.<br/>Feels a little overexosed because of the lights'' saturation.<br/>I''d crop out the right 20% of the image - get rid of the trees and bushes.<br/>Perhaps more water &amp; reflection would help create more ''neon glow'' that seems to be the message here.</td>', 'I wish i was there.Feels a little overexosed because of the lights'' saturation.I''d crop out the right 20% of the image - get rid of the trees and bushes.Perhaps more water & reflection would help create more ''neon glow'' that seems to be the message here.', '2003-10-14 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(450323, 40432, 7703, '<td valign="top">There is something about this picture that I like ... :)</td>', 'There is something about this picture that I like ... :)', '2003-10-14 18:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(450325, 41316, 7703, '<td valign="top">This looks like something</td>', 'This looks like something', '2003-10-14 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(450326, 41336, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Well composed, the streetlight isn''t overpowering the scene, and the rain gives it an extra texture. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'Beautiful. Well composed, the streetlight isn''t overpowering the scene, and the rain gives it an extra texture. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(450328, 40871, 12363, '<td valign="top">lots of light reflecting back</td>', 'lots of light reflecting back', '2003-10-14 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(450329, 41010, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent, though it looks like they''re tiling rather than painting :P<br/>The workmen are very well placed, spread out and giving the shot balance. Did you have to wait or just a lucky moment? Sepia works well. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'Excellent, though it looks like they''re tiling rather than painting :PThe workmen are very well placed, spread out and giving the shot balance. Did you have to wait or just a lucky moment? Sepia works well. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(450333, 41218, 4411, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit bigger than Chorley (pop. 100,000) that''s for sure ; )<br/>Awesome. Breathtaking shot. Would love to see the detail in it at full resolution as I have a feeling that 640 pixels just doesn''t do it justice.<br/>Has to get lumped in with all the other 10s I''m afraid, but only because I can''t give it 11.</td>', 'It looks a bit bigger than Chorley (pop. 100,000) that''s for sure ; )Awesome. Breathtaking shot. Would love to see the detail in it at full resolution as I have a feeling that 640 pixels just doesn''t do it justice.Has to get lumped in with all the other 10s I''m afraid, but only because I can''t give it 11.', '2003-10-14 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(450334, 40671, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great angle. Suits the B&amp;W treatment very well. Excellent detail too.<br/>A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'Great angle. Suits the B&W treatment very well. Excellent detail too.A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(450335, 41298, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I really like this. The water gives it that little extra that pulls it out from the rest of the 7-ish shots. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'Great idea, I really like this. The water gives it that little extra that pulls it out from the rest of the 7-ish shots. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(450336, 41133, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Can''t make my mind up if the plane spoils it a touch, or enhances it a tad. The haze is awesome, and the composition perfect. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'Beautiful. Can''t make my mind up if the plane spoils it a touch, or enhances it a tad. The haze is awesome, and the composition perfect. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450337, 41385, 11432, '<td valign="top">Great night shot, good color. I like the reflections.</td>', 'Great night shot, good color. I like the reflections.', '2003-10-14 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(450338, 41232, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good detail, I like the reflections.</td>', 'Good detail, I like the reflections.', '2003-10-14 18:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(450339, 40968, 11432, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows, I like the color.</td>', 'Nice shadows, I like the color.', '2003-10-14 18:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(450340, 40829, 4411, '<td valign="top">My favourite out of the ''looking up at skyscrapers'' collection. The lamppost gives it that bit extra, as does the sky. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!</td>', 'My favourite out of the ''looking up at skyscrapers'' collection. The lamppost gives it that bit extra, as does the sky. A somewhat devalued 10 because I''ve given so many!', '2003-10-14 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(450341, 40519, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good color, I like the reflections, good buildings.</td>', 'Good color, I like the reflections, good buildings.', '2003-10-14 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
