(450349, 40887, 4411, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you could have captured London any better than this. Perfect composition. I really like the almost silhouetted buildings, and there''s great subdued colour in the sky and water. Another one that gets lumped in with all the 10s only because I can''t give it 11.</td>', 'I don''t know if you could have captured London any better than this. Perfect composition. I really like the almost silhouetted buildings, and there''s great subdued colour in the sky and water. Another one that gets lumped in with all the 10s only because I can''t give it 11.', '2003-10-14 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450350, 41336, 11432, '<td valign="top">Great night shot, I like the rain, good color.</td>', 'Great night shot, I like the rain, good color.', '2003-10-14 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1);
