(450402, 41289, 11432, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, good color, good detail.</td>', 'Nice reflections, good color, good detail.', '2003-10-14 18:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(450403, 41258, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good color, I like the buildings.</td>', 'Good color, I like the buildings.', '2003-10-14 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(450404, 41343, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good color, I like the building.</td>', 'Good color, I like the building.', '2003-10-14 18:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(450406, 41261, 11432, '<td valign="top">Great sky, I like the color, good buildings.</td>', 'Great sky, I like the color, good buildings.', '2003-10-14 18:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(450407, 40707, 12448, '<td valign="top">I originally scored this shot very low and coming back to it and looking at it more closely I think I can tell you why.  I like the concept, the sense of urban is very strong in this shot but the shadow cuts the picture and throws it off balance to me and the wires coming off the building to the right are very distracting.  Maybe from a different angle, a different crop and this would have scored much higher for me.  I am raising the score a few points from the original one I set but can''t go too much higher.  Sorry.</td>', 'I originally scored this shot very low and coming back to it and looking at it more closely I think I can tell you why.  I like the concept, the sense of urban is very strong in this shot but the shadow cuts the picture and throws it off balance to me and the wires coming off the building to the right are very distracting.  Maybe from a different angle, a different crop and this would have scored much higher for me.  I am raising the score a few points from the original one I set but can''t go too much higher.  Sorry.', '2003-10-14 18:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(450410, 40645, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot got a low score from me in the beginning because when I first glanced at it I saw fuzz and lots of it.  Too much light, too busy, too, too, too.  But coming back and taking more time to look at the shot, it''s not really fuzz but the lights and the time of exposure which actually works very well, it adds a sense of a dreamlike state to the shot for me.  Also the colors are very vibrant and the flow of the bridge is very nice.  The only other little thing that jumps at me is the tree on the right, if the angle could have been slightly different or the crop, this would have scored a 9 or 10 with me.</td>', 'This shot got a low score from me in the beginning because when I first glanced at it I saw fuzz and lots of it.  Too much light, too busy, too, too, too.  But coming back and taking more time to look at the shot, it''s not really fuzz but the lights and the time of exposure which actually works very well, it adds a sense of a dreamlike state to the shot for me.  Also the colors are very vibrant and the flow of the bridge is very nice.  The only other little thing that jumps at me is the tree on the right, if the angle could have been slightly different or the crop, this would have scored a 9 or 10 with me.', '2003-10-14 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(450411, 41011, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh, the quiet beach, must be early in the morning for it to be so quiet, or is it later in the evening?  Hard to tell :)<br/> <br/>This is a very peaceful shot and does lend a certain air of urban, very slight but there.  The use of negative space on the top though hurts you a bit for me, if it was cropped a little tighter there and the color seems off also, not sure if I really like it or not.  The DOF is pretty good considering the amount of land you were covering but the forefront could be a tad sharper.  Raising my score by at least 3 points.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh, the quiet beach, must be early in the morning for it to be so quiet, or is it later in the evening?  Hard to tell :) This is a very peaceful shot and does lend a certain air of urban, very slight but there.  The use of negative space on the top though hurts you a bit for me, if it was cropped a little tighter there and the color seems off also, not sure if I really like it or not.  The DOF is pretty good considering the amount of land you were covering but the forefront could be a tad sharper.  Raising my score by at least 3 points.', '2003-10-14 18:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(450412, 41216, 12448, '<td valign="top">I didn''t score very high on this one because the overall quality of the shot left me wanting.  I like the idea and the cropping is very good, including the Selver sign showing what is to come but the clarity and colors of the shot leave me wanting a bit.  I can tell by the sky that nature wasn''t on your side for lighting so I won''t dock you a whole lot for that :)</td>', 'I didn''t score very high on this one because the overall quality of the shot left me wanting.  I like the idea and the cropping is very good, including the Selver sign showing what is to come but the clarity and colors of the shot leave me wanting a bit.  I can tell by the sky that nature wasn''t on your side for lighting so I won''t dock you a whole lot for that :)', '2003-10-14 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450413, 41161, 9004, '<td valign="top">Very nice building. Should have shot it head on though.</td>', 'Very nice building. Should have shot it head on though.', '2003-10-14 18:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450414, 41319, 12448, '<td valign="top">And what a lovely view it is!  Some day I will get over there, heck only 6 hours away now! ;)<br/> <br/>The shot is cropped well, the center of attention, the Empire State Building, I believe, stands out and brings you right into the shot.  The clarity and sharpness is wanting and must have been difficult with the distance you were working with.  Also the trees on the left, while adding that splash of color are a bit distracting, maybe just a slightly tighter crop?</td>', 'And what a lovely view it is!  Some day I will get over there, heck only 6 hours away now! ;) The shot is cropped well, the center of attention, the Empire State Building, I believe, stands out and brings you right into the shot.  The clarity and sharpness is wanting and must have been difficult with the distance you were working with.  Also the trees on the left, while adding that splash of color are a bit distracting, maybe just a slightly tighter crop?', '2003-10-14 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450415, 40800, 13152, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but hardly urban. . .</td>', 'Beautiful, but hardly urban. . .', '2003-10-14 18:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(450417, 40672, 9004, '<td valign="top">Nice pic! Should have rotated the pic a few degrees CW. Overall unique landscape. I like it.</td>', 'Nice pic! Should have rotated the pic a few degrees CW. Overall unique landscape. I like it.', '2003-10-14 19:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(450419, 41089, 9004, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this pic. To me, conveys a sence of ''power''.</td>', 'Great colors in this pic. To me, conveys a sence of ''power''.', '2003-10-14 19:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(450421, 41216, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tricky, difficult photography, and I''m not sure whether you''ve really captured a desolate scene, or whether this is just dull ... but it''s making me stop, so it must be the former. Great mood shot, though I think the focal range could have been either broader or narrower - whilst the piles of mud are in focus, the sign and the distance are either a little motion-blurred or not quite in focus. and there are dust-specks either on your lens or your sensor. 7</td>', 'Tricky, difficult photography, and I''m not sure whether you''ve really captured a desolate scene, or whether this is just dull ... but it''s making me stop, so it must be the former. Great mood shot, though I think the focal range could have been either broader or narrower - whilst the piles of mud are in focus, the sign and the distance are either a little motion-blurred or not quite in focus. and there are dust-specks either on your lens or your sensor. 7', '2003-10-14 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(450422, 41155, 13003, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2003-10-14 19:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(450423, 41272, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is great! The lighting/ exposure are superb - especially for a long exposure such as this. I was here only a week or two ago and also found the cranes and paraphernalia of modern architecture surrounding St Pauls to be quite intriguing. What I like most about this is the way you pull people into the image without actually focusing on individuals since the essence of Urbanity is the population inhabiting it. This really is one of my favourite entries in this challenge.</td>', 'This is great! The lighting/ exposure are superb - especially for a long exposure such as this. I was here only a week or two ago and also found the cranes and paraphernalia of modern architecture surrounding St Pauls to be quite intriguing. What I like most about this is the way you pull people into the image without actually focusing on individuals since the essence of Urbanity is the population inhabiting it. This really is one of my favourite entries in this challenge.', '2003-10-14 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(450424, 40760, 9004, '<td valign="top">The title fits the shot well. Pic is very nicely composed.</td>', 'The title fits the shot well. Pic is very nicely composed.', '2003-10-14 19:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(450425, 40792, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!  The song, "Blinded by the light" comes to mind when I view this shot! ;)  Where did I put those shades so I can sing, "I wear my sunglasses at night" :)<br/> <br/>Okay, enough bad song references, on to the shot.  This is a very interesting shot, very busy, lots of color, lots of light, this works both for you and against you.  The colors, the headlights and taillights are wonderful but the street lights have become distracting because of the prolonged exposure.  To bad you couldn''t get the city to turn them off for you :)  I''m raising my original score by at least 4 more points.</td>', 'WOW!  The song, "Blinded by the light" comes to mind when I view this shot! ;)  Where did I put those shades so I can sing, "I wear my sunglasses at night" :) Okay, enough bad song references, on to the shot.  This is a very interesting shot, very busy, lots of color, lots of light, this works both for you and against you.  The colors, the headlights and taillights are wonderful but the street lights have become distracting because of the prolonged exposure.  To bad you couldn''t get the city to turn them off for you :)  I''m raising my original score by at least 4 more points.', '2003-10-14 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(450426, 40510, 9004, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the best night landscapes. Nicely exposed.</td>', 'Definitely one of the best night landscapes. Nicely exposed.', '2003-10-14 19:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(450429, 40738, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting dynamic of shapes, though the interruption of the lamp-post is I think rather a distraction than an intersting addition. I''d alos have been tempted to either crop out the cars or completely get them in shot: this way they look accidental, rather than a deliberate part of your composition. A good start though ...</td>', 'Intersting dynamic of shapes, though the interruption of the lamp-post is I think rather a distraction than an intersting addition. I''d alos have been tempted to either crop out the cars or completely get them in shot: this way they look accidental, rather than a deliberate part of your composition. A good start though ...', '2003-10-14 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(450432, 41069, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot overall, the clarity is wonderful, the DOF is fantastic.  The only thing that bothers me a bit is the perspective, one moment the building looks like it''s about to fall on you and the next it''s about to fall away, which actually is kind of cool!  The flowers are distracting on the bottom, a tighter crop would have gotten you another point from me. :)</td>', 'This is a lovely shot overall, the clarity is wonderful, the DOF is fantastic.  The only thing that bothers me a bit is the perspective, one moment the building looks like it''s about to fall on you and the next it''s about to fall away, which actually is kind of cool!  The flowers are distracting on the bottom, a tighter crop would have gotten you another point from me. :)', '2003-10-14 19:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(450433, 41213, 12448, '<td valign="top">Where did all the buildings go?  :)  This is a lovely landscape and I do see a town way over on the other side but is that a submarine on the right?  It looks like the top of one.  The beach area is a bit dark to me, the contrast is slightly off compared to the sky.  It looks like a lovely area.</td>', 'Where did all the buildings go?  :)  This is a lovely landscape and I do see a town way over on the other side but is that a submarine on the right?  It looks like the top of one.  The beach area is a bit dark to me, the contrast is slightly off compared to the sky.  It looks like a lovely area.', '2003-10-14 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(450435, 40681, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is this hospital really lighted like this at night?  That is awesome!  The reflection really adds to the shot and the lines from the street lights on the water draw you in, the only thing I would have changed is the cropping, just a tad more off the bottom and this would have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.</td>', 'Is this hospital really lighted like this at night?  That is awesome!  The reflection really adds to the shot and the lines from the street lights on the water draw you in, the only thing I would have changed is the cropping, just a tad more off the bottom and this would have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.', '2003-10-14 19:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450438, 40682, 12448, '<td valign="top">These buildings are beautiful and the cropping from top to bottom is very good but the sides are a bit distracting, the darkeness on the left and the trees on the right keep pulling me out of the main shot.  I would really like to see this shot in color too, the black and white is nice but I think you lost some of the punch by going b&amp;w.</td>', 'These buildings are beautiful and the cropping from top to bottom is very good but the sides are a bit distracting, the darkeness on the left and the trees on the right keep pulling me out of the main shot.  I would really like to see this shot in color too, the black and white is nice but I think you lost some of the punch by going b&w.', '2003-10-14 19:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(450440, 41165, 12448, '<td valign="top">Dead urban ;(  Very interesting take on the challenge, I like it.  The different heights of the crosses really brings you into the shot, building up to the back, very nice.  A tad too much sky for my taste but an overall good use of space.  And the black and white work very well with this shot, a touch more contrast and you would have 9 or 10 from me ;)</td>', 'Dead urban ;(  Very interesting take on the challenge, I like it.  The different heights of the crosses really brings you into the shot, building up to the back, very nice.  A tad too much sky for my taste but an overall good use of space.  And the black and white work very well with this shot, a touch more contrast and you would have 9 or 10 from me ;)', '2003-10-14 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(450442, 41218, 7086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, spot on with the exposure. Pains me to say it but it looks like I''ll have to settle for second place ;)</td>', 'Beautiful capture, spot on with the exposure. Pains me to say it but it looks like I''ll have to settle for second place ;)', '2003-10-14 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(450443, 41233, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very urban AND you have the plants for your landscape, PERFECT! :)<br/> <br/>The cropping on this is close to perfect for me, I think I would have liked to seen the top of the windows though and the top is a little blown out as they say, in the center, a touch of contrast and brightness adjustment would have really made this shot pop.</td>', 'Very urban AND you have the plants for your landscape, PERFECT! :) The cropping on this is close to perfect for me, I think I would have liked to seen the top of the windows though and the top is a little blown out as they say, in the center, a touch of contrast and brightness adjustment would have really made this shot pop.', '2003-10-14 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(450445, 40928, 12448, '<td valign="top">I know this area!  I''ve been there many a time, in the building to the right is Motley Fool Headquarters! :)<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful area, I love the cropping on the overall shot, a real sense of balance but the sun on this shot did not help you, the rays are nice but a bit overpowering in the shot and a bit distracting.  But you get extra points simply because I love this area ;)</td>', 'I know this area!  I''ve been there many a time, in the building to the right is Motley Fool Headquarters! :) This is a wonderful area, I love the cropping on the overall shot, a real sense of balance but the sun on this shot did not help you, the rays are nice but a bit overpowering in the shot and a bit distracting.  But you get extra points simply because I love this area ;)', '2003-10-14 19:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(450447, 40467, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the idea you were going with but the cropping left me hanging. If you could have cut the shot diagonally, from upper right to lower left I think it would have been much better.  The empty space on the left pulls me out.  The cloudy sky, the colors are are great, just a tad more contrast would make them perfect.</td>', 'I love the idea you were going with but the cropping left me hanging. If you could have cut the shot diagonally, from upper right to lower left I think it would have been much better.  The empty space on the left pulls me out.  The cloudy sky, the colors are are great, just a tad more contrast would make them perfect.', '2003-10-14 19:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(450454, 41133, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the composition quite a bit here. Capturing the plane adds additional interest. I know from your title that this was a hazy day, but I think this shot would benefit from trying to boost the tones to gives some darker blacks. It doesn''t detract that much though - this isa very eye catching shot.</td>', 'I like the composition quite a bit here. Capturing the plane adds additional interest. I know from your title that this was a hazy day, but I think this shot would benefit from trying to boost the tones to gives some darker blacks. It doesn''t detract that much though - this isa very eye catching shot.', '2003-10-14 19:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450457, 40458, 8624, '<td valign="top">I was ready to rate this lower, but the more I examined it, the more I liked your composition here. I like the angle of the crane and how there is interesting shape contrast with the water tower. I like the way the clouds frame the building and the curve of the fence in the foreground. Nicely captured.</td>', 'I was ready to rate this lower, but the more I examined it, the more I liked your composition here. I like the angle of the crane and how there is interesting shape contrast with the water tower. I like the way the clouds frame the building and the curve of the fence in the foreground. Nicely captured.', '2003-10-14 19:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(450463, 41261, 12526, '<td valign="top">Excellent work</td>', 'Excellent work', '2003-10-14 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450466, 40460, 12526, '<td valign="top">Nice depict</td>', 'Nice depict', '2003-10-14 19:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(450515, 41089, 12454, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great contrast of light and dark with a very interesting background color.</td>', 'I thought this was a great contrast of light and dark with a very interesting background color.', '2003-10-14 20:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(450519, 41102, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot, but I wish there was a little more light on the distant buildings.  Of course, then you''d have lost those wonderful clouds.  I guess perfection just doesn''t exist in nature.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot, but I wish there was a little more light on the distant buildings.  Of course, then you''d have lost those wonderful clouds.  I guess perfection just doesn''t exist in nature.', '2003-10-14 20:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450532, 41128, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well taken picture. Very interesting pattern in the roofs. Almost looks like a basket weave.</td>', 'Well taken picture. Very interesting pattern in the roofs. Almost looks like a basket weave.', '2003-10-14 21:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(450538, 40987, 2158, '<td valign="top">One of the few entries I''ve seen (for this challenge) where the people have been effectively used.</td>', 'One of the few entries I''ve seen (for this challenge) where the people have been effectively used.', '2003-10-14 21:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(450544, 41410, 12719, '<td valign="top">beautiful. very crisp, and lovely colours. nice subtle reflection.</td>', 'beautiful. very crisp, and lovely colours. nice subtle reflection.', '2003-10-14 21:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450546, 40887, 12719, '<td valign="top">a tiny bit dull, could have contrast more with a tweak of the levels maybe, but nonetheless, lovely composition and view :)</td>', 'a tiny bit dull, could have contrast more with a tweak of the levels maybe, but nonetheless, lovely composition and view :)', '2003-10-14 21:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(450548, 41132, 12719, '<td valign="top">curious distorted reflections. like they have been painted.</td>', 'curious distorted reflections. like they have been painted.', '2003-10-14 21:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(450549, 40460, 12719, '<td valign="top">wow. this I love. it says gotham to me. I''m expecting to see the bat symbol :) sweet.</td>', 'wow. this I love. it says gotham to me. I''m expecting to see the bat symbol :) sweet.', '2003-10-14 21:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(450550, 41310, 12719, '<td valign="top">ah. this is totally my favortie building ing new york. the hotel I stayed in was just down from it (the helmsey on 42nd). couldn''t help but fall in love with it.  a lovely shot of it, thanks.</td>', 'ah. this is totally my favortie building ing new york. the hotel I stayed in was just down from it (the helmsey on 42nd). couldn''t help but fall in love with it.  a lovely shot of it, thanks.', '2003-10-14 21:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450551, 40496, 12943, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2003-10-14 21:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(450554, 41350, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I think it looks great in b&amp;w, too.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I think it looks great in b&w, too.', '2003-10-14 21:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(450557, 41187, 5705, '<td valign="top">Nice Dusk/night shot</td>', 'Nice Dusk/night shot', '2003-10-14 21:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(450558, 41272, 5705, '<td valign="top">Superb, great slow shutter to add to a nice perspective on the capitol-- 10 with the WOW factor</td>', 'Superb, great slow shutter to add to a nice perspective on the capitol-- 10 with the WOW factor', '2003-10-14 22:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(450560, 41278, 5705, '<td valign="top">Very Pretty, maybe a little too much of nothing in the forground-- still a nice shot</td>', 'Very Pretty, maybe a little too much of nothing in the forground-- still a nice shot', '2003-10-14 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(450561, 40639, 5705, '<td valign="top">Very calm and nice colors</td>', 'Very calm and nice colors', '2003-10-14 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(450562, 41214, 12719, '<td valign="top">very very nice. quite spectacular. this is one of my favorties in the challenge methinks.</td>', 'very very nice. quite spectacular. this is one of my favorties in the challenge methinks.', '2003-10-14 22:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(450563, 40811, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great perspective you chose for the shot-- 8</td>', 'Great perspective you chose for the shot-- 8', '2003-10-14 22:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(450564, 41302, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great angle that you chose to shoot from--8</td>', 'Great angle that you chose to shoot from--8', '2003-10-14 22:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(450565, 41260, 5705, '<td valign="top">Thats one crazy thin building!</td>', 'Thats one crazy thin building!', '2003-10-14 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(450566, 41155, 5705, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull COlors, great Wide Shot-- 9</td>', 'Wonderfull COlors, great Wide Shot-- 9', '2003-10-14 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(450567, 40888, 12719, '<td valign="top">shame it''s out of focus. I know alot of digital camera have low light focus troubles - but why not manualy focus it if you can? or make sure you get quite a few shots if this happens to you lots so that you have a selection.<br/> <br/>maybe if you have a landscape mode on your camera it''d be best to use that, they usually focus at a fixed ''landscape'' point which will guarentee focus alot of the time. <br/> <br/>the sky, composure is nice, just a whoping shame about the focus.</td>', 'shame it''s out of focus. I know alot of digital camera have low light focus troubles - but why not manualy focus it if you can? or make sure you get quite a few shots if this happens to you lots so that you have a selection. maybe if you have a landscape mode on your camera it''d be best to use that, they usually focus at a fixed ''landscape'' point which will guarentee focus alot of the time.  the sky, composure is nice, just a whoping shame about the focus.', '2003-10-14 22:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(450568, 40888, 5705, '<td valign="top">Had Great Potential!! did you try to hand-hold this?  If so get a tripod-- It would be wonderfull but its just too blurry- 5</td>', 'Had Great Potential!! did you try to hand-hold this?  If so get a tripod-- It would be wonderfull but its just too blurry- 5', '2003-10-14 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(450569, 40510, 12719, '<td valign="top">I think it''s lovely, it''s urban, it''s landscape and it''s got 3 nice bands - foreground, mid and the glow on the hirizon. well done.</td>', 'I think it''s lovely, it''s urban, it''s landscape and it''s got 3 nice bands - foreground, mid and the glow on the hirizon. well done.', '2003-10-14 22:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450571, 41066, 5705, '<td valign="top">INcredibly Sharp!  nice placement of the flowers in foreground for Composition-- 10</td>', 'INcredibly Sharp!  nice placement of the flowers in foreground for Composition-- 10', '2003-10-14 22:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(450573, 41128, 5705, '<td valign="top">INcredible!  10!!</td>', 'INcredible!  10!!', '2003-10-14 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(450574, 40878, 8911, '<td valign="top">Portland, yes? I''d like to see the shop a little crisper, but I know it''s hard to do with the cloudy weather giving such soft light, even if it''s otherwise glorious weather. :)</td>', 'Portland, yes? I''d like to see the shop a little crisper, but I know it''s hard to do with the cloudy weather giving such soft light, even if it''s otherwise glorious weather. :)', '2003-10-14 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
