(450598, 40800, 8911, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty coast, but...I odn''t see any sign of a city, town, or even a small cluster of outbuildings. Is there a city out in the fog, or just behind? In any case...I can''t tie this to the challenge at all.</td>', 'It''s a pretty coast, but...I odn''t see any sign of a city, town, or even a small cluster of outbuildings. Is there a city out in the fog, or just behind? In any case...I can''t tie this to the challenge at all.', '2003-10-14 22:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(450599, 40983, 5705, '<td valign="top">Perfect Composition, holy cow!<br/>This is an amazing photo--<br/>People may vote it low because its not a "City" shot, but not me, this deserves a 10</td>', 'Perfect Composition, holy cow!This is an amazing photo--People may vote it low because its not a "City" shot, but not me, this deserves a 10', '2003-10-14 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(450600, 41361, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the choice to go black and white here, given how busy the foreground is; the eyes have nowhere to rest, and I suspect color would only have emphasized that.</td>', 'I like the choice to go black and white here, given how busy the foreground is; the eyes have nowhere to rest, and I suspect color would only have emphasized that.', '2003-10-14 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(450601, 40786, 5705, '<td valign="top">Awesome Eye (no pun) to gte this angle for your photo-- 10</td>', 'Awesome Eye (no pun) to gte this angle for your photo-- 10', '2003-10-14 22:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(450603, 40829, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual angle on this, as well as the clouds'' reflection in the building at left (and, to a lesser degree, seen through or against the other buildings). The lack of vivid color except in the sky also helps draw it together, to my eye.</td>', 'I like the unusual angle on this, as well as the clouds'' reflection in the building at left (and, to a lesser degree, seen through or against the other buildings). The lack of vivid color except in the sky also helps draw it together, to my eye.', '2003-10-14 22:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(450604, 40474, 12719, '<td valign="top">um, very nice, but my comment would be way to much sky. that''s all I could see before scrolling down...I feel its a bit much.</td>', 'um, very nice, but my comment would be way to much sky. that''s all I could see before scrolling down...I feel its a bit much.', '2003-10-14 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(450605, 41049, 5705, '<td valign="top">was this taken behind a screen? I dont get the all the lines in the sky?</td>', 'was this taken behind a screen? I dont get the all the lines in the sky?', '2003-10-14 22:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(450606, 41327, 8911, '<td valign="top">It seems like the light areas of this photo are a bit overexposed...I want to see more of the building on the left, in terms of detail, or less in terms of cropping, though that would also cut out the less over-exposed upper left.... The building in the center is definitely striking and interesting, as are the ones in shadow to the right - the details there interest me the most of any part of the photo.</td>', 'It seems like the light areas of this photo are a bit overexposed...I want to see more of the building on the left, in terms of detail, or less in terms of cropping, though that would also cut out the less over-exposed upper left.... The building in the center is definitely striking and interesting, as are the ones in shadow to the right - the details there interest me the most of any part of the photo.', '2003-10-14 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(450607, 41128, 12719, '<td valign="top">this is really hard to tell what it is. I thought it was the side of a building from the thumbnail, now I''m thinking it might be the top. I like it, element of optical illusion. am also kind of confused.</td>', 'this is really hard to tell what it is. I thought it was the side of a building from the thumbnail, now I''m thinking it might be the top. I like it, element of optical illusion. am also kind of confused.', '2003-10-14 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(450609, 41214, 5705, '<td valign="top">The most original perspective in the challenge, great framing on the shot-- 10</td>', 'The most original perspective in the challenge, great framing on the shot-- 10', '2003-10-14 22:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(450610, 40564, 12719, '<td valign="top">maybe it''s just my head, but the title, and the round structure onto are all implying superman things to me (metropolis, daily planet...) I''m expecting to see him in the shot for some reason. :)<br/> <br/>an over all nice photo anyhow.</td>', 'maybe it''s just my head, but the title, and the round structure onto are all implying superman things to me (metropolis, daily planet...) I''m expecting to see him in the shot for some reason. :) an over all nice photo anyhow.', '2003-10-14 22:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(450611, 40565, 8911, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a vertical format showing more of the crane might not have worked better (your framing buildings are dark and bright enough, respectively, to lose detail). Either way, thank you for a great laugh - the title makes this shot.</td>', 'I wonder if a vertical format showing more of the crane might not have worked better (your framing buildings are dark and bright enough, respectively, to lose detail). Either way, thank you for a great laugh - the title makes this shot.', '2003-10-14 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(450612, 41313, 9643, '<td valign="top">I am interpreting Urban Landscape to be a photo that "feels" urban and this one does.  What I like best is the fact that the students are walking as opposed to standing or sitting (and students are the best representation of any urban landscape).  Outside of that the colors are crisp and the composition balanced in a way that is very pleasing.   Nice photo.</td>', 'I am interpreting Urban Landscape to be a photo that "feels" urban and this one does.  What I like best is the fact that the students are walking as opposed to standing or sitting (and students are the best representation of any urban landscape).  Outside of that the colors are crisp and the composition balanced in a way that is very pleasing.   Nice photo.', '2003-10-14 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(450613, 41218, 5705, '<td valign="top">Winner!!!  HANDS DOWN!!  <br/>Where do I start? Its perfect, the exposure, the view of almost an entire city, I''m Stunned!  <br/>This is a postcard! One of the best images Ive seen in a long time ,including some very tough competition in this challenge included..<br/> <br/>Where did you take this picture from to get this amazing view!<br/> <br/>I wish I could give it a 20, but a HUGE 10 will have to do!</td>', 'Winner!!!  HANDS DOWN!!  Where do I start? Its perfect, the exposure, the view of almost an entire city, I''m Stunned!  This is a postcard! One of the best images Ive seen in a long time ,including some very tough competition in this challenge included.. Where did you take this picture from to get this amazing view! I wish I could give it a 20, but a HUGE 10 will have to do!', '2003-10-14 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(450614, 40681, 12719, '<td valign="top">excellent. something about the idea of a pink hospital apeals to me. natty. wonderful shot of it too, nice light bursts and lovely reflection. mmmmyes.</td>', 'excellent. something about the idea of a pink hospital apeals to me. natty. wonderful shot of it too, nice light bursts and lovely reflection. mmmmyes.', '2003-10-14 22:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450615, 41140, 12943, '<td valign="top">Great picture.</td>', 'Great picture.', '2003-10-14 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(450619, 40924, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the downtown skyline. The nearer houses being mostly obscured by trees, don''t work so well for me, and the bright foreground lights draw my eye into the mostly-empty space there, rather than focussing on the more distant buildings/lights, which seem more attractively exposed.</td>', 'I like the downtown skyline. The nearer houses being mostly obscured by trees, don''t work so well for me, and the bright foreground lights draw my eye into the mostly-empty space there, rather than focussing on the more distant buildings/lights, which seem more attractively exposed.', '2003-10-14 23:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(450622, 40736, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene as far as feel, but there''s a lot of artifact here - diagonal lines in the near doorframe, and along the upper faces of the building; rough/blurry look making the signs harder to read than the size would seem likely to do.</td>', 'This is a nice scene as far as feel, but there''s a lot of artifact here - diagonal lines in the near doorframe, and along the upper faces of the building; rough/blurry look making the signs harder to read than the size would seem likely to do.', '2003-10-14 23:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(450626, 41332, 4485, '<td valign="top">just a bit too washed out</td>', 'just a bit too washed out', '2003-10-14 23:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(450629, 41218, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  By far my favourite for the challenge.  It''s nice to see a night shot that is properly done.  Most of the other ones have too much haze or were overexposed.  There does seem to be some noise in the sky, but you could pass that off as stars.  Excellent work.  Keep it up!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  By far my favourite for the challenge.  It''s nice to see a night shot that is properly done.  Most of the other ones have too much haze or were overexposed.  There does seem to be some noise in the sky, but you could pass that off as stars.  Excellent work.  Keep it up!', '2003-10-14 23:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(450630, 41181, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, peaceful area, a very rural urban with the landscape, well done!  I wonder though if this might look better either in it''s original color or even sepia to indicate another era.  The lighting is very good except for the one spot on the left on the landing, dang sun! ;)</td>', 'What a lovely, peaceful area, a very rural urban with the landscape, well done!  I wonder though if this might look better either in it''s original color or even sepia to indicate another era.  The lighting is very good except for the one spot on the left on the landing, dang sun! ;)', '2003-10-14 23:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(450632, 40927, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Is that fairly new?  I have been to Toledo and I sure don''t remember that, but then again it''s been a few years :)  That guilding almost looks pasted in, the lines are so crisp and clear, I love it!  The balance is just slightly off for me, maybe just a tad more cropping off either side but not both?</td>', 'WOW!  Is that fairly new?  I have been to Toledo and I sure don''t remember that, but then again it''s been a few years :)  That guilding almost looks pasted in, the lines are so crisp and clear, I love it!  The balance is just slightly off for me, maybe just a tad more cropping off either side but not both?', '2003-10-14 23:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(450634, 41338, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on this one, the burnt oranges are wonderful, the balance is also very nice and the cropping top to bottom is close to perfect.  But the overall shot is too much out of focus for my personal taste, a bit sharper and this would have gotten an 8 or 9 from me.</td>', 'I love the colors on this one, the burnt oranges are wonderful, the balance is also very nice and the cropping top to bottom is close to perfect.  But the overall shot is too much out of focus for my personal taste, a bit sharper and this would have gotten an 8 or 9 from me.', '2003-10-14 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(450635, 41024, 5373, '<td valign="top">its a nice photo but its a little typical</td>', 'its a nice photo but its a little typical', '2003-10-14 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(450636, 41134, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this so many times and there is something that kept bothering me about the shot.  I love the building, the angle the shot was taken at, the three palm trees in front and then it finally hit me like a brick, the palm trees on the left kept distracting me everytime I came to look at this.  The colors are wonderful and the clarity of the shot, the DOF are fantastic but those dang trees kept you from getting a 10 from me, sorry :(</td>', 'I''ve come back to this so many times and there is something that kept bothering me about the shot.  I love the building, the angle the shot was taken at, the three palm trees in front and then it finally hit me like a brick, the palm trees on the left kept distracting me everytime I came to look at this.  The colors are wonderful and the clarity of the shot, the DOF are fantastic but those dang trees kept you from getting a 10 from me, sorry :(', '2003-10-14 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(450637, 41183, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the reflection of the old in the new building really lends that sense of urban and you have the landscape down for me.  The darkness of the building in the front is slightly distracting and the building on the right side also pulls me away.  But other than that a wonderful shot overall.</td>', 'I really like this shot, the reflection of the old in the new building really lends that sense of urban and you have the landscape down for me.  The darkness of the building in the front is slightly distracting and the building on the right side also pulls me away.  But other than that a wonderful shot overall.', '2003-10-14 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(450639, 41138, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful church and capturing the birds in flight was such a nice touch.  If only that darn building wasn''t in the background but then again it lends a sense of the present to the shot.  The only other thing that throws me just a bit is the angle of shot, can''t quite put my finger on it because the building brings you in from the left and takes you all around the shot, I think it''s the patch of grass in the front, the shape or something, I know, nit picky.  I''m raising my score on this one by at least 5 points :)</td>', 'This is such a beautiful church and capturing the birds in flight was such a nice touch.  If only that darn building wasn''t in the background but then again it lends a sense of the present to the shot.  The only other thing that throws me just a bit is the angle of shot, can''t quite put my finger on it because the building brings you in from the left and takes you all around the shot, I think it''s the patch of grass in the front, the shape or something, I know, nit picky.  I''m raising my score on this one by at least 5 points :)', '2003-10-14 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(450640, 40924, 12448, '<td valign="top">The idea was great but the actual shot leaves much to my imagination, which isn''t always a bad thing but on this one it is, too much darkness across the bottom, a tighter crop and the lights in the center left could have lead you into the shot to the landscape across the back.</td>', 'The idea was great but the actual shot leaves much to my imagination, which isn''t always a bad thing but on this one it is, too much darkness across the bottom, a tighter crop and the lights in the center left could have lead you into the shot to the landscape across the back.', '2003-10-14 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(450642, 41325, 5373, '<td valign="top">not very urban though</td>', 'not very urban though', '2003-10-14 23:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(450643, 41261, 8911, '<td valign="top">A bit of leaning at the edges from the distortion of the wide-angle shot, but what a lovely scene. I like the light and the character of the clouds, and the fact that the buildings are so crisp for their size in the photo.</td>', 'A bit of leaning at the edges from the distortion of the wide-angle shot, but what a lovely scene. I like the light and the character of the clouds, and the fact that the buildings are so crisp for their size in the photo.', '2003-10-14 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(450644, 40987, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a great scene for urban landscape, and very crisp - the distortion makes it look like the right side of the photograph is leaning out, however.</td>', 'This is a great scene for urban landscape, and very crisp - the distortion makes it look like the right side of the photograph is leaning out, however.', '2003-10-14 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
