(450650, 40671, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very good!  I love the DOF and angle, and I really like the tones here.</td>', 'Very good!  I love the DOF and angle, and I really like the tones here.', '2003-10-14 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(450653, 41265, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, you have the urban with the landscape but the lighting seems blown out on the building, maybe played with the brightness and contrast or hues a little too much?  If that is natural lighting from them someone needs to talk to them!   Also the building have the tip cut off a little more open cropping on the top.  I like the overall balance between the tree and the building.</td>', 'I like the idea, you have the urban with the landscape but the lighting seems blown out on the building, maybe played with the brightness and contrast or hues a little too much?  If that is natural lighting from them someone needs to talk to them!   Also the building have the tip cut off a little more open cropping on the top.  I like the overall balance between the tree and the building.', '2003-10-14 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
