(450655, 40532, 9441, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  Such a wonderful portayal of ''city life''.  Good capture of the lighting and height of the buildings.  The clouds in the sky add a certain interest to this photo.  Good job!  A 10</td>', 'I really like this photo!  Such a wonderful portayal of ''city life''.  Good capture of the lighting and height of the buildings.  The clouds in the sky add a certain interest to this photo.  Good job!  A 10', '2003-10-14 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
