(450666, 40859, 8911, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast of the different styles and colors. The similar lines and forms present here and there unify it enough to keep it from feeling over-busy, for me anyway.</td>', 'I really like the contrast of the different styles and colors. The similar lines and forms present here and there unify it enough to keep it from feeling over-busy, for me anyway.', '2003-10-15 00:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
