(450670, 41066, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I love all the wonderful detail here, and the lighting and colors are awesome!  Terrific reflection captured....I''m giving this one a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I love all the wonderful detail here, and the lighting and colors are awesome!  Terrific reflection captured....I''m giving this one a 10.', '2003-10-15 00:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
