(450673, 41289, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this overall shot, the reflections in the water, the cropping, the balance and the color.  The border doesn''t quite seem to work with the shot itself, maybe a different color or a tad smaller?</td>', 'I really like this overall shot, the reflections in the water, the cropping, the balance and the color.  The border doesn''t quite seem to work with the shot itself, maybe a different color or a tad smaller?', '2003-10-15 00:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
