(450677, 41134, 9441, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot!  Wonderful detail captured, and the palms certainly add a certain ''flair'' to this photo....congrats on a job well done!  10</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot!  Wonderful detail captured, and the palms certainly add a certain ''flair'' to this photo....congrats on a job well done!  10', '2003-10-15 00:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(450678, 40510, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this shot, they draw you in and take you around the entire picture and taking pictures at night can be so difficult getting that clear, crisp shot, I know, I''ve been trying all night long tonight.  The shot just seems to go on forever and the colors in the back are wonderful.  The bright patch in the lower right is a bit distracting, a slightly tighter crop might have helped with this?</td>', 'I like the lines in this shot, they draw you in and take you around the entire picture and taking pictures at night can be so difficult getting that clear, crisp shot, I know, I''ve been trying all night long tonight.  The shot just seems to go on forever and the colors in the back are wonderful.  The bright patch in the lower right is a bit distracting, a slightly tighter crop might have helped with this?', '2003-10-15 00:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450679, 41048, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot leaves me wanting somehow.  I like the colors, the lighting is well done but the cropping and the angle of the shot seems off to me personally.  Maybe if you had more of the building and less of the right side, the sign is very distracting to me.</td>', 'This shot leaves me wanting somehow.  I like the colors, the lighting is well done but the cropping and the angle of the shot seems off to me personally.  Maybe if you had more of the building and less of the right side, the sign is very distracting to me.', '2003-10-15 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(450680, 40813, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in the clouds, very dramatic.  But the shot overall is a bit too dark for me and the train and rail draw my attention out of the shot because of the direction it''s heading.  The building to the right is a good balance to help draw you back in but that train just keeps taking me out! ;)</td>', 'I love the colors in the clouds, very dramatic.  But the shot overall is a bit too dark for me and the train and rail draw my attention out of the shot because of the direction it''s heading.  The building to the right is a good balance to help draw you back in but that train just keeps taking me out! ;)', '2003-10-15 00:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(450681, 41345, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm colors, I like the subject matter.  Good composition and show of detail.  10</td>', 'Beautiful warm colors, I like the subject matter.  Good composition and show of detail.  10', '2003-10-15 00:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450684, 40754, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, so busy!  But then again, not really for the LA area, it''s been a few years since I''ve been there.  I like the time exposure and the car lights and street lights came out about as close to perfect as you could ask, but the building lights, especially on the right of the shot just really didn''t seem to come out right to me.  I love the colors and the cropping is wonderful, the street brings you in on the right and takes you right through the shot.</td>', 'Wow, so busy!  But then again, not really for the LA area, it''s been a few years since I''ve been there.  I like the time exposure and the car lights and street lights came out about as close to perfect as you could ask, but the building lights, especially on the right of the shot just really didn''t seem to come out right to me.  I love the colors and the cropping is wonderful, the street brings you in on the right and takes you right through the shot.', '2003-10-15 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450687, 41324, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is awfully small, both on the screen and in terms of file size - so there are lots of artifacts and it''s hard to make out details. It looks like an interesting street, from what I can see, but I''d like to see it better.</td>', 'This is awfully small, both on the screen and in terms of file size - so there are lots of artifacts and it''s hard to make out details. It looks like an interesting street, from what I can see, but I''d like to see it better.', '2003-10-15 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(450688, 41260, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have to comment on this one.  The angle of the shot really got to me or the cropping, I''m not really sure which it is.  If the building had filled half of the shot going from one lower corner to the opposite higher corner I would like this much more.  The lighting seems to work well though the building seems a tad dark to me.</td>', 'I have to comment on this one.  The angle of the shot really got to me or the cropping, I''m not really sure which it is.  If the building had filled half of the shot going from one lower corner to the opposite higher corner I would like this much more.  The lighting seems to work well though the building seems a tad dark to me.', '2003-10-15 00:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(450690, 40540, 8367, '<td valign="top">Everything is perfect. I love it. 10</td>', 'Everything is perfect. I love it. 10', '2003-10-15 00:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(450694, 40959, 6073, '<td valign="top">Well done!  10</td>', 'Well done!  10', '2003-10-15 00:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(450695, 41215, 8911, '<td valign="top">What a neat clock tower! There''s a blueish halo around the edges on the left, where the light is so bright, and I wonder if it might work better if it had been straightened up - it gives the impression of leaning, this way.</td>', 'What a neat clock tower! There''s a blueish halo around the edges on the left, where the light is so bright, and I wonder if it might work better if it had been straightened up - it gives the impression of leaning, this way.', '2003-10-15 00:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(450696, 40952, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The blue sky and the reflections are beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice. The blue sky and the reflections are beautiful.', '2003-10-15 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(450697, 40760, 7711, '<td valign="top">border is too heavy, but I like the shot..the perspective is dizzying.</td>', 'border is too heavy, but I like the shot..the perspective is dizzying.', '2003-10-15 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450701, 40959, 8911, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice, nice exposure/focus on this one - raelly stunning how crisp it is, and how much of the crowd you can see without losing detail in the brighter areas. This is gorgeous.</td>', 'Wow. Nice, nice exposure/focus on this one - raelly stunning how crisp it is, and how much of the crowd you can see without losing detail in the brighter areas. This is gorgeous.', '2003-10-15 00:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(450702, 41260, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture. I like the angle you chose.</td>', 'Very interesting capture. I like the angle you chose.', '2003-10-15 00:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(450704, 40460, 8911, '<td valign="top">Really like the soft look here, the fog and the way it plays with the light. I could easily see this on a postcard - it''s wonderful, and the exposure is great, as is the focus - this is as crisp as it can be, and still look right with the fog.</td>', 'Really like the soft look here, the fog and the way it plays with the light. I could easily see this on a postcard - it''s wonderful, and the exposure is great, as is the focus - this is as crisp as it can be, and still look right with the fog.', '2003-10-15 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(450706, 40681, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and lighting.  I like the starlights.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wonderful color and lighting.  I like the starlights.  Nice job!', '2003-10-15 00:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(450709, 41065, 9441, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Stunning photography!  Beautiful lighting, wonderful warm tones, fantastic detail capture!  Score: 10.</td>', 'WOW!  Stunning photography!  Beautiful lighting, wonderful warm tones, fantastic detail capture!  Score: 10.', '2003-10-15 00:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(450710, 41189, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very interesting compostion and angle.  Good DOF....nicely done!</td>', 'Very interesting compostion and angle.  Good DOF....nicely done!', '2003-10-15 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(450711, 41138, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  Wonderful variety of colors, nice tones, fabulous detail.  I like the capture of the birds, it adds a lot of interest to this photo and conveys a certain mood.  Wonderful composition...I could go on and on about this photo!  A 10!</td>', 'Beautifully done!  Wonderful variety of colors, nice tones, fabulous detail.  I like the capture of the birds, it adds a lot of interest to this photo and conveys a certain mood.  Wonderful composition...I could go on and on about this photo!  A 10!', '2003-10-15 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(450712, 41133, 7711, '<td valign="top">did you try this in bw? I think it would look cool given the amount of similar tones! love the composition, great city. :)</td>', 'did you try this in bw? I think it would look cool given the amount of similar tones! love the composition, great city. :)', '2003-10-15 00:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(450714, 40701, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this but the negative space on this shot hurts you, if the buildings were more defined, a bit clearer.  The colors in this shot also throw me off a bit, maybe a tad more brightness?</td>', 'I like the idea behind this but the negative space on this shot hurts you, if the buildings were more defined, a bit clearer.  The colors in this shot also throw me off a bit, maybe a tad more brightness?', '2003-10-15 00:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(450716, 41251, 12448, '<td valign="top">This really conveys urban to me, the underside if you will.  The fence is very distracting though, maybe if you had been able to shot it from the other side so it was background instead of in your face.  The lighting is wonderful and I like the cropping overall</td>', 'This really conveys urban to me, the underside if you will.  The fence is very distracting though, maybe if you had been able to shot it from the other side so it was background instead of in your face.  The lighting is wonderful and I like the cropping overall', '2003-10-15 00:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(450717, 40987, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness, but the tilt does nothing for me. Its not enough to look deliberate, and just comes off a bit sloppy. otherwise, grand shot!</td>', 'I love the crispness, but the tilt does nothing for me. Its not enough to look deliberate, and just comes off a bit sloppy. otherwise, grand shot!', '2003-10-15 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(450719, 41287, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love the color and detail!  10</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love the color and detail!  10', '2003-10-15 01:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(450720, 41218, 4493, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Be proud! Truely above the rest!</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Be proud! Truely above the rest!', '2003-10-15 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(450721, 41218, 5333, '<td valign="top">Yup, above all.....  congrats!</td>', 'Yup, above all.....  congrats!', '2003-10-15 01:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(450722, 41327, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice tones.  Lots of wonderful detail!</td>', 'nice tones.  Lots of wonderful detail!', '2003-10-15 01:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(450723, 41218, 6870, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo! A well deserved ribbon! Congrats!</td>', 'Amazing photo! A well deserved ribbon! Congrats!', '2003-10-15 01:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(450724, 41218, 8953, '<td valign="top">WOW! one of the best shots on the site. Good Job! congrats on your first ribbon (more to follow) and It is time for the Cubs to Win too.<br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'WOW! one of the best shots on the site. Good Job! congrats on your first ribbon (more to follow) and It is time for the Cubs to Win too. Richard', '2003-10-15 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(450725, 41294, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, interesting detail...good composition!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, interesting detail...good composition!', '2003-10-15 01:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(450727, 41346, 7711, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful curve and a beautiful shot. Congratulations!</td>', 'what a beautiful curve and a beautiful shot. Congratulations!', '2003-10-15 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(450729, 41155, 5112, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!!!!  Great picture!<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!!!!  Great picture! Ursula', '2003-10-15 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(450730, 41218, 259, '<td valign="top">nice job buddy.  as your old college roommate you need to thank me for everything i taught you.  just kidding, you''ve out done me by far and will probably continue to.  this won''t be your last ribbon i''m sure.</td>', 'nice job buddy.  as your old college roommate you need to thank me for everything i taught you.  just kidding, you''ve out done me by far and will probably continue to.  this won''t be your last ribbon i''m sure.', '2003-10-15 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(450737, 41010, 10625, '<td valign="top">disappointed that this didn''t place higher.</td>', 'disappointed that this didn''t place higher.', '2003-10-15 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(450738, 41049, 12812, '<td valign="top">I appreciate all the comments made. Urban Landscapes was my first challenge and in the process of shrinking my image to upload it in the required file size it acquired the grid. The grid does not appear on the actual image.</td>', 'I appreciate all the comments made. Urban Landscapes was my first challenge and in the process of shrinking my image to upload it in the required file size it acquired the grid. The grid does not appear on the actual image.', '2003-10-15 01:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(450741, 41010, 675, '<td valign="top">one of my favs from the challenge...great job</td>', 'one of my favs from the challenge...great job', '2003-10-15 01:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(450745, 41218, 10402, '<td valign="top">Your first ribbon! Now you''ll have to change your bio!</td>', 'Your first ribbon! Now you''ll have to change your bio!', '2003-10-15 01:19:12.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(450763, 41174, 11895, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented.  Many of you mentioned that it was a cold or desolate scene without people.  That is what I felt as I took the picture and processed it so I am glad some of it came thru.  A large city can be a cold, desolate, and impersonal place.</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented.  Many of you mentioned that it was a cold or desolate scene without people.  That is what I felt as I took the picture and processed it so I am glad some of it came thru.  A large city can be a cold, desolate, and impersonal place.', '2003-10-15 01:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(450765, 41389, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce work, Tony! Congrats on your frist ribbon!</td>', 'NIce work, Tony! Congrats on your frist ribbon!', '2003-10-15 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(450766, 41287, 12813, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and sharp. Wish it scored higher.</td>', 'Beautiful and sharp. Wish it scored higher.', '2003-10-15 01:36:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(450770, 41218, 1717, '<td valign="top">awesome shot, josh...i''m so proud for you (and of you!).  congratulations on your first of many ribbons to come.<br/> <br/>hugs...<br/>sher<br/>xoxo</td>', 'awesome shot, josh...i''m so proud for you (and of you!).  congratulations on your first of many ribbons to come. hugs...sherxoxo', '2003-10-15 01:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(450776, 41132, 714, '<td valign="top">Sounds and looks like you were pretty lucky to get this shot when you did.  Very nice contrast.  Great image!</td>', 'Sounds and looks like you were pretty lucky to get this shot when you did.  Very nice contrast.  Great image!', '2003-10-15 01:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(450778, 40519, 12813, '<td valign="top">my favorite shot of the challenge. It captures the spirit of the place, and yet it could be another city altogether, could be anywhere. like poetry.</td>', 'my favorite shot of the challenge. It captures the spirit of the place, and yet it could be another city altogether, could be anywhere. like poetry.', '2003-10-15 01:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(450779, 41272, 714, '<td valign="top">Excellent image! Way to go!</td>', 'Excellent image! Way to go!', '2003-10-15 01:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(450780, 41346, 714, '<td valign="top">You almost got yourself a ribbon.  Rats! Very nice shot!  The tones are perfect!</td>', 'You almost got yourself a ribbon.  Rats! Very nice shot!  The tones are perfect!', '2003-10-15 01:49:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(450785, 41217, 12813, '<td valign="top">I like the fact it''s tilted, makes the crane look alive, like the rainbow</td>', 'I like the fact it''s tilted, makes the crane look alive, like the rainbow', '2003-10-15 01:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(450787, 41155, 10275, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much everyone for all your comments. My 6th place finish is a dream in this challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-21 06:57:50.</i></td>', 'Thank you so much everyone for all your comments. My 6th place finish is a dream in this challenge.', '2003-10-15 01:56:13.000000', '2003-11-21 06:57:50.000000', 0),
(450793, 41389, 10275, '<td valign="top">Congrats hubby on your shot. You''ve just became my biggest competition :-))</td>', 'Congrats hubby on your shot. You''ve just became my biggest competition :-))', '2003-10-15 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(450794, 41407, 12813, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that abstract painting, the Chocolate Grinder. Love the tone</td>', 'Reminds me of that abstract painting, the Chocolate Grinder. Love the tone', '2003-10-15 02:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(450802, 41389, 10419, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your high votes and great comments. I am very happy with my 3rd place finish.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your high votes and great comments. I am very happy with my 3rd place finish.', '2003-10-15 02:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(450803, 41003, 12813, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very old photograph of a place that has longs since changed. Nice and different.</td>', 'Looks like a very old photograph of a place that has longs since changed. Nice and different.', '2003-10-15 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(450804, 41309, 12151, '<td valign="top">oh well- i still think you should have scored among the top photos, if not have been the winner.  obviously only mainstream, postcard styles will "win" in the dpchallenge, but don''t worry- I really like this photo, and I''m sure others do too.  you wouldn''t have prints available would you?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-15 01:05:28.</i></td>', 'oh well- i still think you should have scored among the top photos, if not have been the winner.  obviously only mainstream, postcard styles will "win" in the dpchallenge, but don''t worry- I really like this photo, and I''m sure others do too.  you wouldn''t have prints available would you?', '2003-10-15 02:04:51.000000', '2003-10-15 02:05:28.000000', 0),
(450808, 41392, 10983, '<td valign="top">Thank you all who commented on my image.</td>', 'Thank you all who commented on my image.', '2003-10-15 02:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(450816, 41218, 5728, '<td valign="top">Josh good on ya, your first ribbon! You can be very proud of this one not only is it a bluey but it was won in an extremely tough challenge.</td>', 'Josh good on ya, your first ribbon! You can be very proud of this one not only is it a bluey but it was won in an extremely tough challenge.', '2003-10-15 02:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(450818, 41409, 4927, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. I''m glad that some people noticed the layers and repeating patterns. :) I had to mess with the autofocus brackets and change the aperature to 8.0 after trying several other settings to finally get the ''skyscraper'' focused well because it kept turning out softer than I wanted it.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. I''m glad that some people noticed the layers and repeating patterns. :) I had to mess with the autofocus brackets and change the aperature to 8.0 after trying several other settings to finally get the ''skyscraper'' focused well because it kept turning out softer than I wanted it.', '2003-10-15 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(450819, 41010, 7531, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments! A quick note for those that had a problem with the term ''Painting'', it was meant to relay a metaphorical sense of paining a landscape which in this case was urban.</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments! A quick note for those that had a problem with the term ''Painting'', it was meant to relay a metaphorical sense of paining a landscape which in this case was urban.', '2003-10-15 02:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(450821, 40665, 12618, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted for this shot, particularly the high scores :)  I especially like all the comments.  I have since taken the advice of many of you and shot the scene from just under the lights in the foreground so as to eliminate them from the shot...Unfortunately, the platform is right on top of a bridge and I will be lucky to get a shot without camera shake....I''m having fun here, 1 top 10 finish and 1 top 20 with only 2 submissions...whooohooo!</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted for this shot, particularly the high scores :)  I especially like all the comments.  I have since taken the advice of many of you and shot the scene from just under the lights in the foreground so as to eliminate them from the shot...Unfortunately, the platform is right on top of a bridge and I will be lucky to get a shot without camera shake....I''m having fun here, 1 top 10 finish and 1 top 20 with only 2 submissions...whooohooo!', '2003-10-15 02:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(450823, 41407, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the good contrast in the shadows. Really helps to make the cylinders show off their rounded shapes. Great fluffy clouds. I gave you the "10"</td>', 'I like the good contrast in the shadows. Really helps to make the cylinders show off their rounded shapes. Great fluffy clouds. I gave you the "10"', '2003-10-15 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(450825, 40671, 9109, '<td valign="top">Wow thanks for all the comments and votes, this is my best so far at DPC.<br/> <br/>Now to answer everyone''s queries and debunk some stuff:<br/> <br/>- Yes these are the Petronas Twin Towers, a.k.a. KLCC, right in the capital of Malaysia (Kuala Lumpur).<br/>- Due to the overcast sky and nature of the building itself, this made the whole picture look like a duotone or B&amp;W. Trust me, it isn''t! ;)<br/> <br/>Thanks again everyone! ^_^</td>', 'Wow thanks for all the comments and votes, this is my best so far at DPC. Now to answer everyone''s queries and debunk some stuff: - Yes these are the Petronas Twin Towers, a.k.a. KLCC, right in the capital of Malaysia (Kuala Lumpur).- Due to the overcast sky and nature of the building itself, this made the whole picture look like a duotone or B&W. Trust me, it isn''t! ;) Thanks again everyone! ^_^', '2003-10-15 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(450829, 41010, 200, '<td valign="top">Ha...this was one of my favorites...glad to see it was you chez!</td>', 'Ha...this was one of my favorites...glad to see it was you chez!', '2003-10-15 02:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(450830, 41218, 2352, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon!  It`s about time!!!<br/>Awsome shot!!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon!  It`s about time!!!Awsome shot!!!', '2003-10-15 02:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(450833, 41165, 200, '<td valign="top">I didnt realize you have such great graveyards over there. Very nice!</td>', 'I didnt realize you have such great graveyards over there. Very nice!', '2003-10-15 02:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(450861, 40645, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey Loz, congrats on your best score so far. You do your new camera justice there. It''s good to know it went into good hands.</td>', 'Hey Loz, congrats on your best score so far. You do your new camera justice there. It''s good to know it went into good hands.', '2003-10-15 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(450864, 40645, 7706, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i>Hey Loz, congrats on your best score so far. You do your new camera justice there. It''s good to know it went into good hands.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wait till I beat your best score ;) You will quickly change your mind lol<br/> <br/>Thanks :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-15 02:29:44.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness:Hey Loz, congrats on your best score so far. You do your new camera justice there. It''s good to know it went into good hands.  Wait till I beat your best score ;) You will quickly change your mind lol Thanks :)', '2003-10-15 03:27:46.000000', '2003-10-15 03:29:44.000000', 0),
(450866, 41336, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah Stephan, now I really should have recognised that tower shouldn''t I? After all it is our Berlin meeting place :-) Tolles Bild!</td>', 'Ah Stephan, now I really should have recognised that tower shouldn''t I? After all it is our Berlin meeting place :-) Tolles Bild!', '2003-10-15 03:36:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(450869, 41303, 10799, '<td valign="top">You finished well with this one!</td>', 'You finished well with this one!', '2003-10-15 03:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(450871, 41177, 12316, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments.', '2003-10-15 03:47:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(450873, 41412, 7706, '<td valign="top">Hey Pam, its good to see you entering again. I often check your profile to see how you do :)</td>', 'Hey Pam, its good to see you entering again. I often check your profile to see how you do :)', '2003-10-15 03:58:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(450874, 41218, 13058, '<td valign="top">Thats a great shot!!</td>', 'Thats a great shot!!', '2003-10-15 04:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(450876, 41010, 6999, '<td valign="top">Should have won ... by a distance the best shot in this challenge for me.</td>', 'Should have won ... by a distance the best shot in this challenge for me.', '2003-10-15 04:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(450877, 41177, 12902, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dave Gordon:</b></div><hr/><i>What a beautiful town square. The guy at the right might have been a real asset if you''d caught him sooner. As it is, he seems to be walking out of the phtoto - and taking me with him.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> <br/>It would have been nice if the guy would have walked in. But I think that a person or a tree in that exactly spot is a must, for the balance of the picture.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dave Gordon:What a beautiful town square. The guy at the right might have been a real asset if you''d caught him sooner. As it is, he seems to be walking out of the phtoto - and taking me with him.   It would have been nice if the guy would have walked in. But I think that a person or a tree in that exactly spot is a must, for the balance of the picture.', '2003-10-15 04:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(450881, 41217, 10635, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Shannon:</b></div><hr/><i>to bad the rainbow didn''t extend further.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>The rainbow did orginally go alot further across, but the shots I took of that were from a different angle.  This was the best lighting shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by Shannon:to bad the rainbow didn''t extend further. The rainbow did orginally go alot further across, but the shots I took of that were from a different angle.  This was the best lighting shot.', '2003-10-15 04:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(450886, 41046, 11457, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all the persons who dropped a comment! Just a few notes. This photograph is meant as a counterpoint between urban structures and natural structures. Thus I wanted the image to convey this idea of each party trying to "take over" the other. Hence come both the large amount of foreground and the low perspective: I wanted the flowers to look as they were "competing" with the building. The out-of-focus flower at the bottom left is also there on purpose: I chose a round one because I wanted it to contrast with the steel sphere of the building. I wanted it to be out of focus because otherwise it would have taken too much of the viewer''s attention. Most importantly, I wanted the viewer to feel the presence of the flower when watching the building, to be distracted by it - and yet have his eyes slip off it, brought away by the sharper focus of the rest. I am actually glad that so many people complained about the flower being "distracting": it is designed to be so. I wanted the flower and the building to actually compete, as visual elements of the image, for the attention of the viewer. This is meant to be a dissonance. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=42363" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here</a> you can see an outtake for the same subject: more building, less foreground, higher perspective, no flower - it''s plain boring imho. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-15 03:45:19.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all the persons who dropped a comment! Just a few notes. This photograph is meant as a counterpoint between urban structures and natural structures. Thus I wanted the image to convey this idea of each party trying to "take over" the other. Hence come both the large amount of foreground and the low perspective: I wanted the flowers to look as they were "competing" with the building. The out-of-focus flower at the bottom left is also there on purpose: I chose a round one because I wanted it to contrast with the steel sphere of the building. I wanted it to be out of focus because otherwise it would have taken too much of the viewer''s attention. Most importantly, I wanted the viewer to feel the presence of the flower when watching the building, to be distracted by it - and yet have his eyes slip off it, brought away by the sharper focus of the rest. I am actually glad that so many people complained about the flower being "distracting": it is designed to be so. I wanted the flower and the building to actually compete, as visual elements of the image, for the attention of the viewer. This is meant to be a dissonance. Here you can see an outtake for the same subject: more building, less foreground, higher perspective, no flower - it''s plain boring imho. ;)', '2003-10-15 04:42:47.000000', '2003-10-15 04:45:19.000000', 0),
(450893, 41410, 9809, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to say much about my photo the first time around -- I was submitting against the deadline. The weather on the weekend before wasn''t that special, so I didn''t even go downtown to see if I could get a shot. Tuesday the weather was great, so I left work early, rode my motorcycle the 25 miles to downtown, and started shooting. I had several locations in mind, and this was the last one. I think I stood there about an hour, shooting various shots as the sun set. At about 7:30, I deemed myself done, raced home, and quickly flipped through to pick one of the 200 or so shots I had taken. By the time I finished editing it, and a few others (see the out takes in the forum discussion <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=49354" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">My Urban Landscape Out takes</a>, I only had about 5 minutes left to choose which I really wanted to post, post it, and give the description.<br/> <br/>This was shot with no tripod, but not hand held either. I rested the camera on a hand rail. I rode my motorcycle downtown because I knew it would be easier to park, but that excluded me bringing my tripod. I was able to bring my lenses though, but for this shot, I used the old trusty Canon EF 28-135mm f3.5-5.6 IS.</td>', 'I didn''t get to say much about my photo the first time around -- I was submitting against the deadline. The weather on the weekend before wasn''t that special, so I didn''t even go downtown to see if I could get a shot. Tuesday the weather was great, so I left work early, rode my motorcycle the 25 miles to downtown, and started shooting. I had several locations in mind, and this was the last one. I think I stood there about an hour, shooting various shots as the sun set. At about 7:30, I deemed myself done, raced home, and quickly flipped through to pick one of the 200 or so shots I had taken. By the time I finished editing it, and a few others (see the out takes in the forum discussion My Urban Landscape Out takes, I only had about 5 minutes left to choose which I really wanted to post, post it, and give the description. This was shot with no tripod, but not hand held either. I rested the camera on a hand rail. I rode my motorcycle downtown because I knew it would be easier to park, but that excluded me bringing my tripod. I was able to bring my lenses though, but for this shot, I used the old trusty Canon EF 28-135mm f3.5-5.6 IS.', '2003-10-15 04:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(450897, 41346, 3585, '<td valign="top">The subtlety of the color tones + my colorblindness led me to think that was a b&amp;w photo at first. Love the sharp rhythm of the fading skyline in the water. A quality shot.</td>', 'The subtlety of the color tones + my colorblindness led me to think that was a b&w photo at first. Love the sharp rhythm of the fading skyline in the water. A quality shot.', '2003-10-15 05:28:10.000000', NULL, 0),
