(451053, 41303, 11096, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tfaust:</b></div><hr/><i>Where does the singing come into play, is how the walls are shaped and how wind moves through them?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These walkways always "sing" when the wind picks up.  They connect all 9 of the buildings in the complex where I work.  They are arranged like a figure 8.</td>', 'Originally posted by tfaust:Where does the singing come into play, is how the walls are shaped and how wind moves through them?  These walkways always "sing" when the wind picks up.  They connect all 9 of the buildings in the complex where I work.  They are arranged like a figure 8.', '2003-10-15 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
