(451586, 40869, 12834, '<td valign="top">The new Walt Disney Concert Hall has not even seen its first show! I took lots of shots of the building, but I selected one that didn''t give away its true form. I liked the mystery and strangeness of this shot. Plus, this isn''t something you see every day.<br/>Unfortunately, the sky in Los Angeles never turns any color except brown! I was looking for sunset or blue, but it was extremely smoggy. Even after dark, the sky became a dark brown glow from streetlights.<br/></td>', 'The new Walt Disney Concert Hall has not even seen its first show! I took lots of shots of the building, but I selected one that didn''t give away its true form. I liked the mystery and strangeness of this shot. Plus, this isn''t something you see every day.Unfortunately, the sky in Los Angeles never turns any color except brown! I was looking for sunset or blue, but it was extremely smoggy. Even after dark, the sky became a dark brown glow from streetlights.', '2003-10-15 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(451587, 41331, 10360, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kdsprog:</b></div><hr/><i>Rittenhouse square?</i></td></tr></table> That''s correct.  Ritten House square is the area, this was taken in the park at the center.</td>', 'Originally posted by kdsprog:Rittenhouse square? That''s correct.  Ritten House square is the area, this was taken in the park at the center.', '2003-10-15 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(451606, 41218, 6900, '<td valign="top">Achiral - I said it once and I will say it again.  This is the best pure image on DPC since the Matrix challenge and "You think that''s air you''re breathing now?" <br/> <br/>Whoever gave this a 2 or a 3 or even a 4 - I would just ADORE you to PM me your reasons.  I think you''re smoking something.  2?  Look again.</td>', 'Achiral - I said it once and I will say it again.  This is the best pure image on DPC since the Matrix challenge and "You think that''s air you''re breathing now?"  Whoever gave this a 2 or a 3 or even a 4 - I would just ADORE you to PM me your reasons.  I think you''re smoking something.  2?  Look again.', '2003-10-15 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
