(451629, 40500, 12753, '<td valign="top">Hi to everybody out there. Lots of thanks for your comments. This is my first time here, and I really enjoyed the thrill of the voting process and reading your comments afterwards. <br/> <br/>I took this picture trough a 45 angle window, which reflected the city that was on my right. And through the glass there was that elevation. So both landscapes met in front of my Finepix lens. <br/> <br/>I turned to BW because, like you noticed, the window was dirty and in color this picture was much more confusing. It really looked nice in color. Wish I can show the original to you. After reading your comments I made a different crop and it really worked a lot better. <br/> <br/>Thanks to all for your comments, and hope to see you soon again. I think I''ll join to the ALL ALONE challenge....<br/> <br/>See ya, <br/> <br/>Pablo<br/>Founder of <br/><a href="//www.pixelatesight.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pixelatesight.com</a></td>', 'Hi to everybody out there. Lots of thanks for your comments. This is my first time here, and I really enjoyed the thrill of the voting process and reading your comments afterwards.  I took this picture trough a 45 angle window, which reflected the city that was on my right. And through the glass there was that elevation. So both landscapes met in front of my Finepix lens.  I turned to BW because, like you noticed, the window was dirty and in color this picture was much more confusing. It really looked nice in color. Wish I can show the original to you. After reading your comments I made a different crop and it really worked a lot better.  Thanks to all for your comments, and hope to see you soon again. I think I''ll join to the ALL ALONE challenge.... See ya,  PabloFounder of //www.pixelatesight.com', '2003-10-15 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(451636, 41346, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great work, congrats. Beautiful light here, and the sun in the misty air is fabulously caught. One of my favourites from this crop.</td>', 'Great work, congrats. Beautiful light here, and the sun in the misty air is fabulously caught. One of my favourites from this crop.', '2003-10-15 20:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(451638, 41346, 8953, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Zeuszen! wonderful image. I am left with only admiration of this shot. The tones, balance are right on. the stillness of the water that captures the reflection of the buildings and the soft muted expanse of sky all come together to give this shot that feeling of real Art. Thank You Zeuszen for sharing<br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'Congratulations Zeuszen! wonderful image. I am left with only admiration of this shot. The tones, balance are right on. the stillness of the water that captures the reflection of the buildings and the soft muted expanse of sky all come together to give this shot that feeling of real Art. Thank You Zeuszen for sharing Richard', '2003-10-15 20:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
