(452649, 40800, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kyrielle:</b></div><hr/><i>It''s a pretty coast, but...I odn''t see any sign of a city, town, or even a small cluster of outbuildings. Is there a city out in the fog, or just behind? In any case...I can''t tie this to the challenge at all.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>yes, actually there is. Just to the left below the mountains.</td>', 'Originally posted by kyrielle:It''s a pretty coast, but...I odn''t see any sign of a city, town, or even a small cluster of outbuildings. Is there a city out in the fog, or just behind? In any case...I can''t tie this to the challenge at all. yes, actually there is. Just to the left below the mountains.', '2003-10-16 13:28:02.000000', NULL, 0),
