(453396, 41314, 11769, '<td valign="top">I guess my 10 is a little out of place, but I lived in Boston for years and owned a Dog. This Shot brought back the feelings to a degree the others failed to. I could sense the buildings all around, just like walking my Dog Bo so many years ago.</td>', 'I guess my 10 is a little out of place, but I lived in Boston for years and owned a Dog. This Shot brought back the feelings to a degree the others failed to. I could sense the buildings all around, just like walking my Dog Bo so many years ago.', '2003-10-17 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
