(454473, 41346, 9711, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, i like the reflections on the water, plus i love the angle you chose to shoot, i mean the curve we follow from near to far, i love the boats, and buildings. i didn''t get to vote for this challenge. but i would have gave this 9. congradulations, great job!</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, i like the reflections on the water, plus i love the angle you chose to shoot, i mean the curve we follow from near to far, i love the boats, and buildings. i didn''t get to vote for this challenge. but i would have gave this 9. congradulations, great job!', '2003-10-18 05:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
