(458526, 41390, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m just reviewing some of my favorite shots of this challenge, trying to learn things so I can be a better photographer. This is a really nice photo. I like how the trees frame the building and how the top of the building is in the upper left part of the photo--giving it added height and importance. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I''m just reviewing some of my favorite shots of this challenge, trying to learn things so I can be a better photographer. This is a really nice photo. I like how the trees frame the building and how the top of the building is in the upper left part of the photo--giving it added height and importance. Keep up the good work!', '2003-10-22 15:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(458973, 41174, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting materials and variety of textures in this. Very smart shot.<br/> <br/>The complete absence of life (other than the tree) is quite remarkable.</td>', 'Love the contrasting materials and variety of textures in this. Very smart shot. The complete absence of life (other than the tree) is quite remarkable.', '2003-10-22 19:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(459671, 41327, 10084, '<td valign="top">Want to show the shapes that can be seen in a Urban Landscapes. I was hoping that the dark buildings on the right lead the eyes toward the shapes in the background that stood above the streets in downtown San Francisco. This <a href="//www.fotolog.net/faidoi/?photo_id=1716015" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">is the original.</a>. Thanks everybody for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-23 03:26:42.</i></td>', 'Want to show the shapes that can be seen in a Urban Landscapes. I was hoping that the dark buildings on the right lead the eyes toward the shapes in the background that stood above the streets in downtown San Francisco. This is the original.. Thanks everybody for the comments.', '2003-10-23 04:24:07.000000', '2003-10-23 04:26:42.000000', 0),
(459855, 41272, 12332, '<td valign="top">I like the way you caught modern vs historic and static vs fluid nature of life in a city such as London. And the exposure is nearly perfect with beautiful shades of gray.</td>', 'I like the way you caught modern vs historic and static vs fluid nature of life in a city such as London. And the exposure is nearly perfect with beautiful shades of gray.', '2003-10-23 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(461865, 40540, 11410, '<td valign="top">that is a beautiful shot.  I don''t know what warrants 1st or 2nd or 3rd place, but that doesn''t matter. just be satisfied that you have taken a beautiful shot.</td>', 'that is a beautiful shot.  I don''t know what warrants 1st or 2nd or 3rd place, but that doesn''t matter. just be satisfied that you have taken a beautiful shot.', '2003-10-25 19:43:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(461866, 41132, 11410, '<td valign="top">that''s beautiful! very post-modern too, that building masking itself by mirroring it''s natural surroundings.  very cool! especially when the real sky surrounding it does not reflect the reflected sky within.  really good!  well done.</td>', 'that''s beautiful! very post-modern too, that building masking itself by mirroring it''s natural surroundings.  very cool! especially when the real sky surrounding it does not reflect the reflected sky within.  really good!  well done.', '2003-10-25 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
