(465709, 40778, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot lisa - i love night photography and appreciate the effect you were going for here.  My only suggestion would be to line up the benches at the bottom ( kind of creating a centered upside down v with the two benches and cutting out the third one on the right - this would lead your eyes a little better out into the frame imo)  Just a thought.  Didn''t get a chance to vote on this one - but you would have gotten a 7 from me.  Cool shot.</td>', 'cool shot lisa - i love night photography and appreciate the effect you were going for here.  My only suggestion would be to line up the benches at the bottom ( kind of creating a centered upside down v with the two benches and cutting out the third one on the right - this would lead your eyes a little better out into the frame imo)  Just a thought.  Didn''t get a chance to vote on this one - but you would have gotten a 7 from me.  Cool shot.', '2003-10-29 10:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
