(3081635, 41346, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a stunning photo!   Everything about it is flawless: the black and white.  the misty foggy look in the background, the mirror reflection in the water.  I can''t believe I''ve missed it -- but then, it was taken and entered onto dpc before I came on board.  Glad I stumbled on it now -- I just added it to my favorites so I could view it often :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is such a stunning photo!   Everything about it is flawless: the black and white.  the misty foggy look in the background, the mirror reflection in the water.  I can''t believe I''ve missed it -- but then, it was taken and entered onto dpc before I came on board.  Glad I stumbled on it now -- I just added it to my favorites so I could view it often :) ', '2006-12-02 13:05:36.000000', NULL, 0),
